	["神弃之地-梅迪奇-散射长矛-选人射击"] = "Forsaken Land of the Gods-Medici-Scattering Spear-Select person to shoot",
	["神弃之地-梅迪奇-烈火灼心-dot传染一个人"] = "Forsaken Land of the Gods-Medici-Burning Heart-dot infect one person",
	["神弃之地·旷野"] = "Forsaken Land of the Gods · Wilderness",
	["神弃之地·王庭"] = "Forsaken Land of the Gods · King's Court",
	["神弃之地旷野中游荡着的失控者，他的饥饿永远在增长，和他的疯狂一样···"] = "A person who has lost control, wandering in the wilderness of the Forsaken Land of the Gods. His hunger is always growing, just like his madness...",
	["神弃之地深处，饥饿的怪物在旷野游荡，欺诈之神于暗中窥视，乌黯魔狼守护着千年的秘密。当《救赎圣典》的书页翻开，你将在格尔曼·斯帕罗的带领下，亲历那段被黑暗吞没的岁月。"] = "Deep in the Forsaken Land of the Gods, hungry monsters roam the wilderness, the God of Deceit watches from the shadows, and the Dark Demonic Wolf guards a thousand-year-old secret. When the pages of the \"Book of Redemption\" are turned, you will experience those years swallowed by darkness under the guidance of Gehrman Sparrow.",
	["神弃之地诞生于远古太阳神陨落后，是一片被黑暗笼罩的地域。"] = "The Forsaken Land of the Gods was born after the fall of the Ancient Sun God and is a region shrouded in darkness.",
