	["神秘学知识"] = "Mysticism knowledge",
	["神秘学者高价收购"] = "Occultist high-price acquisition",
	["神秘学首屈一指的大师，核心能力是“神秘再现”，从掌握的神秘学知识里汲取力量创造魔法，知识越少人知道法术越强大。"] = "A premier master of mysticism. Your core ability is 'Mystical Re-enactment', drawing power from mastered mystical knowledge to create magic. The fewer people who know the spell, the more powerful it is.",
