	["神秘的宫殿"] = "Mysterious palace",
	["神秘的影像，只留下了一句话，不具有沟通的能力。"] = "The mysterious image left only one sentence and does not have the ability to communicate.",
	["神秘的知识，未知的来源，却凝固了时间，浓缩了对能力运用的理解。"] = "Mysterious knowledge, unknown origin, yet it solidifies time and condenses the understanding of ability application.",
