	["神话生物不再是平面或者立体能够描述，就像在长、宽、高之外，多了信息、力量、灵性等衡量尺度，它们直观地呈现出来，浓缩为了神秘复杂的花纹、符号和标识。"] = "Mythical creatures can no longer be described by mere planes or three-dimensional space. It is as if, beyond length, width, and height, there are additional scales of measurement such as information, power, and spirituality. They are presented intuitively, condensed into mysterious and complex patterns, symbols, and signs.",
