	["神降制作"] = "Divine Descent Creation",
	["神降华服，非凡之证。凡人以金钱求购，非凡者以仪式降下神迹。\n埃姆林·怀特曾向你展示过他所拥有的那些精美衣饰，每一件都堪称艺术品，每一件都来历不凡。而当你问起这些衣饰从何而来时，他露出了一个神秘的笑容。\n去找埃姆林·怀特，或许，你也可以拥有。"] = "Divine descent in gorgeous attire, a testament to the extraordinary. Mortals buy them with money, while Beyonders use rituals to bring down divine miracles. \nEmlyn White once showed you those exquisite clothes he possessed; each one was a work of art, and each had an extraordinary origin. And when you asked where these clothes came from, he revealed a mysterious smile.\n Go find Emlyn White; perhaps you too can possess them.",
