	["秩序审判主动效果进入的烈阳状态时间延长4秒。"] = "The duration of the Blazing Sun state entered by the active effect of Order Judgment is extended by 4 seconds.",
	["秩序审判天赋叠烈阳"] = "Order Judgment Talent stacks Blazing Sun",
	["秩序审判施放后，立刻获得5点太阳能量，之后5次无暗之枪释放后立刻获得5点太阳能量。"] = "After casting Order Judgment, immediately gain 5 points of Solar Energy, and gain 5 points of Solar Energy after each of the next 5 casts of Unshadowed Spear.",
	["秩序审判施放后，立刻获得5点太阳能量，之后5次无暗之枪释放后立刻获得5点太阳能量。无暗之枪伤害提高40%。"] = "After casting Order Judgment, immediately gain 5 Solar Energy, and subsequently gain 5 Solar Energy after each of the next 5 Unshadowed Spear casts. Unshadowed Spear damage increased by 40%.",
	["秩序审判施放后，阻挡敌人对你造成伤害的60%，当你的本次烈阳状态结束时，若对你造成伤害的敌人全部存活，你将一次性受到阻挡的伤害。"] = "After casting Order Judgment, block 60% of damage dealt by enemies. When your current Blazing Sun state ends, if all enemies that dealt damage to you are still alive, you will take all the blocked damage at once.",
	["秩序已经恢复，成功封印天平！"] = "Order has been restored; the scale has been successfully sealed!",
	["秩序已经重建。"] = "Order has been restored.",
	["秩序是人类的本能还是理性？我们是在自发追求稳定，还是为生命构建囚笼？"] = "Is order an instinct of humanity or reason? Are we spontaneously pursuing stability, or building a cage for life?",
