	["立体感。"] = "Three-dimensional effect.",
	["立刻回复友方目标最大生命值*f**的生命（回复量不超过自身最大生命值的*f**），并使其buffdisc(*id)，持续*f秒。本技能造成过量治疗时，回复技能范围内生命百分比最低的团队成员的生命，回复量等于溢出的治疗量（受目标减疗影响）。\n本技能可以充能2次。\n仅<HighLight>空想姿态</>可用，<HighLight>噩梦姿态</>下切换为<HighLight>梦境编织</>。"] = "Instantly restores *f** of the allied target's max Health (the amount restored does not exceed *f** of your own max Health) and grants them buffdisc(*id) for *f seconds. When this skill causes overhealing, it restores Health to the team member with the lowest Health percentage within the skill's range, with the amount restored equal to the overflow healing (affected by the target's Healing Reduction). \n This skill can be charged 2 times. \n Only available in <HighLight> Imagination Stance </>; switches to <HighLight> Dream Weaving </> in <HighLight> Nightmare Stance </>.",
	["立刻回复友方目标最大生命值{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*f**}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*f**}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*f**}的生命（回复量不超过自身最大生命值的{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*f**}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*f**}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*f**}），并使其buffdisc(*id)，持续*f秒。本技能造成过量治疗时，回复技能范围内生命百分比最低的团队成员的生命，回复量等于溢出的治疗量（受目标减疗影响）。"] = "Immediately restore {CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*f**}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*f**}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*f**} of the friendly target's maximum health (the amount restored cannot exceed {CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*f**}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*f**}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*f**} of your own maximum health) and apply buffdisc(*id) for *f seconds. If this skill causes overhealing, it restores health to the team member with the lowest health percentage within range, equal to the excess healing (affected by the target's healing reduction).",
	["立刻回复目标最大生命值*f**的生命，并使其buffdisc(*id)，持续*f秒。"] = "Immediately restore the target's health by *f** of their max health and apply buffdisc(*id) for *f seconds.",
