	["竞速，是风暴的缩影。\n驾驭蒸汽车疾驰于街巷，乘风破浪冲过险滩，借灵性之跃腾空飞越——追逐风暴之主的脚步，赢取独属于你的荣耀与馈赠。"] = "Racing is the epitome of the storm. \n Drive a steam car to speed through the streets, ride the wind and waves to rush through dangerous shoals, and use Leap of Spirituality to fly through the air—chase the footsteps of the Lord of Storms and win the glory and gifts that belong only to you.",
	["竞速，是风暴的缩影。驾驭蒸汽车疾驰于街巷，乘风破浪冲过险滩，借灵性之跃腾空飞越——追逐风暴之主的脚步，赢取独属于你的荣耀与馈赠。"] = "Racing is the epitome of the storm. Drive a steam car to gallop through the streets, ride the wind and waves to rush through dangerous shoals, and use the Leap of Spirituality to soar through the air—chase the footsteps of the Lord of Storms and win the glory and gifts that belong only to you.",
