	["竟然无视阿罗德斯的问题，惩罚！"] = "To actually ignore Arrodes' question, punishment!",
	["竟然有这么可怕的事？"] = "There's actually such a terrifying thing?",
	["竟然没有偷偷溜走，你们还真听话。"] = "You didn't actually sneak away; you really are obedient.",
	["竟然没有偷偷溜走，你们还真听话！"] = "You didn't actually sneak away; you really are obedient!",
	["竟然用笔记本，掉包应该归还的书！"] = "To actually use a notebook to swap out a book that should have been returned!",
	["竟然还有这么多参考文献？<P_Yellow>《二十年战争中的苏尼亚岛》、《百年恩怨：帝国与家族的想象共同体》、《黑铁纪元：现代国家的政治寓言》</>……"] = "There are actually so many references? <P_Yellow> 'Sonia Island in the Twenty-Year War', 'A Century of Grudges: The Imagined Community of Empire and Family', 'The Black Iron Era: Political Allegories of Modern States' </>...",
