	["端庄的发式是来到新家的第一课。爱与信仰照拂着孩子们，让灵魂虔诚而纯净。"] = "A dignified hairstyle is the first lesson upon arriving at a new home. Love and faith shine upon the children, making their souls pious and pure.",
