	["第一个月：向父亲证明我擅长规划自己的人生。\n第一年：蜜月旅行（目的地见附录），海蒂感到幸福。\n第三年：换大房子，海蒂在我宣布拥有新房产时喜极而泣。\n……\n第十年：孩子入学，甜蜜亲吻我和海蒂的脸颊。"] = "First Month: Prove to father that I am good at planning my own life.\n First Year: Honeymoon (destination see appendix), Heidi feels happy.\n Third Year: Move to a big house, Heidi weeps with joy when I announce we have a new property.\n...\n Tenth Year: Child starts school, sweetly kisses my and Heidi's cheeks.",
	["第一个朋友"] = "First Friend",
	["第一个水晶球的谜题：\n<InvHighlight>α乘以β</>等于<InvHighlight>12</>"] = " The puzzle of the first crystal ball: \n <InvHighlight> α multiplied by β </> equals <InvHighlight> 12 </>",
	["第一个水晶球的谜题：\n<InvHighlight>α乘以β</>等于<InvHighlight>12</>\n\n第二个水晶球的谜题：\n水晶球的位置<InvHighlight>(β减2,α减2)</>为<InvHighlight>(1,3)</>"] = "Puzzle of the first crystal ball: \n<InvHighlight>α multiplied by β</> equals <InvHighlight>12</>\n\n Puzzle of the second crystal ball: \nThe position of the crystal ball<InvHighlight>(β minus 2, α minus 2)</> is <InvHighlight>(1, 3)</>",
	["第一个水晶球的谜题：\n<InvHighlight>α乘以β</>等于<InvHighlight>12</>\n\n第二个水晶球的谜题：\n水晶球的位置<InvHighlight>(β减2,α减2)</>为<InvHighlight>(1,3)</>\n\n第三个水晶球的谜题：\n水晶球的位置<InvHighlight>(α,ω加1)</>为<InvHighlight>(4,3)</>"] = "Puzzle of the first crystal ball: \n<InvHighlight>α multiplied by β</> equals <InvHighlight>12</>\n\n Puzzle of the second crystal ball: \nThe position of the crystal ball<InvHighlight>(β minus 2, α minus 2)</> is <InvHighlight>(1, 3)</>\n\n Puzzle of the third crystal ball: \nThe position of the crystal ball<InvHighlight>(α, ω plus 1)</> is <InvHighlight>(4, 3)</>",
	["第一个水晶球的谜题：\n<InvHighlight>α乘以β</>等于<InvHighlight>12</>\n\n第二个水晶球的谜题：\n水晶球的位置<InvHighlight>(β减2,α减2)</>为<InvHighlight>(1,3)</>\n\n第三个水晶球的谜题：\n水晶球的位置<InvHighlight>(α,ω加1)</>为<InvHighlight>(4,3)</>\n\n第一个传送门：\n<InvHighlight>α加α</>等于<InvHighlight>8</>"] = "Puzzle of the first crystal ball: \n<InvHighlight>α multiplied by β</> equals <InvHighlight>12</>\n\n Puzzle of the second crystal ball: \nThe position of the crystal ball<InvHighlight>(β minus 2, α minus 2)</> is <InvHighlight>(1, 3)</>\n\n Puzzle of the third crystal ball: \nThe position of the crystal ball<InvHighlight>(α, ω plus 1)</> is <InvHighlight>(4, 3)</>\n\n First Portal: \n<InvHighlight>α plus α</> equals <InvHighlight>8</>",
	["第一个水晶球的谜题：\n<InvHighlight>α乘以β</>等于<InvHighlight>12</>\n\n第二个水晶球的谜题：\n水晶球的位置<InvHighlight>(β减2,α减2)</>为<InvHighlight>(1,3)</>\n\n第三个水晶球的谜题：\n水晶球的位置<InvHighlight>(α,ω加1)</>为<InvHighlight>(4,3)</>\n\n第一个传送门：\n<InvHighlight>α加α</>等于<InvHighlight>8</>\n\n第二个传送门：\n<InvHighlight>β减α</>等于<InvHighlight>-1</>"] = "Puzzle of the first crystal ball: \n<InvHighlight>α multiplied by β</> equals <InvHighlight>12</>\n\n Puzzle of the second crystal ball: \nThe position of the crystal ball<InvHighlight>(β minus 2, α minus 2)</> is <InvHighlight>(1, 3)</>\n\n Puzzle of the third crystal ball: \nThe position of the crystal ball<InvHighlight>(α, ω plus 1)</> is <InvHighlight>(4, 3)</>\n\n First Portal: \n<InvHighlight>α plus α</> equals <InvHighlight>8</>\n\n Second Portal: \n<InvHighlight>β minus α</> equals <InvHighlight>-1</>",
	["第一个水晶球的谜题：\n<InvHighlight>α乘以β</>等于<InvHighlight>12</>\n\n第二个水晶球的谜题：\n水晶球的位置<InvHighlight>(β减2,α减2)</>为<InvHighlight>(1,3)</>\n\n第三个水晶球的谜题：\n水晶球的位置<InvHighlight>(α,ω加1)</>为<InvHighlight>(4,3)</>\n\n第一个传送门：\n<InvHighlight>α加α</>等于<InvHighlight>8</>\n\n第二个传送门：\n<InvHighlight>β减α</>等于<InvHighlight>-1</>\n\n第三个传送门：\n<InvHighlight>α乘以β乘以ω</>等于<InvHighlight>24</>"] = "Puzzle of the first crystal ball: \n<InvHighlight>α multiplied by β</> equals <InvHighlight>12</>\n\n Puzzle of the second crystal ball: \nThe position of the crystal ball<InvHighlight>(β minus 2, α minus 2)</> is <InvHighlight>(1, 3)</>\n\n Puzzle of the third crystal ball: \nThe position of the crystal ball<InvHighlight>(α, ω plus 1)</> is <InvHighlight>(4, 3)</>\n\n First Portal: \n<InvHighlight>α plus α</> equals <InvHighlight>8</>\n\n Second Portal: \n<InvHighlight>β minus α</> equals <InvHighlight>-1</>\n\n Third Portal: \n<InvHighlight>α multiplied by β multiplied by ω</> equals <InvHighlight>24</>",
