	["第一批蠹虫"] = "First Batch of Bookworms",
	["第一批醋栗成熟那天，我穿着晨衣奔到树林里去，树梢的尖刺划破我的袖子和手指。我全然不顾，只是合着雨水咀嚼刚刚摘下来的果实。它们又苦又涩，可我仍然一把一把地抓起来，咽下去。"] = "The day the first batch of gooseberries ripened, I ran into the grove in my dressing gown. The thorns on the branches tore my sleeves and fingers. I didn't care at all, just chewed the freshly picked fruits mixed with rainwater. They were bitter and astringent, yet I still grabbed them by the handful and swallowed them.",
