	["第一步：点击<Highlight>上传按钮</>即可上传已准备好的短视频。\n第二步：视频上传成功后，可勾选<Highlight>动作、表情、音乐、镜头</>。\n第三步：点击<Highlight>生成按钮</>，等待一段时间后创作完成。"] = "Step 1: Click the <Highlight>Upload button</> to upload your prepared short video. \nStep 2: After the video is uploaded successfully, you can check <Highlight>Actions, Expressions, Music, Camera Angles</>. \nStep 3: Click the <Highlight>Generate button</>, wait for a while, and the creation will be completed.",
