	["第二阶段，声称也许会有意外出现的污染，但我们不该贸然行动。"] = "The second stage is to claim that there might be unexpected corruption, but we shouldn't act rashly.",
	["第二页……啊，是韦尔奇和小猫。"] = "The second page... Ah, it's Welch and the kitten.",
	["第二题"] = "Second question",
	["第二，“质询”。"] = "Second, \"Interrogation\".",
	["第二，棕发女人，戒指藏针，言谈煽情。刺客？"] = "Second, brown-haired woman, ring hiding a needle, emotional speech. Assassin?",
	["第二，每月两天，本乞丐休息！"] = "Second, two days every month, this beggar is off duty!",
	["第二，红发女人，戒指藏针，言谈煽情。刺客？"] = "Second, the red-haired woman, a needle hidden in her ring, and her speech was provocative. An assassin?",
	["第二，艾琳娜的“刺杀”是假的，是男爵安排的表演。"] = "Second, Elena's \"assassination\" is fake; it's a performance arranged by the Baron.",
