	["第五纪元"] = "The Fifth Epoch",
	["第五纪元·黑铁纪元"] = "Fifth Epoch: Epoch of Black Iron",
	["第五纪元等对话"] = "Fifth Epoch and other dialogues",
	["第五纪背誓之战时期，这里曾发生过两大教会冲突，带来了荒芜之灾。"] = "During the War of the Oath-Breakers in the Fifth Epoch, a conflict between two major churches occurred here, bringing the disaster of desolation.",
	["第五题相机"] = "Fifth Question Camera",
	["第八周，作物正在越长越快。我挖了几次土，发现它们的根系都朝着湖心蔓延——像在“听”什么。我越来越怀疑，这丰收不是自然的，是某种意志在推着我们往它那里靠近。\n排除令人不安的因素，金秋小镇的作物依然美味，简直让人停不下来。"] = "Week 8, the crops are growing faster and faster. I've dug up the soil a few times and discovered that their root systems are all spreading toward the center of the lake—as if they are 'listening' to something. I am increasingly suspicious that this harvest is not natural; some kind of will is pushing us toward it.\nSetting aside the unsettling factors, the crops in Golden Autumn Town are still delicious; it's simply impossible to stop eating them.",
	["第八章"] = "Chapter 8",
	["第八题，我国股票交易方式的革新及其影响……"] = "Question 8, the innovation of our country's stock trading methods and its impact...",
	["第六十五节：清晨纯露"] = "Section 65: Morning Dew",
	["第六天"] = "Day 6",
	["第六幕·腐肉"] = "Act VI · Rotten Meat",
	["第六幕解锁"] = "Act 6 unlocked",
	["第六瓶了吧……就算是她，也有点多了。"] = "The sixth bottle, I think... Even for her, that is a bit much.",
	["第六章"] = "Chapter 6",
	["第六章·艾尔喂药无镜"] = "Chapter 6: Alger feeding medicine without mirror",
	["第六题，弗萨克双头巨人军团曾侵入凛冬郡的安曼达山脉。"] = "Question 6: The Feysac Empire's two-headed giant legion once invaded the Amontha Mountains in the Winter County.",
	["第十三周，我的身体变得奇怪。这几天指甲生长得过于迅速，甚至会在睡醒时发现它们贴在面上，像是试图去探索什么。\n我还不能确定是否与果子有关，但直觉告诉我，它们含着某种会“鼓励生长”的东西。\n赞美这无尽的丰收，多汁而甜蜜的葡萄，柔润的南瓜……我还要再吃一点。"] = "Week 13, my body has become strange. These past few days, my fingernails have been growing too rapidly; I even wake up to find them pressed against my face, as if trying to explore something.\nI'm not yet sure if it's related to the fruit, but my intuition tells me they contain something that 'encourages growth.'\nPraise this endless harvest, the juicy and sweet grapes, the tender and moist pumpkins... I must have a little more.",
	["第十九次，又失败了吗？<P_Yellow>新生者</>每次都会遭受死亡和意志的摧残……"] = "The nineteenth time, another failure? <P_Yellow>Newborn</> will suffer the ravages of death and will every time...",
	["第十二个"] = "The Twelfth One",
