	["等"] = "Wait",
	["等  等……"] = "Wait... wait...",
	["等——"] = "Wait—",
	["等“全类武器使用证”申请下来，就买下那把漂亮的左轮手枪……"] = "Once the 'All-Class Weapon Usage Permit' is approved, I'll buy that beautiful revolver...",
	["等一下……你看这斜阳下的街角，光线和建筑的样子，很像那幅《廷根街景》油画里的感觉。我们就在这里停留一会儿，好吗？ "] = "Wait a minute... look at this street corner in the setting sun, the light and the shape of the buildings feel very much like the oil painting 'Tingen Street Scene'. Shall we stay here for a while?",
	["等一下……帕里克，太危险了……"] = "Wait a minute... Parick, it's too dangerous...",
	["等一下下"] = "Wait a moment",
	["等一下见到他，我应该矜持一些，还是扑他个满怀？"] = "Should I be reserved when I see him later, or should I throw myself into his arms?",
	["等一下，{{PlayerName}}！"] = "Wait a moment, {{PlayerName}}!",
	["等一下，让我试试。"] = "Wait a moment, let me try.",
	["等一会<h>老先生</>"] = "Wait for the <h> old gentleman </> for a while",
	["等上一步的画外音播完"] = "Wait for the previous voiceover to finish playing",
	["等下……你，不是已经被开膛手杰斯杀死了吗？"] = "Wait... you, weren't you already killed by Jack the Ripper?",
	["等下的事肯定能成，心里莫名的有底气！"] = "What's coming up will definitely succeed, I feel inexplicably confident!",
	["等了一会，罗珊他们在窗前坐下了。"] = "After waiting a while, Rozanne and the others sat down by the window.",
	["等了半天，还要再领一轮号码牌？"] = "Waited for so long, and I have to get another number tag?",
	["等了好久了……"] = "We've been waiting forever...",
	["等于"] = "Equal to",
	["等什么？"] = "Wait for what?",
	["等他回来我狠狠收拾他！"] = "I'll give him a good lesson when he gets back!",
	["等他毕业，找到份体面工作，我们一家人就能在廷根真正站住脚了！ "] = "Once he graduates and finds a decent job, our family will be able to truly stand firm in Tingen!",
	["等他的技艺足够好，会有人愿意为他的手艺付更多的钱。"] = "When his skill is good enough, there will be people willing to pay more for his craftsmanship.",
	["等你做完计划天都黑了。"] = "It'll be dark by the time you finish your plan.",
	["等你到了，请记得给我你的信。"] = "When you arrive, please remember to send me your letter.",
	["等你到我这个年纪的时候，就会发现身体康健，没有心事，坐在长椅上看一份报纸，是多么舒服的事情。"] = "When you reach my age, you'll realize how comfortable it is to be healthy, have no worries, and sit on a bench reading a newspaper.",
	["等你更加熟练后，还能看到更多。很有用的技能，对吧？"] = "After you become more proficient, you will be able to see more. A very useful skill, right?",
	["等你的序列晋升得更高一点，再去深入调查这些吧。"] = "Wait until your Sequence advancement is higher before investigating these matters further.",
	["等你真正接触这方面的工作，就会知道这有多难了！"] = "Once you truly get involved in this work, you will know how difficult it is!",
	["等你知道自己真正想要什么的时候……也许我们可以再聊。"] = "Once you know what you truly want... perhaps we can talk again.",
	["等你自己去发现吧。"] = "Wait for you to discover it yourself.",
	["等候洛琳女士行动"] = "Wait for Ms. Lorin to Act",
	["等到下街的那群醉鬼打着酒嗝上工，牡蛎的臭味和猫鼠大军就把我可怜的房子淹没了。"] = "By the time those drunks from Lower Street go to work with their hiccups, the stench of oysters and the army of cats and mice will have flooded my poor house.",
	["等到半夜，看看究竟"] = "Wait until midnight to see what is going on",
	["等到太阳下山，就把它们一只只赶回家。"] = "When the sun goes down, drive them home one by one.",
	["等到晚上"] = "Wait until night",
	["等到第二天夜晚，准备赴宴"] = "Wait until the next night, prepare to attend the banquet",
	["等口渴了再尝尝吧！"] = "Wait until you're thirsty to taste it!",
	["等同于控制台执行stat Unit"] = "Equivalent to executing 'stat Unit' in console.",
	["等埃尔夫的腿好一些，我们就举行婚礼！"] = "Once Alf's leg gets better, we will hold the wedding!",
	["等夕阳A"] = "Waiting for Sunset A",
	["等夕阳B"] = "Waiting for Sunset B",
	["等姐姐得到永暗蜡烛的垂怜，姐姐就带你去见爸爸妈妈。"] = "When sister receives the mercy of the Candle of Eternal Darkness, sister will take you to see Mom and Dad.",
	["等委托者支付报酬后，会再分发给你们一笔可观的额外经费。"] = "Once the client pays the reward, a significant extra fund will be distributed to you.",
	["等婆婆帮你留意留意，温柔内敛的人可不好找啊……"] = "Let Granny keep an eye out for you. Gentle and introverted people are hard to find...",
	["等存够钱，我就不干了，回家陪波西和我的小迈卡。"] = "Once I've saved enough money, I'm quitting. I'll go home to be with Percy and my little Micah.",
