	["等待，等待下一位小姐的回眸。"] = "Waiting, waiting for the next lady to look back.",
	["等您再进一步，把城堡升到3级，我们还能建造自己的工坊，这些丰富的物产能装载上火车，被用于铁路行商中。"] = "Once you advance further and upgrade the castle to level 3, we can build our own workshop. These abundant resources can be loaded onto trains and used for railway trade.",
	["等我们的店开业后，欢迎来做客，我们会给你一个美丽的折扣价。"] = "Once our shop opens, you are welcome to visit. We will give you a beautiful discount.",
	["等我再长大一点，再努力一点。"] = "When I grow up a little more, and work a little harder.",
	["等我恢复过来，一定要让他们好看……"] = "Once I recover, I'll definitely make them pay...",
	["等我成为了像大名鼎鼎的佛尔思·沃尔一样的小说家，这个班就给你上。"] = "Once I become a novelist as famous as Fors Wall, I'll let you take this class.",
	["等我找到新的线索再过来。"] = "Wait until I find new clues before coming back.",
	["等我晋升到高序列，是不是就不用再为几镑几苏勒发愁了呢。"] = "Once I advance to a high Sequence, will I no longer have to worry about a few pounds or shillings?",
	["等我有钱……"] = "When I have money...",
	["等我的心上……呃，没什么，怎么随便打听别人的事！"] = "Waiting for my sweetheart... uh, nothing, why are you prying into other people's business!",
	["等我站上舞台那天，会邀请你来观演的，一定要来哦！"] = "The day I stand on stage, I will invite you to watch the performance, you must come!",
	["等我编完圣典，我要放把火把这堆玩意儿都烧了！都烧了！"] = "Once I finish editing the codex, I'm going to set this whole pile of junk on fire! Burn it all!",
	["等我考上了，想点蜡烛就点蜡烛，还要买一盏全新的煤气灯，想亮多久就亮多久……"] = "Once I pass, I'll light candles whenever I want, and I'll buy a brand new gas lamp, and keep it on as long as I want...",
	["等我跟<P_Yellow>瑞尔</>把这些麻烦事解决，一定一起去感谢您，莫雷蒂先生。"] = "Once I settle these troubles with <P_Yellow> Riel </>, I will definitely come to thank you together, Mr. Moretti.",
	["等我选上市长，你不就是了嘛？再忍忍，我的宝贝。"] = "Once I'm elected mayor, won't you be? Just bear with it a little longer, my treasure.",
	["等我选举成功，我向民众承诺的一切都会得到兑现！"] = "Once I am successfully elected, everything I promised the people will be fulfilled!",
	["等旁白1"] = "Wait for narration 1",
	["等旁白2"] = "Wait for narration 2",
	["等有机会试试。"] = "I'll try it when I have the chance.",
	["等爸爸当上领班，就能带你们来这里吃饭了！当然要提前学学，不能被那些绅士小姐笑话。"] = "When Dad becomes a foreman, I'll be able to bring you here to eat! Of course, we have to learn in advance so we aren't laughed at by those gentlemen and ladies.",
	["等着吧！要是被我抓到，你就完了！"] = "Just you wait! If I catch you, you're finished!",
	["等着吧，明天的头版头条就是他们俩的同框照片！"] = "Just wait, tomorrow's front-page headline will be a photo of the two of them together!",
	["等着瞧吧……我已经找了不少私家侦探……"] = "Just you wait... I've already hired quite a few private detectives...",
	["等着瞧！不让我种菜，我偏要种！"] = "Just you wait! If they won't let me grow vegetables, I'll grow them anyway!",
	["等着，下一次参加聚会，我帮你好好找找。"] = "Wait for it. Next time I attend a gathering, I'll help you look carefully.",
	["等等 天才中将！"] = "Wait, Genius Admiral!",
	["等等 这是怎么了——"] = "Wait, what is happening—",
	["等等……好吧，我去试试……你们等会儿，我得先去附近买点章鱼……"] = "Wait... okay, I'll try... you wait a moment, I have to go buy some octopus nearby...",
	["等等……我好像听见柯尼在喊我了？！"] = "Wait... did I just hear Koni calling me?!",
	["等等……我好像听见柯尼的惨叫声了？！"] = "Wait... I think I heard Conny scream?!",
	["等等……我数数……一、二、三……糟糕，好像有一封信丢了！"] = "Wait... let me count... one, two, three... oh no, it seems a letter is missing!",
	["等等……新面孔？"] = "Wait... a new face?",
	["等等……艾琳娜怎么不逃跑，还微笑着看这一切？"] = "Wait... why isn't Elena running away, and why is she smiling while watching all this?",
	["等等、我不是——"] = "Wait, I'm not—",
	["等等吧，明天又是今天，今天又是昨天。"] = "Let's wait, tomorrow is today, and today is yesterday.",
	["等等贝克，还有一件事。"] = "Wait, Baker, there's one more thing.",
	["等等！"] = "Wait!",
	["等等！他该不会是位穿越者前辈吧……"] = "Wait! Could he be a transmigrator predecessor...",
	["等等！你呢？官方的，还是野生的？"] = "Wait! What about you? Are you official, or are you a rogue?",
	["等等！你没有计划！第六步要……"] = "Wait! You don't have a plan! The sixth step needs to...",
	["等等！你的信还在我这里。"] = "Wait! I still have your letter.",
	["等等！别在这里……"] = "Wait! Don't do it here...",
	["等等！姐姐、爸爸……烧鹅……不见了。"] = "Wait! Big sister, Father... the roast goose... is gone.",
	["等等！小女孩，你叫什么名字？ "] = "Wait! Little girl, what's your name?",
	["等等！抱歉，{{先生|女士}}，您现在还不能坐上去。"] = "Wait! Sorry, {{Mr.|Ms.}}, you can't sit on it yet.",
	["等等！这不是交通部长斯宾塞男爵吗？"] = "Wait! Isn't this the Minister of Transport, Baron Spencer?",
	["等等！这是什么声音？前面有人在呼救！"] = "Wait! What is that sound? Someone is calling for help ahead!",
	["等等！这种危险的预感……"] = "Wait! This dangerous premonition...",
	["等等，8镑，就8镑，成交！"] = "Wait, 8 pounds, just 8 pounds, deal!",
	["等等，{{PlayerName}}！"] = "Wait, {{PlayerName}}!",
	["等等，{{先生|女士}}。"] = "Espere, {{senhor|senhora}}.",
	["等等，不行……不能这么写，太平淡了，毫无戏剧张力！"] = "Wait, no... I can't write it like this, it's too bland, it lacks dramatic tension!",
	["等等，什么胸针？"] = "Wait, what brooch?",
	["等等，会长出鱼鳞的蔬菜？"] = "Wait, vegetables that grow fish scales?",
	["等等，你为什么不跟我一起去？"] = "Wait, why aren't you coming with me?",
	["等等，你们不会都买过内部资料吧？"] = "Wait, you guys didn't all buy the insider materials, did you?",
	["等等，你们仔细看看。"] = "Wait, look closely, everyone.",
	["等等，你们真的是大地教会的人？"] = "Wait, are you really from the Church of Earth?",
	["等等，你们都买过那个考试资料？！"] = "Wait, you all bought that exam material?!",
	["等等，你们都是普通人，对付不了的！"] = "Wait, you are all ordinary people, you can't handle it!",
	["等等，你怎么突然要谢谢我？"] = "Wait, why are you suddenly thanking me?",
	["等等，你放了什么？"] = "Wait, what did you put in?",
	["等等，倒霉……？"] = "Wait, unlucky...?",
	["等等，克莱恩！"] = "Wait, Klein!",
	["等等，同样的料子罗切尔太太那只要50苏勒，你给我报70？"] = "Wait, the same fabric only costs 50 Soles at Mrs. Rochel's, and you're charging me 70?",
	["等等，后面不会还有吧……"] = "Wait, there won't be more, right...",
	["等等，夫人，你是说，你的丈夫赛斯死于一场急病，然后你很快认识了那位斐乐先生，是吗？"] = "Wait, Madam, you mean your husband Seth died of a sudden illness, and then you met that Mr. Phil very soon after, is that right?",
	["等等，女士，你手里的针……"] = "Wait, Miss, the needle in your hand...",
	["等等，女士，你手里的针为什么这么长？"] = "Wait, Madam, why are the needles in your hand so long?",
	["等等，女士，这里面肯定有误会，我和他聊聊！"] = "Wait, miss, there must be a misunderstanding here. Let me talk to him!",
	["等等，布雷登——这里最奇怪的应该是布雷登！"] = "Wait, Braden—the strangest thing here is Braden!",
	["等等，怎么有一些……黑色的毛？"] = "Wait, why is there some... black fur?",
	["等等，怎么有这么巨大的丧尸在这里——得尽快解决它！"] = "Wait, why is there such a huge zombie here? I need to take it down as soon as possible!",
	["等等，我不知道这是怎么回事！"] = "Wait, I don't know what's going on here!",
	["等等，我好像听见了奇怪的动静？"] = "Wait, I think I heard a strange noise?",
	["等等，我想再挑战一次，不知道可不可以？"] = "Wait, I'd like to try again, is that allowed?",
	["等等，我看了下，两边明明都有路可以绕过去啊，你为什么非要穿墙？"] = "Wait, I just looked, there are clearly paths on both sides to go around. Why did you have to walk through the wall?",
	["等等，我知道你要说什么，可是不行哦。"] = "Wait, I know what you're going to say, but that's not possible.",
	["等等，所以，那到底是谁？"] = "Wait, so, who is that exactly?",
	["等等，是伦纳德先生或弗莱队长让你调查他的？"] = "Wait, did Mr. Leonard or Captain Frye ask you to investigate him?",
	["等等，有点……"] = "Wait, a bit...",
	["等等，灵感提醒我，这里有危险……很古怪。"] = "Wait, my inspiration is warning me that there is danger here... it's very strange.",
	["等等，等等，我笔记还没翻到那一页……"] = "Wait, wait, I haven't turned to that page in my notes yet...",
	["等等，这个小孩怎么好像朝我走过来了？"] = "Wait, why does this child seem to be walking toward me?",
	["等等，这里好像不太对劲。"] = "Wait, something doesn't feel right here.",
	["等等，这里怎么还有几本书......"] = "Wait, why are there a few books here...",
