	["管家·提交点"] = "Butler · Submission point",
	["管家、医生、仆人……在那段时间里，每个人都有机会进入卧室，看来得去收集其余三人的证词才能继续推理了。"] = "Butler, doctor, servant... during that time, everyone had the opportunity to enter the bedroom. It seems I need to collect the testimonies of the other three to continue the deduction.",
	["管家、医生、仆人……在那段时间里，每个人都有机会进入那扇门，看来得去收集其余三人的证词才能继续推理了。"] = "The butler, the doctor, the servant... during that time, everyone had the opportunity to enter that door. It seems I need to collect the testimonies of the other three to continue the deduction.",
	["管家东"] = "Butler East",
	["管家仆人_1"] = "Butler Servant_1",
	["管家仆人_2"] = "Butler Servant_2",
	["管家仆人_3"] = "Butler Servant_3",
	["管家仆人_4"] = "Butler Servant_4",
	["管家仆人_5"] = "Butler Servant_5",
	["管家会告诉你一切的。我还有些问题，不得不向你询问。"] = "The butler will tell you everything. I have some questions that I must ask you.",
	["管家伪造案发现场"] = "The butler faked the crime scene",
	["管家先生和乔纳尔医生离开了……"] = "The butler and Dr. Jonar have left...",
	["管家先生还在外面……去找他问问好了。"] = "The butler is still outside... I'll go ask him.",
	["管家先生，管家先生，我报名，我很能干活！"] = "Mr. Butler, Mr. Butler, I'm signing up, I'm very capable of hard work!",
	["管家具有机会"] = "The butler had the opportunity",
	["管家出场"] = "Butler Appearance",
	["管家出场后"] = "After the butler appears",
	["管家出现"] = "Butler appears",
	["管家前往卧室送药的时间与霍克斯男爵的死亡时间吻合。他有充分的时间杀害霍克斯男爵。"] = "The time the butler went to the bedroom to deliver medicine coincides with the time of Baron Hawkes's death. He had ample time to murder Baron Hawkes.",
	["管家北"] = "Butler North",
	["管家南"] = "Butler Nan",
	["管家召唤"] = "Butler Summon",
	["管家召唤了庄园的看门犬，但这头猎犬已经异化成了诡异的模样……"] = "The butler summoned the manor's watchdog, but this hound has already mutated into a bizarre form...",
	["管家和男爵关系怎么样？"] = "What is the relationship between the butler and the baron?",
	["管家女士还在外面。是时候叫她回来了。"] = "The housekeeper is still outside. It's time to call her back.",
	["管家已经在议员宅邸的门口等待，前去向他了解情况吧。"] = "The butler is already waiting at the entrance of the councilor's mansion, go and ask him about the situation.",
	["管家幻影"] = "Butler Phantom",
	["管家幻影-二阶段"] = "Butler Phantom - Phase Two",
	["管家幻影召唤追人小猎犬"] = "Butler Phantom Summons Chasing Hound",
	["管家幻影召唤锁头小猎犬"] = "Butler Phantom Summons Locking Hound",
	["管家幻象标记"] = "Butler Illusion Mark",
	["管家幻象点名标记"] = "Butler Illusion Target Mark",
	["管家幻象连线"] = "Butler illusion connection",
	["管家异变"] = "Butler mutates",
	["管家手里的皇冠，是一件0级封印物，因为堕落母神的污染，已经有了活化的迹象。"] = "The crown in the butler's hand is a Grade 0 Sealed Artifact, which has shown signs of activation due to the corruption of the Mother Goddess of Depravity.",
	["管家拥有远程攻击能力，小心！"] = "The butler has ranged attack capabilities; be careful!",
	["管家文森特不是个爱说话的人，但每天傍晚他都会站在庄园门口，等安德鲁把当天的巡视路线跑完。\n安德鲁回来的时候，他会说一句：\"今天干得好。\"\n就这一句。每天都说。安德鲁就会把头蹭过来，等他摸。\n庄园变了，污染侵蚀了安德鲁的眼睛，夺走了它的意志。它不再认识任何人，只是一遍一遍地跑完那条巡视路线。\n但每次跑回到门口，它都会停一下。然后继续走。\n文森特站在窗后看见了这一幕，一句话也没有说。"] = "Butler Vincent is not a man of many words, but every evening he stands at the manor gate, waiting for Andrew to finish the day's patrol route. \nWhen Andrew returns, he will say: \"Good job today.\" \nJust that one sentence. Every day. Andrew would then rub its head against him, waiting for him to pet it. \nThe manor changed; corruption eroded Andrew's eyes and took away its will. It no longer recognizes anyone, just running that patrol route over and over again. \nBut every time it runs back to the gate, it stops for a moment. Then it continues walking. \nVincent stands behind the window and sees this scene, not saying a single word.",
	["管家是第一个闯入卧室的人，他有时间伪造案发现场，将嫌疑转嫁仆人。"] = "The butler was the first to break into the bedroom; he had the time to forge the crime scene and shift suspicion onto the servant.",
	["管家朝向点位"] = "Butler faces the point",
	["管家杀害男爵"] = "The butler murdered the Baron",
	["管家测试"] = "Butler test",
	["管家特写摄像机"] = "Butler Close-up Camera",
	["管家的忠诚残留，在子爵夫人使用幽灵猎杀时，替她标记目标。标记同一目标3次时，子爵夫人将陷入混乱，进行无差别攻击。"] = "Butler's lingering loyalty; marks the target for her when the Viscountess uses Ghost Hunt. When the same target is marked 3 times, the Viscountess will fall into chaos and attack indiscriminately.",
	["管家的星象之力扭曲了时空，可从前方浮现的传送门返回大厅"] = "The butler's astrological power has distorted space-time; you can return to the hall from the portal that appears in front.",
	["管家的行为与他的忠诚不符"] = "The butler's behavior is inconsistent with his loyalty",
	["管家的行动"] = "The butler's actions",
	["管家的证词"] = "Butler's Testimony",
	["管家约翰"] = "Butler John",
	["管家约翰从小看着霍克斯男爵长大，照顾霍克斯超过三十年。管家曾在猎场意外中救过男爵的命，二人关系<InvHighlight>极为亲近。</>\n仆人性格胆小老实，<InvHighlight>不擅长撒谎。</>\n埃文医生过去<InvHighlight>十分关心</>男爵的身体状况，近期态度却明显变得冷淡。\t"] = " Butler John watched Baron Hawkes grow up and has taken care of Hawkes for over thirty years. The butler once saved the Baron's life in a hunting accident, and the two had an <InvHighlight> extremely close </> relationship. \n The servant is timid and honest by nature and <InvHighlight> is not good at lying. </> \n Dr. Evan used to <InvHighlight> care very much about </> the Baron's physical condition, but his attitude has become noticeably cold recently.",
	["管家约翰？"] = "Butler John?",
	["管家舍身救主"] = "The butler sacrificed himself to save his master",
	["管家西"] = "Butler West",
	["管家负责霍克斯男爵的药物管理，拥有接触霍克斯男爵的机会和伪造案发现场的时间。"] = "The butler was responsible for Baron Hawkes's medication management, giving him the opportunity to contact the Baron and the time to forge the crime scene.",
	["管家身后的房间可能通往庄园更深的区域，继续前进吧。"] = "The room behind the butler might lead to deeper areas of the manor. Let's continue forward.",
	["管家长期负责男爵的药物管理。案发当天下午，他曾进入卧室送药，拥有毒杀男爵的机会。"] = "The butler was responsible for the Baron's long-term medication management. On the afternoon of the incident, he had entered the bedroom to deliver medicine, giving him the opportunity to poison the Baron.",
	["管家门口镜头（暂时废弃）"] = "Butler doorway camera (temporarily abandoned)",
	["管家阿尔伯特"] = "Butler Albert",
	["管家：我家主人说，30镑是诚实者应得的报酬。"] = "Butler: My master said, 30 pounds is the reward that an honest person deserves.",
