	["米尔贡根失去耐心！进入狂暴！！！"] = "Milgongen has lost patience! Entering Berserk state!!!",
	["米尔贡根标记Buff"] = "Milgongen Mark Buff",
	["米尔贡根狂暴"] = "Milgongen Berserk",
	["米尔贡根血量在75%以上时为<Disable>阶段1</>，一阶段场上最多2座雕像同时进入激光状态，需要在同时注意米尔贡根释放的机制和抵挡<Disable>雕像射线</>。"] = "When Milgongen's health is above 75%, it is <Disable>Phase 1</>. In the first phase, up to 2 statues can enter the laser state at the same time. Players need to pay attention to the mechanics released by Milgongen and block the <Disable>statue rays</>.",
	["米尔贡根血量在75%以下时为<Disable>阶段二</>，二阶段米尔贡根将获得一定的常驻免伤效果。但在米尔贡根<Disable>破防</>时，免伤效果会被移除，并且米尔贡根破防状态的持续时间更长。二阶段场上有2座雕像进入激光状态，1座雕像进入法阵状态。"] = "When Milgongen's health is below 75%, it is <Disable>Phase 2</>. In the second phase, Milgongen will gain a certain permanent damage reduction effect. However, when Milgongen is <Disable>Armor Broken</>, the damage reduction effect will be removed, and the duration of Milgongen's Armor Broken state will be longer. In the second phase, 2 statues enter the laser state and 1 statue enters the spell field state.",
