	["糊墙"] = "Wall Paster",
	["糕点铺的蜂蜜糕，今日的糖放多了，掌柜的愁眉苦脸藏在后厨。"] = "The honey cakes at the bakery had too much sugar today; the shopkeeper is hiding in the back kitchen with a worried look on his face.",
