	["紫藤廊道"] = "Wisteria Corridor",
	["紫藤廊道下午茶时间"] = "Afternoon Tea at the Wisteria Corridor",
	["紫藤廊道的观景拍照留念：\n距离圣赛琳娜教堂不远处的小巷，紫藤花四季盛放。\n人们来此度过闲暇时光，花房为人们包装花束、递送祝福。\n黑荆棘的值夜者们常常来此散步，花香会给予他们安宁的拥抱。"] = "Wisteria Corridor Sightseeing Photo: \nA small alley not far from Saint Selena Cathedral, where wisteria blooms all year round. \nPeople come here to spend their leisure time; the flower shop packages bouquets and delivers blessings for them. \nThe Nighthawks of Blackthorn often come here for a stroll; the fragrance of flowers gives them a peaceful hug.",
	["紫藤花"] = "Wisteria",
	["紫藤花下\n嘉德丽雅扶了扶眼镜，起身往紫藤花画廊的深处走去"] = "Under the wisteria \n Cattleya adjusts her glasses and stands up, walking toward the depths of the wisteria gallery.",
	["紫藤花下                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          紫藤花廊,嘉德丽雅坐在花架下,有花瓣飘落。\n她扶了扶眼镜,起身朝紫藤花廊深处缓缓走去。"] = "Under the wisteria. Wisteria corridor, Cattleya sits under the trellis, petals drifting down. \n She adjusts her glasses, stands up, and walks slowly into the depths of the wisteria corridor.",
