	["红手套"] = "Red Glove",
	["红手套……和伦纳德一样。"] = "Red Glove... just like Leonard.",
	["红手套代表了什么？"] = "What do the Red Gloves represent?",
	["红手套可以不受限制地追踪和抓捕罪犯和被关注的邪恶者。"] = "Red Gloves can track and arrest criminals and those evil individuals under surveillance without restrictions.",
	["红手套是没有固定辖区的，伦纳德总是喜欢回来这里，我也偶尔来看看。"] = "Red Gloves don't have a fixed jurisdiction. Leonard always likes to come back here, and I drop by occasionally too.",
	["红晶菊"] = "Red Crystal Chrysanthemum",
	["红月"] = "Red Moon",
	["红月之跃，那就像鹰之翱翔一般，能让你体会真正自由的感觉！"] = "Leap of the Red Moon, it's like an eagle soaring, it can let you experience the feeling of true freedom!",
	["红月亮街"] = "Red Moon Street",
	["红月亮街\r\n<LeonSubTitle size=\"38\">Red Moonlight Street</>"] = "Red Moon Street\r\n<LeonSubTitle size=\"38\">Red Moonlight Street</>",
	["红月亮街上，有人在当街大喊我爱你。"] = "On Red Moon Street, someone is shouting \"I love you\" in the middle of the street.",
	["红月亮街的圣赛琳娜教堂，是黑夜女神教会在廷根的总部。"] = "Saint Selena Cathedral on Red Moon Street is the headquarters of the Church of the Evernight Goddess in Tingen.",
	["红月亮街，玛丽"] = "Red Moon Street, Mary.",
	["红月当空，难以忽视；古堡依旧，无人深入。"] = "The red moon is in the sky, hard to ignore; the ancient castle remains, and no one goes deep inside.",
	["红月注视之下，周明瑞从疼痛中惊醒，成为了鲁恩王国廷根市的克莱恩。想要回家的他尝试了一个古怪的仪式，却意外进入了一片灰雾弥漫的空间……"] = "Under the gaze of the crimson moon, Zhou Mingrui wakes up from the pain and becomes Klein of Tingen City, Loen Kingdom. Wanting to go home, he tries a strange ritual, but accidentally enters a space filled with gray fog...",
	["红月注视，跪地臣服！"] = "The Red Moon watches, kneel and submit!",
	["红月照耀大地 木偶荣获新生"] = "The red moon illuminates the earth, the puppet gains new life",
	["红月牌"] = "Red Moon Card",
	["红月特效"] = "Red Moon Effect",
	["红月种子"] = "Crimson Moon Seed",
	["红月落下"] = "The Red Moon sets",
	["红月被遮蔽的深沉黑夜里，嘉德丽雅的面前。\n心灵巨龙的恐怖吐息，几乎在瞬间洞穿了这位半神的精神！\n——但嘉德丽雅还活着。\n那张绯红的纸人如同凝结的月光。\n它只在最危险的那一刻，承担那致命的一击。\n然后留下微微发冷的身体，提醒着那擦肩而过的死亡。"] = "In the deep night when the red moon was obscured, before Cattleya. \n The terrifying breath of the Mind Dragon pierced through this Demigod's spirit in an instant! \n —But Cattleya was still alive. \n That crimson paper figurine was like congealed moonlight. \n It only bore that fatal blow at the most dangerous moment. \n Then it left behind a slightly cold body, reminding her of the death that had brushed past.",
	["红月降临"] = "Crimson Moon Descent",
	["红木座钟，典雅庄重，内含机械报时鸟，购买维修服务可上门调节音量。"] = "Rosewood grandfather clock, elegant and solemn, containing a mechanical cuckoo; repair services can be purchased for volume adjustment.",
