	["纵横在鲁恩铁路，谈笑间吞吐百万，在你眼前的是——站在顶峰的铁路大亨！参与铁路大亨玩法，获得周排行榜第1名。"] = "Traversing the Loen railways, swallowing millions in laughter, before you stands—the Railway Tycoon at the peak! Participate in the Railway Tycoon challenge and win 1st place in the weekly leaderboard.",
