	["纵火犯：凭什么命运要夺走我的一切！那些有钱人什么都不用做，就享受财富。而我们……拼尽全力，却最终一无所有。\n？？？：又一个……错的是这个世界，你难道不准备做点什么吗？"] = "Pyromaniac: Why does fate have to take everything from me! Those rich people don't have to do anything to enjoy their wealth. And us... we try our best, yet in the end, we have nothing. \n???: Another one... It is this world that is wrong. Aren't you going to do something about it?",
