	["纺织厂如同教堂一般静谧，你的灵性却如琴键起伏不定，你向灵性预警方向看去。\n隐约看见一只手在黑雾中挣扎着，在地面刻出五道血痕，\n疯女工的惨叫再次从黑雾中传来， 她被拖进黑雾之中，再没有一点动静……"] = "The textile factory was as quiet as a church, but your spirituality was fluctuating like piano keys. You looked in the direction of the Spirituality Warning. \nVaguely saw a hand struggling in the black fog, carving five bloodstains on the ground,\n the screams of the mad female worker came from the black fog again. She was dragged into the black fog, and there was no more movement...",
