	["终结开膛手的时间正是白昼般的夜晚"] = "The time the Ripper was ended was during a night as bright as day",
	["终结开膛手的角色是？"] = "Who is the character that ends the Ripper?",
	["终结开膛手的角色正是警察队长"] = "The character who ended the Ripper is the police captain",
	["终结技能"] = "Finisher Skill",
	["终结技能等级+4，释放技能时，概率使技能增强额外提高40，持续10秒，20秒最多触发1次。"] = "Ultimate Skill level +4. When releasing skills, there is a chance to increase Skill Enhancement by 40 for 10 seconds; can be triggered at most once every 20 seconds.",
	["终结者"] = "Finisher",
	["终结者就这么点能耐吗？看来这里没出过像样的拳击手。"] = "Is that all the Terminator can do? It seems this place hasn't produced any decent boxers.",
	["终结者就这点能耐吗？"] = "Is that all the Terminator can do?",
	["终结：半径9米的圆形"] = "Finish: Circle with a radius of 9 meters",
	["终结：自身4.5米范围内的区域"] = "Finish: Area within 4.5 meters of self",
	["终结：自身4.5米范围的圆形区域"] = "Finish: Circular area within 4.5 meters of yourself",
	["绊马索"] = "Tripwire",
	["绊马索减速"] = "Tripwire Slow",
	["绍兴"] = "Shaoxing",
	["绍兴Rank 10"] = "Shaoxing Rank 10",
	["经不住软磨硬泡，最终还是被迫买下烛台……"] = "Unable to resist the pestering, I was eventually forced to buy the candlestick...",
	["经久不衰的北大陆经典花纹，无论什么时候都不会过时。"] = "The enduring classic pattern of the Northern Continent, which will never go out of style.",
	["经典模式"] = "Classic Mode",
	["经典模式：拖拽屏幕旋转视角，默认鼠标常驻。\n动作模式：移动鼠标旋转视角，按住Alt呼出鼠标指针。"] = "Classic Mode: Drag the screen to rotate the view; mouse is resident by default. \n Action Mode: Move the mouse to rotate the view; hold Alt to bring up the mouse pointer.",
	["经典款式？塔罗学派很多年轻人都有这样的喜好。"] = "Classic style? Many young people in the Tarot Club have such preferences.",
	["经典款式？塔罗学院很多年轻人都有这样的喜好。"] = "A classic style? Many young people at Tarot Academy have such preferences.",
	["经典的"] = "Classic",
	["经典的木门样式，隔开一方室内空间。"] = "A classic wooden door style that separates an indoor space.",
	["经典的波浪发式，透出来自上个时代的优雅余韵。"] = "Classic wavy hairstyle, revealing an elegant lingering charm from the previous era.",
	["经典窖藏红酒，色泽深邃，入口顺滑饱满，经得起岁月收藏。"] = "Classic cellar-aged red wine, deep in color, smooth and full-bodied on the palate, worthy of aging through the years.",
	["经发酵的普通葡萄酒，常作为仪式媒介，用于缓冲超凡力量与人体的冲突。"] = "Fermented ordinary wine, often used as a ritual medium to buffer the conflict between extraordinary power and the human body.",
	["经受神圣的审判与焚烧，直至罪孽净尽。"] = "Endure the divine judgment and burning until all sins are purged.",
	["经太阳信仰仪式祝圣的器物，带有明确的光明、净化与秩序象征。"] = "An object consecrated through Sun Pathway faith rituals, carrying clear symbols of light, Purification, and order.",
	["经常有人说！但我觉得这是夸奖，对吧？"] = "People say that often! But I think it's a compliment, right?",
	["经您治理的因蒂斯，想必是您最满意的作品。"] = "Intis, governed by you, must be your most satisfying work.",
	["经月光净化的巨熊胆汁，能中和部分诅咒并增强恢复力。"] = "Giant bear bile purified by moonlight, which can neutralize some Curses and enhance recovery.",
	["经月光净化的苦，能治愈创伤。"] = "Bitterness purified by moonlight can heal Trauma.",
	["经查证，这些金币来自一名资本家洛克，含有非凡力量，不能让普通市民接触，会带来不可预料的危险。"] = "After verification, these gold coins came from a capitalist named Locke and contain Beyonder power. They cannot be allowed to reach ordinary citizens, as they will bring unpredictable dangers.",
	["经特定仪式去除负面影响的器物，常作为安全的仪式承载体。"] = "An artifact whose negative effects have been removed through a specific ritual, often used as a safe ritual carrier.",
	["经理打开金库时，你礼貌地问“能装多少算多少对吗？”"] = "When the manager opened the vault, you politely asked, \"It's 'take as much as you can carry,' right?\"",
	["经由特殊仪式魔法制成的治疗药剂，能激发人体自愈极限。"] = "A healing potion made through special Ritual Magic, capable of stimulating the body's self-healing limits.",
	["经由特殊仪式魔法制成的特殊药剂，能填满灵性的空洞，察觉隐秘与未知。"] = "A special potion made through special Ritual Magic, capable of filling the void of spirituality and perceiving secrets and the unknown.",
	["经由特殊仪式魔法制成的狂暴药剂，使人剥离痛觉与恐惧，短暂化为战斗兵器。"] = "A Berserk potion made through special Ritual Magic, stripping away pain and Horror, briefly turning one into a combat weapon.",
	["经过%d天的评选，%s为俱乐部付出了诸多辛勤，成功当选为新一任俱乐部领袖"] = "After %d days of selection, %s has contributed much hard work to the club and was successfully elected as the new club leader.",
	["经过<Highlight>赛勒斯·莫宁</>的帮助，你的理智恢复了%s"] = "With the help of <Highlight> Cyrus Morning </>, your Sanity has been restored by %s",
	["经过“正义”小姐的心理治疗，和在咖啡厅的休憩后……"] = "After the psychotherapy from Miss Justice and a rest at the cafe...",
	["经过一段时间的努力，莱昂终于完成了今日的义工工作。"] = "After some effort, Leon finally completed today's volunteer work.",
	["经过一番深思熟虑，您选择了退出%s俱乐部"] = "After careful consideration, you have chosen to leave Club %s.",
	["经过净化、不含任何杂质的水，是绝大多数仪式与配方的基础介质。"] = "Water that has been purified and contains no impurities; it is the basic medium for the vast majority of rituals and formulas.",
	["经过协会内部各个成员的努力，目前神奇生物保护协会已经初具规模了。"] = "Through the efforts of various members within the association, the Magical Creature Protection Association has now taken initial shape.",
	["经过我的研究，结合了鲁恩人的饮食偏好，我发明出了这道菜品——将咸鱼头依次放在派上烤！"] = "After my research, combined with the dietary preferences of Loen people, I invented this dish—placing salted fish heads on a pie and baking them in order!",
	["经过我近半年的实验，我每天许不同的愿，并记录它们的结果。"] = "After nearly half a year of experiments, I make a different wish every day and record the results.",
	["经过推理，知道了这一幕的真相是：<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">警察队长拿走了手枪前往河边，而少女故意从河边逃向警局外，在白昼般的晚上将开膛手一路引向了警局外。</>。"] = "After reasoning, the truth of this scene is: <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">The police captain took the pistol and went to the riverside, while the young girl intentionally fled from the riverside toward the outside of the police station, leading the Ripper all the way outside the police station during the day-like night. </>.",
	["经过推理，知道了这一幕的真相是：<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">警察队长</>拿走了手枪前往河边，而少女故意从河边逃向<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">警局外</>，在<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">白昼般的晚上</>将开膛手一路引向了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">警局外</>。"] = "After reasoning, the truth of this scene is: <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">The police captain </>took the pistol and went to the riverside, while the young girl intentionally fled from the riverside toward <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">outside the police station</>, leading the Ripper all the way toward <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">outside the police station</> during the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">day-like night</>.",
	["经过改良的霰弹枪"] = "Modified Shotgun",
	["经过漫长的实验和摸索，人们完善了魔药体系，形成了稳定的序列链条，序列数字越低，魔药品阶越高。"] = "After long experiments and exploration, people perfected the potion system and formed a stable Sequence chain. The lower the Sequence number, the higher the potion grade.",
	["经过这段时间的合作，我们应该都对彼此积累了一点信任。"] = "After working together for this long, we should have both built up a bit of trust in each other.",
