	["结合CheckContainObjOnShot使用，拍摄到了物体时发送事件"] = "Used in conjunction with CheckContainObjOnShot; sends event when an object is captured",
	["结合各个神之途径的非凡特性的物品统称为神奇物品，其中被正神教会搜集封印的那些有强大的负面效果的统称为封印物。不含有非凡特性，但具备一定的超凡表现的物品统称非凡之物。"] = "Items that combine Beyonder characteristics from various pathways are collectively known as Sealed Artifacts. Those collected and sealed by the Churches of the Orthodox Deities that possess powerful negative effects are collectively known as Sealed Artifacts. Items that do not contain Beyonder characteristics but possess certain extraordinary properties are collectively known as Beyonder items.",
	["结合额外伤害表使用"] = "Use in conjunction with the additional damage table",
	["结完婚你就懂了。"] = "You'll understand once you're married.",
	["结实的"] = "Robusto",
	["结实耐骑，齿轮传动特别顺畅，经得起工厂区那些石板路颠簸。蒸汽教会的工匠亲自监制，质量最有保证！"] = "Sturdy and durable for riding, the gear transmission is exceptionally smooth, capable of withstanding the bumps of the cobblestone roads in the factory district. Personally supervised by the craftsmen of the Church of Steam, the quality is guaranteed!",
	["结实！你坐上去，咻的一下，比马车还快！ 可好玩了！"] = "It's sturdy! You sit on it, whoosh, it's faster than a carriage! It's so much fun!",
