	["绯红遮蔽了一切，只留下你痛苦的闷哼和急促心跳声。\n“正义”：不，不要拥抱那背负污染的红月。\n“正义”：你将永远无法醒来。\n你执意选择拥抱“伟大母亲”，心理治疗失败，被污染完全侵蚀。"] = "The crimson obscured everything, leaving only your painful muffled groans and the sound of rapid heartbeats. \n \"Justice\": No, do not hug that red moon burdened with corruption. \n \"Justice\": You will never be able to wake up. \n You insisted on choosing to hug the \"Great Mother\"; the Psychotherapy failed, and you were completely eroded by the corruption.",
