	["罗塞尔·古斯塔夫"] = "Roselle Gustav",
	["罗塞尔·古斯塔夫发明了蒸汽机，改良了帆船。"] = "Roselle Gustav invented the steam engine and improved sailing ships.",
	["罗塞尔·古斯塔夫曾推翻了索伦家族对因蒂斯王国的统治。"] = "Roselle Gustav once overthrew the Solomon family's rule over the Intis Republic.",
	["罗塞尔·古斯塔夫曾经是因蒂斯共和国的首任执政官。"] = "Roselle Gustav was once the first Consul of the Intis Republic.",
	["罗塞尔·古斯塔夫评传"] = "A Critical Biography of Roselle Gustav",
	["罗塞尔·困难"] = "Roselle · Hard",
	["罗塞尔·普通"] = "Roselle · Normal",
	["罗塞尔与时代浪潮"] = "Roselle and the tides of the era",
	["罗塞尔之笔"] = "Pen of Roselle",
	["罗塞尔全局·困难"] = "Roselle Global · Hard",
	["罗塞尔全局·普通"] = "Roselle Global · Normal",
	["罗塞尔出现"] = "Roselle appears",
	["罗塞尔单BOSS团本-史诗"] = "Roselle Single-Boss Raid — Epic",
	["罗塞尔单BOSS团本-普通"] = "Roselle Single-Boss Raid — Normal",
	["罗塞尔单BOSS团本-终局挑战"] = "Roselle Single-Boss Raid — Final Challenge",
	["罗塞尔卧室1"] = "Roselle bedroom 1",
	["罗塞尔又是谁？一百多年前……工业革命？"] = "Who is Roselle again? Over a hundred years ago... the Industrial Revolution?",
	["罗塞尔古斯塔夫"] = "Roselle Gustav",
	["罗塞尔和咸鱼？"] = "Roselle and salted fish?",
	["罗塞尔和她……？"] = "Roselle and her...?",
	["罗塞尔四处征战，成就大帝之名，同时曾作为知识皇帝的他，收集了有关战争的历史，其中最为庞杂丰富的便是第四纪的四皇之战。\n在罗塞尔大帝陨落之后，祂的知识与意志并未消散，而是与王冠结合，成为了知识王冠。其中蕴含着最为丰富的一处知识，承载着祂对\"四皇之战\"的全部记忆——那些血与火的岁月、征服与被征服的史诗、王朝兴衰的轨迹，被知识皇冠的光芒永久镌刻。\n末日降临，母神的威胁逼近，祂影响了知识皇冠让其权柄自行运转，以知识带来\"创造\"，于是，一个前所未有的存在诞生了——\n「战略服」，一个由罗塞尔的战争记忆与知识皇冠的历史推演能力，共同编织的平行空间集合体。\n\"战略服，等你入局。\""] = "Roselle fought everywhere, achieving the name of Great Emperor. At the same time, as the Knowledge Emperor, he collected history related to war, the most complex and rich of which was the War of the Four Emperors in the Fourth Epoch.\nAfter the fall of Emperor Roselle, His knowledge and will did not dissipate, but combined with the crown to become the Knowledge Crown. It contains the richest piece of knowledge, carrying all His memories of the \"War of the Four Emperors\"—those years of blood and fire, the epics of conquering and being conquered, and the trajectories of the rise and fall of dynasties were permanently engraved by the light of the Knowledge Crown.\nThe apocalypse descended, and the threat of the Mother Goddess approached. She influenced the Knowledge Crown to make its authority operate on its own, bringing \"creation\" through knowledge. Thus, an unprecedented existence was born—\n\"Strategic Server\", a collection of parallel spaces woven together by Roselle's war memories and the historical deduction ability of the Knowledge Crown.\n\"Strategic Server, waiting for you to enter the game.\"",
	["罗塞尔在目标位置树立<HighLight>帝国旗帜</>，<HighLight>旗帜</>具有血量可以被攻击，<HighLight>帝国旗帜</>存在时间内颁布<HighLight>律令</>：敌方每次闪避消耗的体力值翻倍，移速降低，己方多个<HighLight>旗帜</>效果不叠加，该技能体力消耗相应的效果不受其他体力消耗速率效果的影响。"] = "Roselle erects an <HighLight>Imperial Flag</> at the target location. The <HighLight>Flag</> has Health and can be attacked. While the <HighLight>Imperial Flag</> exists, it issues a <HighLight>Decree</>: the stamina cost for enemy dodges is doubled, and movement speed is reduced. Multiple <HighLight>Flags</> do not stack, and the stamina cost effect of this skill is unaffected by other stamina consumption rate effects.",
	["罗塞尔在目标位置树立<HighLight>帝国旗帜</>，<HighLight>旗帜</>继承250%生命值，<HighLight>帝国旗帜</>存在时间内，<HighLight>旗帜</>周围12米半径内颁布<HighLight>律令</>：敌方每次闪避消耗的体力值翻倍，移动速度降低15%，<HighLight>旗帜</>持续12秒，己方多个<HighLight>旗帜</>效果不叠加，该技能体力消耗相应的效果不受其他体力消耗速率效果的影响。"] = "Roselle plants an <HighLight>Imperial Flag</> at the target location. The <HighLight>Flag</> inherits 250% Health. While the <HighLight>Imperial Flag</> exists, it issues a <HighLight>Decree</> within a 12-meter radius of the <HighLight>Flag</>: the Stamina cost for each enemy Dodge is doubled, and Movement Speed is reduced by 15%. The <HighLight>Flag</> lasts for 12 seconds. The effects of multiple friendly <HighLight>Flags</> do not stack. The Stamina cost of this skill is not affected by other Stamina consumption rate modifiers.",
	["罗塞尔在通识者途径序列2前，试图设计“斯蒂姆宫”，这是他所能构想出的蒸汽能力的极致，他想要借助这个伟大的蒸汽之城登上月球，但一直没有成功。而他转到窥秘人途径序列1知识皇帝后，又不再需要借助斯蒂姆宫登上月球，于是将其部分化作知识洪流收了起来。\n\n罗塞尔大帝在白枫宫刺杀陨落时，“斯蒂姆宫”的知识随同他的部分非凡特性一起凝聚成了封印物“知识皇冠”。如今知识王冠的活化出逃，藏于其中斯蒂姆宫的知识也在活化涌动，具现化于这个世界。\n\n伴随这座蒸汽之城一起醒来的，还有它旧主的一缕气息、一道残影……"] = "Before Roselle reached Sequence 2 of the Savant Pathway, he attempted to design the \"Steam Palace\". This was the pinnacle of steam power he could conceive, and he wanted to use this great steam city to land on the moon, but he never succeeded. After he switched to Sequence 1 Knowledge Emperor of the Mystery Pryer Pathway, he no longer needed to rely on the Steam Palace to land on the moon, so he turned part of it into a Torrent of Knowledge and put it away. \n\n When Emperor Roselle fell during the assassination at White Maple Palace, the knowledge of the \"Steam Palace\" condensed along with his partial Beyonder characteristic into the Sealed Artifact \"Knowledge Crown\". Now that the Knowledge Crown has activated and escaped, the knowledge of the Steam Palace hidden within is also activating and surging, manifesting in this world. \n\n Accompanying the awakening of this steam city is a wisp of its former master's aura, a remnant shadow...",
	["罗塞尔大帝"] = "Emperor Roselle",
	["罗塞尔大帝……"] = "Emperor Roselle...",
	["罗塞尔大帝不会错过任何一位美女，我得去寻觅她的芳踪。"] = "Emperor Roselle would never miss out on any beautiful woman, I must go and seek her trail.",
	["罗塞尔大帝似乎说过，富贵都藏在危险的求索中……<P_Heart>（艰难抉择）</>先去看看吧。"] = "Emperor Roselle seemed to say that wealth is hidden in dangerous pursuits... <P_Heart> (a difficult choice) </> Let's go take a look first.",
	["罗塞尔大帝副本开启"] = "Roselle the Great dungeon opened",
	["罗塞尔大帝在他的日记里提到过……“不管是学徒，还是<P_Yellow>占卜家</>、偷盗者，都更加好”。"] = "Emperor Roselle mentioned in his diary... \"Whether it's Apprentice, or <P_Yellow>Seer</>, or Marauder, they are all better\".",
	["罗塞尔大帝在他的日记里提到过……“不管是学徒，还是占卜家、偷盗者，都更加好”。"] = "Emperor Roselle mentioned in his diary... 'Whether it's Apprentice, Seer, or Marauder, they are all better'.",
	["罗塞尔大帝总是能抓住观众的心，如果是他的话，会怎么续写这个故事呢？"] = "Emperor Roselle can always capture the hearts of the audience. If it were him, how would he continue this story?",
	["罗塞尔大帝是这么说来着？"] = "Is that what Emperor Roselle said?",
	["罗塞尔大帝曾经说过——“如果早上能得知真理，让他晚上面临死亡，也是值得的。”"] = "Emperor Roselle once said—\"If one can learn the truth in the morning, it is worth facing death in the evening.\"",
	["罗塞尔大帝曾说过“富贵险中求”，这恰恰说明我马上就要发财了！"] = "Emperor Roselle once said, 'Wealth is sought amidst danger,' which just goes to show that I am about to get rich!",
	["罗塞尔大帝曾说过，知识就是力量。"] = "Emperor Roselle once said, Knowledge is Power.",
	["罗塞尔大帝最爱的咸鱼。"] = "Emperor Roselle's favorite salted fish.",
	["罗塞尔大帝有句名言，来都来了。"] = "Emperor Roselle has a famous saying: since we're already here.",
	["罗塞尔大帝有句诗是怎么说的来着？“许多人曾爱过你美丽的青春，当你老去，我却依旧爱你脸上的皱纹”……"] = "How did that poem by Emperor Roselle go? \"Many have loved your beautiful youth, but when you grow old, I still love the wrinkles on your face\"...",
	["罗塞尔大帝海报，无正文"] = "Emperor Roselle poster, no text",
	["罗塞尔大帝留下了很多童话故事，被贝尔纳黛精心收藏在塔罗学派。然而不知为何，童话故事们纷纷长出了双腿！它们和相邻的故事聊天打招呼，不慎衍生出好多离谱的剧情。文字溢出纸页，路过的学生被剧情吸引，纷纷向校长申请，进入故事近距离追看结局，顺便拨乱反正，让混乱的故事回归原貌。"] = "Emperor Roselle left behind many fairy tales, which were carefully collected by Bernadette in the Tarot Club. However, for some reason, the fairy tales have grown legs! They chat and greet neighboring stories, inadvertently deriving many absurd plots. The text overflows the pages, and passing students are attracted by the plots, applying to the principal one after another to enter the stories to watch the endings up close, and by the way, set things right so that the chaotic stories return to their original appearance.",
	["罗塞尔大帝登上月球时，并未乘坐这座蒸汽之城——但斯蒂姆宫为此而生，又为此沉寂。有些伟大的构想，即使未被选择，也值得被铭记。"] = "When Emperor Roselle ascended to the moon, he did not ride this City of Steam—but the Steam Palace was born for it, and fell silent for it. Some great concepts, even if not chosen, are worth remembering.",
	["罗塞尔大帝的《伯爵归来》本来就是连载在报纸上，写给普通市民的，你的改编也应该……"] = "Emperor Roselle's \"The Count's Return\" was originally serialized in newspapers and written for ordinary citizens. Your adaptation should also...",
	["罗塞尔大帝的一项发明。据说灵感源于家乡的提神配方。以薄荷精油为底，混入七种对抗腐败气息的草本——传言这个名字对应了“七位正神”。装于金属小瓶，随取随用，只需开瓶凑近鼻端，那股清冽的气味便能在一瞬间驱散腐败带来的头脑迷糊。\n\n无论何时何地，它都如此有效，并不昂贵的价格，却总能在最狼狈的时候救得了人。 "] = "An invention of Emperor Roselle. It is said that the inspiration came from a refreshing formula from his hometown. With peppermint essential oil as the base, mixed with seven herbs that fight against the aura of corruption—rumor has it that this name corresponds to the \"Seven Orthodox Gods.\" Packed in a small metal bottle, it can be used at any time; just open the bottle and bring it close to your nose, and that crisp scent can instantly dispel the mental confusion brought about by corruption. \n\n No matter when or where, it is always so effective, and at an inexpensive price, it can always save someone at their most disheveled moment.",
	["罗塞尔大帝的传记？好厚……翻翻目录吧。"] = "A biography of Emperor Roselle? It's so thick... Let me flip through the table of contents.",
	["罗塞尔大帝的探索队在扩招……"] = "Emperor Roselle's Exploration team is recruiting...",
	["罗塞尔大帝的残留意志……不太对劲。"] = "Emperor Roselle's residual will... something is not right.",
	["罗塞尔大帝的笔记？"] = "Emperor Roselle's notes?",
	["罗塞尔大帝的诗集，被放在最显眼的位置。"] = "Emperor Roselle's poetry collection, placed in the most conspicuous position.",
	["罗塞尔大帝的说话之道"] = "Emperor Roselle's Way of Speaking",
	["罗塞尔大帝的身影再次重现于世间，昔日伟岸的身影却染上了扭曲的绯色……"] = "The figure of Emperor Roselle reappears in the world, but the once-majestic figure is stained with a distorted crimson...",
	["罗塞尔大帝的这出戏里没有神祇和帝王，只有穿着粗呢外套的水手，他粗粝的台词就像石头一般砸碎了我毕生信奉的琉璃穹顶。"] = "There are no gods or emperors in this play by Emperor Roselle, only a sailor in a coarse coat. His rough lines smashed the glass dome I had believed in all my life like stones.",
	["罗塞尔大帝纪念展览？希望能看到罗塞尔大帝的发明原稿！"] = "Emperor Roselle Memorial Exhibition? I hope to see the original manuscripts of Emperor Roselle's inventions!",
	["罗塞尔大帝说的对，山峰之外有更高的山峰……"] = "Emperor Roselle was right, beyond the mountains there are higher mountains...",
	["罗塞尔大帝说的扮演是这个意思吗？或许可以尝试下，反正也不会有什么坏处。"] = "Is that what Emperor Roselle meant by acting? Perhaps I can try it; it won't do any harm anyway.",
	["罗塞尔大帝说过，“富贵从来都需要从危险中寻求”，这个机会我不能错过！"] = "Emperor Roselle said, 'Wealth and honor must always be sought from danger.' I cannot miss this opportunity!",
	["罗塞尔大帝说过，“真正的金子，不怕火的考验”。真正的艺术品，也不畏惧任何人的品鉴。"] = "Emperor Roselle once said, 'True gold does not fear the test of fire.' True works of art do not fear anyone's appraisal.",
	["罗塞尔大帝说过，三十年前河水在东……"] = "Emperor Roselle said that thirty years ago the river was in the east...",
	["罗塞尔大帝说过，人不该舍弃近处的东西，去追求远的东西。我为什么逞强接下这份困难的工作？我就要被困在这里了……"] = "Emperor Roselle said that one should not abandon what is near to pursue what is far. Why did I push myself to take on this difficult job? I'm going to be trapped here...",
	["罗塞尔大帝说过，善良与邪恶都会获得应有的回应！接下来就让他们去牢里反省吧！"] = "Emperor Roselle once said that both kindness and evil will receive their due response! Now, let them go to prison and reflect on their actions!",
	["罗塞尔大帝说过，当你发现一只老鼠，就意味着家已经被老鼠占据。"] = "Emperor Roselle said that when you find one mouse, it means the house has already been occupied by mice.",
	["罗塞尔大帝说过，相聚就是有缘分！我打算去那边探查，如果你需要，可以一起。"] = "Emperor Roselle once said that meeting is fate! I plan to investigate over there. If you need to, we can go together.",
	["罗塞尔大帝说过，若为自由的缘故，生命与金镑皆可抛。"] = "Emperor Roselle said, for the sake of freedom, both life and gold pounds can be cast aside.",
	["罗塞尔大帝说过，这是最好的时代，也是最坏的时代。"] = "Emperor Roselle said that this is the best of times, and the worst of times.",
	["罗塞尔大帝说，罗塞尔大帝说，罗塞尔大帝总是说——"] = "Emperor Roselle says, Emperor Roselle says, Emperor Roselle always says—",
	["罗塞尔大帝，您和“愚者”先生，是怎么认识的？"] = "Emperor Roselle, how did you and Mr. \"Fool\" come to know each other?",
	["罗塞尔大帝，您和“神秘女王”贝尔纳黛女士是父女？"] = "Emperor Roselle, are you and the 'Mystic Queen' Bernadette mother and daughter?",
	["罗塞尔大帝，您如何看待今日的鲁恩和因蒂斯？"] = "Emperor Roselle, how do you view Loen and Intis today?",
	["罗塞尔大帝，您对这个世界的发展做出了很多的贡献。"] = "Emperor Roselle, you have made many contributions to the development of this world.",
	["罗塞尔大帝，我了解到，您被称为“蒸汽之子”……"] = "Emperor Roselle, I learned that you are called the \"Son of Steam\"...",
	["罗塞尔大帝：等我成为高序列强者，看到一个“占卜家”就揍一个！"] = "Emperor Roselle: Once I become a high-sequence powerhouse, I'll beat up every 'Seer' I see!",
	["罗塞尔大帝：魔女的滋味真不错啊！"] = "Emperor Roselle: The taste of a witch is truly excellent!",
	["罗塞尔意志"] = "Roselle's Will",
	["罗塞尔意志·普通"] = "Roselle's Will - Normal",
	["罗塞尔意志·英雄"] = "Roselle's Will - Hero",
	["罗塞尔意志狂暴"] = "Roselle's Residual Will Berserk",
	["罗塞尔戏剧节"] = "Roselle Drama Festival",
	["罗塞尔戏剧节即将拉开帷幕！巨大的蒸汽之城重现于世，外界的异动惊扰了陵墓中沉睡的大帝……"] = "The Roselle Theater Festival is about to begin! The massive City of Steam has reappeared in the world, and the disturbances outside have disturbed the slumbering Emperor in his mausoleum...",
	["罗塞尔戏剧节开幕在即"] = "Roselle Drama Festival Opening Soon",
	["罗塞尔护符"] = "Roselle's Charm",
	["罗塞尔日记"] = "Roselle's Diary",
	["罗塞尔日记攻防"] = "Roselle's Diary Attack/Defense",
	["罗塞尔日记残页"] = "Roselle diary page",
	["罗塞尔日记（初见）"] = "Roselle's Diary (First Encounter)",
	["罗塞尔明信片"] = "Roselle Postcard",
	["罗塞尔曾经南征北战，将因蒂斯共和国再次改为帝国，自称“凯撒大帝”。"] = "Roselle once fought in many battles, reformed the Intis Republic back into an empire, and proclaimed himself 'Caesar the Great'.",
	["罗塞尔残存意志复苏"] = "Roselle's residual will revives",
	["罗塞尔海报"] = "Roselle Poster",
	["罗塞尔登场时强化全队，秘术师获得额外加成。"] = "When Roselle enters the field, buff the entire team; Mysticism users gain additional bonuses.",
	["罗塞尔的意志"] = "Roselle's Will",
	["罗塞尔的意志被红月侵蚀，彻底失控！"] = "Roselle's will has been eroded by the Red Moon; he has completely lost control!",
	["罗塞尔的日记"] = "Roselle's diary",
	["罗塞尔的残存意志1"] = "Roselle's Residual Will 1",
	["罗塞尔的残存意志2"] = "Roselle's Residual Will 2",
	["罗塞尔的残存意志3"] = "Roselle's Residual Will 3",
	["罗塞尔的残留意志"] = "Roselle's Residual Will",
	["罗塞尔的残留意志-1星"] = "Roselle's Residual Will - 1 Star",
	["罗塞尔的残留意志-2星"] = "Roselle's Residual Will - 2 Star",
	["罗塞尔的残留意志-3星"] = "Roselle's Residual Will - 3 Star",
	["罗塞尔终局之战"] = "Roselle Final Battle",
	["罗塞尔被刺杀后的遗物，有堕落母神污染的残留。 "] = "A relic left behind after Roselle was assassinated, containing lingering corruption from the Mother Goddess of Depravity.",
	["罗塞尔装备"] = "Roselle Equipment",
	["罗塞尔装备·污染"] = "Roselle Equipment - Corruption",
	["罗塞尔诗社成员"] = "Roselle Poetry Club member",
	["罗塞尔诗社社长"] = "Roselle Poetry Club president",
	["罗塞尔踱步路径"] = "Roselle pacing path",
	["罗塞尔邮票"] = "Roselle Stamp",
	["罗塞尔酥皮挞"] = "Roselle Puff Tart",
	["罗塞尔重写《基督山伯爵》的手稿。"] = "Manuscript of Roselle rewriting \"The Count of Monte Cristo\".",
	["罗塞尔隐秘羁绊奖励"] = "Roselle secret bond reward.",
	["罗塞尔：“故乡”"] = "Roselle: \"Hometown\"",
	["罗塞尔：《基督山伯爵》不愧是爽文的鼻祖，抄得好爽。"] = "Roselle: \"The Count of Monte Cristo\" is worthy of being the ancestor of satisfying novels, it feels so good to copy it.",
	["罗塞尔：你老爹我果然是这个世界上最出色的“工匠”！"] = "Roselle: Your old man is indeed the most outstanding 'Artisan' in this world!",
	["罗塞尔：你要永远记住这两个字——"] = "Roselle: You must always remember these two words—",
	["罗塞尔：做了一件很适合你的神奇物品"] = "Roselle: Made a mystical item that suits you very well.",
	["罗塞尔：困境都只是逆袭的前奏，来吧！主角的外挂是时候登场了！"] = "Roselle: Hardships are just the prelude to a comeback, come on! It's time for the protagonist's cheat to appear!",
	["罗塞尔：所以说，抓住人们内心深处最原始、最朴素、最浓烈的感情，才是一部作品成功的关键。"] = "Roselle: Therefore, grasping the most primitive, simple, and intense emotions deep in people's hearts is the key to a work's success.",
	["罗塞尔：无论在哪个时代、哪个世界，“善有善报，恶有恶报”永远是所有人都认同的正义观。"] = "Roselle: Regardless of the era or the world, 'good deeds are rewarded with good, and evil deeds are rewarded with evil' is a concept of justice that everyone will always agree with.",
	["罗塞尔：正因为如此，“复仇”才是最具有感染力的剧情，《基督山伯爵》才能成为一本世界名著级别的爽文。"] = "Roselle: Precisely because of this, \"revenge\" is the most infectious plot, and that's why \"The Count of Monte Cristo\" can become a world-class masterpiece of satisfying fiction.",
	["罗塞尔：永远不准回来！"] = "Roselle: Never come back!",
	["罗塞尔：离开吧……"] = "Roselle: Leave...",
	["罗塞尔：等我成为知识皇帝"] = "Roselle: Wait until I become the Knowledge Emperor.",
	["罗塞尔：至于关键台词，不妨致敬一下传奇场面……"] = "Roselle: As for the key lines, I might as well pay tribute to a legendary scene...",
	["罗塞尔：要的就是这种屈辱的感觉，特别是在这个贵族横行霸道的社会，因蒂斯人民一定会产生共鸣的。"] = "Roselle: That's the kind of humiliating feeling I want, especially in this society where nobles run rampant; the Intis people will definitely resonate with it.",
	["罗塞尔：贝尔纳黛就不用担心隐匿贤者了"] = "Roselle: Bernadette won't have to worry about the Hidden Sage anymore.",
	["罗塞尔：越狱、奇遇、金手指、信息差……后世很多套路都是从这里发扬光大的。"] = "Roselle: Prison breaks, encounters, golden fingers, information gaps... many tropes of later generations were carried forward from here.",
	["罗塞尔：这是爸爸给你的护身符文"] = "Roselle: This is the protective amulet Daddy gave you.",
	["罗塞尔：退婚流真是网文界的伟大发明，用它来魔改《基督山伯爵》的开头再合适不过了。"] = "Roselle: The \"broken engagement\" trope is truly a great invention in web literature; it's perfect for adapting the beginning of \"The Count of Monte Cristo\".",
	["罗塞尔？！我变成了罗塞尔大帝？"] = "Roselle?! I've become Emperor Roselle?",
