	["罗森是谁？"] = "Who is Rosen?",
	["罗森死了！我是他可怜的学生，不仅赚不到钱，还要每月给他上缴……"] = "Lawson is dead! I am his poor student. Not only can I not earn money, but I also have to pay him every month...",
	["罗森民俗草药店"] = "Rosson Folk Herb Shop",
	["罗森的民俗草药店"] = "Rosson's Folk Herbal Shop",
	["罗森草药店罗森草药店倒闭了！老板卷款逃跑，草药大甩卖中！"] = "Rosen Herbal Shop has gone out of business! The owner has absconded with the money, herbal clearance sale in progress!",
