	["罗珀"] = "Roper",
	["罗珊 你好点了吗？"] = "Rozanne, are you feeling better?",
	["罗珊 你知道昨天的案件档案放在哪里了吗？"] = "Rozanne, do you know where yesterday's case file was put?",
	["罗珊-对话萨凡娜"] = "Rozanne - Talk to Savannah",
	["罗珊1"] = "Roselle 1",
	["罗珊2"] = "Rozanne 2",
	["罗珊lookat"] = "Rozanne lookat",
	["罗珊·中点"] = "Rozanne - Midpoint",
	["罗珊·办公桌前"] = "Rozanne - at desk",
	["罗珊·回来"] = "Rozanne - Return",
	["罗珊·新"] = "Rozanne · New",
	["罗珊·默认"] = "Rozanne · Default",
	["罗珊……我们没保护好她。我们快点汇总分析下线索，找到调查方向。"] = "Rozanne... We didn't protect her. Let's quickly summarize and analyze the clues to find the direction of the investigation.",
	["罗珊上前"] = "Rozanne steps forward",
	["罗珊与市民失踪案"] = "Rozanne and the missing citizens case",
	["罗珊专门为你准备的入职礼包，里面装着一些你需要的东西。"] = "An onboarding gift package specially prepared for you by Rozanne, containing some items you need.",
	["罗珊从老维尔餐厅随手拿的今日菜单。"] = "Today's menu that Rozanne grabbed from Old Will's Restaurant.",
	["罗珊会有个能陪伴她，满足她一切要求的好丈夫，连加了胡椒粉的咖啡都能喝那种！"] = "Rozanne will have a good husband who can accompany her and satisfy all her demands, even one who can drink coffee with pepper added!",
	["罗珊位置"] = "Rozanne's location",
	["罗珊低头"] = "Rozanne lowers her head",
	["罗珊低头2"] = "Rozanne lowers her head 2",
	["罗珊你在外面走一天累了吧？快坐。"] = "Rozanne, you must be tired from walking around all day, right? Sit down.",
	["罗珊先行离开"] = "Rozanne leaves first",
	["罗珊初遇"] = "First meeting with Rozanne",
	["罗珊去准备合同了"] = "Rozanne went to prepare the contract",
	["罗珊又在例行整理"] = "Rozanne is doing her routine tidying again",
	["罗珊吃1"] = "Rozanne Eating 1",
	["罗珊吃3"] = "Rozanne Eating 3",
	["罗珊向你走来"] = "Rozanne walks toward you",
	["罗珊和丹尼等人正准备进入镜子时，一阵铃声响起。\n管家从绯红色的知识洪流特效中走出来，向众人微微欠身。"] = "Just as Rozanne and Dunn were preparing to enter the mirror, a bell rang.\n The butler walked out from the crimson torrent of knowledge effect and bowed slightly to everyone.",
	["罗珊和几位市民 \r\n在中央广场瓦解消散\r\n失踪地点共三个\r\n近期失踪者可能还活着"] = "Rozanne and several citizens \r\ndisappeared at the Central Plaza \r\n, totaling three locations \r\n. The recent missing persons might still be alive.",
	["罗珊和几位市民，在中央广场瓦解消散。失踪地点共三个，近期失踪者可能还活着。"] = "Rozanne and several citizens dissolved in the Central Plaza. There are three locations where people have gone missing, and the recent missing persons might still be alive.",
	["罗珊和安东愉快地享用完剩下的食物。"] = "Rozanne and Anton happily finished the rest of the food.",
	["罗珊和市民瓦解消散……知识皇冠的能力之一，就是将具体事物瓦解为知识洪流。"] = "Rozanne and the citizens dissolving... One of the abilities of the Crown of Knowledge is to disintegrate concrete objects into a torrent of knowledge.",
	["罗珊回前台表演"] = "Rozanne returns to front desk performance",
	["罗珊回应"] = "Rozanne responds",
	["罗珊回来了"] = "Rozanne is back",
	["罗珊回来路径"] = "Rozanne Return Path",
	["罗珊在前台低头忙碌，听有人来，抬头发现你和伦纳德。\n伦纳德向罗珊介绍了你，并向罗珊询问准备的合同和徽章。"] = "Rozanne is busy at the front desk, hears someone coming, looks up, and finds you and Leonard. \n Leonard introduces you to Rozanne and asks her about the prepared contract and badge.",
	["罗珊在理什么"] = "What is Rozanne tidying?",
	["罗珊坐着"] = "Rozanne Sitting",
	["罗珊失踪了 准确地说 是消散了"] = "Rozanne is missing. To be precise, she has dissipated.",
	["罗珊女士，你怎么突然沉默了？"] = "Ms. Rozanne, why did you suddenly go silent?",
	["罗珊女士，请允许我来挑战这一关。"] = "Ms. Rozanne, please allow me to take on this challenge.",
	["罗珊女士，这是谁留给我的纸条？"] = "Ms. Rozanne, who left this note for me?",
	["罗珊她……"] = "Rozanne, she...",
	["罗珊姐姐！"] = "Sister Rozanne!",
	["罗珊小姐 你也有这个小铜镜？我也有一个"] = "Miss Rozanne, you have this little copper mirror too? I have one as well.",
	["罗珊小姐 你怎么在这儿？"] = "Miss Rozanne, why are you here?",
	["罗珊小姐帮忙预订的工作餐，由醇厚的奶油和鲜美的牡蛎熬制而成。"] = "A work meal ordered by Miss Rozanne, made from rich cream and delicious oysters.",
	["罗珊小姐帮忙预订的工作餐，经过炙烤的羊腿肉，饱满的汁水将绵韧的肉质浸透。"] = "A work meal pre-ordered by Miss Rozanne. Roasted lamb leg meat, with full juices soaking into the tender and chewy meat.",
	["罗珊小姐真是位友善的人，打扰了，尼尔先生。"] = "Miss Rozanne is truly a friendly person. Sorry to bother you, Mr. Neil.",
	["罗珊小姐路过那里，但很快就和其他几位市民一起……变成碎片消散了。"] = "Miss Rozanne passed by there, but soon she and several other citizens... turned into fragments and dissipated.",
	["罗珊小姐！"] = "Miss Rozanne!",
	["罗珊小姐，你也有这个小铜镜？我也有一个。"] = "Miss Rozanne, you have this little bronze mirror too? I have one as well.",
	["罗珊小姐，我选好了，看起来都很好吃。"] = "Miss Rozanne, I've chosen, they all look delicious.",
	["罗珊小姐，这个铃铛是用来做什么的？"] = "Miss Rozanne, what is this bell used for?",
	["罗珊建议黑荆棘安保公司的新员工尽快熟悉廷根，新人手册会帮上不少忙。"] = "Rozanne suggests that new employees of the Blackthorn Security Company familiarize themselves with Tingen as soon as possible; the newcomer's manual will be quite helpful.",
	["罗珊归"] = "Roselle Returns",
	["罗珊彩蛋"] = "Rozanne Easter egg",
	["罗珊指路动作前转向定位"] = "Roselle Pointing Direction Action Before Turning Positioning",
	["罗珊最近话又多起来了，她把新来的文员带得很好。"] = "Rozanne has been talkative again lately; she's been training the new clerk well.",
	["罗珊点位2"] = "Rozanne point 2",
	["罗珊点位3"] = "Rozanne point 3",
	["罗珊点位4"] = "Rozanne Point 4",
	["罗珊点位5"] = "Rozanne Position 5",
	["罗珊父亲"] = "Rozanne's Father",
	["罗珊父亲：小罗珊 看着我"] = "Rozanne's father: Little Rozanne, look at me.",
	["罗珊父亲：我们是非凡者"] = "Rozanne's father: We are Beyonders.",
	["罗珊的声音"] = "Rozanne's voice",
	["罗珊的心意当然是最重要的，我们也只是考察一些基本条件，确保他没什么坏心。"] = "Rozanne's wishes are of course the most important, we are just checking some basic conditions to ensure he doesn't have any bad intentions.",
	["罗珊的怪"] = "Rozanne's monster",
	["罗珊的纸条"] = "Rozanne's note",
	["罗珊的花变怪"] = "Rozanne's Flower Transformation Monster",
	["罗珊的铜镜"] = "Rozanne's bronze mirror",
	["罗珊看下面"] = "Rozanne looks down",
	["罗珊离开路径"] = "Rozanne's Departure Path",
	["罗珊离开路径1"] = "Rozanne departure path 1",
	["罗珊离开路径2"] = "Roselle departure path 2",
	["罗珊离开路线"] = "Rozanne's departure route",
	["罗珊站"] = "Rozanne stands",
	["罗珊站着"] = "Roselle standing",
	["罗珊站起来"] = "Rosanne stands up",
	["罗珊说他们是为守护廷根而牺牲的，她还说，在黑荆棘一直流传着一句话："] = "Rozanne said they sacrificed themselves to guard Tingen. She also said that a saying has always been passed down among the Nighthawks:",
	["罗珊说话"] = "Rozanne speaks",
	["罗珊走向玩家"] = "Rozanne walks toward the player",
	["罗珊走来喝咖啡"] = "Rozanne walks over to drink coffee",
	["罗珊走路"] = "Rozanne Walking",
	["罗珊跑向小聚定位点"] = "Rozanne runs to the small gathering waypoint",
	["罗珊跑向弗莱定位点"] = "Roselle running to Frye waypoint",
	["罗珊路径"] = "Roselle Path",
	["罗珊转向"] = "Rozanne turns",
	["罗珊转身中景"] = "Rozanne turning medium shot",
	["罗珊近景"] = "Rozanne close-up",
	["罗珊远处镜头"] = "Rozanne long shot",
	["罗珊迷上了泡咖啡，说想泡出和老尼尔一样的味道。"] = "Rozanne has become obsessed with brewing coffee, saying she wants to brew the same taste as Old Neil.",
	["罗珊！"] = "Rozanne!",
	["罗珊！罗珊！"] = "Rozanne! Rozanne!",
	["罗珊，以后还有机会自我介绍，队长应该正等着你们。"] = "Rozanne, there will be opportunities to introduce ourselves later. The Captain should be waiting for you.",
	["罗珊，你太了不起了……"] = "Rozanne, you are amazing...",
	["罗珊，你知道昨天的案件档案放在哪里了吗？"] = "Rozanne, do you know where yesterday's case files were put?",
	["罗珊，你确定？"] = "Rozanne, are you sure?",
	["罗珊，你还在生我们的气吗？"] = "Rozanne, are you still angry with us?",
	["罗珊，你还好吗？"] = "Rozanne, are you okay?",
	["罗珊，停、停一下！"] = "Rozanne, stop, stop for a second!",
	["罗珊，好久不见啊。平时多谢你们安保公司照顾生意，来，尝尝我们的新菜。"] = "Rozanne, long time no see. Thanks for your security company's patronage. Come, try our new dish.",
	["罗珊，我和弗莱队长要去追查一件封印物。"] = "Rozanne, Captain Frye and I are going to track down a Sealed Artifact.",
	["罗珊，早上好！"] = "Rozanne, good morning!",
	["罗珊，没想到你还有做美食评论家的天赋呢。"] = "Rozanne, I didn't know you had a talent for being a food critic.",
	["罗珊：一定要小心啊。"] = "Rozanne: You must be careful.",
	["罗珊：他有位美丽的未婚妻，最近为了婚礼在努力攒钱。"] = "Rozanne: He has a beautiful fiancée and has been saving up for their wedding recently.",
	["罗珊：伦纳德就干过这种蠢事，他在成为“不眠者”的第一天就试图以冲刺的速度下楼。"] = "Rozanne: Leonard once did something that stupid. On his first day as a Sleepless, he tried to run down the stairs at a sprint.",
	["罗珊：你自己进去吧，我去找西迦要的资料了。"] = "Rozanne: You go in yourself, I'm going to find the files Xiga asked for.",
	["罗珊：刚才的是科恩黎，不久前从文职人员转为了正式的值夜者。"] = "Rozanne: That was Kenley just now. He transferred from a clerical position to a formal Nighthawk not long ago.",
	["罗珊：到了，这就是查尼斯门，队长就在旁边的值班室。"] = "Rozanne: We're here, this is Chanis Gate, the captain is in the duty room next door.",
	["罗珊：呃……"] = "Rozanne: Uh...",
	["罗珊：哇！吓我一跳。弗莱，你在这里做什么？"] = "Rozanne: Wow! You scared me. Frye, what are you doing here?",
	["罗珊：小心点，虽然我经常走这里，但我还是害怕摔倒， 咕噜咕噜滚下去。"] = "Rozanne: Be careful, although I walk here often, I'm still afraid of tripping and rolling down, Gulu Gulu.",
	["罗珊：左边通向的是圣赛琳娜教堂和炼金室，往右是武器、材料和文献库。"] = "Rozanne: The left side leads to Saint Selena Cathedral and the alchemy room, to the right are the weapons, materials, and archives.",
	["罗珊：希望邓恩队长别等急了。"] = "Rozanne: I hope Captain Dunn isn't waiting impatiently.",
	["罗珊：我一直都有点怕队长，虽然他很和蔼，给我父亲的感觉，但不知为什么就是害怕。"] = "Rozanne: I've always been a bit afraid of the Captain. Even though he's very kind and gives me a fatherly feeling, I don't know why, but I'm just afraid.",
	["罗珊：我们走吧，还得下几层楼梯。"] = "Rozanne: Let's go. We still have a few flights of stairs to descend.",
	["罗珊：我就不了，我要先送新人去入职，队长还等着呢。"] = "Rozanne: I'll pass. I have to take the newcomer to get settled in first; the Captain is still waiting.",
	["罗珊：我帮你，我记得它的位置。"] = "Rozanne: I'll help you. I remember where it is.",
	["罗珊：我是罗珊，以后我们就是同事了！"] = "Rozanne: I'm Rozanne. From now on, we're colleagues!",
	["罗珊：放心，能让你直接来这里，说明队长同意了。"] = "Rozanne: Don't worry, the fact that you were sent directly here means the Captain has agreed.",
	["罗珊：有道理。"] = "Rozanne: That makes sense.",
	["罗珊：沿这条路直走就是查尼斯门。"] = "Rozanne: Walk straight along this road to reach Chanis Gate.",
	["罗珊：然后，然后他就变成了车轮。哈哈，想想就好笑。"] = "Rozanne: And then, and then he turned into a wheel. Haha, it's hilarious just thinking about it.",
	["罗珊：科恩黎，值班辛苦了！"] = "Rozanne: Kenley, thanks for your hard work on duty!",
	["罗珊：西迦你去吧，待会我帮你把案件资料带上来。"] = "Rozanne: Xiga, you go. I'll bring the case files up for you in a moment.",
	["罗珊：证据？这是证据？！"] = "Rozanne: Evidence? This is evidence?!",
	["罗珊：那是弗莱，别看他这样，其实是个挺好的家伙，以后介绍给你认识。"] = "Rozanne: That's Frye, don't look at him like that, he's actually a pretty good guy, I'll introduce you later.",
	["罗珊：那起案件怎么了？"] = "Rozanne: What's wrong with that case?",
	["罗珊：那起纵火案？我把它收进文献室了。"] = "Rozanne: That arson case? I put it in the archives.",
	["罗珊？"] = "Rozanne?",
