	["老尼尔之死2动画"] = "Animation: The death of Old Neil 2",
	["老尼尔之死动画"] = "Animation: The death of Old Neil",
	["老尼尔会边看书边念叨，邓恩总是把队员护在身后，弗莱板着脸却偷偷请大家喝啤酒。"] = "Old Neil would mutter to himself while reading, Dunn would always shield his teammates behind him, and Frye would keep a straight face while secretly treating everyone to beer.",
