	["老尼尔家"] = "Old Neil's House",
	["老尼尔对话"] = "Old Neil Dialogue",
	["老尼尔对话报销"] = "Old Neil Dialogue Reimbursement",
	["老尼尔并没有用捡到的钱去还债，克莱恩对他的道德品质有了全新的认知。\n\n当然，他印象更深刻的还是用魔法解决的账单。"] = "Old Neil didn't use the money he found to pay off his debts, and Klein gained a brand new understanding of his moral character. \n\nOf course, what left a deeper impression on him was the bill settled with magic.",
	["老尼尔庆祝开服"] = "Old Neil celebrates the server launch",
	["老尼尔应该在<P_Yellow>炼金室</>里，你直接去找他就好……愿女神护佑你。"] = "Old Neil should be in the <P_Yellow>Alchemy Room</>, you can just go find him... May the Goddess protect you.",
	["老尼尔拿出两个杯子，泡了两杯热气腾腾的咖啡。"] = "Old Neil takes out two cups and brews two cups of steaming coffee.",
	["老尼尔支线"] = "Old Neil Side Quest",
	["老尼尔教灵视后位置"] = "Old Neil's Position After Teaching Spirit Vision",
	["老尼尔普攻-2格"] = "Old Neil Basic Attack - 2 Grids",
	["老尼尔曾经是正式成员，只是年纪大了，不再适合处理案件。但他不愿意休养，只希望与文献典籍作伴。"] = "Old Neil used to be a formal member, but he is too old and no longer suitable for handling cases. However, he is unwilling to rest and only wishes to keep company with documents and books.",
	["老尼尔的仪式魔法"] = "Old Neil's Ritual Magic",
	["老尼尔的历史投影，重现了原主的形态与部分能力。"] = "A historical projection of Old Neil, recreating the original's form and partial abilities.",
	["老尼尔的咖啡"] = "Old Neil's coffee",
	["老尼尔的墓碑"] = "Old Neil's Tombstone",
	["老尼尔的幻象"] = "Old Neil's Illusion",
	["老尼尔的画"] = "Old Neil's Painting",
	["老尼尔看邓恩"] = "Old Neil looks at Dunn",
	["老尼尔给的古怪粉末。"] = "Strange powder given by Old Neil.",
	["老尼尔背过身去转向点"] = "Old Neil turns away point",
	["老尼尔走入"] = "Old Neil walks in",
	["老尼尔走到吧台前"] = "Old Neil walks to the bar",
	["老尼尔走到坩埚前路线"] = "Old Neil's route to the crucible",
	["老尼尔起身泡咖啡传送点"] = "Old Neil standing up to make coffee teleport point",
	["老尼尔转向坩埚定位点"] = "Old Neil Turning to Crucible Positioning Point",
	["老尼尔钢琴"] = "Old Neil Piano",
	["老尼尔隐秘羁绊"] = "Old Neil Secret Bond",
	["老尼尔隐秘羁绊奖励"] = "Old Neil secret bond reward.",
	["老尼尔面向"] = "Old Neil faces",
	["老尼尔，接下来就交给你了。"] = "Old Neil, I'll leave the rest to you.",
	["老尼尔，老尼尔！你老了好多呀！"] = "Old Neil, Old Neil! You've aged so much!",
	["老尼尔，麻烦过来一下。"] = "Old Neil, please come over here for a moment.",
	["老尼尔，黑荆棘资历最深的老前辈之一。他会教你冥想、灵视，还会教你在报销单上如何“合理”填数字。他欠账三十镑时，也能对捡来的三百镑钱包分文不动。\n“为所欲为，但勿伤害”，是他恪守一生的格言。\n他曾是正式值夜者，但离晋升始终差了那么一步。年纪渐长，教会让他转做“看守者”或回家休养，他拒绝了。他只愿留在黑荆棘，守着那些泛黄的典籍，为大家点亮一盏灯。\n在平常幽默风趣的相处中，没人知道，老尼尔一直在节省资金，试图用禁忌的“生命炼成”仪式复活亡妻。他在需要鲜血材料的配方旁写道：“可以考虑抽取我的。”——他宁愿用自己的血，也不愿伤害任何人。\n直到隐匿贤者的低语吞没他，队友亲手送别他……当值夜者们翻开老尼尔的日记，看见最后一页写着：“如果不能拯救她，那就去陪伴她。”时，他们终于明白了老尼尔最后的坚守。\n他想用余生为年轻人照亮一小段路，然后用生命，践行一句无人知晓的誓言。"] = "Old Neil, one of the most senior veterans of Blackthorn. He would teach you meditation and spirit vision, and he would also teach you how to \"reasonably\" fill in numbers on expense reports. When he owed thirty pounds, he could also leave a three-hundred-pound wallet he found untouched. \n \"Do what you will, but do no harm\" was the motto he upheld his whole life. \n He was once an official Nighthawk, but he was always one step away from promotion. As he grew older, the Church asked him to become a \"Gatekeeper\" or retire at home, but he refused. He only wished to stay at Blackthorn, guarding those yellowed classics and lighting a lamp for everyone. \n In their usual humorous interactions, no one knew that Old Neil had been saving money, trying to resurrect his late wife with the forbidden \"Life Creation\" ritual. Next to the formula that required blood materials, he wrote: \"Can consider extracting mine.\"—He would rather use his own blood than hurt anyone. \n Until the whispers of the Hidden Sage engulfed him, and his teammates sent him off with their own hands... When the Nighthawks opened Old Neil's diary and saw the last page written: \"If I cannot save her, then I will accompany her,\" they finally understood Old Neil's final persistence. \n He wanted to illuminate a short path for the young people with the rest of his life, and then use his life to practice a vow that no one knew.",
	["老尼尔，黑荆棘资历最深的老前辈之一。他会教你冥想、灵视，还会教你在报销单上如何“合理”填数字。但他欠账三十镑时，也能对捡来的三百镑钱包分文不动。\n“为所欲为，但勿伤害”，是他恪守一生的格言。\n他曾是正式值夜者，但离晋升始终差了那么一步。年纪渐长，教会让他转做“看守者”或回家休养，他拒绝了。他只愿留在黑荆棘，守着那些泛黄的典籍，为大家点亮一盏灯。\n在平常幽默风趣的相处中，没人知道，老尼尔一直在节省资金，试图用禁忌的“生命炼成”仪式复活亡妻。他在需要鲜血材料的配方旁写道：“可以考虑抽取我的。”——他宁愿用自己的血，也不愿伤害任何人。\n直到隐匿贤者的低语吞没他，队友亲手送别他……当值夜者们翻开老尼尔的日记，看见最后一页写着：“如果不能拯救她，那就去陪伴她。”时，他们终于明白了老尼尔最后的坚守。\n他想用余生为年轻人照亮一小段路，然后用生命，践行一句无人知晓的誓言。"] = "Old Neil, one of the most senior veterans of the Blackthorn Security Company. He would teach you meditation, spirit vision, and how to \"reasonably\" fill in numbers on reimbursement forms. Yet, when he owed thirty pounds, he could remain unmoved by a wallet containing three hundred pounds he had found.\n\"Do what thou wilt, but harm none\" was the motto he upheld his entire life.\nHe was once a formal Nighthawk, but he was always just one step away from advancement. As he grew older, the Church suggested he become a \"Gatekeeper\" or retire home, but he refused. He only wished to remain at Blackthorn, guarding those yellowed classics and lighting a lamp for everyone.\nAmidst the usual humor and lighthearted interactions, no one knew that Old Neil had been saving money, attempting to resurrect his late wife using the forbidden \"Life Creation\" ritual. Beside the formula requiring blood materials, he wrote: \"Consider drawing mine.\"—he would rather use his own blood than harm anyone.\nUntil the whispers of the Hidden Sage engulfed him, and his teammates had to personally bid him farewell... When the Nighthawks opened Old Neil's diary and saw the last page written: \"If I cannot save her, then I shall accompany her,\" they finally understood Old Neil's final persistence.\nHe wanted to light up a short path for the young ones with the rest of his life, and then, with his life, fulfill a vow no one knew.",
	["老尼尔：呵呵，这就是魔法的力量。"] = "Old Neil: Hehe, this is the power of magic.",
	["老尼尔：女神啊，是一个钱包！"] = "Old Neil: Goddess, it's a wallet!",
	["老尼尔：感谢这位善良慷慨的爵士。"] = "Old Neil: Thank you to this kind and generous gentleman.",
	["老尼尔：我们又不会试图占有这些不属于我们的金钱，在这里等一下吧。"] = "Old Neil: We aren't going to try to keep money that doesn't belong to us, let's wait here for a bit.",
	["老尼尔：我们是可怜虫"] = "Old Neil: We are wretches.",
	["老尼尔？"] = "Old Neil?",
	["老巴克的山羊比他胡子还黑！下一个！"] = "Old Buck's goat is blacker than his beard! Next!",
	["老布莱克教士就不一样了，有时候还会给我们分蛋糕。但要是比利来教堂捉我，他肯定也会笑呵呵地把我供出来……"] = "Old Father Blake is different; sometimes he even shares cake with us. But if Billy came to the church to catch me, he would definitely laugh and give me away...",
	["老师"] = "Teacher",
	["老师不是说过了桥直走吗？"] = "Didn't the teacher say to go straight after crossing the bridge?",
	["老师们暴跳如雷，学生们议论纷纷……一桩未解的悬案让霍伊大学陷入了骚动。"] = "The teachers are furious, the students are gossiping... An unsolved case has thrown Hoy University into a frenzy.",
	["老师你工作六年了还是助教啊？"] = "Teacher, you've been working for six years and you're still a teaching assistant?",
	["老师只是最近精神上出了点问题，我们联系的是心理诊所，为什么警察会来？"] = "The teacher just had some mental problems recently. We contacted a psychological clinic, so why did the police come?",
	["老师比我聪明得多，他早就预感到了蜡烛工坊的倒闭，提前把我送进了糖厂学手艺。"] = "My teacher was much smarter than me. He had long sensed the closure of the candle workshop and sent me to the sugar factory to learn a trade in advance.",
	["老师生前发现集市上除了工厂的便宜蜡烛，还出现了一种点不着的蜡烛。"] = "Before my teacher passed away, he discovered that besides the cheap factory candles, a type of candle that wouldn't light had appeared at the market.",
	["老师追查那些蜡烛，最后发现是有人举办诡异的<P_Yellow>“死亡”庆典</>，在庆典上分发了这些蜡烛。"] = "My teacher investigated those candles and eventually discovered that someone was holding a bizarre <P_Yellow> \"Death\" celebration </> and distributing these candles there.",
	["老师，你什么时候回来啊！"] = "Teacher, when will you come back!",
	["老师，我是隔壁大学来旁听的，不是本班学生。"] = "Teacher, I am auditing from the university next door; I am not a student in this class.",
	["老师，我是隔壁廷根大学来旁听的，不是本班学生。"] = "Teacher, I am from Tingen University next door to audit, not a student in this class.",
	["老年女性"] = "Elderly Woman",
	["老年普通棕色男"] = "Elderly ordinary brown-haired man",
	["老年男性"] = "Elderly Man",
	["老廷根市民"] = "Old Tingen Citizen",
	["老弟，来，喝一杯，哈加提草原的苦酒，后劲爽得像被金镑投怀送抱！"] = "Brother, come, have a drink, bitter wine from the Hagati Grasslands, the aftertaste is as refreshing as being embraced by gold pounds!",
	["老强尼"] = "Old Johnny",
	["老托马斯"] = "Old Thomas",
	["老托马斯的“护身符”"] = "Old Thomas's \"Amulet\"",
	["老托马斯重物"] = "Old Thomas Heavy Object",
	["老托马斯：<P_Heart>（用力）</>可恶……根本搬不动……"] = "Old Thomas: <P_Heart>(Straining)</> Damn it... I can't move it at all...",
	["老托马斯：不——不——"] = "Old Thomas: No—no—",
	["老托马斯：好孩子……谢谢你们。"] = "Old Thomas: Good children... thank you.",
	["老旧手枪"] = "Old pistol",
	["老旧的帽子"] = "Chapéu Velho",
	["老旧的铠甲感受到了侵袭，从漫长的沉眠中醒来，为了守护家族，它将不惜一切代价。"] = "The old armor senses the intrusion and wakes from its long slumber; to guard the family, it will stop at nothing.",
	["老旧蒸汽锅"] = "Old Steam Boiler",
	["老早没人管了，这是废墟，{{先生|女士}}！没有治安官，没有警察。只有我这样的向导保证你的安全——我是从小在这儿长大的，里里外外不知道转过多少回了。"] = "No one has cared about this place for a long time; it's a ruin, {{Mr.|Ms.}}! There are no magistrates, no police. Only a guide like me can ensure your safety—I grew up here and have walked through every corner more times than I can count.",
	["老是受你照顾，真不好意思。"] = "I'm so embarrassed to always be taken care of by you.",
	["老杰克"] = "Old Jack",
	["老板"] = "Owner",
	["老板 再来杯黑麦啤酒 不 要烈朗齐！"] = "Boss, another rye beer, no, not the strong one!",
	["老板们不在……我再睡一会……"] = "The bosses aren't here... I'll sleep a little longer...",
	["老板前"] = "Before the Boss",
	["老板常常把这作为谈资，和顾客分享呢，呵呵。"] = "The boss often uses this as a topic of conversation to share with customers, hehe.",
	["老板总说公司是我们老员工的家，说我们的经验就是财富。"] = "The boss always says the company is home to us veteran employees, and that our experience is wealth.",
	["老板总说对我有点失望，他招我做店员，其实是看中我面试时表现的潜力。他希望我入职后能够拼一把，快速成长为销冠……不行，累，太累了。"] = "The boss always says he is a bit disappointed in me. He hired me as a clerk because he saw the potential I showed during the interview. He hopes that after I join, I can work hard and quickly grow into a top salesperson... No, it's tiring, too tiring.",
	["老板来了！这是最后的机会了……"] = "The boss is here! This is the last chance...",
	["老板的光"] = "Boss's Light",
	["老板的光0"] = "Boss's light 0",
	["老板，你上次给我的助眠草药好像没有效果啊？"] = "Boss, the sleep-aid herbs you gave me last time didn't seem to have any effect?",
	["老板，你这上面写着“格尔曼同款”，下面又写“与《大冒险家》无关”？"] = "Boss, it says \"Gehrman's favorite\" on this, but below it says \"Unrelated to 'The Great Adventurer'\"?",
	["老板，您知道最近总有人自杀的事吗？"] = "Boss, do you know about the recent suicides?",
	["老板，我想要一点那个。"] = "Boss, I want a little of that.",
	["老板，跟您打听一下——金秋湖农场最近是不是出了什么事？"] = "Boss, let me ask you—has something happened at the Golden Autumn Lake farm recently?",
	["老板，需不需要保镖？能帮你收租的！"] = "Boss, do you need a bodyguard? I can help you collect rent!",
	["老查克不在了，但他的酒还在。小柯莱不在了，她的南瓜还在。我还在。"] = "Old Chuck is gone, but his wine is still here. Little Colley is gone, but her pumpkin is still here. I am still here.",
	["老柯尔"] = "Old Cole",
	["老比尔"] = "Old Bill",
	["老毛病又犯了……唉。"] = "The old problem is acting up again... sigh.",
	["老毛病，心口很闷，您再帮我看看？"] = "The usual, my chest feels very tight, could you take another look for me?",
	["老水手们"] = "Old sailors",
	["老水手波恩"] = "Old Sailor Bone",
	["老汤姆"] = "Old Tom",
	["老汤姆，你就帮帮我吧！"] = "Old Tom, please just help me out!",
	["老汤姆，看在咱们二十年交情的份上，就帮我这一回！ "] = "Old Tom, for the sake of our twenty-year friendship, just help me this once!",
	["老爷……老爷当时就倒在书桌旁，茶撒了一地。我冲过去，碰了碰他的手——"] = "The Master... the Master was lying by the desk at that time, and the tea was spilled all over the floor. I rushed over and touched his hand—",
	["老爷……让我在这里等……"] = "Master... told me to wait here...",
	["老爷卧室的<P_Yellow>门锁着</>。我敲了很久，里面一直没人回应。过了几秒，老爷突然开口说……"] = "The <P_Yellow> door </> to the master's bedroom was locked. I knocked for a long time, but there was no response from inside. After a few seconds, the master suddenly said...",
	["老爷和夫人从来没过想责备小姐和那男孩，只是希望我来把把关……如果您见到他，请帮忙转达这份心意吧。谢谢您。"] = "The master and mistress never intended to blame the young lady and that boy; they just wanted me to check on things... If you see him, please help convey this sentiment. Thank you.",
	["老爷夫人们行行好吧！"] = "Have mercy, my lords and ladies!",
	["老爷如果去反复承诺、推翻一件事，长远看更不利于工厂的发展。"] = "Sir, if you keep making and breaking promises, it will be detrimental to the factory's development in the long run.",
	["老爷对我们也太诚恳了，竟然直接告诉了我们工厂的困境……"] = "Sir is too sincere with us; he even told us directly about the factory's predicament...",
	["老爷对盒饭的解释，你能接受吗？"] = "Can you accept Sir's explanation regarding the boxed meals?",
	["老爷爷"] = "Old Grandpa",
	["老爷让我守着宅子等他回来，我就一直等……"] = "Master told me to guard the house and wait for his return, so I've been waiting...",
	["老爷说工厂遇到了困难，你之前有听到过什么传言吗？"] = "Sir said the factory is facing difficulties; have you heard any rumors about that before?",
	["老爷车"] = "Vintage car",
	["老爷车同骑"] = "Old Car Co-riding",
	["老爷车喇叭"] = "Old Car Horn",
	["老爷车喇叭旧"] = "Old Car Horn",
	["老爷车展"] = "Vintage car show",
	["老爷车满5万镑减5镑代金券……呃，没有捡起的欲望。"] = "A 5-pound voucher for a 50,000-pound vintage car... Uh, I have no desire to pick it up.",
	["老爷车竞速"] = "Vintage car racing",
	["老爷车车灯"] = "Vintage Car Headlights",
	["老爷车车载音乐"] = "Old Car Music",
	["老爷车，竞速排名，多圈"] = "Vintage car, racing ranking, multi-lap",
	["老爷车，竞速计时，有分级"] = "Vintage car, racing time trial, ranked",
	["老爷都一把年纪了，去贝克兰德上议院当个议员不好吗，非要竞选廷根市长。"] = "The old gentleman is already at such an age; wouldn't it be better to be a member of the House of Lords in Backlund? Why must he run for mayor of Tingen?",
	["老爷，可老爷说要我等的。"] = "Master, but Master said I should wait.",
	["老爷，请容我提醒，工厂的效益再差下去，我们甚至无法提供这样的盒饭。"] = "Sir, if I may remind you, if the factory's performance continues to decline, we won't even be able to provide these boxed meals.",
	["老爹"] = "Old Dad",
	["老特勒"] = "Old Tiller",
	["老特勒从墓地里爬出来了，该死的，小科勒又把这个墓地卖给别人了。"] = "Old Trelle crawled out of the cemetery. Damn it, Little Kohler sold this plot to someone else again.",
	["老特勒呀，就是个住在村里的混蛋罢了，前几天死了。"] = "Old Tuller, he's just a bastard who lived in the village, he died a few days ago.",
	["老特勒是谁？"] = "Who is Old Trelle?",
	["老特勒活着的时候是个老混蛋，死了以后也不让人消停，死了还出来蹦跶，还没有没找到。"] = "Old Trelle was an old bastard when he was alive, and he doesn't let people rest after he's dead. He crawled out after dying, and he still hasn't been found.",
	["老特勒，没啥好说的，他就是个混蛋罢了，住在这村子里。"] = "Old Tuller, nothing to say, he's just a bastard, lived in this village.",
	["老特勒？看起来很有名的样子。"] = "Old Tuller? He seems quite famous.",
	["老理查德近景镜头"] = "Old Richard close-up shot",
	["老电影"] = "Old Film",
	["老科勒：不，也许睡一觉就好了，盖上我的被子睡一觉就好了！"] = "Old Kohler: No, maybe I'll be fine after a sleep, just cover myself with my blanket and sleep!",
	["老科勒：为什么？"] = "Old Kohler: Why?",
	["老科勒：今天的雾气怎么这么难闻？"] = "Old Kohler: Why is the fog so foul today?",
	["老科勒：我们这样的人……是秸秆……风一吹，就会倒下……"] = "Old Kohler: People like us... are straw... when the wind blows, we fall...",
	["老科勒：每一顿都能有两片，三片，不，至少五片的火腿肉，我还能切一些下来，和土豆一起炖汤，甚至不用放盐……"] = "Old Kohler: Every meal can have two, three, no, at least five slices of ham. I can even cut some off to stew with potatoes, and I won't even need to add salt...",
	["老科勒：生病了吗？该死，我还想过个美好的新年，现在只能把积蓄送到诊所送到医院了……"] = "Old Kohler: Sick? Damn it, I wanted to have a nice New Year, now I can only send my savings to the clinic and the hospital...",
	["老科勒：荷，荷，荷……"] = "Old Kohler: Hah, hah, hah...",
	["老科勒：还是太贵太大了，只能和人合伙买一条，锯成几份……这足够我新年假期吃了。"] = "Old Kohler: Still too expensive and too big. I can only buy one with someone else and saw it into several pieces... This will be enough for me to eat during the New Year holiday.",
	["老管家"] = "Old Butler",
	["老管家出于本能保护男爵，怎么会用封印物操控他？"] = "The old butler is protecting the Baron out of instinct; how could he be using a Sealed Artifact to control him?",
	["老管家戴着“看见我”……是他用封印物操控了男爵？"] = "The old butler is wearing \"See Me\"... is he the one using the Sealed Artifact to control the Baron?",
	["老管家：莫里亚蒂侦探，王子殿下在街口的马车上等你，希望了解调查的进度。"] = "Old Butler: Detective Moriarty, His Highness the Prince is waiting for you in the carriage at the corner of the street, hoping to understand the progress of the investigation.",
	["老约翰"] = "Old John",
	["老约翰又动了！女神啊我们该怎么办？"] = "Old John is moving again! Goddess, what should we do?",
	["老约翰终于出门喝酒了……"] = "Old John finally went out to drink...",
	["老约翰，就在那边，那具尸体，说实话我们也不知道发生了什么，也不知道谁能帮得上忙……"] = "Old John, right over there, that corpse. To be honest, we don't know what happened either, and we don't know who can help...",
	["老绅士"] = "Old gentleman",
	["老维克多"] = "Old Victor",
	["老维克多……佛尔思女士……"] = "Old Victor... Miss Fors...",
	["老维克多的怀表"] = "Old Victor's Pocket Watch",
	["老维克多的怀表能力，可以在空间的“稳定态”与“侵蚀态”间切换。"] = "Old Victor's pocket watch ability, which can switch between the \"Stable State\" and \"Erosion State\" of space.",
	["老维尔"] = "Old Will",
	["老维尔先生，<P_Heart>（有些局促）</>没想到你们也参加了这次活动。"] = "Mr. Old Will, <P_Heart>(A bit awkward)</> I didn't expect you to participate in this event too.",
	["老维尔先生，你记得我喜欢香草？"] = "Mr. Old Will, you remember I like herbs?",
	["老维尔先生，我是黑荆棘安保公司的{{PlayerName}} ，有些事——"] = "Old Mr. Will, I am {{PlayerName}} from the Blackthorn Security Company, there are some things—",
	["老维尔告示"] = "Old Will Notice",
	["老维尔告示牌"] = "Old Will's Notice Board",
