	["老维德手下位置5"] = "Old Vied's Subordinate Position 5",
	["老维斯塔临死前，给这条街上的店，送了好些蜡烛。大半个月了，我还没用完呢。"] = "Before old Vista died, he gave many candles to the shops on this street. It's been over half a month, and I haven't finished using them yet.",
	["老罗德"] = "Old Rhodes",
	["老罗德trigger"] = "Old Rhode trigger",
	["老罗德昨天还念叨着要晒太阳，说晒硬朗了好去背柴。 "] = "Old Rhode was still talking about wanting to bask in the Sun yesterday, saying that once he got stronger from the sun, he'd go back to carrying firewood.",
	["老罗德经常来蜡烛工坊，找老师聊天。老师死后，他就没人说话了……"] = "Old Rhode often came to the candle workshop to chat with my teacher. After the teacher died, he had no one left to talk to...",
	["老罗德蜡烛"] = "Old Rhode's candle",
	["老罗德迷糊了，举着蜡烛说要回归死亡！我喊不住他！"] = "Old Rhode is confused; he's holding a candle and saying he wants to return to death! I can't stop him!",
	["老罗德！住手！"] = "Old Rhode! Stop!",
	["老罗德，你醒醒。"] = "Old Rhode, wake up.",
	["老老老大！就是{{他|她}}！之前总坏咱们好事的那个！"] = "Bo-boss! It's {{him| her}}! The one who always ruins our plans!",
