	["考试大纲\n史前时代、混沌纪元、黑暗纪元、灾变纪元、众神纪元、黑铁纪元。"] = "Exam Syllabus \n Prehistoric Era, Chaos Era, Dark Era, Cataclysm Era, Era of Gods, Black Iron Era.",
	["考试成绩不算——不论我算得高还是低，对你的心态一定会产生影响。"] = "Exam results are not included—no matter if I predict high or low, it will definitely affect your mindset.",
