	["而且……上面的游戏比下面危险得多。你现在这样，上去了也活不过第一夜。"] = "Besides... the games upstairs are much more dangerous than the ones below. The way you are now, you wouldn't survive the first night even if you went up.",
	["而且……说不定我们还来得及去参加你今晚的生日聚会。"] = "And... maybe we can still make it to your birthday party tonight.",
	["而且一定要在红月的时候体验！"] = "And you must experience it during the Red Moon!",
	["而且他们……似乎永远年轻，永远无法离开。"] = "And they... seem to be forever young, forever unable to leave.",
	["而且他有了新名字，你可以叫他“毛毛草”"] = "And he has a new name; you can call him 'Fuzzy Grass'.",
	["而且他真的出手相助，用一种很平淡的方式，就像只是顺手拂去灰尘。"] = "And he really reached out to help, in a very plain way, as if he were just brushing off dust.",
	["而且你不觉得吗？这是真正的奇遇。像我小说里写的那样，神秘、危险，但充满可能。"] = "And don't you think? This is a true adventure. Just like what I write in my novels, mysterious, dangerous, but full of possibilities.",
	["而且你们在黛西小姐身上的尝试，害死两位仆人和一位管家……"] = "And your attempts on Miss Daisy caused the deaths of two servants and a butler...",
	["而且你和班森都还没成家，现在家里每便士的开支都得做好计划。"] = "And neither you nor Benson are married yet. Every penny of the family's expenses must be planned carefully.",
	["而且你的钱不是还要去占卜俱乐部交年费。对了，你去那做什么？"] = "And isn't your money for the annual fee of the Divination Club? By the way, what are you doing there?",
	["而且你的钱不是还要去占卜家俱乐部交年费。对了，你去那做什么？"] = "Besides, don't you still need money to pay the annual fee for the Divination Club? By the way, what do you do there?",
	["而且即使妈妈不能和我见面，我也知道她爱我。"] = "And even if Mom can't see me, I know she loves me.",
	["而且在我饿的时候，还拿出面包跟我分享！"] = "And when I was hungry, you even took out Bread to share with me!",
	["而且外祖父也没有进行“财产赠予保护”，这在法庭上会对我们很不利。"] = "Furthermore, Grandfather didn't set up a \"property gift protection,\" which will be very disadvantageous for us in court.",
	["而且奥黛丽说过，观众途径最厉害的不是打架，是让对手根本不想和你打。我觉得这说得很有道理。"] = "Besides, Audrey said that the most powerful thing about the Spectator pathway isn't fighting, but making the opponent not want to fight you at all. I think that makes a lot of sense.",
	["而且她看起来很是纤弱。或许是文职人员？"] = "And she looks very frail. Perhaps a clerical worker?",
	["而且她还买了只青蛙……不妙，赶紧找找关于青蛙的记载！"] = "And she even bought a frog... This is bad, I need to quickly find records about frogs!",
	["而且它只要12镑！只要12镑，您就会成为社交场合里最亮眼的那位绅士！"] = "And it's only 12 pounds! For just 12 pounds, you will be the most eye-catching gentleman in any social occasion!",
	["而且它好像很安静……我还以为它一路上会说个不停。"] = "And it seems very quiet... I thought it would talk non-stop along the way.",
	["而且弗莱队长他们刚才被突发任务叫走了，现在只剩我们继续这件庞大的工作。{{PlayerName}}……或许你刚好有时间帮帮我？"] = "And Captain Frye and the others were called away by a sudden mission just now, so only we are left to continue this massive task. {{PlayerName}}... perhaps you happen to have time to help me?",
	["而且很多时候死人比活人好相处，因为从不用担心他们会突然冷场。"] = "Besides, dead people are often easier to get along with than living ones, because you never have to worry about them suddenly making things awkward.",
	["而且我们已经委托侦探寻找它了，肯定很快就会有结果的。"] = "And we have already commissioned a detective to find it, so there will definitely be results soon.",
	["而且我只是个……普通的、跑得快一点的送货员！"] = "And I'm just a... normal delivery person who runs a bit fast!",
	["而且我有了自己的新名字，我不再是一只让人记不住的小猫了！"] = "And I have a new name of my own; I am no longer a kitten that people can't remember!",
	["而且我相信，我们会在黑夜的国度里，再次相聚……"] = "And I believe that we will reunite in the Kingdom of the Evernight...",
	["而且我能被知识皇冠误认为是“自己人”，也许我更安全一些。"] = "Besides, I can be mistaken for 'one of our own' by the Crown of Knowledge, so perhaps I am safer.",
	["而且按照规则，只要有一个人代表小队报名即可。"] = "And according to the rules, as long as one person signs up on behalf of the team, it counts.",
	["而且斯林太太一直挂念着你，刚好你可以顺路去买些东西，陪她聊几句。"] = "And Mrs. Stiller has been thinking about you. You can stop by to buy some things and chat with her for a bit.",
	["而且是完美的引路者和投资人！"] = "And a perfect guide and investor!",
	["而且有戴莉女士的案例在先，从中得到启发更进一步完成扮演法，还是挺合理的。"] = "And with Ms. Daly's case as a precedent, it is quite reasonable to be inspired by it to further complete the Acting method.",
	["而且杰姆怎么办？我跑了，雷克斯一定会把气撒在他身上。他跑不动的……"] = "And what about Jem? If I run away, Rex will definitely take his anger out on him. He can't run...",
	["而且脑海中出现另一个人，一个强大又陌生的人……"] = "And another person appeared in my mind, a powerful and strange person...",
	["而且脑海中分裂出另一个我，一个很陌生的我……"] = "And another me has split off in my mind, a very unfamiliar me...",
	["而且说到天才，我觉得你也是一个天才。真正的天才。"] = "And speaking of geniuses, I think you are one too. A real genius.",
	["而且还很健康，一般炸物都会增加人体负担，而库克用的猪油都是……"] = "And it's healthy too. Generally, fried food increases the burden on the human body, but the lard Cook uses is...",
	["而且这副牌已经用了很多年，我想他们会更习惯这些“老朋友”。"] = "And this deck has been used for many years, I think they are more accustomed to these \"old friends\".",
	["而且这次得救了，下次呢？哥哥的病不是一天两天了，我们……我们总不能一直指望陌生人的善心。"] = "And even if I'm saved this time, what about next time? My brother's illness isn't a one-day thing, we... we can't always rely on the kindness of strangers.",
	["而且这里离安布罗斯学长的书摊……不对，单纯是我习惯在这里了！"] = "Besides, this is near Senior Ambrose's book stall... no, wait, it's just that I'm used to being here!",
	["而且这里还闹过鬼！蒸汽在上，教会的人来看了之后就留下一盏煤油灯，也不知道有没有用。"] = "And this place is haunted! Steam above, the Church people came to look and left a kerosene lamp, but I don't know if it's useful.",
	["而且那位不是银月公爵，而是大地母神教会的高级执事。"] = "And that person is not the Duke of Silver Moon, but a high-ranking deacon of the Church of the Earth Mother.",
	["而且，你做得比我想象中更好。黑荆棘的委托，你从没让人失望过。魔药材料都准备好了吗？"] = "Besides, you have done better than I imagined. You have never disappointed anyone with the Blackthorn's commissions. Are the potion materials ready?",
	["而且，你的状态并不稳定，我需要尽快将你带回贝克兰德教会重新封印。"] = "And your state is not stable. I need to take you back to the Backlund Church as soon as possible to be resealed.",
	["而且，听说老头的三个亲生儿子都不是他的……看来他这私生子可要大赚一笔了。唉，这小子的好日子还在后头呢。"] = "Besides, I heard the old man's three biological sons aren't actually his... Looks like this illegitimate son is going to make a fortune. Sigh, the good days for this kid are still ahead.",
	["而且，如果缴满二十年年限，公司届时将退您四成保费。被保人的长寿，也是我们不吝于祝福的事。"] = "Moreover, if you pay for the full twenty-year term, the company will refund you 40% of the premiums at that time. The longevity of the insured is also something we are happy to bless.",
	["而且，尊敬的先生，如果您需要一些……嗯，不那么正式的情报，我们也有办法弄到。毕竟，在这片街区，孩子们的耳朵总是最灵的。"] = "And, respected sir, if you need some... well, less formal information, we have ways to get it. After all, in this neighborhood, children's ears are always the sharpest.",
	["而且，我也没有占据主要的道路。"] = "Besides, I am not blocking the main road.",
	["而且，我更想加强对神秘学的了解和掌握，收尸人途径并不适合我。"] = "Besides, I want to strengthen my understanding and mastery of the occult more; the Corpse Collector pathway is not suitable for me.",
	["而且，我的小阿诺德很像我，我相信他。"] = "Besides, my little Arnold is very much like me. I believe in him.",
	["而且，我积攒的功勋也不够换取配方和魔药。"] = "Besides, the merit I've accumulated isn't enough to exchange for formulas and potions.",
	["而且，本案已经有三点矛盾无法解释了。"] = "Moreover, there are already three points of contradiction in this case that cannot be explained.",
	["而且，说到守护者的职责……我们还有不少该做的事。"] = "Besides, speaking of the duties of a Guardian... we still have quite a few things we ought to do.",
	["而且，这样打扮有个好处——没人敢随便搭讪我。那些自以为是的绅士，看到蓝眼影和黑袍就绕道走，省了我很多麻烦。"] = "Besides, there's a benefit to dressing this way—no one dares to hit on me casually. Those self-righteous gentlemen see the blue eyeshadow and black robes and take a detour, saving me a lot of trouble.",
	["而且，那边有个失恋的醉鬼。钱包都等着了，你还等什么？"] = "Besides, there's a heartbroken drunk over there. The wallet is just waiting; what are you waiting for?",
	["而且，那边的孩子手里不就是《大冒险家》？"] = "And isn't that child over there holding \"The Great Adventurer\"?",
	["而为了这不合常理的爱，男女主角都自愿走向死亡，这让我更加不理解……如果不能共度余生，那么爱情的意义又是什么？"] = "And for this unreasonable love, the male and female protagonists voluntarily walk toward death, which makes me understand even less... If you can't spend the rest of your life together, then what is the meaning of love?",
	["而他……他是一个孤独的人。我能感觉得出他从骨子里透出来的孤独。"] = "And he... he is a lonely person. I can feel the loneliness that permeates from his bones.",
	["而他不在的话，你会怎么选呢……"] = "And if he weren't here, how would you choose...",
	["而他们的故事，才刚刚开始……"] = "And their story has only just begun...",
	["而他唯一给你留下的东西不见了，你会怎么做？"] = "And the only thing they left you went missing, what would you do?",
	["而你"] = "And you,",
	["而你……有这样的觉悟吗？"] = "And you... do you have such resolve?",
	["而你……犹豫片刻，选择了拒绝（至少这次，是的）。"] = "And you... hesitate for a moment, then choose to refuse (at least this time, yes).",
	["而你出现在我的意识里，难道……"] = "And you appearing in my consciousness, could it be...",
	["而你，只需要运用自己现有的非凡能力，尝试打败我。"] = "And you, just use your existing Beyonder abilities to try and defeat me.",
	["而促成这一切的我，高高在上，傲慢，冷漠。有时我会想，帝国时期的我，到底算不算我。"] = "And I, who facilitated all this, was high and mighty, arrogant, and cold. Sometimes I wonder, was the me of the imperial era really me?",
	["而到了夜晚，整个教堂都会在女神的庇佑下陷入静谧。"] = "And at night, the entire cathedral falls into tranquility under the Goddess's protection.",
	["而到最后，如果你真的达到那个高度，那么，你能与之并肩战斗的，就会是他。"] = "And in the end, if you truly reach that height, then the one you will be able to fight side-by-side with will be him.",
	["而吸血鬼，多数是服食了“药师”途径某些特定魔药后发生可悲异变的人类怪物，它们只是渴血的奴隶。"] = "And vampires are mostly human monsters who have undergone tragic mutations after consuming certain specific potions of the 'Apothecary' pathway; they are just slaves thirsty for blood.",
	["而大地……"] = "And the earth...",
	["而她绝对不会允许我在家里碰一根烟叶，你懂吗？"] = "And she absolutely won't allow me to touch a single tobacco leaf at home, you understand?",
	["而娜娅女士将自己淹死在了一个水盆里，嗯，用来洗脸的那种。"] = "And Ms. Naya drowned herself in a washbasin, um, the kind used for washing one's face.",
	["而它的对手，那只黑白大狗看着就很愚蠢……"] = "And its opponent, that big black and white dog, looks so stupid...",
	["而它的对手，那只黑白大狗看着就很愚蠢，有几次它甚至兴奋地和耗子玩了起来！"] = "And its opponent, that big black and white dog, looks so stupid. A few times it even excitedly started playing with the mice!",
	["而封锁前，帽子帮的亨特和下街牵马的老马丁也来过湖畔。"] = "And before the blockade, Hunter from the Hat Gang and old Martin who leads horses on Lower Street also came to the lake.",
	["而就算侥幸赢得了大笔财富，又会很快变成整日流连在“红剧场”中的蛆虫，哦——“红剧场”就是那儿最大的妓院名字。"] = "And even if you are lucky enough to win a large fortune, you will quickly become a maggot lingering in the 'Red Theater' all day—oh, 'Red Theater' is the name of the biggest brothel there.",
	["而您躲闪时溅起来的泥点，恰好弄脏了我的裙子。"] = "And the mud you splashed when you dodged just happened to dirty my skirt.",
	["而您，我们的弗兰奇先生，您真是一位优雅高尚的绅士。"] = "And you, our Mr. Franky, you really are an elegant and noble gentleman.",
	["而我也该走向我的春天，继续我的相会与离别了。"] = "And I should also head toward my spring, to continue my meetings and partings.",
	["而我以为您是想进行一场正经的学术讨论，看来是我弄错了。"] = "And I thought you wanted to have a serious academic discussion. It seems I was mistaken.",
	["而我们用诗歌抚慰他们，用黑夜包容他们，用安宁解放他们。"] = "And we comfort them with poetry, embrace them with the night, and liberate them with peace.",
	["而我们，每天能盼到的最好的事情，就是你这样的人肯把手伸进口袋，丢给我们一点什么，叫我们帮忙拎行李或者牵马、送信。"] = "And for us, the best thing we can hope for every day is that someone like you is willing to reach into their pocket and toss us something, asking us to help carry luggage, lead a horse, or deliver a letter.",
	["而我剩下的这一半灵魂，也在分割时被他用非凡物品结合。我开始死而复生，就像“不死者”一样。"] = "And the remaining half of my soul was combined with a Sealed Artifact by him during the splitting. I began to undergo resurrection, just like an 'Undying'.",
	["而我却被遗忘在原地……"] = "And yet I was forgotten where I stood...",
	["而我和我孩子的体面衣服，\r\n都已经是半年前买的……"] = "And the decent clothes for me and my child\r\nwere all bought half a year ago...",
	["而我已经在这个世界，找到生命中最珍贵的东西——亲人之间的感情。小黛西的纯真快乐，乔纳尔的善良温柔感染着我，我才逐渐融入和接纳这个世界。"] = "And I have found the most precious thing in life in this world—the affection between relatives. Little Daisy's innocence and joy, and Jonar's kindness and gentleness have infected me, and I have gradually integrated into and accepted this world.",
	["而我相信，每一位顾客都拥有明亮的眼睛。"] = "And I believe that every customer has bright eyes.",
	["而我，伙计们相信我，没有人比我更懂赚钱。"] = "And me, folks, believe me, no one knows how to make money better than I do.",
	["而掌握这种非凡力量的人……或者动物，就是非凡者。"] = "And those who master this Extraordinary power... or animals, are Beyonders.",
	["而推断条件最重要的是参考站点信息，通过推理提升你的成功率"] = "The most important thing for inferring conditions is to refer to station information and improve your success rate through deduction.",
	["而收尸人的职责，就是护送他们体面地走完最后一程。"] = "And the duty of a Corpse Collector is to escort them through their final journey with dignity.",
	["而最后一步，也是关键所在——"] = "And the final step, which is also the key—",
	["而现在，你需要确定你的代号。愚者、正义、倒吊人除外。"] = "And now, you need to determine your codename. Except for The Fool, Justice, and The Hanged Man.",
	["而现在，我只想征服你的心。 "] = "And now, I just want to conquer your heart.",
	["而现在，我有能力让你们都处于烈焰之中。"] = "And now, I have the ability to place you all in the flames.",
	["而现在，我要去加入值夜者了，这真是奇妙啊……"] = "And now, I'm going to join the Nighthawks. This is truly wonderful...",
	["而这一切——都只是因为我轻轻推了一下。"] = "And all of this—was just because I gave it a gentle push.",
	["而这些保留了人性的底片，将成为那位存在在沉睡中保持人性的助力。"] = "And these negatives that preserve humanity will become the help for that existence to maintain humanity while in deep sleep.",
	["而这些纸……记录了所有谜题的答案。原来你也全都记住了？"] = "And these papers... record the answers to all the puzzles. So you remembered everything too?",
	["而这本书里"] = "And within this book",
	["而这种涉及非凡力量又不够严谨的东西，往往会造成更严重的危害。"] = "And things that involve Beyonder powers but lack rigor often lead to even more serious harm.",
	["而这里的先生女士们并不十分欢迎我们……这也是应该的，我们没有好衣服，家里杂物很多，也没有多余的钱购买会客的糕点。"] = "And the gentlemen and ladies here don't really welcome us... This is also to be expected. We don't have good clothes, there is a lot of clutter in the house, and we don't have extra money to buy pastries for guests.",
	["而这里，都是会长创造的魔法，像桃花源，杰克与豌豆……"] = "And here, all the magic is created by the president, like Peach Blossom Spring, Jack and the Beanstalk...",
	["而这间公寓每周的租金才5苏勒6便士。"] = "And the weekly rent for this apartment is only 5 soli and 6 pence.",
	["而那个可怜虫，眼里只有命运的赌桌，失去了身边的一切……"] = "And that poor wretch, his eyes only see the gambling table of fate, losing everything around him...",
	["而那座古堡，是这里最为出名的地标，可以说拉姆德小镇的名字，正来源于拉姆德古堡。"] = "And that ancient castle is the most famous landmark here. You could say that the name of Lamud Town comes from Lamud Castle.",
	["耍酒疯醉汉"] = "Homem bêbado",
	["耐心的"] = "Paciente",
	["耐心等<h>黛西</>醒来"] = "Patiently wait for <h>Daisy</> to wake up",
	["耐心等待……"] = "Waiting patiently...",
	["耐心等待即可"] = "Just wait patiently",
	["耐心等黛西醒来"] = "Wait Patiently for Daisy to Wake Up",
	["耐用的"] = "Durable",
	["耕种星座"] = "Constellation of Cultivation",
	["耕种者"] = "Agricultor",
	["耕种者途径的生命炼金，能赋予人长久的生命，但无法让人理解生死。"] = "The life alchemy of the Planter Pathway can grant people long lives, but it cannot make them understand life and death.",
	["耳坠"] = "Earrings",
	["耳垂"] = "Earlobe",
	["耳廓"] = "Auricle",
	["耳朵"] = "Ears",
	["耳朵上侧"] = "Upper ear",
	["耳朵尖"] = "Ear tip",
	["耳朵整体"] = "Overall ear",
	["耳机"] = "Headphones",
	["耳畔偶尔会响起带有方位感的隐秘低语，这是灵性的指引。"] = "Secret whispers with a sense of direction occasionally ring in your ears; this is the guidance of spirituality.",
	["耳畔则传来不知何物发出的飘渺低语。"] = "Ethereal whispers from an unknown source reach your ears.",
	["耳语戒指"] = "Whisper Ring",
	["耳边传来一阵呓语，你痛苦地捂住胸口，一些仪式的恐怖画面在脑中闪回"] = "A whisper echoes in your ears. You clutch your chest in pain as horrific scenes of some ritual flash back into your mind.",
	["耳边传来一阵呓语，你痛苦地捂住脑袋，一些仪式的画面在脑中闪回"] = "A whisper echoes in your ears. You clutch your head in pain as scenes of some ritual flash back into your mind.",
	["耳边呓语"] = "Whispers in the Ear",
	["耳饰"] = "Earrings",
	["耶利米"] = "Jeremiah",
	["耶利米·"] = "Jeremiah ",
	["耶塔"] = "Yetta",
	["耶茨"] = "Yates",
	["耶，有男朋友了！"] = "Yay, I have a boyfriend!",
	["耸肩"] = "Shrug",
	["耽误这么多时间，我如果按自己的计划来，早就找到戒指了！也许在湖心的亭子，也许在许愿树……"] = "Wasting so much time, if I had followed my own plan, I would have found the ring long ago! Maybe in the pavilion in the middle of the lake, maybe at the wishing tree...",
	["聆听"] = "Ouvir",
	["聆听<h>知识残影</>的指引"] = "Listen to the guidance of the <h> knowledge remnant </>",
	["聆听_1"] = "Listen_1",
	["聆听_2"] = "Listen_2",
	["聆听_3"] = "Listen_3",
	["聆听世界低语，同时保持沉默心境。"] = "Listen to the whispers of the world while maintaining a silent state of mind.",
	["聆听告解"] = "Ouça a Confissão",
	["聆听心声"] = "Listen to Heart's Voice",
	["聆听心声-减"] = "Listen to Heart's Voice - Subtract",
	["聆听心声-加"] = "Listen to Heart's Voice - Add",
