	["胡德·欧根"] = "Hood Eugen",
	["胡桃木制的上下铺，结实的床架看起来很可靠。"] = "A bunk bed made of walnut; the sturdy frame looks very reliable.",
	["胡桃木制的单人床，尺寸足够容纳完整的休息。"] = "A single bed made of walnut, large enough for a full rest.",
