	["能"] = "Can",
	["能“看”到被挡住的事物，“听”到微弱的脚步声，掌握灵摆以及类似的占卜能力。"] = "Can 'see' things that are blocked, 'hear' faint footsteps, and master the pendulum and similar divination abilities.",
	["能一直被你们喜欢，是我们店的荣幸。"] = "It is our shop's honor to always be liked by you.",
	["能一眼辨别出王室画师拉姆齐作品的真假，并且毫不费力地打倒了好几个序列8的高手。放眼整个因蒂斯，恐怕找不到第二个人。"] = "Being able to distinguish the authenticity of the royal painter Ramsay's work at a glance, and effortlessly defeating several Sequence 8 experts. Looking at the entire Intis, I'm afraid you won't find a second person.",
	["能一眼辨别出王室画师拉姆齐作品的真假，并且毫不费力地打倒好几个序列8的高手。放眼整个因蒂斯，恐怕找不到第二个人。"] = "To be able to distinguish the authenticity of Royal Painter Ramsay's works at a glance, and to effortlessly defeat several Sequence 8 experts—I'm afraid you won't find a second person like that in all of Intis.",
	["能不受济贫院折磨，建造这样的生活，他们很了不起。"] = "To be able to build such a life without the torment of the poorhouse, they are remarkable.",
	["能不能出门要占一下，今天晚饭吃什么也要占一下！"] = "Whether I can go out needs divination, and what to eat for dinner today also needs divination!",
	["能不能利用铜镜或咒语，进入隐藏空间，救出罗珊和失踪者？"] = "Can we use the bronze mirror or the spell to enter the hidden space and rescue Rozanne and the missing people?",
	["能不能告诉我，到底怎么才能买到内部资料呢？"] = "Can you tell me how I can buy the insider materials?",
	["能不能讲得更清楚一些？"] = "Can you explain it more clearly?",
	["能为历史学的发展做出一点贡献，也是我的荣幸。"] = "It is my honor to contribute a little to the development of history.",
	["能借用一下你的锅和丝瓜吗？让我做一个尝试。"] = "Can I borrow your pot and loofahs? Let me give it a try.",
	["能像您这样真好啊。"] = "It's so good to be like you.",
	["能公费报销吗？"] = "Can this be reimbursed by the department?",
	["能具体说说吗？"] = "Can you be more specific?",
	["能具体说说嘛，比如伦纳德先生？"] = "Can you be more specific, for example, Mr. Leonard?",
	["能几乎完美的控制表情和肢体语言，属于技巧型格斗大师，拥有极高的身体协调性。"] = "Can control facial expressions and body language almost perfectly, belongs to the technical fighting master type, and possesses extremely high physical coordination.",
	["能分几个果子给我吗？"] = "Can you share a few fruits with me?",
	["能制作卷轴，念出咒文后卷轴会燃烧并释放其中能力，极大节约施法时间，提升巫师战斗能力，掌握冰冻、闪光等卷轴法术。"] = "Capable of making scrolls. After chanting the incantation, the scroll will burn and release the ability within, greatly saving casting time and improving the wizard's combat ability. Master scroll spells such as freezing and flash.",
	["能力"] = "Ability",
	["能力掌握得越好，需要的睡眠就越少。"] = "The better you master your abilities, the less sleep you need.",
	["能力提升礼盒"] = "Ability Enhancement Gift Box",
	["能力石板"] = "Ability Slate",
	["能力评价一览"] = "Ability Evaluation Overview",
	["能卖得更贵吗？"] = "Can it be sold for more?",
	["能听到来自不同方向的危险。"] = "Can hear danger from different directions.",
	["能和我详细说说吗？"] = "Can you tell me more about them?",
	["能和我说说吗？"] = "Can you tell me more about it?",
	["能四处游历做自己喜欢的事，真帅呀，是不是？"] = "Being able to travel around and do what you love is really cool, isn't it?",
	["能在战斗里发出让敌人惊恐混乱的声音，就像雷神降临到地面，正不间断地怒吼，它每一击都带有强烈的毁灭性，可怕的闪电永不缺席。"] = "It can emit a sound in battle that makes enemies terrified and chaotic, as if the God of Thunder has descended to the ground, roaring incessantly. Every strike carries intense destructiveness, and the terrifying lightning is never absent.",
	["能在济贫院这种地方，吹奏出这么美妙的歌曲。"] = "To be able to play such beautiful music in a place like the poorhouse.",
	["能够为世人所知晓的，只有一个伯爵归来的传说……"] = "All that remains known to the world is the legend of the Count's return...",
	["能够从过去的自己处借取力量，从历史孔隙中召唤影像。对古代学者而言，只要拥有过的东西就不算真正失去，历史是其无尽的宝库。"] = "Capable of borrowing power from your past self and summoning images from the gaps of history. For a Scholar of Yore, as long as something has been possessed, it is not truly lost; history is your endless treasure trove.",
	["能够从阳光中解读隐秘信息，对阴影与异常有着敏锐直觉，所行之处黑暗退散，让隐藏的真相无所遁形，照亮被掩盖的真实。"] = "Able to interpret hidden information from sunlight, has keen intuition for shadows and anomalies, darkness retreats wherever one walks, making hidden truths impossible to hide and illuminating the covered reality.",
	["能够掌握简化的“代行”权柄，可短暂和节制地代表自身所效忠的神明或旧日展现威能，降下神罚，代行神之意志。"] = "Capable of mastering a simplified 'Agent' authority, briefly and temperately representing the god or Great Old One you serve to display power, bringing down divine punishment and acting on behalf of the divine will.",
	["能够播放预设的动画序列资源"] = "Capable of playing preset animation sequence resources.",
	["能够沟通、连接灵界的特殊圣杯。\n曾是血月女王“美神”奥尔尼娅的收藏品，可作为媒介与效忠“美神”的灵界生物临时缔约，驱使其从灵界中带来神眷之物。"] = "A special holy grail capable of communicating with and connecting to the Spirit World. \n was once a collection piece of the Blood Moon Queen, the \"Goddess of Beauty\" Olnia. It can serve as a medium to temporarily form a covenant with Spirit World creatures loyal to the \"Goddess of Beauty,\" driving them to bring forth divine items from the Spirit World.",
	["能够激活乌托邦剧院效果，连接秘偶小镇的特定秘偶。使用后可以获得橙色品质的秘偶，<Highlight>先祖铠甲</>。"] = "Activates the Utopia Theater effect, connecting to a specific marionette from the Marionette Small Town. Upon use, you will obtain an orange-quality marionette: <Highlight>Ancestor Armor</>.",
	["能够激活乌托邦剧院效果，连接秘偶小镇的特定秘偶。使用后可以获得橙色品质的秘偶，<Highlight>剥面人</>。"] = "Activates the Utopia Theater effect, connecting to a specific marionette from the Marionette Small Town. Upon use, you will obtain an orange-quality marionette: <Highlight>Face-Peeler</>.",
	["能够激活乌托邦剧院效果，连接秘偶小镇的特定秘偶。使用后可以获得橙色品质的秘偶，<Highlight>厄水巨龟</>。"] = "Activates the Utopia Theater effect, connecting to a specific marionette from the Marionette Small Town. Upon use, you will obtain an orange-quality marionette: <Highlight>Misfortune Water Giant Turtle</>.",
