	["能量过载中"] = "Energy Overload in progress.",
	["能量返还"] = "Energy Return",
	["能闻到甜甜的香味，有些熟悉。"] = "I can smell a sweet fragrance, somewhat familiar.",
	["能麻烦你帮我尝尝，这两样蔬菜吃起来有什么不同吗？"] = "Could you trouble yourself to taste these two vegetables and tell me what the difference is?",
	["能，有时候是风，有时候是雨，有时候是阳光晒在背上那一阵温暖。您觉得是它，那就是它。"] = "Yes. Sometimes it's the wind, sometimes it's the rain, sometimes it's the warmth of the sun on your back. If you feel it's him, then it is him.",
	["脆弱"] = "Fragile",
	["脆弱的禁忌"] = "Fragile Taboo",
	["脆弱的纸张，却能承载一次逃离致命伤害的机会——只有一次，也已足够。"] = "Fragile paper, yet it can carry a chance to escape fatal damage—only once, but that is enough.",
	["脉动中凝聚着耐性与多角感知。"] = "Patience and multi-angle perception condensed in the pulse.",
	["脉动频率极高，充满原始力量。"] = "Pulse frequency is extremely high, full of primitive power.",
	["脏水"] = "Dirty Water",
	["脏污遮罩"] = "Dirt Mask",
	["脏词ACE审核"] = "Profanity ACE Review",
	["脏话蘑菇：来自一位母亲途径非凡者的研究，不停往外蹦下流单词的蘑菇，必须密封保存才能阻止它。伦纳德带回，等他回来处理。"] = "Profanity Mushroom: Research from a Mother pathway Beyonder; a mushroom that keeps blurting out obscene words. It must be kept sealed to stop it. Leonard brought it back; wait for him to return to handle it.",
	["脏，绑匪总该吃点苦头不是吗？"] = "It's dirty. Kidnappers should suffer a little, shouldn't they?",
	["脐带护体"] = "Umbilical Cord Protection",
	["脐带藤蔓"] = "Umbilical Vine",
	["脐带藤蔓被击破，痛苦魔女进入虚弱状态！"] = "The umbilical vine has been destroyed; the Pain Witch has entered a state of Weakness!",
	["脑子里……好些多了一些新知识，还有新能力……"] = "In my mind... it seems there is some new knowledge, and new abilities...",
	["脑子里……好像多了一些新知识，还有新能力……"] = "In my mind... it seems like there's some new knowledge, and new abilities...",
	["脑海中一股神秘的力量阻止了你继续看向那个庞大到不甚合理的数字。"] = "A mysterious force in your mind prevents you from continuing to look at that unreasonably large number.",
	["脑海中又出现了一些记忆片段，接下来……使用金币，重历历史。"] = "More memory fragments have appeared in my mind. Next... use the gold coin to relive history.",
	["脑海中的光球逐渐凝聚，所寻之地似乎在[%s]。"] = "The ball of light in your mind gradually condenses; the place you are looking for seems to be at [%s].",
	["脑瘫"] = "Brain-dead",
	["脑缠"] = "Brain-dead",
	["脑袋在膨胀，看什么事物都有着数不清的重影。"] = "Your head is expanding, and everything you see has countless overlapping images.",
	["脑袋昏昏沉沉的，好像忘记了什么……"] = "My head feels dizzy and heavy, as if I've forgotten something...",
	["脖子粗细"] = "Neck thickness",
	["脖子长度"] = "Neck length",
	["脚"] = "Foot",
	["脚上的伤，看样子没法走了。"] = "With this injury on my leg, it looks like I can't walk.",
	["脚下即将生成黑水！"] = "Black water is about to form under your feet!",
	["脚下留神，别让石头绊了跟头！"] = "Watch your step, don't let the stones trip you up!",
	["脚下迷雾散尽，前路星光铺就。"] = "The fog underfoot dissipates, and the path ahead is paved with starlight.",
