	["脚踏车·铜青"] = "Bicycle - Bronze Green",
	["脚踏车·麦金"] = "Bicycle - Mackin",
	["脚踏车中最经典的款型，选用独特的蓝白配色重新粉刷后再度推出。当煤气路灯的光芒穿透雨水照耀车身，每个人都将从此处领略到金属的美感。"] = "The most classic bicycle model, relaunched after being repainted in a unique blue and white scheme. When the light of the gas streetlamp pierces the rain and shines on the body, everyone will appreciate the beauty of metal from here.",
	["脚踏车告示"] = "Bicycle Notice",
	["脚踏车宣传海报"] = "Bicycle Promotional Poster",
	["脚踏车的设计者好像不是大帝，如果有机会真想见见那位人才……"] = "The designer of the bicycle doesn't seem to be the Emperor. If I had the chance, I'd really like to meet that talent...",
