	["脱战回血"] = "Heal upon exiting combat",
	["脱战时使用<Dungeon_Highlight>左下角-动作表情-默念尊名</>可以获得愚者的帮助，快速回复生命值"] = "When out of combat, use <Dungeon_Highlight> bottom-left - Emotes - Meditate on the honorific name </> to receive the Fool's help and rapidly recover Health.",
