	["臣服于“母亲”，是你唯一的归宿。"] = "Submitting to the 'Mother' is your only destination.",
	["臣服于红月吧！"] = "Submit to the Red Moon!",
	["臣民们，瞻仰我的荣耀吧。"] = "Subjects, behold my glory.",
	["臣民们，这次事态非常紧急，我需要大家的帮助。军情大臣，你先说明情况。"] = "Subjects, this situation is very urgent, I need everyone's help. Minister of Military Intelligence, you explain the situation first.",
	["自"] = "From",
	["自主探索"] = "Autonomous Exploration",
	["自从《反污染法案》出台后，无烟煤就成了新的主流，他们最终破产了。"] = "Since the Anti-Pollution Act was passed, anthracite has become the new mainstream, and they eventually went bankrupt.",
	["自从三个月零五天零七个小时前，在廷根剧院看过《吉赛尔》舞剧的演出后，我就无法自拔！"] = "Ever since I saw the performance of the ballet 'Giselle' at the Tingen theater three months, five days, and seven hours ago, I haven't been able to stop thinking about it!",
	["自从发布了新货币，最近的物价可真是糟透了。"] = "Ever since the new currency was issued, the recent prices have been terrible.",
	["自从小艾恩失踪后，艾恩夫妇每天都在外面寻找……唉，小艾恩，多可爱的小姑娘。"] = "Ever since little Aen disappeared, the Aen couple has been searching outside every day... Sigh, little Aen, what a cute little girl.",
	["自从我的小鸟在艺术学派看过这段舞蹈后，就非常兴奋。大概是因为这些动作很像鸭子走路，让同属禽类的它倍感亲切。"] = "Ever since my little bird saw this dance at the Art School, it has been very excited. Perhaps it's because these movements are very similar to a duck's walk, making it, as a fellow bird, feel a sense of kinship.",
	["自从我转为正式人员后，罗珊总抱怨文职的数量太少、工作太多，她现在应该非常高兴。"] = "Ever since I became a formal member, Rozanne has always complained that there are too few clerical staff and too much work. She should be very happy now.",
	["自从谢尔敏先生离开，已经过去一周，路边怎么没看到有人卖“焦糖炸弹”了？"] = "It's been a week since Mr. Shermin left. Why don't I see anyone selling \"Caramel Bombs\" by the roadside anymore?",
	["自从遇到艾登，我感觉自己就像童话故事里的主角一样。"] = "Ever since I met Aiden, I feel like the protagonist in a fairy tale.",
