	["自定义购买金镑，每支付1元可获得10金镑，并根据单次购买金额获得额外加赠金镑，单次购买上限100000元。\n加赠规则：单次购买金额＜30元时，无额外赠送，30元≤单次购买金额＜600元时，额外赠送10%的金镑，600元≤单次购买金额≤100000元时，额外赠送20%的金镑。"] = "Customize your Gold Pound purchase. For every 1 yuan paid, you receive 10 Gold Pounds, with additional bonus Gold Pounds based on the single transaction amount. The maximum single purchase amount is 100,000 yuan. \n Bonus rules: If the single purchase amount is < 30 yuan, there is no extra bonus. If 30 yuan ≤ single purchase amount < 600 yuan, you receive an extra 10% in Gold Pounds. If 600 yuan ≤ single purchase amount ≤ 100,000 yuan, you receive an extra 20% in Gold Pounds.",
