	["自身仇恨系数提高*d，减伤提高*f**，最大生命值提高*f**，怪物专防增加*d，但造成的伤害降低*f**"] = "Self aggro coefficient increased by *d, Damage Reduction increased by *f**, maximum Health increased by *f**, Monster Specialization increased by *d, but damage dealt is reduced by *f**",
	["自身仇恨系数提高10，减伤提高，最大生命值提高25%，怪物专防增加，但造成的伤害降低。当周围敌方玩家数量变多时，自身减伤会增多，同时造成的伤害更低。"] = "Self aggro coefficient increased by 10, Damage Reduction increased, maximum Health increased by 25%, Monster Specialization increased, but damage dealt is reduced. As the number of enemy players nearby increases, your Damage Reduction increases, while the damage you deal decreases further.",
