	["自身及2格内友军攻速提高<HighLight>35%</>，持续<HighLight>6</>秒；自身恢复<HighLight>15%</>最大生命。"] = "Self and allies within 2 tiles have Attack Speed Increased by <HighLight>35%</> for <HighLight>6</> seconds; self recovers <HighLight>15%</> of maximum Health.",
