	["自身技能处于冷却中"] = "Own skill is on cooldown",
	["自身护盾与减伤"] = "Self-shield and damage reduction.",
	["自身效果剩余时间（秒）"] = "Self effect remaining time (seconds)",
	["自身效果层数"] = "Self effect stacks",
	["自身效果是否存在"] = "Does self effect exist",
	["自身有The Fool祝福效果层数大于2层"] = "Number of stacks of The Fool's blessing effect on self is greater than 2",
	["自身有愚者祝福效果层数大于2层"] = "Number of stacks of The Fool's blessing effect on self is greater than 2",
	["自身格挡永久提升"] = "Permanent Block Increase",
	["自身特效强度"] = "Own Effect Intensity",
	["自身特效质量"] = "Own Effect Quality",
	["自身状态是否存在"] = "Does self status exist",
	["自身生命上限5%的护盾。"] = "Shield equal to 5% of own maximum Health.",
	["自身累计受到的伤害达到本格填写值后，分摊失效"] = "When the total damage received by the self reaches the value filled in this cell, the damage sharing becomes invalid",
	["自身获得*d**减伤"] = "Gain *d** Damage Reduction",
	["自身获得<HighLight>能量涌动</>效果，且施放<HighLight>惩戒</>和<HighLight>无暗之枪</>时，获得1层<HighLight>正义审判</>，持续15秒，最多叠加3层。\n<HighLight>烈阳</>状态下，施放普通攻击<HighLight>烈阳斩</>和战斗技能时也会为自身增加1层<HighLight>正义审判</>。\n\n<HighLight>能量涌动</>：击败敌方玩家时，获得5点<HighLight>太阳能量</>；净化敌方玩家时，获得5点<HighLight>太阳能量</>；参与助攻击败敌方玩家时，获得1点<HighLight>太阳能量</>，且每秒最多触发1次。\n<HighLight>正义审判</>：每层<HighLight>正义审判</>使<HighLight>惩戒</>和<HighLight>无暗之枪</>的伤害提高5%。"] = "You gain the <HighLight> Energy Surge </> effect. When casting <HighLight> Punishment </> and <HighLight> Unshadowed Spear </>, gain 1 stack of <HighLight> Judgment of Justice </>, lasting 15 seconds, stacking up to 3 times. \n <HighLight> Blazing Sun </> state: Casting Basic Attack <HighLight> Blazing Sun Slash </> and combat skills also adds 1 stack of <HighLight> Judgment of Justice </> to yourself. \n \n <HighLight> Energy Surge </>: Defeating an enemy player grants 5 points of <HighLight> Spirituality </>; Purifying an enemy player grants 5 points of <HighLight> Spirituality </>; participating in an assist to defeat an enemy player grants 1 point of <HighLight> Spirituality </>, triggering at most once per second. \n <HighLight> Judgment of Justice </>: Each stack of <HighLight> Judgment of Justice </> increases the damage of <HighLight> Punishment </> and <HighLight> Unshadowed Spear </> by 5%.",
	["自身获得<HighLight>银白细剑</>，持续<HighLight>20</>秒；自身获得4层<HighLight>晨曦</>，每<HighLight>5</>秒将有一层<HighLight>晨曦</>消散。施法时获得2枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>。当正在释放其他技能时，点按本技能可直接获得各个增益效果。\n\n<FaintYellow>银白细剑</>\n对敌方造成伤害时，将对其进行协同攻击，造成bulletdisc(*id)点物理伤害。此效果有<HighLight>3</>秒内置冷却。\n<FaintYellow>晨曦</>\n每层使buffdisc(*id)。\n<FaintYellow>黄昏印记</>\n使<HighLight>终结技能</>和<HighLight>怒意猛击</>得到强化，最多持有6枚。"] = "Gain <HighLight>Silver Rapier</> for <HighLight>20</> seconds; gain 4 stacks of <HighLight>Dawn</>, with one stack of <HighLight>Dawn</> dissipating every <HighLight>5</> seconds. Gain 2 <HighLight>Twilight Marks</> upon casting. When casting other skills, tap this skill to directly gain all buff effects. \n\n<FaintYellow>Silver Rapier</>\n: When dealing damage to enemies, perform a coordinated attack, dealing bulletdisc(*id) physical damage. This effect has a <HighLight>3</>-second internal cooldown. \n<FaintYellow>Dawn</>\n: Each stack provides buffdisc(*id). \n<FaintYellow>Twilight Mark</>\n: Strengthens <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> and <HighLight>Angry Slam</>. Can hold up to 6 marks.",
	["自身获得持续6秒的<HighLight>研习</>，在目标位置召唤持续5秒的空间牢笼，对范围内的敌方造成3次*d点魔法伤害，之后牢笼坍塌造成*d点魔法伤害。\n牢笼内的敌方被自身战斗技能命中后，自身获得1层持续<HighLight>0.5</>秒的<HighLight>折幕</>，并令牢笼协同攻击该目标，造成*d点范围魔法伤害并附加*f秒buffdisc(*id)的效果。（同一目标存在1秒的内置冷却时间）\n\n<FaintYellow>折幕</>\n每层<HighLight>折幕</>使自身获得<HighLight>霸体</>与<HighLight>减伤6%</>，最多叠加<HighLight>5</>层，持续时长也会随层数叠加。\n<FaintYellow>研习</>\n施放<HighLight>星云咏叹</>、<HighLight>戏法演绎</>、<HighLight>放逐</>时强化其效果。"] = "You gain <HighLight>Study</> for 6 seconds and summon a Space Cage at the target location that lasts for 5 seconds, dealing 3 instances of *d magic damage to enemies within range. The cage then collapses, dealing *d magic damage. \nWhen enemies inside the cage are hit by your combat skills, you gain 1 stack of <HighLight>Folding Screen</> for <HighLight>0.5</> seconds, and the cage performs a coordinated attack on the target, dealing *d area magic damage and applying, for *f seconds, the buffdisc(*id) effect. (There is a 1-second internal cooldown for the same target.) \n\n<FaintYellow>Folding Screen</>\nEach stack of <HighLight>Folding Screen</> grants you <HighLight>Super Armor</> and <HighLight>6% Damage Reduction</>, stacking up to <HighLight>5</> times, with the duration also stacking with the number of layers. \n<FaintYellow>Study</>\nStrengthens the effects of <HighLight>Nebula Aria</>, <HighLight>Trick Performance</>, and <HighLight>Exile</> when cast.",
	["自身获得灰雾加持，提高增伤。"] = "Gain gray fog Blessing, increasing Damage Boost.",
