	["致命的甘甜，是通往超凡的窄门。"] = "The deadly sweetness is the narrow door to the extraordinary.",
	["致命的阴谋在清冷的月光下成型，一场新的猎杀即将拉开帷幕。"] = "A deadly conspiracy takes shape under the cold moonlight; a new hunt is about to begin.",
	["致命预兆"] = "Fatal Omen",
	["致命预兆·神话"] = "Fatal Omen - Mythical",
	["致好心的您，"] = "To you, kind soul,",
	["致尊敬的非凡者：\n\n      我们注意到神座之争玩法中，最终伤害相关属性的局内缩放未能正常生效，导致局内伤害异常。对此我们深表歉意，并已连夜展开修复，预计于明日修复完成。\n      已为您随信奉上<M_Orange>绑定金镑*500、凯旋法典·神座之争*5、战勋之书·神座之争*5、守恒契文·神座之争*5、凯旋徽章*500</>的补偿。\n\n      感谢你的理解与包容，非凡世界因你的守望而更加稳固。我们将持续倾听，持续修缮，让每一场战斗都如约而至。\n"] = "Dear Beyonder:\n\n      We have noticed that the in-game scaling for final damage-related attributes in the War of the Divine Thrones mode was not functioning correctly, leading to abnormal damage values. We sincerely apologize for this and have worked through the night to implement a fix, which is expected to be completed by tomorrow.\n      We have attached compensation to this letter: <M_Orange>Bound Gold Pound*500, Triumph Codex: War of the Divine Thrones*5, Book of War Merits: War of the Divine Thrones*5, Conservation Contract: War of the Divine Thrones*5, Triumph Badge*500</>.\n\n      Thank you for your understanding and tolerance. The Beyonder world is more stable because of your vigilance. We will continue to listen and continue to improve, ensuring that every battle arrives as promised.\n",
	["致幻的汁液，分不清现实与梦境。"] = "Hallucinogenic sap, unable to distinguish reality from dreams.",
	["致您，"] = "To you,",
	["致意"] = "Saudação",
	["致新同事："] = "To new colleagues:",
	["致春夜的眷顾者："] = "To the favored of the spring night:",
	["致最亲爱的伊琳，"] = "To my dearest Irene,",
	["致盲"] = "Blinding",
	["致被黑夜眷顾的灵魂："] = "To the soul favored by the Night:",
	["致诸位虔诚信众："] = "To all devout believers:",
	["致身怀佛手柑与迷迭香的您，"] = "To you who carry bergamot and rosemary,",
	["致远"] = "Zhiyuan",
	["致迷途的羔羊与渴求庇护的灵魂：\n\n我主自称愚者，在过去，在现在，也在未来，他是支配灵界的伟大主宰，也是执掌好运的黄黑之王，更是每个生灵追求永恒的道标。\n\n他是怜悯的，他是仁慈的，他是这个世界的救主……他的仁爱播撒在人间，为家家户户带去温暖。我们将这关怀化作触手可及的回馈，将愚者的福音传遍大地……\n\n如有聆听福音的需要，请根据背面的地图指引，于夜深人静之时拜访<Letter_Highlight>奇迹邮筒</>。\n\n<Letter_Normal_HW>注：请不要在公开场合宣传愚者教会。</>"] = "To the lost lambs and souls craving Shelter: \n\n My Lord calls himself the Fool. In the past, in the present, and in the future, He is the great master who dominates the Spirit World, the King of Yellow and Black who holds good luck, and the beacon for every living being pursuing eternity. \n\n He is merciful, He is kind, He is the savior of this world... His love is spread across the human world, bringing warmth to every household. We turn this care into tangible feedback, spreading the gospel of the Fool across the land... \n\n If you have a need to listen to the gospel, please visit the <Letter_Highlight>Miracle Mailbox</> in the dead of night according to the map guide on the back. \n\n<Letter_Normal_HW> Note: Please do not promote the Church of the Fool in public. </>",
	["致非凡者：\n部分非凡者在「装备加速」活动中获取了额外的蓝山晶石道具，为保证所有非凡者从活动中可获得的最大道具数量一致，值夜者已对额外获取的%s进行扣除。对于异常期间给您造成的不便，我们深感歉意。"] = "To Beyonders: \nSome Beyonders obtained extra Blue Mountain Crystal items during the \"Equipment Acceleration\" event. To ensure that all Beyonders can obtain the same maximum number of items from the event, the Nighthawks have deducted the extra %s obtained. We deeply apologize for the inconvenience caused during this anomaly.",
	["致非凡者：\n部分非凡者在「装备加速」活动中获取了额外的蓝山晶石道具，为保证所有非凡者从活动中可获得的最大道具数量一致，值夜者已对额外获取的%s进行扣除，其中待扣除部分（%s）将在后续获得时进行扣除。对于异常期间给您造成的不便，我们深感歉意。"] = "To Beyonders: \nSome Beyonders obtained extra Blue Mountain Crystal items during the \"Equipment Acceleration\" event. To ensure that all Beyonders can obtain the same maximum number of items from the event, the Nighthawks have deducted the extra %s obtained. The portion to be deducted (%s) will be deducted when obtained in the future. We deeply apologize for the inconvenience caused during this anomaly.",
