	["艾伦·怀特"] = "Allen White",
	["艾伦生前把父亲当假想敌——那是金狼种进他脑中的声音。金狼死后，声音消失了，可死亡让和解再无可能。好在魂灵未散。在生死缝隙里，帮他还原迟到的拥抱。"] = "Allen viewed his father as a hypothetical enemy while he was alive—that was the voice the Golden Wolf planted in his mind. After the Golden Wolf died, the voice vanished, but death made reconciliation impossible. Fortunately, his soul hasn't dissipated. In the rift between life and death, help him restore the hug that came too late.",
