	["艾琳，你一个小女孩去探险太危险了。高塔是一张预示灾难的牌。"] = "Irene, it's too dangerous for a little girl like you to go exploring. The Tower is a card that foretells disaster.",
	["艾琳？艾琳花钱找我？我前天出门前还跟她吵了架……我以为她暂时不想见到我呢。"] = "Irene? Irene spent money to find me? I had an argument with her before I left the day before yesterday... I thought she didn't want to see me for a while.",
