	["苏茜-1星"] = "Susie - 1 Star",
	["苏茜-2星"] = "Susie - 2 Star",
	["苏茜-3星"] = "Susie - 3 Star",
	["苏茜不能和您共舞，毕竟苏茜只是一条狗。"] = "Susie cannot dance with you; after all, Susie is just a dog.",
	["苏茜不能和您同乘，因为苏茜只是一只狗。"] = "Susie cannot ride along with you because Susie is just a dog.",
	["苏茜出现"] = "Susie Appears",
	["苏茜原本只是一只血统不太纯正的金毛犬，是我父亲购买猎狐犬时获得的赠品。但她现在是我的家人，我的助手。"] = "Susie was originally just a Golden Retriever with not-so-pure bloodlines, a free gift I received when my father bought a Foxhound. But she is now my family, my assistant.",
	["苏茜原本是一只血统不太纯正的金毛犬，是我父亲购买猎狐犬时获得的赠品。但她现在是我的家人，我的助手。"] = "Susie was originally a Golden Retriever with not-so-pure bloodlines; she was a free gift when my father bought a Foxhound. But she is my family now, my assistant.",
	["苏茜大门"] = "Susie's Gate",
	["苏茜女士建议用“命运”作为咖啡厅的名字，因为这个词的鲁恩语发音像摇篮曲尾声的轻叹一样让人感到平静，嗯，她的视角总是很别致。"] = "Ms. Susie suggested using 'Fate' as the cafe's name because the Loen pronunciation of this word feels as calm as a sigh at the end of a lullaby. Well, her perspective is always quite unique.",
	["苏茜女士，在您眼里，奥黛丽小姐是什么样的人？"] = "Ms. Susie, in your eyes, what kind of person is Miss Audrey?",
	["苏茜女士，您晋升了？"] = "Ms. Susie, have you advanced?",
	["苏茜女士，您经常说“我只是一条狗”，您真的这么认为吗？"] = "Ms. Susie, you often say 'I am just a dog,' do you really think so?",
	["苏茜女士，我听说您在研读心理学？"] = "Ms. Susie, I heard you are studying psychology?",
	["苏茜女士，每个周一下午，您都会守在奥黛丽小姐的房间门口？"] = "Ms. Susie, every Monday afternoon, you guard the door to Miss Audrey's room?",
	["苏茜女士？但她只是一只……"] = "Ms. Susie? But she is just a...",
	["苏茜庆祝开服"] = "Susie celebrates the server launch",
	["苏茜懂事离开cs"] = "Susie leaves sensibly cs",
	["苏茜护盾计数BUFF"] = "Susie Shield count BUFF",
	["苏茜摇尾巴"] = "Susie wagging tail",
	["苏茜是一条血统不那么纯正的金毛大狗，是她父亲霍尔伯爵购买猎狐犬时获得的赠品，但非常受奥黛丽喜欢。在没有成为非凡生物前就能够自己打开房门，因此误服奥黛丽所调制的序列9观众魔药，成为非凡生物，并能够开口说话。"] = "Susie is a not-so-purebred golden retriever, a freebie obtained when her father, Earl Hall, purchased a foxhound, but she is very much loved by Audrey. Even before becoming a Beyonder creature, she was able to open doors on her own, which led her to accidentally ingest the Sequence 9 Spectator potion prepared by Audrey, becoming a Beyonder creature and gaining the ability to speak.",
	["苏茜的历史投影，重现了原主的形态与部分能力。"] = "A historical projection of Susie, recreating the original's form and partial abilities.",
	["苏茜的身份，让她避免了很多烦恼。当我们面对问题一筹莫展时，苏茜只要说——“我不知道，毕竟我只是一条狗”。"] = "Susie's identity saved her a lot of trouble. When we were at a loss for what to do, Susie would just say—\"I don't know, after all, I am just a dog\".",
