	["若"] = "Ruo",
	["若 bIDInBBV 为 true, 则调用黑板值 skillid\n注意：技能相关监听（OnSkillCast、OnSkillTriggerCD）会写黑板值"] = "If bIDInBBV is true, call the blackboard value skillid\n Note: Skill-related listeners (OnSkillCast, OnSkillTriggerCD) will write to the blackboard",
	["若%s内响应的玩家数量未达要求，则俱乐部创建失败，将返还部分创建费用。"] = "If the number of responding players does not meet the requirements within %s, the Club creation fails, and a portion of the creation fee will be refunded.",
	["若两条线索关联可推理出新的线索"] = "If two clues are related, a new clue can be deduced.",
	["若为 true，则是装载数据重载；若为 false 为热替换.。\n若为重载，则原技能被认为卸载，同时替换装配界面描述；\n若为热替换，原技能不被认为卸载，不会替换描述"] = "If true, it is a data reload; if false, it is a hot swap. \n If it is a reload, the original skill is considered uninstalled, and the assembly interface description is replaced; \n if it is a hot swap, the original skill is not considered uninstalled, and the description is not replaced.",
	["若为true，前面4个参数无效，但白名单优先级高于全部禁用"] = "If true, the first 4 parameters are invalid, but the whitelist priority is higher than disabling all.",
	["若云"] = "Ruoyun",
	["若仅命中了单个敌人，则会额外对其进行一次伤害为60%的斩击。"] = "If only a single enemy is hit, an additional slash dealing 60% damage is performed on them.",
	["若伊·"] = "Ruoyi ",
	["若你准备好加入我们了，欢迎再来找我，春夜舞会的大门随时为你敞开。"] = "If you are ready to join us, you are welcome to come back to me; the doors of the Spring Night Ball are always open to you.",
	["若你的心已做好准备，欢迎再来此处，安魂诗社随时欢迎你的加入。"] = "If your heart is prepared, you are welcome to return here; the Requiem Poetry Society is always open to your joining.",
	["若兮"] = "Ruoxi",
	["若再次被首领吞噬,会承受极高的消化伤害。"] = "If swallowed by the boss again, you will suffer extremely high digestion damage.",
	["若冰"] = "Ruobing",
	["若冲刺方向<Highlight>靠近</>安西娅，需吸引安西娅<Highlight>远离</>该位置。"] = "If the dash direction <Highlight>brings you close to</> Anthea, you must lure Anthea <Highlight>away from</> that position.",
	["若君"] = "Ruojun",
	["若含"] = "Ruohan",
	["若墨"] = "Ruomo",
	["若多年以后再相聚，我该如何见你？以眼泪，以沉默。"] = "If we meet again many years from now, how should I greet you? With tears, with silence.",
	["若娜·"] = "Ruona ",
	["若宇"] = "Ruoyu",
	["若宸"] = "Ruochen",
	["若对折扣力度不满意，3秒内可以再次释放技能重新讨价还价。"] = "If you are not satisfied with the discount, you can cast the skill again within 3 seconds to bargain again.",
	["若尘"] = "Ruochen",
	["若尝过她唇间的酒，谁还愿意清醒着回归！"] = "If one has tasted the wine from her lips, who would still be willing to return sober!",
	["若希"] = "Ruoxi",
	["若干"] = "Several",
	["若彤"] = "Ruotong",
	["若征服旌旗被攻占，夺得尾刀方将获得更多神选积分。"] = "If the Banner of Conquest is captured, the side that lands the final blow will receive more God-Chosen points.",
	["若忘记题面，可查看背包内的纸条。"] = "If you forget the question, you can check the note in your Inventory.",
	["若思"] = "Ruosi",
	["若怡"] = "Ruoyi",
	["若您喜欢浪漫，可以看看右手边的那些项链与发冠。"] = "If you prefer romance, you can take a look at the necklaces and tiaras on the right.",
	["若您是个浪漫的人，可以看看右手边的那些项链与头梳。"] = "If you are a romantic person, you can take a look at the necklaces and hair combs on the right.",
	["若您是个潮流的人，可以看看左手边的珠宝们。"] = "If you are a trendy person, you can take a look at the jewelry on the left.",
	["若您更在意潮流，可以看看左手边的珠宝们。"] = "If you care more about trends, you can take a look at the jewelry on the left.",
	["若您渴望成为政府雇员，请选择我们的夜间学堂！\n识字就能来，结业保送市政厅考试！\n\n<Highlight>开课详情</>\n◆每逢二四六夜间授课\n◆学费1磅12苏勒\n\n月月准点发金镑，刮风下雨不下岗。\n高薪体面又轻松，码头扛包百倍强！\n\n<Highlight>水仙花街6号\"金笔杆\"商行</>报名，名额只收<Mark id=\"#159_R\"> 30人 </>，手慢明年挤破头！"] = "If you aspire to become a government employee, please choose our night school! \n If you can read, you can come. Graduation guarantees a recommendation for the City Hall exam! \n \n <Highlight> Course Details </> \n ◆ Classes held on Tuesday, Thursday, and Saturday nights \n ◆ Tuition: 1 pound 12 soli \n \n Receive gold pounds on time every month, no layoffs regardless of wind or rain. \n High-paying, decent, and easy; a hundred times better than carrying bags at the docks! \n \n <Highlight> 6 Daffodil Street, \"Golden Pen\" Firm </> Registration, only <Mark id=\"#159_R\"> 30 spots </>, sign up fast or you'll be squeezed out next year!",
	["若想单人使用视频创作，可退出团队"] = "If you wish to use video creation solo, you may exit the team.",
	["若拉·"] = "Ruola ",
	["若持有防御力增加效果将获得防罩效果，若持有防御力增加效果将获得防护罩效果，吸收相当于体力上<HighLight>20.0%</>的伤害持续<HighLight>15</>秒"] = "If you have a defense increase effect, you will gain a Protective Shield effect. If you have a defense increase effect, you will gain a Protective Shield effect, absorbing damage equivalent to <HighLight> 20.0% </> of your health for <HighLight> 15 </> seconds.",
	["若星"] = "Ruoxing",
	["若是方便的话，可否请那位系银灰围裙的先生过来？他总能把红茶温度控制得像初春溪水一样恰好。"] = "If it's convenient, could you ask that gentleman in the silver-gray apron to come over? He always manages to keep the black tea temperature as perfect as a stream in early spring.",
