	["若目标玩家可以进行安魂，会显示<Highlight>安魂按钮</>，点击后即可对其进行安魂。"] = "If the target player is eligible for Requiem, the <Highlight>Requiem</> button will be displayed. Clicking it will allow you to perform Requiem on them.",
