	["苹果树在庄园内疯狂生长，绯红月光照耀大地。惨烈的献祭背后，污秽之物正在孕育……"] = "Apple trees grow wildly in the manor, and the crimson moonlight shines upon the earth. Behind the tragic sacrifice, something filthy is gestating...",
