	["苹果耳机用户建议关闭手机系统自带“空间化立体声”，仅支持IOS17系统版本及以上。"] = "Apple headphone users are advised to turn off the system's built-in \"Spatialized Stereo.\" Only supported on iOS 17 and above.",
