	["茜安1"] = "Xian 1",
	["茜安2"] = "Xian 2",
	["茜安不是普通章鱼，八年前，我在迪西海湾救下受伤的她，之后我们一直一起生活。一年前，我因客人投诉失业，她第一次开口说话，说要帮我做菜……"] = "Cian isn't an ordinary octopus. Eight years ago, I saved her when she was injured in Tisi Bay, and we've lived together ever since. A year ago, when I lost my job due to customer complaints, she spoke for the first time, saying she wanted to help me cook...",
	["茜安在你进后厨时弄晕了我，大概是不想让我看到你们打斗的场面。"] = "Cian knocked me out when you entered the kitchen; she probably didn't want me to see you two fighting.",
