	["茜耶娜"] = "Sienna",
	["茜茜"] = "Sissi",
	["茜茜上晚课，出门和回家的马车也会吵到他们休息……这在搬家前甚至算不上烦恼，而现在，茜茜需要走到另一条街道坐马车。"] = "Cici takes night classes, and the carriage ride out and back home also disturbs their rest... This wasn't even a problem before moving, but now, Cici needs to walk to another street to take a carriage.",
	["茜茜喜欢看书……虽然和政府雇员考试没有关系，但她是个好孩子。"] = "Cici likes to read... although it has nothing to do with the government employee exam, she is a good child.",
