	["荣幸至极！世上每一位辛劳的园丁听到您这话，疲惫都会一扫而空。"] = "It's an absolute honor! Every hardworking gardener in the world would have their fatigue wiped away upon hearing that.",
	["荣幸？你每次都这么说。 不过……你至少会看着我的眼睛说话。家里那位，三年没正眼瞧过我了。"] = "Honor? You say that every time. However... at least you look me in the eye when you speak. The one at home hasn't looked at me properly in three years.",
	["荣耀"] = "Glory",
	["荣耀、财富、力量……要多少有多少！"] = "Glory, wealth, power... as much as I want!",
	["荣耀与吾同在！"] = "Glory is with me!",
	["荣耀之斩"] = "Slash of Glory",
	["荣耀之斩的下劈额外在原地生成一个半径5米的区域，持续5秒，区域内对敌人持续造成伤害，给友方减伤30%。"] = "The downward slash of Slash of Glory additionally generates a 5-meter radius area at the location, lasting 5 seconds. The area continuously deals damage to enemies and provides 30% Damage Reduction to allies.",
	["荣耀之斩的下劈额外在原地生成一个半径5米的区域，持续5秒，引力场内对敌人持续造成伤害，给友方减伤。"] = "The downward slash of Slash of Glory additionally generates a 5-meter radius area at the location, lasting 5 seconds, continuously dealing damage to enemies within the gravity field and granting Damage Reduction to allies.",
