	["药瓶堆得越高，命就越长。"] = "The higher the pile of medicine bottles, the longer the life.",
	["药瓶旁压着一叠就诊记录"] = "A stack of medical records is pressed beside the medicine bottle",
	["药瓶旁压着一叠就诊记录。\n纸页已经有些卷边，显然被反复翻阅过。\n一张记录单半露在外，夹得有些仓促，像是有人不久前刚看过，还没来得及收起。"] = "A stack of medical records is pressed beside the medicine bottle. \n The pages are slightly curled, clearly having been flipped through repeatedly. \n A record sheet is half-exposed, tucked in rather hastily, as if someone had just looked at it recently and hadn't had time to put it away.",
