	["获得技能摄心：使最多6个目标防御降低并受到伤害，持续6秒。对梦境编织内和受到精神瘟疫的普通怪物造成定身。"] = "Obtain Skill Mind Capture: Reduces the Defense of up to 6 targets and causes them to take damage for 6 seconds. Immobilizes normal monsters within Dream Weaving and those affected by Mental Plague.",
