	["获得护盾增幅_百分比加成"] = "Shield Gain Amplification_Percentage Bonus",
	["获得护盾效果，吸收所受到的伤害。"] = "Gain Shield effect, absorbing damage taken.",
	["获得护身盾技能，可反弹邦尼的丝线！"] = "Obtained Protective Shield skill; can reflect Bonnie's threads!",
	["获得持续<Highlight>30</>天的福音券运势解读，以及<Highlight>人脉快速互动次数增加</>、<Highlight>玩法货币获取效率提升</>、<Highlight>自定义传送信标</>、<Highlight>活力上限增加</>等特权。\n每日登录可获得<Highlight>100</>绑定金镑，累积登录还可额外获得更多<Highlight>活力方糖</>。\n请注意，只有当前愚者福音剩余天数<Highlight>小于等于150天</>时，才可使用道具。"] = "Grants a <Highlight>30</>-day Gospel Voucher fortune reading, along with privileges such as <Highlight>increased rapid interaction attempts with connections</>, <Highlight>improved efficiency in obtaining gameplay currency</>, <Highlight>customizable teleportation beacons</>, and <Highlight>increased Vitality cap</>. \nLog in daily to receive <Highlight>100</> Bound Pounds, and accumulate logins to receive additional <Highlight>Vitality Sugar Cubes</>. \nPlease note that this item can only be used if the remaining days of your current Fool's Gospel are <Highlight>150 days or less</>.",
