	["菜鸟，你以为特殊行动部就只有四个组？从第五组开始，他们在暗中处理郡内各个市的超自然现象。"] = "Rookie, do you think the Special Operations Department only has four groups? From the fifth group onwards, they operate in the shadows, handling supernatural phenomena across the county's cities.",
	["菠菜奖杯"] = "Spinach Trophy",
	["菠菜新鲜到在跳舞！1便士一捆？简直是蔬菜界的浪漫！"] = "The spinach is so fresh it's dancing! 1 penny a bundle? It's simply the romance of the vegetable world!",
