	["萨斯利尔发射<Disable>3条120度夹角排列的高伤射线</>，并旋转一圈"] = "Sasrir fires <Disable>3 high-damage rays arranged at 120-degree angles</> and rotates in a circle.",
	["萨斯利尔召唤2个献祭幻影持续靠近自己<Disable>每个献祭幻影触碰到萨斯利尔，都会造成高额全场伤害，并为所有玩家叠加1层持续30秒的献祭灼烧dot</>"] = "Sasrir summons 2 Sacrifice Phantoms that continuously approach it. <Disable>Each Sacrifice Phantom that touches Sasrir will deal high field-wide damage and apply 1 stack of a Sacrifice Burn DoT that lasts for 30 seconds to all players.</>",
	["萨斯利尔召唤多个分身向本体输送黑白两种混沌能量，<Disable>所有接触到萨斯利尔的混沌能量都会给他增加1层强化</>一段时间后萨斯利尔释放渎神者死，造成持续的全场伤害，每层混沌能量增强都会提升20%该伤害。"] = "Sasrir summons multiple avatars to transport black and white Chaos Energy to its main body. <Disable>All Chaos Energy that touches Sasrir will add 1 stack of strengthening to it.</> After a period of time, Sasrir releases Blasphemer's Death, dealing continuous field-wide damage. Each stack of Chaos Energy enhancement increases this damage by 20%.",
	["萨斯利尔射球小怪材质变化"] = "Sasrir Ball-Shooting Monster Material Change",
	["萨斯利尔常驻buff"] = "Sasrir Permanent Buff",
	["萨斯利尔引导混沌海的水流，在场地上生成3条黑色河流<Disable>河流会间隔一段时间喷发，击飞河流上方的所有玩家，</>并造成中等伤害。"] = "Sasrir channels the water of the Chaos Sea, generating 3 black rivers on the field. <Disable>The rivers will erupt after an interval, knocking up all players above them</> and dealing moderate damage.",
	["萨斯利尔沉睡后，米尔贡根一直守护着巨人王庭。"] = "After Sasrir fell into a deep sleep, Milgongen has been guarding the Giant King's Court.",
	["萨斯利尔点名多个玩家，<Disable>6秒后在被点名玩家脚下生成一滩腐蚀的黑水</>，持续伤害并减速上面的玩家"] = "Sasrir targets multiple players, <Disable>generating a pool of corrosive black water at the feet of the targeted players after 6 seconds</>, which continuously deals damage and slows players on it.",
