	["蔬菜便宜卖了！"] = "Vegetables for sale, cheap!",
	["蔬菜摊主"] = "Vegetable stall owner",
	["蔬菜摊怎么又出现了！这都第几回了！"] = "Why is the vegetable stall here again! This is the how many-th time!",
