	["藏有时之虫的宝箱散落在各处，开启每一个宝箱，都是在破解恶作剧之神阿蒙留下的谜题与陷阱。"] = "Treasure chests containing Worms of Time are scattered everywhere. Opening each chest is like solving the puzzles and traps left behind by Amon, the God of Mischief.",
