	["虫子……都碾碎……"] = "Bugs... crush them all...",
	["虫子！滚出！我的！房子！"] = "Bugs! Get out! Of my! House!",
	["虫子！虫子！不要靠近我！"] = "Bugs! Bugs! Don't come near me!",
