	["血族始祖亲手锻造的永恒满月。提升自己与队友的战斗技能等级，并强化秘偶，即使技能冷却中也有概率强制召出。代价是每一次强召，都会吞噬你的生命。"] = "The eternal full moon forged by the ancestor of the vampires. Increases the battle skill level of yourself and teammates, and strengthens the marionette; even if the skill is on Cooldown, there is a probability of forced summoning. The price is that every forced summoning will devour your Health.",
