	["衰败-纯技能描述引用"] = "Decay - Pure Skill Description Reference",
	["衰败增加吸血效果，吸血量和衰败单次的伤害量正相关，该效果最多每0.5秒触发一次。"] = "Decay gains a Life Steal effect. The amount of Life Steal is positively correlated with the single-hit damage of Decay. This effect can trigger at most once every 0.5 seconds.",
	["衰败增加吸血效果，吸血量和衰败每次造成的伤害量正相关。"] = "Decay gains a Life Steal effect; the amount of Life Steal is positively correlated with the damage dealt by each instance of Decay.",
	["衰败的伤害提高300%，光之风暴的引爆伤害同步提升300%"] = "Decay damage increased by 300%; Hurricane of Light's detonation damage is increased by the same amount.",
	["衰败的伤害提高300%，光之风暴的引爆伤害同步提升300%。"] = "Decay damage increased by 300%, and the detonation damage of Hurricane of Light is increased by the same amount.",
	["衰败的最大持续时间提高15秒"] = "Maximum duration of Decay increased by 15 seconds",
	["衰败的最大持续时间无上限，并且衰败的频率提升至0.5秒"] = "Decay has no maximum duration, and the frequency of Decay is increased to 0.5 seconds.",
	["衰败的最大持续时间无上限，并且衰败的频率提升至0.5秒。"] = "The maximum duration of Decay has no limit, and the frequency of Decay is increased to 0.5 seconds.",
	["衰败的最大持续时间无上限，并且衰败的频率提升至每0.5秒"] = "The maximum duration of Decay has no limit, and the frequency of Decay is increased to every 0.5 seconds",
