	["袁"] = "Yuan",
	["袁康"] = "Yuan Kang",
	["袋子上写了什么……‘蘑菇变成了虫子？’"] = "What's written on the bag... 'Mushrooms turned into bugs?'",
	["袍上的花纹是荣耀的勋章，也是对战斗的不灭执念。"] = "The patterns on the robe are medals of glory and an undying obsession with battle.",
