	["被周围的火热气氛所感染，克莱恩也投身到了紧张的牌局中。"] = "Infected by the heated atmosphere around him, Klein also throws himself into the intense card game.",
	["被商人捡到的残存记忆，购买后立刻进行一次记忆碎片选择"] = "A residual memory found by a merchant; purchase to immediately perform a memory fragment selection.",
