	["被锁定的玩家通过<Highlight>移动引导大地震颤的攻击方向</>，避免波及过多队友。"] = "The targeted player must <Highlight>move to guide the direction of the Earth Tremor attack</> to avoid affecting too many teammates.",
	["被锁定的非凡者<Highlight>向场边移动</>，避免影响中心战场。"] = "The targeted Beyonder should <Highlight>move to the edge of the field</> to avoid affecting the central battlefield.",
	["被锁定目标及时<Highlight>开启减伤</>，其他人注意<Highlight>远离</>被锁定目标所在方位。"] = "The targeted player should <Highlight>activate damage reduction</> in time, and others should be careful to <Highlight>stay away</> from the targeted player's location.",
