	["西装男子"] = "Man in a suit",
	["西装订货人安迪斯……订货人安迪斯……订货人……怎么全都是这个安迪斯？"] = "Suit orderer Andis... orderer Andis... orderer... why is it all this Andis?",
	["西西弗"] = "Sisyphus",
	["西边太阳落下的地方……真的是谷地吗？"] = "The place where the sun sets in the west... is it really a valley?",
	["西迦"] = "Xiga",
	["西迦1"] = "Xiga 1",
	["西迦2"] = "Seika 2",
	["西迦·特昂"] = "Xiga Tion",
	["西迦。是队长让你来的吗？"] = "Xiga. Did the Captain send you?",
	["西迦会用一件封印物来帮大家变装，防止罗珊认出我们。"] = "Xiga will use a Sealed Artifact to help everyone disguise themselves to prevent Rozanne from recognizing us.",
	["西迦你去吧 待会我帮你把案件资料带上来"] = "Xiga, you go. I'll bring the case files up for you in a moment.",
	["西迦你去吧，待会我帮你把案件资料带上来。"] = "Xiga, you go ahead; I'll bring the case files up later.",
	["西迦可能在休息区写作。我要去煮咖啡，可以顺便问问。 "] = "Xiga might be writing in the lounge. I'm going to make coffee, I can ask her while I'm at it.",
	["西迦女士"] = "Ms. Xiga",
	["西迦女士……她教我的方法让我成功避开了麻烦。听说她不光在这里做安保，还是个大作家，我准备了些纸笔……希望她用得上。"] = "Madam Xiga... the method she taught me allowed me to successfully avoid trouble. I heard that she not only does security here but is also a great writer, so I prepared some paper and pens... I hope she can use them.",
	["西迦女士在黑荆棘休息区"] = "Ms. Xiga is in the Blackthorn lounge",
	["西迦特昂以邓恩戴莉为原型撰写的童话故事第一节。"] = "The first chapter of the fairy tale written by Xiga Teang, based on Dunn and Daly.",
	["西迦特昂以邓恩戴莉为原型撰写的童话故事第三节。"] = "The third chapter of the fairy tale written by Xiga Teang, based on Dunn and Daly.",
	["西迦特昂以邓恩戴莉为原型撰写的童话故事第二节。"] = "The second chapter of the fairy tale written by Xiga Teang, based on Dunn and Daly.",
	["西迦特昂以邓恩戴莉为原型撰写的童话故事第五节。"] = "The fifth chapter of the fairy tale written by Xiga Teang, based on Dunn and Daly.",
	["西迦特昂以邓恩戴莉为原型撰写的童话故事第四节。"] = "The fourth chapter of the fairy tale written by Xiga Teang, based on Dunn and Daly.",
	["西迦特昂以邓恩戴莉为原型撰写的童话故事，他们在童话里拥有美好幸福的结局。"] = "The fairy tale written by Xiga Teang based on Dunn and Daly, in which they have a beautiful and happy ending.",
	["西迦的照片"] = "Photo of Xiga",
	["西迦离开路径"] = "Xiga Departure Path",
	["西迦，现在方便吗？一位叫凯尔文的年轻人托我给你带点东西，想感谢你之前的指点。"] = "Seika, is now a good time? A young man named Kelvin asked me to bring you something to thank you for your previous guidance.",
	["西迦，现在方便吗？一位叫凯尔文的年轻人托我给你带点东西，想感谢你之前的指点。 "] = "Xiga, are you free right now? A young man named Kelvin asked me to bring you something; he wants to thank you for your previous guidance.",
	["西迦：不用担心。说起来，这是我们的新人？挺帅气的嘛。"] = "Xiga: Don't worry. Speaking of which, is this our new recruit? Quite handsome.",
	["西迦：好，我去找找看。"] = "Xiga: Good, I'll go look for them.",
	["西迦：罗珊，你知道昨天的案件档案放在哪里了吗？"] = "Xiga: Rozanne, do you know where yesterday's case files were put?",
	["西迦：虽然已经结案，但我隐约觉得遗漏了什么，想继续调查看看。"] = "Xiga: Although the case is closed, I vaguely feel that something was missed, and I want to continue investigating.",
	["西迦：那……行，就来一把，现在是休息时间。"] = "Xiga: Well... okay, let's play a round, it's break time now.",
	["西部区域"] = "Western Region",
	["西里尔"] = "Cyril",
	["西里尔，再给我点时间……好了，不要辜负金秋湖的景色，让我们暂时遗忘贝克兰德的一切。"] = "Cyril, give me more time... Alright, don't let the scenery of Golden Autumn Lake go to waste; let us temporarily forget everything about Backlund.",
	["西里斯残影"] = "Sirius afterimage",
	["西里莎"] = "Cirisa",
	["西门"] = "West Gate",
	["西马车"] = "West Carriage",
	["要"] = "Must",
	["要……要买花吗？我这儿有……有不少。"] = "Do... do you want to buy flowers? I have... quite a few here.",
	["要一杯酒"] = "Order a drink",
	["要上传/保存图片功能，请在系统设置中打开游戏的相册或文件读写权限 "] = "To use the upload/save image function, please enable the game's album or file read/write permissions in system settings.",
	["要上车吗"] = "Want a ride?",
	["要上车吗（废弃）"] = "Want to get on the carriage? (Discarded)",
	["要上车吗？"] = "Should I get in the carriage?",
	["要不……就进店看看？"] = "How about…… I just go inside and take a look?",
	["要不今天不去了？"] = "How about not going today?",
	["要不你带他们去找西奥多，拿回那本书？"] = "Why don't you take them to find Theodore and get the book back?",
	["要不先来杯锡伯红茶，或者是南威尔咖啡！边喝边想。"] = "How about having a cup of Sibe black tea or Southwell coffee first! Think while you drink.",
	["要不先试试——"] = "How about we try it first—",
	["要不先试试——七日任务？"] = "Why not try—a seven-day quest first?",
	["要不先试试——苟三家？"] = "Should I try—the 'Gou' trio first?",
	["要不怎么说晦气呢，这死人躺过的地方，我可不敢坐。"] = "Why else would I say it's bad luck? I wouldn't dare sit where a dead person has lain.",
	["要不您去帮一下旁边的那位先生？他有点害羞。"] = "Why don't you go help that gentleman over there? He's a bit shy.",
	["要不您去帮帮旁边那位先生？他有点害羞。"] = "Why don't you go help that gentleman over there? He's a bit shy.",
	["要不我也来写一句？写什么好呢……"] = "How about I write a line too? What should I write...",
	["要不我们走吧。"] = "Maybe we should leave.",
	["要不我们钓点鱼到这个池塘里。"] = "How about we catch some fish and put them in this pond?",
	["要不我帮你们叫个警察？反正他们闲着也是闲着。"] = "How about I call a policeman for you? They're just idling around anyway.",
	["要不换个地方试试？转换一下心情，或许对演奏有帮助。"] = "How about trying a different place? A change of scenery might help with the performance.",
	["要不是为了工作，我才不来这小地方，街道又小又脏。"] = "If it weren't for work, I wouldn't come to this small place; the streets are so narrow and dirty.",
	["要不是你当初坚持去剧院，我们还能赶上火车呢。"] = "If you hadn't insisted on going to the theater, we would have caught the train.",
	["要不是我弟弟暂时征用了我的私家马车，谁愿意来坐公共火车呢？"] = "If my brother hadn't temporarily commandeered my private carriage, who would want to take a public train?",
	["要不是托您的运我都没命了，您别客气！"] = "If it weren't for your luck, I wouldn't have survived. Don't be so polite!",
	["要不是有那宝贝，没人能从终结者的最后一击站起来。"] = "If it weren't for that treasure, no one could have stood up after the Terminator's final strike.",
	["要不然算了，我们厂罢工这么多次，也没见哪次真的有效果。"] = "Or maybe forget it, our factory has gone on strike so many times, and I've never seen it have any real effect.",
	["要不算了"] = "Maybe forget it",
	["要不要去占卜呢……想去，又感觉有点儿怕。"] = "Should I go for a divination... I want to, but I feel a bit scared.",
	["要不要尝尝我们的丝瓜汤，可以去火气。"] = "Do you want to try our loofah soup? It can reduce internal heat.",
	["要不要看看我的货物？或者听听故事？"] = "Do you want to see my goods? Or listen to a story?",
	["要不要继续深入调查？"] = "Should we continue to investigate deeper?",
	["要不要试着给他一次机会？"] = "Would you like to try giving him a chance?",
	["要不要请假休息一阵子?"] = "Would you like to take some time off to rest?",
	["要不要邀请呢……"] = "Should I invite her...",
	["要不试试加点增香剂？不行不行，那会让我的客人们上瘾的……"] = "How about adding some flavor enhancer? No, no, that would make my customers addicted...",
	["要不还是先尝尝……就尝一口……"] = "Maybe I should just taste it... just one bite...",
	["要不还是别买了……"] = "Maybe we shouldn't buy them after all...",
	["要不还是算了？"] = "How about forgetting it?",
	["要不送一个小礼物吧，向莎莉丝特小姐表示歉意？算了，算了……"] = "Should I give a small gift to apologize to Miss Celeste? Forget it, forget it...",
	["要么我们自行承担廷根高昂的房租，要么我们把校委那帮卷毛狒狒从高级宿舍赶出去！"] = "Either we bear the high rent in Tingen ourselves, or we kick those curly-haired baboons from the school committee out of the high-end dorms!",
	["要么生而为王，要么卑躬屈膝。"] = "Either be born a king or bow your head in submission.",
	["要买帽子吗？格尔曼同款哦！"] = "Want to buy a hat? It's the same style as Gehrman's!",
	["要买把伞吗？"] = "Do you want to buy an umbrella?",
	["要买报纸找那只鸽子去。"] = "If you want to buy a newspaper, go find that pigeon.",
	["要买束花吗？"] = "Would you like to buy a bouquet of flowers?",
	["要买点什么吗，都是廷根当地的猪肉和蔬菜。"] = "Do you want to buy something? It's all local pork and vegetables from Tingen.",
	["要买点什么吗？都是廷根当地的猪肉和蔬菜。"] = "Do you want to buy anything? It's all local Tingen pork and vegetables.",
	["要买点肉吗，新鲜的猪肉，本地的卷耳朵短毛猪。"] = "Want to buy some meat? Fresh pork, local short-haired pig with curled ears.",
	["要买点蔬菜吗？长期购买，我可以送货上门。"] = "Do you want to buy some vegetables? If you buy regularly, I can deliver them to your door.",
	["要买药和我说，问诊需要排队，看望病人病房在对面。"] = "If you want to buy medicine, tell me. Consultations require queuing, and the ward for visiting patients is on the opposite side.",
	["要买鱼吗？"] = "Do you want to buy fish?",
	["要使用游戏内的语音聊天、语音转文字功能，请在系统设置中开启设备录音权限"] = "To use the in-game voice chat and voice-to-text functions, please enable device recording permissions in system settings.",
	["要修改的技能ID列表，bAllSkills为FALSE时才生效"] = "The list of skill IDs to be modified; only effective when bAllSkills is FALSE.",
	["要修改的技能列表，bAllSkills为FALSE时才生效"] = "List of skills to modify; only effective when bAllSkills is FALSE.",
	["要修改的技能标签列表，bAllSkills为FALSE时才生效"] = "List of skill tags to modify; only effective when bAllSkills is FALSE.",
	["要修改的技能类型列表，bAllSkills为FALSE时才生效"] = "List of skill types to modify; only effective when bAllSkills is FALSE.",
	["要先去哪里呢……你有没有什么特别想念的事情？"] = "Where should we go first... Is there anything you particularly miss?",
	["要再来一杯咖啡吗，熊先生？"] = "Would you like another cup of coffee, Mr. Bear?",
	["要出发去哪里呢，{{先生|女士}}？"] = "Where are we heading, Mr. {{ Ms. |}}?",
	["要删小猫"] = "Need to delete kitten",
	["要加入白名单的技能ID列表"] = "List of skill IDs to be added to the whitelist.",
	["要占卜什么"] = "What do you want to divine?",
	["要占卜吗1"] = "Do you want to divine 1",
	["要占卜吗2"] = "Would you like to divine 2?",
	["要占卜吗？"] = "Want a divination?",
	["要占卜吗？与众不同的人，异者中的异类。"] = "Want a divination? For those who are different, an outlier among outliers.",
	["要占卜吗？我塔罗占卜很准的。"] = "Want a divination? My Tarot divination is very accurate.",
	["要占卜吗？被命运指引而来的迷途者。"] = "Do you want a divination? Lost soul guided here by fate.",
	["要去<P_Yellow>更高</>的地方……<P_Yellow>更高</>的地方……"] = "Must go to a <P_Yellow> higher </> place... a <P_Yellow> higher </> place...",
	["要去深入调查吗？"] = "Should we go in for a deep investigation?",
	["要去趟拉斐尔墓园，要带什么花呢？"] = "I'm going to Raphael Cemetery, what flowers should I bring?",
	["要取消吗？多好的机会，这太可惜了！"] = "You want to cancel? What a great opportunity, that's such a pity!",
	["要听的话，一次3便士，我要赚赎身钱。"] = "If you want to hear it, it's 3 pennies a time, I need to earn my ransom money.",
	["要命镜头"] = "Fatal Shot",
	["要和其他非凡者切磋一下吗？"] = "Do you want to spar with other Beyonders?",
	["要喝咖啡吗？推荐您来一杯南大陆帕斯河谷的费尔默咖啡。"] = "Would you like some coffee? I recommend a cup of Fermer coffee from the Paz Valley in the Southern Continent.",
	["要处理的事件越来越多了。"] = "There are more and more incidents to handle.",
	["要多看几眼吗？"] = "Do you want to take a few more looks?",
	["要小心知识皇冠……"] = "Be careful of the Crown of Knowledge...",
	["要小心，因为这个镇子上的一切都在重复。"] = "Be careful, because everything in this town is repeating.",
	["要尝尝新品蛋糕吗？清新好味，全部免费！"] = "Would you like to try the new cake? Fresh and delicious, all free!",
	["要开启名流之殿吗？"] = "Do you want to open the Hall of Fame?",
	["要忍住……"] = "Must endure...",
	["要怪，嗝，就怪马西莫写的那篇文章，带火了海岸线餐厅。以前，嗝，哪需要排这么长的队。"] = "If you want to blame someone, *hic*, blame that article Massimo wrote, it made the Coastline Restaurant popular. Before, *hic*, why would we need to wait in such a long line.",
	["要想真正了解这里，不妨在教堂的钟声、市场的吆喝与酒馆的闲聊之间多走走，故事都藏在人们的日常里。 "] = "If you want to truly understand this place, you might as well walk more between the church bells, the market cries, and the tavern chats. Stories are hidden in people's daily lives.",
	["要我说也是，真有大智慧的人也不在这儿摆摊。"] = "I'd say so too, someone with real great wisdom wouldn't be setting up a stall here.",
	["要我说，他真应该去给公爵和议员治病，却因为善良留在这间小诊所。"] = "If you ask me, he really should be treating dukes and councilors, but he stayed in this small clinic because of his kindness.",
	["要我说，写诗就得重视新方法、看清新形式、理准新要求！"] = "If you ask me, writing poetry requires valuing new methods, seeing new forms clearly, and grasping new requirements!",
	["要我说，有这功夫不如多去女神的教堂里祷告！"] = "If you ask me, instead of wasting time on this, you'd be better off praying in the Goddess's church!",
	["要我说，还不如给这些穷人撒点金镑。"] = "If you ask me, it would be better to scatter some gold pounds to these poor people.",
	["要我说，这家伙真有意思……也不怕自己的菜被人偷走吗？"] = "If you ask me, this guy is really interesting... Isn't he afraid of his vegetables being stolen?",
	["要我说，这纯属胡编，不过是斐谢尔那家伙想独占鱼贩的生意罢了！"] = "If you ask me, this is pure fabrication, just Fesher wanting to monopolize the fishmonger business!",
	["要我送你去上路吗"] = "Do you want me to send you to the top lane?",
	["要我送你去下路吗"] = "Do you want me to send you to the bottom lane?",
	["要我送你去中路吗"] = "Do you want me to send you to the middle lane?",
	["要抓紧晋升了。嗯，跟队长铺垫一次后，就提出特别申请吧。顺便也趁这个机会暗示下扮演法，帮助队长他们降低失控的风险。"] = "I need to hurry up and advance. Well, after laying the groundwork with the Captain, I'll submit a special application. By the way, I'll take this opportunity to hint at the Acting method to help the Captain and the others reduce the risk of losing control.",
	["要放在哪杯咖啡里呢？"] = "Which cup of coffee should I put it in?",
	["要是{{他|她}}愿意加入我们就好了……"] = "If only {{he|she}} were willing to join us...",
	["要是不介意的话，分我一些？也好让我快点离开这个危险的鬼地方。放心，我有好货给你，你肯定不吃亏~"] = "If you don't mind, share some with me? It would help me leave this dangerous ghost place sooner. Don't worry, I have good stuff for you; you definitely won't lose out~",
	["要是不满意的话，那边也有新鲜的花卖！"] = "If you're not satisfied, there are fresh flowers for sale over there too!",
	["要是伦纳德能经常来就好了，我听小罗珊说过他的牌技相当不错。"] = "If only Leonard could come by more often. I heard from little Rozanne that his card skills are quite good.",
	["要是你愿意买上一磅肉，我就告诉你，只要前往艺术学派就能学到这么棒的舞蹈啦。"] = "If you are willing to buy a pound of meat, I will tell you that you can learn such a great dance just by going to the Art School.",
	["要是在冥界真的遇到老师，他肯定骂我，呵呵，肯定说我还没活到他的岁数，怎么就能死呢！"] = "If I really met my teacher in the Underworld, he would definitely scold me. Hehe, he would definitely say that I haven't even lived to his age yet, so how could I die!",
	["要是在这条街上烘烤了四十多年面包称得上“一直”的话，那确实是这样。这附近不少小孩吃着我烤的面包长大。"] = "If baking bread on this street for over forty years counts as 'always', then that's indeed the case. Many children around here grew up eating the bread I baked.",
	["要是她也爱抽烟就好了。"] = "If only she loved smoking too.",
	["要是小时候能多读点书，我这辈子能不能少辛苦一点呢？"] = "If I had read more books when I was a child, could I have had a less difficult life?",
	["要是当时我陪着小艾琳去买冰淇淋就好了……都怪我！"] = "If only I had accompanied little Irene to buy ice cream back then... it's all my fault!",
	["要是我一直串开学时去吃饭会遇见一个身高154长相甜美性格乖巧带有一点傲娇属性高马尾声音软萌不善于社交的傻白甜卡哇伊灵森的话"] = "If I were to meet a 154cm tall, sweet-looking, well-behaved, slightly tsundere, high-ponytail, soft-voiced, socially awkward, cute, airheaded Linsen when I go to eat at the start of the semester...",
	["要是我们也能用上就好了，省得天天累得像头驴。"] = "If only we could use that too, we wouldn't have to work like donkeys every day.",
	["要是我总宰人，那在这里还能接到客人吗？我不仅要价公道，而且还会帮客人把东西搬到家里。"] = "If I were always ripping people off, would I still be able to get customers here? Not only are my prices fair, but I also help customers carry their things home.",
	["要是我的灵感高一些，就能用<P_Yellow>窥秘之眼</>看到残留的魔法痕迹了。"] = "If my Inspiration were higher, I could use <P_Yellow>Eyes of Mystery Prying</> to see the residual magical traces.",
	["要是我的香水也能这么清新就好了。"] = "If only my perfume could be this fresh too.",
	["要是我能有一只能变画为真的笔就好了！"] = "If only I had a pen that could turn drawings into reality!",
	["要是找不到，我也不想活了……"] = "If I can't find them, I don't want to live anymore...",
	["要是把比利急哭了，他下次就不跟我玩了……"] = "If Billy gets anxious and cries, he won't play with me next time...",
	["要是有一所专门学习神秘学，学生和老师都是超能力者的大学就好了，我现在就提交转学报告。"] = "If only there were a university dedicated to the study of mysticism where both students and teachers were Beyonders, I would submit my transfer application right now.",
	["要是有人能治治他就好了。"] = "If only someone could deal with him.",
	["要是真炸了，你说工厂主会给我们的寡妇多少抚恤金？够不够买块像样的墓碑？"] = "If it really exploded, how much pension do you think the factory owner would give our widows? Would it be enough to buy a decent tombstone?",
	["要是穿这些衣服去贝克兰德参加俱乐部晚会，我的脸就都丢尽了！更别提陪会长一起出席“贝克兰德社交季”！"] = "If I wore these clothes to the club party in Backlund, I would lose all my face! Not to mention attending the 'Backlund Social Season' with the president!",
	["要是能住进对面那些大房子里去就好了。"] = "If only I could live in those big houses across the street.",
	["要是能尝尝他的酒就好了。哦不，我是说，我的南瓜比他的酒好多了，如果他想要的话，我当然可以慷慨地和他交换！"] = "If only I could taste his wine. Oh no, I mean, my pumpkins are much better than his wine. If he wants them, I can certainly generously exchange with him!",
	["要是能摸摸那软软的皮座位，我保证这周都不要糖果了！ "] = "If I could touch those soft leather seats, I promise I won't ask for candy for a whole week!",
	["要是被我发现了什么宝贝，那我可就发财了！"] = "If I discover some treasure, I'll be rich!",
	["要是还找不到的话，或许可以问问这里的掘墓人。"] = "If you still can't find it, perhaps you could ask the gravedigger here.",
	["要是那天晚上被抓住的是我，现在在店里风光的就该是我了，而他就是那个在门外转悠的疯子。"] = "If I had been the one caught that night, I would be the one enjoying the glory in the shop now, and he would be the madman wandering outside the door.",
	["要月亮……还是六便士……"] = "Want the moon... or sixpence...",
	["要有一身漂亮的肌肉，才能把衣服穿得挺拔呢。"] = "You need a nice set of muscles to wear clothes with poise.",
	["要来一份报纸吗？"] = "Would you like a newspaper?",
	["要来一局吗？选择一只狗，如果他能更快的抓够10只老鼠，你将获得不错的奖励。"] = "Want to play a round? Choose a dog. If it can catch 10 mice faster, you will receive a nice reward.",
	["要来一把吗？最低500便士。"] = "Want to play a round? Minimum 500 pence.",
	["要来一束鲜花吗？"] = "Would you like a bouquet of fresh flowers?",
	["要来一次塔罗牌吗，我指尖的卡牌能替你卜算未知的命运。"] = "Would you like a Tarot reading? The cards at my fingertips can divine your unknown fate.",
	["要来一盘海鲜饭吗？"] = "Would you like a plate of seafood rice?",
	["要来一碗炖汤吗，铁十字街这里就属我家的炖汤最好喝了！"] = "Would you like a bowl of stew? My stew is the best on Iron Cross Street!",
	["要来体验一场紧张刺激的“百里挑蛋”吗？"] = "Would you like to experience a tense and exciting 'One in a Hundred Eggs' challenge?",
	["要来占卜一下你最近的运势吗？"] = "Would you like to have your recent fortune divined?",
	["要来咯"] = "It's coming.",
	["要来条塔索克鱼吗？今早刚从霍伊河上游打捞运过来，肉质鲜嫩又少刺，仅需7便士，您的不二选择！"] = "Want some Tussock fish? It was just caught and shipped from the upper Hoy River this morning. The meat is tender and has few bones. It only costs 7 pence—your best choice!",
	["要来点什么吗？"] = "Would you like to have something?",
	["要来点迷迭香、罗勒、孜然这些香料吗？要知道它们才是美食的灵魂所在。"] = "Would you like some rosemary, basil, or cumin? You know, they are the soul of delicious food.",
	["要来点面包吗，早上才烤好的！"] = "Would you like some Bread, it was just baked this morning!",
	["要求分数"] = "Required Score",
	["要求只有一条，不要太过好奇。"] = "There is only one requirement: don't be too curious.",
	["要求报刊推荐"] = "Request a newspaper recommendation",
	["要求：所有部位强化至%s阶\n当前进度：%s / %s件\n套装效果：\n%s"] = "Requirement: All parts strengthened to %s rank \n Current progress: %s / %s pieces \n Set effect: \n %s",
	["要注意的"] = "Things to pay attention to",
	["要洗衣服么？每周三上午我有空。"] = "Do you need laundry done? I'm free on Wednesday mornings.",
	["要理顺这些知识洪流，做出正确的选择，才能继续追踪下去。"] = "You must straighten out this torrent of knowledge and make the right choice to continue the pursuit.",
	["要的就是这种屈辱的感觉，特别是在这个贵族横行霸道的社会，因蒂斯人民一定会产生共鸣的。"] = "That is exactly the feeling of humiliation I want, especially in this society where nobles run rampant; the people of Intis will surely resonate with it.",
	["要看工匠什么时候修好。"] = "It depends on when the craftsman finishes the repairs.",
	["要看邮差什么时候送来。"] = "It depends on when the postman delivers it.",
	["要真有钱，一开始我们就不至于到这个破地方摆摊！"] = "If we really had money, we wouldn't have ended up setting up a stall in this dump in the first place!",
	["要知道……墓园里的闹鬼和活尸传闻并不罕见。"] = "You know... rumors of hauntings and living corpses in the cemetery are not uncommon.",
	["要知道，你们的贫穷，都是因为你们愚钝的脑袋与懒惰的身体。"] = "You must understand that your poverty is entirely due to your dull minds and lazy bodies.",
	["要知道，在正式的社交场合里，你的衣服、礼帽甚至皮带的价格，都有可能影响到你在别人眼中的价值。"] = "You know, in formal social occasions, the price of your clothes, top hat, and even belt can affect your value in others' eyes.",
	["要知道，所有出事锅炉都在年初通过了质检公司的“优质级”检验。"] = "You know, all the boilers that had accidents passed the quality inspection company's \"Premium Grade\" inspection at the beginning of the year.",
	["要知道，那小子现在可是红手套，还是高级执事。"] = "You know, that kid is a Red Glove now, and a high-ranking deacon at that.",
	["要离开了吗？"] = "Are you leaving already?",
	["要租公寓吗，不管你信不信，我还是要说，我这可是廷根租房性价比最高的地方。"] = "Want to rent an apartment? Believe it or not, I have to say, this is the most cost-effective place to rent in Tingen.",
	["要租房吗？"] = "Looking to rent a place?",
	["要结婚了？恭喜你。"] = "Getting married? Congratulations.",
	["要给它们再浇点水。"] = "I need to water them again.",
	["要给我摘一朵最漂亮最柔软的睡莲，真是个笨蛋！"] = "He wants to pick the most beautiful and softest water lily for me. What a fool!",
	["要花钱的，算了。"] = "It costs money. Forget it.",
	["要记得保护头发，可别像邓恩那样。"] = "Remember to protect your hair, don't end up like Dunn.",
	["要说幸会吗……"] = "Should I say it's a pleasure to meet you...",
	["要说真有病……呵，哪轮到他们。"] = "If we're talking about being truly sick... heh, it's not their turn.",
	["要跑？是想“开门”，还是“传送”？"] = "Want to run? Are you planning to \"Open Door\" or \"Teleport\"?",
	["要跳过这段对话吗？"] = "Skip this dialogue?",
	["要转一圈吗，{{先生|女士}}？"] = "Would you like to take a tour, {{Mr.|Ms.}}?",
	["要重置符号吗？"] = "Do you want to reset the symbols?",
	["要！全部包起来！多少钱？"] = "Yes! Wrap it all up! How much?",
	["覆灭了，覆灭。"] = "Destroyed, destroyed.",
	["覆盖"] = "Overwrite",
	["覆盖Pitch"] = "Override Pitch",
	["覆盖Yaw"] = "Override Yaw",
	["覆盖基础武器"] = "Override base weapon",
	["覆盖方案"] = "Override Scheme",
	["覆盖模板"] = "Overwrite Template",
	["覆盖记录"] = "Overwrite Record",
	["覆盖重力"] = "Override gravity",
	["覆裙裙片"] = "Over-skirt Panel",
	["见不到伯爵我不难过，我不——呜呜呜。"] = "I'm not sad that I can't see the Count, I'm not—boo-hoo.",
	["见习"] = "Aprendiz",
	["见伦纳德"] = "See Leonard",
	["见你触及真相，塔罗牌喜出望外——刹那间整个空间变化，你看到了黛丝的故事……"] = "Seeing that you have touched upon the truth, the Tarot card is overjoyed—in an instant, the entire space changes, and you see Daisy's story...",
	["见到他之前，您还得自己行动一段时间，带着伤会不方便的。如果先治好，之后就不会有妨碍了。"] = "Before you see him, you will have to act on your own for a while; it will be inconvenient with your injuries. If you get them treated first, there won't be any obstacles later.",
	["见到你很高兴！"] = "I'm glad to see you!",
	["见到你很高兴，来看看俱乐部商店中的商品吧！"] = "Nice to see you, come and check out the items in the club shop!",
	["见到戴莉"] = "Meet Daly",
	["见到老朋友一定会很开心吧……"] = "It must be very happy to see an old friend...",
	["见到茶会的主人，也许就能直接问出欧洛斯的下落？"] = "If I meet the host of the tea party, perhaps I can ask directly about Oros's whereabouts?",
	["见奥黛丽推镜头"] = "Camera push when seeing Audrey",
	["见字如面。数月未联系，一切安好？\n我把《伯爵归来》的首演定在了金梧桐剧院，离你现在的住宅很近。两天后我将带着剧团来廷根演出，我知道你那天没课，不如来看我的首演吧。\n随信附赠两张特等戏票。"] = "I hope this letter finds you well. It's been months since we last spoke; are you doing alright?\nI've scheduled the premiere of \"The Earl's Return\" at the Golden Phoenix Theater, which is very close to where you live now. I'll be bringing the troupe to Tingen for a performance in two days. I know you don't have class that day, so why not come and see my premiere?\nEnclosed are two premium theater tickets.",
	["见证之环"] = "Ring of Witness",
	["见证之环-采集物"] = "Circle of Witness - Collectible",
	["见证之环上镌刻的名字并非恒久不变——每逢周一，历史更替，荣光随新的名字一同浮现。"] = "The names engraved on the Ring of Witness are not constant—every Monday, history changes, and glory emerges along with new names.",
	["见证众神之战"] = "Witness the War of the Gods",
	["见证初始之龙"] = "Witness to the Primordial Dragon",
	["见证巨人的力量，和不熄的荣光！"] = "Witness the power of the giants and their undying glory!",
	["见证愚者大人在乌托邦中上演的奇迹！购买后立刻获得一次额外复活次数。"] = "Witness the miracle performed by Lord Fool in Utopia! Purchase to immediately gain one extra resurrection count.",
	["见证故事的结局"] = "Witness the end of the story",
	["见证求知者的追寻，翻阅最后一页。"] = "Witness the seeker's pursuit and turn to the final page.",
	["见证神降仪式后，获得的赞美奖励。"] = "Praise reward received after witnessing the divine descent ceremony.",
	["见证被遗忘的战争，与无名者的呐喊一同破碎。"] = "Witness the forgotten war, shattering along with the screams of the nameless.",
	["见识下我忠诚的幼兽！"] = "Witness my loyal young beast!",
	["见识见识水晶球里的魔法！"] = "Witness the magic inside the crystal ball!",
	["见鬼……连狗都学会抢劫了！"] = "Damn it... even the dogs have learned to rob people!",
	["见鬼安多"] = "Damn it, Andor",
	["见鬼的弗萨克火炮跟长了眼睛一样追着我们炸，我们这边倒好，火炮一个个炸膛！"] = "Those damn Feysac cannons were chasing us like they had eyes, while ours were exploding one after another!",
	["见鬼的，谁知道……怪讲究的。"] = "Hell if I know... they're quite particular.",
	["见鬼罗珊"] = "Damn it, Rozanne",
	["见鬼能力"] = "Ability to see ghosts",
	["见鬼！"] = "Damn it!",
	["见鬼！到底是哪儿跟哪儿来着？"] = "Damn it! Where is where again?",
	["见鬼，今天手气真臭！"] = "Damn it, my luck is terrible today!",
	["见鬼，你一定要在水里待着吗？"] = "Damn it, do you have to stay in the water?",
	["见鬼，你在胡说什么？他可是在因蒂斯发了好大一笔财，那封信我还随身带着呢！"] = "Damn it, what are you talking about? He made a fortune in Intis, and I still have that letter with me!",
	["见鬼，连一张面具都能说话了——"] = "Hell, even a mask can talk now—",
	["观众"] = "Espectador",
	["观众-Trigger"] = "Spectator-Trigger",
	["观众-女"] = "Spectator - Female",
	["观众-学院玩法"] = "Spectator - Academy Gameplay",
	["观众-巨龙吐息"] = "Spectator - Dragon Breath",
	["观众-心灵壁垒治疗"] = "Spectator-Mental Barrier Healing",
	["观众-心灵壁垒治疗2nd往后"] = "Spectator-Mental Barrier Healing 2nd onwards",
	["观众-心理暗示溢出治疗"] = "Spectator-Psychological Suggestion Overheal",
	["观众-扮演"] = "Spectator - Acting",
	["观众-扮演技能-心灵慰藉"] = "Spectator - Acting Skill - Mental Comfort",
	["观众-扮演技能-情绪光谱"] = "Spectator - Acting Skill - Emotional Spectrum",
	["观众-扮演技能-聆听心声"] = "Spectator - Acting Skill - Listen to Heart's Voice",
	["观众-新人警察"] = "Spectator - Rookie Police Officer",
	["观众-梦境分析"] = "Spectator - Dream Analysis",
	["观众-梦境编织肉鸽"] = "Spectator - Dream Weaving Roguelike",
	["观众-狂乱音效子弹"] = "Spectator - Frenzy Sound Effect Bullet",
	["观众-男"] = "Spectator - Male",
	["观众-空气墙"] = "Spectator - Invisible wall",
	["观众-精神瘟疫"] = "Spectator - Mental Plague",
