	["观察<Highlight>小丑做出的表情</>，然后在结合自身头顶<Highlight>卡牌花色</>，快速站到对应区域。"] = "Observe the <Highlight>expression made by the Clown</>, then combine it with the <Highlight>card suit</> above your head to quickly stand in the corresponding area.",
