	["触发技能CD时，减去触发来源的剩余时长乘以该系数后得到的时长。触发来源：通过Buff触发时，获取Buff的剩余时长，通过技能技能触发时，获取技能的剩余时长"] = "When triggering a skill CD, subtract the remaining duration of the trigger source multiplied by this coefficient to get the duration. Trigger source: When triggered via Buff, get the remaining duration of the Buff; when triggered via skill, get the remaining duration of the skill.",
