	["警示<Reminder_Red>强力玩法</>测试测试测试"] = "Warning <Reminder_Red> High-Difficulty Activity </> test test test.",
	["警示牌"] = "Warning sign",
	["警署会关注这里，你最好祈祷你的故事能说服他们。"] = "The police station will keep an eye on this place; you'd better pray that your story can convince them.",
	["警署接到过您的报案，我是调查案件的警官{{PlayerName}}。"] = "The police station received your report. I am the police officer {{PlayerName}} investigating the case.",
	["警署最近在对这起案件进行调查，我们可以先去询问情况。"] = "The police station has been investigating this case recently. We can go and ask about the situation first.",
