	["语馨"] = "Yuxin",
	["误会了。我们不过是找了个僻静地方，闹着玩罢了。"] = "It's a misunderstanding. We just found a quiet place to play around.",
	["误会，其实我是阿霍瓦郡警察厅的警员，有人说这边出现了连环凶案的杀手，我来抓捕。"] = "It's a misunderstanding. Actually, I am an officer from the Ahoava County Police Department. Someone said a serial killer appeared here, and I've come to make an arrest.",
	["误加入至尊小萝卜，破坏进度-1！"] = "Mistakenly added Supreme Little Radish, destruction progress -1!",
	["误导用华丽宝箱"] = "Misleading Ornate Chest",
	["诱人的草丛"] = "Alluring Bush",
	["诱使铁血军团士兵互相撞击！"] = "Lure the Iron and Blood Legion soldiers into colliding with each other!",
	["诱导"] = "Induction",
	["诱导攻击"] = "Inductive Attack",
	["诱导攻击分身"] = "Inductive Attack Clone",
	["诱导攻击分身1"] = "Induction Attack Clone 1",
	["诱导攻击分身辨识buff"] = "Inductive Attack clone identification buff",
	["诱导攻击命中层数"] = "Inductive Attack Hit Stacks",
	["诱导攻击空间裂隙"] = "Inductive Attack Spatial Rift",
	["诱导攻击空间裂隙1"] = "Inductive Attack Spatial Rift 1",
	["诱导攻击空间裂隙2"] = "Inductive Attack Spatial Rift 2",
	["诱导攻击空间裂隙3"] = "Inductive Attack Spatial Rift 3",
	["诱导攻击空间裂隙4"] = "Inductive Attack Spatial Rift 4",
	["诱导攻击辨识分身1"] = "Inductive Attack Identify Clone 1",
	["诱导攻击辨识分身2"] = "Inductive Attack identify clone 2",
	["诱导攻击辨识分身3"] = "Inductive Attack Identification Clone 3",
	["诱惑开场"] = "Temptation Opener",
	["诱惑水晶"] = "Seduction Crystal",
	["诱惑着许下愿望的神灯，以扭曲形式实现的心愿。贪婪的人总是数到三，于是无处可逃。和狡诈者做交易的方法，只有比它更为狡诈。"] = "The lamp that tempts you to make a wish, granting desires in a distorted form. Greedy people always count to three, and thus have nowhere to escape. The only way to trade with the cunning is to be more cunning than it.",
	["说"] = "Tell",
	["说不定他们在努力寻找公主的下落。"] = "Perhaps they are working hard to find where the princess is.",
	["说不定喝下安魂师的魔药，你当场就能完成消化了。"] = "Perhaps if you drink the potion of a Spirit Medium, you could complete the digestion on the spot.",
	["说不定喝下魔药，你当场就能完成消化了。"] = "Maybe once you drink the potion, you'll be able to complete the digestion on the spot.",
	["说不定是罗布泊……"] = "Maybe it's Lop Nur...",
	["说不定真的可以呢？"] = "Maybe it's actually possible?",
	["说了几次不许去了！"] = "How many times have I told you not to go!",
	["说了多少次怎么就是赶不走。"] = "I've told you how many times, why won't you just leave?",
	["说些什么呢？"] = "What should I say?",
	["说什么呢臭老头！"] = "What are you talking about, you old geezer!",
	["说什么呢？不要不学好，偷东西不是什么好事情！"] = "What are you saying? Don't learn bad habits; stealing is not a good thing!",
	["说什么来着，这孩子心里装着全镇人的健康呢……这事儿急不得。"] = "What did I say, this child has the health of the whole town in his heart... This matter can't be rushed.",
	["说出想法"] = "Speak your thoughts",
	["说出斯维因告诉你的口令"] = "Say the password Swain gave you",
	["说出祂的名字：黑夜女神"] = "Speak Her name: Evernight Goddess",
	["说到圣赛缪尔，就不得不提第四纪特伦索斯特帝国时期，当时他作为黑夜女神教会在贝克兰德的大主教，对女神信仰的传播做出了卓越贡献，生前就进入神国，成为了天使……"] = "Speaking of Saint Samuel, one must mention the Fourth Epoch during the Trunsoest Empire. As the archbishop of the Evernight Goddess Church in Backlund at the time, he made outstanding contributions to the spread of the Goddess's faith, entered the divine kingdom while still alive, and became an angel...",
	["说到天使，据传最早的文献记载可以追溯到……"] = "Speaking of angels, it is said that the earliest historical records can be traced back to...",
	["说到小情人，昨天山姆和梅兰妮吵到大半夜，他干脆挑明了，过去几个月幽会的不是别人……"] = "Speaking of the little mistress, Sam and Melanie argued until late last night. He finally came clean that the person he'd been meeting for the past few months was none other than...",
	["说到底他也只是个肆意杀人的罪犯而已。要我看，安提科夫人被他带走可不是什么好事，说不定一年之后凯娜小姐就会多出一个妹妹。"] = "At the end of the day, he's just a criminal who kills at will. If you ask me, it's not a good thing that Lady Antigonus was taken away by him. Who knows, maybe a year from now, Miss Kena will have a little sister.",
	["说到底，罗塞尔大帝发起爱国卫生运动是几百年前的事，现在的鲁恩，下水道系统足够完备，何必继续浪费财力？"] = "After all, Emperor Roselle launching the Patriotic Health Campaign was hundreds of years ago. In the current Loen, the sewer system is complete enough, so why continue to waste financial resources?",
	["说到底，这个精灵其实就是给主角开挂的“<P_Yellow>系统</>”。只要有了“<P_Yellow>系统</>”，压根用不着什么复杂的写作技巧，就能写出源源不断的爽点。"] = "In the end, this elf is actually the \"<P_Yellow> System </>\" for the protagonist to cheat. As long as you have the \"<P_Yellow> System </>\", you don't need any complex writing techniques at all to write a constant stream of cool points.",
	["说到底，这个精灵其实就是给主角开挂的“系统”。只要有了“系统”，压根用不着什么复杂的写作技巧，就能写出源源不断的爽点。"] = "When it comes down to it, this fairy is just a \"system\" that gives the protagonist cheats. As long as you have a \"system,\" you don't need any complex writing techniques to churn out endless moments of gratification.",
	["说到赫密斯文——"] = "Speaking of Hermes—",
	["说到这个……上周《廷根市老实人报》确实报道过一个“醉酒之后就会变老实”的专栏作家酒后说的话，他说质检员的账户每月固定收到好几笔“技术咨询费”……"] = "Speaking of which... last week, the \"Tingen Honest Man\" did report what a columnist who \"becomes honest after getting drunk\" said after drinking. He said that the quality inspector's account receives several \"technical consultation fees\" every month...",
	["说到这里，希望你想起来的时候替我提醒戴里克两句，叫他合理安排饮食和睡眠。"] = "Speaking of which, I hope you can remind Derrick for me when you think of it, and tell him to arrange his diet and sleep reasonably.",
	["说到追溯，我记得在赫密斯文中……"] = "Speaking of tracing back, I remember in Hermes...",
	["说吧。"] = "Go on.",
	["说唱可是学派“旧日复兴乐团”里最火的艺术形式之一！"] = "Rap is one of the hottest art forms in the 'Great Old One Revival Orchestra' school!",
	["说唱地毯"] = "Rap Carpet",
	["说唱导师"] = "Rap Mentor",
	["说唱歌手？也许只是生活给我安排的韵脚太过密集。"] = "A rapper? Maybe life just arranged the rhymes too densely for me.",
	["说唱舞台灯"] = "Rap Stage Light",
	["说回你的生意吧"] = "Back to your business",
	["说回正题，需要我帮你去做些什么呢？关于你的执念，队长还有什么线索吗？"] = "Back to the main point, what do you need me to do for you? Regarding your obsession, does the Captain have any other clues?",
	["说好的五盆一样的花，怎么会有一盆<P_Yellow> 没开花的幼苗</> ，这叫我怎么给客人啊。"] = "We agreed on five identical flowers, how come there is one <P_Yellow> unbloomed seedling </>, how am I supposed to give this to the customer.",
	["说完了"] = "Finished speaking",
	["说定了，我回去准备一下，明天湖边见！"] = "It's a deal. I'll go back and prepare, see you at the lakeside tomorrow!",
	["说实在的，比起这个，我更期待成为一名真正的大学生……"] = "Honestly, compared to that, I'm looking forward to becoming a real university student more...",
	["说实话……我甚至不知道它们躲在哪里。"] = "To be honest... I don't even know where they are hiding.",
	["说实话吧"] = "Diga a verdade",
	["说实话吧。"] = "Tell the truth.",
	["说实话，我一开始也很喜欢这个名字。它也切实地帮助过我。"] = "To be honest, I liked this name at first too. It has indeed helped me.",
	["说实话，我不相信你。"] = "To be honest, I don't believe you.",
	["说实话，我也有点搞不清状况。"] = "To be honest, I'm a bit confused about the situation myself.",
	["说得不错，这就是扮演。收尸人途径需要和死亡、灵界打交道，你穿得像个普通人，亡者不会信任你。"] = "Well said, this is Acting. The Corpse Collector pathway needs to deal with death and the Spirit World. If you dress like an ordinary person, the dead won't trust you.",
	["说得好……可要从哪里弄这种东西……"] = "Well said... but where can we get such things...",
	["说得好听，刚才逃跑时可不是这样的。"] = "That sounds nice, but that's not how it was when you were running away just now.",
	["说得好，但你怎么能预设我一定用不完呢。"] = "Well said, but how can you assume I definitely won't finish it?",
	["说得对。{{PlayerName}}，如果你是格尔曼·斯帕罗，你会选择哪种场景作为故事的舞台呢？"] = "You're right. {{PlayerName}}, if you were Gehrman Sparrow, which scene would you choose as the stage for your story?",
	["说得对亲爱的，这身非常适合你。"] = "You're right, dear, this outfit suits you perfectly.",
	["说得对，就连霍伊河的河水也会改道，我们总有一天也会混出头的！"] = "Well said, even the water of the Hoy River changes its course. We will make it big one day too!",
	["说得轻巧，你替我去说好了。"] = "That is easy for you to say, why don't you go say it for me?",
	["说明"] = "Instruções",
	["说明一下你们的名字，以及在向谁祈祷？"] = "Explain your names, and who are you praying to?",
	["说明内容说明内容。说明内容说明内容。说明内容说明内容。说明内容说明内容。"] = "Explanation content explanation content. Explanation content explanation content. Explanation content explanation content. Explanation content explanation content.",
	["说明来意"] = "Explain the purpose of the visit",
	["说明自己的决定"] = "Explain Your Decision",
	["说是……为了康斯顿煤钢联合体去勘探地质。"] = "It's said... to explore the geology for the Coniston Coal and Steel Syndicate.",
	["说是为了“提升运输效率”，哈哈哈！"] = "They say it's to 'improve transport efficiency,' hahaha!",
	["说是奖励，其实是锁链。"] = "She calls it a reward, but it's actually a chain.",
	["说是她丈夫做生意败光了钱。"] = "They say her husband lost all their money in business.",
	["说服我"] = "Convince me",
	["说服梅丽莎"] = "Persuade Melissa",
	["说来也巧，我深夜换班走了一半，发现地图和武器忘了带，赶紧原路折返。结果回去拿东西时，正好看见开膛手居然还在原地，正和另一个人在那儿低声交谈呢。"] = "As it happens, I was halfway through my shift change in the middle of the night when I realized I had forgotten my map and weapon, so I hurried back the way I came. When I went back to get my things, I saw that the Ripper was actually still in the same spot, whispering to someone else.",
	["说来听听"] = "Let's hear it",
	["说来话长，我们先去找到阿诺德吧。"] = "It's a long story. Let's go find Arnold first.",
	["说来话长，我刚结束一场300镑的大交易，只想快点离开……结果卡住了！"] = "It's a long story. I just finished a 300-pound deal and just wanted to leave quickly... and then I got stuck!",
	["说来，“愚者”先生也曾是黑荆棘的一员呢。"] = "Speaking of which, Mr. 'Fool' was also once a member of Blackthorn.",
	["说梦话吗……"] = "Talking in sleep, huh...",
	["说点什么"] = "Say something",
	["说的没错。"] = "Well said.",
	["说的这么厉害，这饮料真的有用？"] = "That sounds impressive. Does this drink really work?",
	["说真的利诺，我不知道你为什么一句词都不在调子上！"] = "Seriously, Lino, I don't know why not a single note of yours is in tune!",
	["说真的，我只是不想去接放学的儿子，哈哈。"] = "Honestly, I just don't want to go pick up my son from school, haha.",
	["说真的，我要回去了，这根本不是一位度假的绅士应该爬的山。"] = "Seriously, I'm going back. This is not a mountain a gentleman on vacation should climb.",
	["说真的，教教我，到底怎么做到的？"] = "Seriously, teach me, how did you do it?",
	["说真的，码头区搬运工薪水比我们还高2便士呢！对2！"] = "Seriously, the dock workers get paid 2 pence more than us! 2 pence!",
	["说真的，艾瑞克，我实在无法理解你们这些咖啡爱好者。茶可是鲁恩王国的灵魂。"] = "Seriously, Eric, I really can't understand you coffee lovers. Tea is the soul of the Loen Kingdom.",
	["说着“让我来考考你，霍纳奇斯山脉的古代遗迹由什么组成”……"] = "Saying \"Let me test you, what are the ancient ruins of the Hornacis Mountain Range composed of\"...",
	["说着，克莱恩掏出了一块柠檬布丁。"] = "As he says this, Klein takes out a lemon pudding.",
	["说自己只是路过"] = "Say you're just passing by",
	["说话怪"] = "Talking monster",
	["说话怪2"] = "Talking Monster 2",
	["说话的怪"] = "Talking Monster",
	["说说价格"] = "Talk about the price",
	["说说你今天心情如何，我来为你推荐！"] = "Tell me how you're feeling today, and I'll give you a recommendation!",
	["说说具体情况。"] = "Tell me the specific situation.",
	["说说看，你在瞧什么呢？"] = "Tell me, what are you looking at?",
	["说说看？"] = "Let's hear it?",
	["说谎？"] = "Lying?",
	["说起来你到底为什么要偷吃田里的南瓜啊！"] = "Speaking of which, why on earth did you steal and eat the pumpkin in the field!",
	["说起来在刚才的梦中，我似乎也听到了诡异的声音……"] = "Speaking of which, in the dream just now, I seem to have heard a strange sound too...",
	["说起来实在荒谬，这出戏竟然没有主演，甚至也找不到剧院经理和舞台总监！"] = "It's truly absurd; this play doesn't even have a lead actor, and I can't even find the theater manager or the stage director!",
	["说起来都是你的功劳，多亏你当时的提醒，我才能写出《黑铁时代那些事》和《所罗门皇帝》，也才有了现在的成功。"] = "Speaking of which, it's all your credit. Thanks to your reminder at the time, I was able to write \"Things in the Iron Age\" and \"Emperor Solomon,\" and that's why I have my current success.",
	["说起来，乔恩家的红果也已经堆成一座山了……"] = "Speaking of which, the red fruits at Jon's house have also piled up into a mountain...",
	["说起来，二楼有块儿区域……"] = "Speaking of which, there's an area on the second floor...",
	["说起来，从你入队开始，你们两个就很亲近，而且你提及邓恩的次数多到让我忍不住想……"] = "Come to think of it, from the moment you joined the team, you two were very close, and you mentioned Dunn so often that I couldn't help but want to...",
	["说起来，你哥哥杰克最近怎么样，找到新工作了吗？"] = "Speaking of which, how is your brother Jack doing lately? Has he found a new job?",
	["说起来，你在这里做什么？"] = "Come to think of it, what are you doing here?",
	["说起来，你有没有留意到二楼有一块专门的地方，去那儿练习的人动作都很专业。"] = "Speaking of which, have you noticed that there is a special place on the second floor? The people who go there to practice have very professional movements.",
	["说起来，你都看到了什么？"] = "Speaking of which, what did you see?",
	["说起来，前两天艾尔萨小姐和雅克先生两位设计师在廷根采风的时候，来我们店转了一圈，还说有机会想和我们建立合作呢。他们要做一个新品牌，你听说过吗？"] = "Speaking of which, two days ago, designers Miss Elsa and Mr. Jacques came to our shop while they were in Tingen for inspiration, and they even said they wanted to establish a partnership with us if there was an opportunity. They are going to make a new brand; have you heard of it?",
	["说起来，动物之间的战斗算是格斗吧，如果足够幸运的话，说不定能从中学到一些格斗技巧。"] = "Speaking of which, fights between animals count as combat, right? If you are lucky enough, you might be able to learn some combat techniques from it.",
	["说起来，我刚刚好像听到一个小女孩的声音，说着火柴、火柴什么的，你们听到了吗？"] = "Speaking of which, I think I just heard a little girl's voice, saying something about matches... did you guys hear it?",
	["说起来，我刚刚好像听到一个小孩的声音，说着火柴、火柴什么的，你们听到了吗？"] = "Come to think of it, I just heard a child's voice saying \"match, match\" or something, did you hear it?",
	["说起来，我并不是这个年代的人……加上“不属于这个时代”怎么样？"] = "Come to think of it, I'm not from this era... How about adding 'not belonging to this era'?",
	["说起来，最早我还是廷根舞蹈团的团长，可后来家里人都让我以照顾孩子为重，爱好就等孩子长大了再搞。"] = "Come to think of it, I was the leader of the Tingen Dance Troupe at first, but later my family told me to prioritize taking care of the child and wait until the child grew up to pursue my hobbies.",
	["说起来，温德姆太太一个人真不容易。"] = "Come to think of it, it's really not easy for Mrs. Wyndham all by herself.",
	["说起来，这次能够假扮成我父亲提出财产赠予，也是多亏了这条扭曲领带。你说，这算不算是你的外祖父在保佑着他的女儿呢？"] = "Speaking of which, being able to pose as my father to propose the property gift this time is all thanks to this distorted tie. Would you say this counts as your grandfather watching over his daughter?",
	["说起来，那个引我进来的声音……画里的夫人，应该就藏在这个世界的某处。"] = "Come to think of it, the voice that led me in... the lady in the painting must be hiding somewhere in this world.",
	["说起来，那位猎人先生的东西没派上用处，沿着原路去找找他吧。"] = "Speaking of which, that Mr. Hunter's item didn't come in handy. Let's go back the way we came and look for him.",
	["说起来，黑荆棘安保公司似乎翻新过，但很多物件却是旧的、破损的，有些违和感。"] = "Come to think of it, Blackthorn Security Company seems to have been renovated, but many items are old and damaged, which feels a bit out of place.",
	["说这个没意义，活人都活不好，哪还有能力管死人！"] = "There's no point in saying that. The living can't even live well, how would they have the ability to care for the dead!",
	["说这么玄乎，它真的这么有用？"] = "That sounds so mystical. Is it really that effective?",
	["说那个什么贵族夫人……搞了个舞会？光买花就花了多少？"] = "Saying that some noble lady... threw a ball? How much did she spend just on flowers?",
	["说重点。"] = "Get to the point.",
	["诵念咒文"] = "Encantamento de Canto",
	["诵念咒语"] = "Chant incantation",
	["诵念太阳相关的祈愿短句，牵引一缕凝练却不灼人的神圣光辉，精准落于目标头顶并形成持续悬停的光束。"] = "Recite short prayer phrases related to the Sun, drawing a wisp of condensed yet non-scorching holy radiance that precisely lands on the target's head, forming a continuously hovering beam of light.",
	["诵念太阳相关的祈愿短句，牵引一缕凝练却不灼人的神圣光辉，精准落于目标头顶并形成持续悬停的光束。\n使目标获得武力加3，学识加1。\n对同一个目标连续使用可以使目标头顶的光束变为两束或者三束。"] = "Recite a short prayer related to the Sun, drawing down a strand of condensed yet non-scorching holy light that lands precisely on the target's head, forming a continuously hovering beam. \n Grants the target +3 Might and +1 Knowledge. \n Using this consecutively on the same target can turn the beam above their head into two or three beams.",
	["诵念愚者尊名"] = "Recite the honorific name of The Fool",
	["诵念祈祷"] = "Recite the prayer.",
	["诵念神明的尊名会被注视，邪神的尤为危险。你只需要记得那位帮助你的伟大存在：不属于这个时代的愚者……"] = "Chanting the honorific name of a deity will draw their gaze, and those of evil gods are particularly dangerous. You only need to remember the great being who helped you: The Fool that doesn't belong to this era...",
	["诵经的老人"] = "Old Man Chanting",
	["诶 {{PlayerName}} 你回来啦？"] = "Hey, {{PlayerName}}, you're back?",
	["诶……那是神明要干的事情，疯人院的意义，更多的是避免这些患者给社会造成新的隐患。治疗他们是神明才能完成的事情。"] = "Eh... that is something for the Gods to do. The significance of the asylum is more about preventing these patients from causing new hidden dangers to society. Treating them is something only the Gods can accomplish.",
	["诶呦，又…卡住了……"] = "Ouch, it's... stuck again...",
	["诶！那边在发光！"] = "Hey! Something over there is glowing!",
	["诶，你怎么偷看！都是……客户写的。"] = "Hey, why are you peeking! They are... written by customers.",
	["诶，灵之虫有些变化？"] = "Huh, the Worm of Spirit has changed?",
	["诶，等等……"] = "Eh, wait...",
	["诶，队长……"] = "Eh, Captain...",
	["诶？"] = "Eh?",
	["诶？什么掉下来了！"] = "Eh? What fell down!",
	["诶？怎么变回人类了？"] = "Eh? How did he turn back into a human?",
	["诶？还想找他问下路呢……"] = "Eh? I still wanted to ask him for directions...",
	["诶？这报纸上的日期怎么是三十多年前的？……现在还在看吗？"] = "Eh? Why is the date on this newspaper from over thirty years ago? ...Are you still reading it now?",
	["诶？队长？我不擅长照顾孩子啊……"] = "Eh? Captain? I'm not good at taking care of children...",
	["诶？队长？老尼尔？我真的不擅长照顾孩子啊……"] = "Eh? Captain? Old Neil? I'm really not good at taking care of children...",
	["请<h>店主</>挑选花束"] = "Ask the <h>shopkeeper</> to pick out a bouquet",
	["请<h>店员</>挑选戒指"] = "Ask the <h>clerk</> to pick out a ring",
	["请<h>管家</>为你介绍"] = "Ask the <h>Butler</> to introduce you",
	["请——"] = "Please—",
	["请一定告诉阿兹克先生，午夜，墓地广场。"] = "Please be sure to tell Mr. Azik: midnight, cemetery square.",
	["请下载%s玩法后进行体验"] = "Please download the %s gameplay before experiencing it.",
	["请不要再往前了"] = "Please do not go any further.",
	["请不要吝惜你们手中的鲜花！"] = "Please don't be stingy with the flowers in your hands!",
	["请不要在图书馆吃东西，食物残渣会引来老鼠。\n\n<Delete stylename=\"Note_Normal_HW\" id=\"#158\">老鼠会在图书馆学习知识，考上大学，统治人类！</>"] = "Please do not eat in the library; food scraps will attract mice.\n\n<Delete stylename=\"Note_Normal_HW\" id=\"#158\">Mice will study knowledge in the library, get into university, and rule humanity!</>",
	["请不要小看我，女士"] = "Please don't look down on me, Madam",
	["请不要这么说，阿诺德懂事又聪明，我们早把他当成自己的孩子来抚养。"] = "Please don't say that. Arnold is sensible and smart. We have long treated him as our own child to raise.",
	["请不要随意靠近，容易陷入混乱。"] = "Please do not approach casually; it is easy to fall into chaos.",
	["请不要难过，只要想，总能回去的。"] = "Please don't be sad, as long as you want to, you can always go back.",
	["请为所有成员安排位次"] = "Please arrange positions for all members",
	["请二位跟我来。"] = "Please follow me, both of you.",
	["请从以下协议2选1"] = "Please choose 1 of the following 2 protocols",
	["请他一杯"] = "Buy him a drink",
	["请他占卜"] = "Ask him for divination",
	["请优先下载更高优先级资源"] = "Please prioritize downloading higher-priority resources.",
	["请伸出你的手，让直觉引导你选择那张牌。"] = "Please extend your hand and let your intuition guide you to choose that card.",
	["请你一定要答应我，作为主演登台，拜托你了！演出马上就要开始，我没有别的办法了。"] = "Please, you must agree to go on stage as the lead actor, I beg you! The performance is about to start, and I have no other choice.",
	["请你们相信我，我没有恶意！"] = "Please believe me, I mean no harm!",
	["请你冷静……"] = "Please calm down...",
	["请你驾驶新警车绕行一圈，给我们提供宝贵的意见。小心点，别撞到市民。"] = "Please drive the new police car for a lap and give us your valuable feedback. Be careful, don't hit any citizens.",
	["请你，至少让我们一家人……最后团聚。"] = "Please, at least let our family... reunite one last time.",
	["请便，四处看看。如果姑娘们的表演不合您的口味……那边也有专门陪姐姐们聊天的，嘴甜得很。 "] = "Please, feel free to look around. If the girls' performances aren't to your taste... there are also those over there who specialize in chatting with the ladies; they have very sweet tongues.",
	["请保持当前船速，缓慢靠岸。"] = "Please maintain current speed and approach the shore slowly.",
	["请保持距离——啊，{{PlayerName}}。"] = "Please keep your distance—ah, {{PlayerName}}.",
	["请允许我走进你的生命，让我们的故事从今晚开始书写。莉娜，我爱你，胜过爱这世间的一切美好！"] = "Please allow me to walk into your life and let our story be written starting tonight. Lena, I love you more than everything beautiful in this world!",
	["请先使用<Highlight_L>%s</>道具，接取任务后进行追踪"] = "Please use the <Highlight_L>%s</> item first, accept the quest, and then track it.",
	["请先做出选择"] = "Please make a selection first.",
	["请先切换为非准备状态，再执行该操作。"] = "Please switch to non-ready status before performing this operation.",
	["请先完成引导任务：%s。"] = "Please complete the tutorial quest first: %s.",
	["请先将%s的撤职为会员，再进行任命学徒操作"] = "Please demote %s to member before appointing them as an Apprentice.",
	["请先开启语音权限"] = "Please enable voice permissions first.",
	["请先手动转移会长"] = "Please manually transfer the President first.",
	["请先接受阿罗德斯的惩罚再提问"] = "Please accept Arrodes' punishment before asking questions.",
	["请先添加好友再开启弹幕"] = "Please add friends before enabling barrage",
	["请先添加好友再操作"] = "Please add as a friend before proceeding",
	["请先添加好友再置顶"] = "Please add as a friend before pinning",
	["请先确认或取消修改。"] = "Please confirm or cancel the changes first.",
	["请先移交队长，然后跟随进入"] = "Please hand over the leader role first, then follow to enter.",
	["请先结束当前社交动作，再切换人脉站位"] = "Please end the current social action before switching social positioning.",
	["请先获取%s再进行染色。"] = "Please obtain %s before dyeing.",
	["请先解锁前一级军衔"] = "Please unlock the previous military rank first.",
	["请先解锁前置节点"] = "Please unlock the prerequisite nodes first.",
	["请先解锁扮演系统中的跳舞玩法"] = "Please unlock the dance gameplay in the Acting system first.",
	["请先设置目标"] = "Please set a target first.",
	["请先输入俱乐部名称"] = "Please enter the Club name first",
	["请先进入多人坐骑，再邀请人脉角色同乘。"] = "Please enter the multi-person mount first, then invite the connection character to ride along.",
	["请先选中1个暂存方案"] = "Please select a saved slot first",
	["请先选中1个暂存记录"] = "Please select 1 temporary record first",
	["请先选中一名玩家"] = "Please select a player first.",
	["请先选中装备上想要置换的词条"] = "Please select the affix on the equipment you wish to replace first.",
	["请先选中需要删除的分组"] = "Please select the group you need to delete first.",
	["请先选择一个举报原因"] = "Please select a report reason first.",
	["请先选择一个俱乐部"] = "Please select a club first.",
	["请先选择一个感兴趣的教团"] = "Please select a church you are interested in first.",
	["请先选择一个求助道具"] = "Please select a help item first.",
	["请先选择一个福音尖碑"] = "Please select a Gospel Stele first.",
	["请先选择合适的共乘目标"] = "Please select a suitable ride-sharing target first.",
	["请先选择圣膏和被涂抹的词条"] = "Please select the holy ointment and the entry to be anointed first.",
	["请先选择目标团队后进行战术标点"] = "Please select a target team before placing tactical marks",
	["请先选择要任命的对象"] = "Please select the target for the appointment first.",
	["请关注《廷根市老实人报》《廷根晨报》《阿霍瓦晚报》《廷根日报》。"] = "Please pay attention to the 'Tingen Honest Man,' 'Tingen Morning Post,' 'Awwa Evening News,' and 'Tingen Daily.'",
	["请再次输入新密码"] = "Please enter the new password again",
	["请别介意，但我想，专家应该也精通些安抚证人的方法。"] = "Please don't mind, but I think an expert should also be proficient in some methods of pacifying witnesses.",
	["请别继续说下去了，我马上就要和卡迪订婚了。"] = "Please don't continue; I'm about to get engaged to Kadi.",
	["请到前面来，伸出手。"] = "Please come to the front and hold out your hand.",
	["请前往参与猎城战"] = "Please go and participate in the Hunting City Battle",
	["请前往大世界再使用同行功能"] = "Please head to the open world before using the accompany feature.",
	["请前辈保佑我考试通过……"] = "Please, senior, bless me to pass the exam...",
	["请努力听我的声音。"] = "Please try hard to listen to my voice.",
	["请勿迷失在灵界的迷幻色彩中。"] = "Do not get lost in the psychedelic colors of the Spirit World.",
	["请勿重复打开阿罗德斯对话窗口"] = "Do not open Arrodes' dialog window repeatedly.",
	["请勿重复操作"] = "Please do not repeat the operation.",
	["请勿频繁分享，请稍后再试"] = "Please do not share too frequently; please try again later.",
	["请勿频繁发送"] = "Please do not send frequently.",
	["请勿频繁操作"] = "Please do not operate frequently.",
	["请原谅我"] = "Please forgive me.",
	["请原谅我无法声张，但你一定能听出来，是我！"] = "Please forgive me for not being able to speak up, but you must be able to tell, it's me!",
	["请原谅我现在不能站起来迎接你。"] = "Please forgive me for not being able to stand up to greet you.",
	["请原谅我的激动，但见证天才本就是一件令人激动的事情。请为他加油吧！"] = "Please forgive my excitement, but witnessing genius is always an exciting thing. Please cheer for him!",
	["请原谅我的笑声，我只是没想到从廷根来的大教授也会有被试题折磨的那一日。"] = "Forgive my laughter, I just didn't expect that a great professor from Tingen would also have a day where he's tormented by test questions.",
	["请原谅我这愚蠢的主意。"] = "Please forgive me for this foolish idea.",
	["请原谅，我儿子正是调皮的年纪，我会像修理他父亲一样好好修理他的。"] = "Please forgive me; my son is at a mischievous age, and I will discipline him just as I would repair his father.",
	["请原谅，自从搬到廷根，我就遇到了太多这样的事情。"] = "Please forgive me, ever since I moved to Tingen, I've encountered too many things like this.",
	["请及时设置俱乐部英雄"] = "Please set your Club Hero in time",
	["请友好一些"] = "Please be friendly.",
	["请取消勾选非卖品后再点击套用"] = "Please uncheck non-sale items before clicking apply.",
	["请各位认真看看这篇公告！\n我们的老约翰死了，别管你认不认识，有什么奇怪的东西还在老约翰身上！\n我不知道怎么去描述，但是老约翰还会在半夜走动，在没有心跳和呼吸的情况下。\n我们不知道应该找谁，医生还是牧师。\n任何知道或有相关消息的人请来铁十字街东南角，位于中街和金梧桐大道之间。\n如果能让老约翰安睡，将会得到一笔丰厚报酬。"] = "Please read this announcement carefully! \n Our Old John is dead. Regardless of whether you know him or not, there is something strange still on Old John! \n I don't know how to describe it, but Old John still walks in the middle of the night, without a heartbeat or breathing. \n We don't know who to look for, a doctor or a priest. \n Anyone who knows or has relevant information, please come to the southeast corner of Iron Cross Street, located between Middle Street and Golden Indus Avenue. \n If you can let Old John rest in peace, you will receive a generous reward.",
	["请各位贵宾尽快落座，<P_Yellow>《伯爵归来》</>即将开幕！"] = "Please take your seats as soon as possible, <P_Yellow> 'The Count's Return' </> is about to begin!",
	["请各位贵宾尽快落座，《伯爵归来》即将开幕！"] = "Distinguished guests, please take your seats as soon as possible. \"The Count Returns\" is about to begin!",
	["请向永恒烈阳的代言人说出密语。"] = "Please speak the secret phrase to the spokesperson of the Eternal Blazing Sun.",
	["请吩咐。"] = "Please instruct me.",
	["请告诉他，以后不用再通信了。我会乘最近的一班火车离开廷根，谢谢你。"] = "Please tell him there's no need to correspond anymore. I will take the next train out of Tingen. Thank you.",
	["请告诉他，我们应该不会再见面了，以后也不必再通信了。我会乘最近的一班火车离开廷根。"] = "Please tell him we likely won't meet again, and there's no need to correspond in the future. I will take the next train out of Tingen.",
	["请在下方选择喜好的内容（至少2个，后续可更改）"] = "Please select your preferred content below (at least 2, can be changed later)",
	["请在倒计时结束前做出选择"] = "Please make your choice before the countdown ends",
	["请在合适的高度进行建造"] = "Please build at a suitable height.",
	["请在外面稍等。"] = "Please wait outside for a moment.",
	["请在布雷登附近使用【灵视】技能，否则技能将无法开启。"] = "Please use the [Spirit Vision] skill near Brayden, otherwise the skill will not be able to be activated.",
	["请在心中默想你的问题"] = "Please think of your question in your heart",
	["请在祂的注视下回答。"] = "Please answer under His gaze.",
	["请在规定时间内击败怪物，解救被困住的居民！"] = "Please defeat the monsters within the time limit and rescue the trapped residents!",
	["请在设置中开启存储权限"] = "Please enable storage permissions in Settings",
	["请在赛琳娜附近使用【灵视】技能，否则技能将无法开启。"] = "Please use the [Spirit Vision] skill near Selena, otherwise the skill will not activate.",
	["请在限时内做出正确动作"] = "Please perform the correct action within the time limit.",
	["请在限时内做出正确动作。"] = "Please perform the correct action within the time limit.",
	["请在限时内完成愿望任务"] = "Please complete the wish quest within the time limit",
	["请填入升级道具。"] = "Please insert upgrade items.",
	["请大家不要担心，我已经让夫人喝下了药水，她稍后就会醒来。"] = "Please don't worry, everyone. I have already had the lady drink a potion; she will wake up shortly.",
	["请她占卜"] = "Ask her for a divination",
	["请好好地\r\n跟着我"] = "Please follow me\r\nclosely.",
	["请安娜进来"] = "Invite Anna In",
	["请安娜进门"] = "Invite Anna inside",
	["请完成前面关卡解锁"] = "Please complete previous stages to unlock",
	["请家教的宝妈"] = "Mom hiring a tutor",
	["请容我打扰一下，护士小姐。这位老先生似乎是肺部不好，他闻到你身上的香水味就会感到不舒服。"] = "Please allow me to interrupt, Miss Nurse. This old gentleman seems to have poor lungs; he feels uncomfortable when he smells the perfume on you.",
	["请将您的OWO共享脚踏车停在停车点内，否则将收取调度费。"] = "Please park your OWO shared bicycle in the parking point, otherwise a dispatch fee will be charged.",
	["请小心，你只有  次选择机会。"] = "Please be careful, you only have  chances to choose.",
	["请小猫动手"] = "Ask the kitten to do it",
	["请小猫动手。"] = "Ask the kitten to take action.",
	["请尽快击杀分身！"] = "Please kill the clone as soon as possible!",
	["请尽快击败失控怪物！"] = "Please defeat the Out-of-Control monster as soon as possible!",
	["请尽情地\r\n向我展现"] = "Please show me\r\nto your heart's content.",
	["请帮我告诉他，无论发生了什么，只要我们在一起，就可以好好活……我们要好好活。"] = "Please help me tell him that no matter what happens, as long as we are together, we can live well... We must live well.",
	["请庇佑我被霍伊大学的蒸汽与机械系录取！"] = "Please bless me to be admitted to the Department of Steam and Machinery at Hoy University!",
	["请应用一个自定义方案进行复制."] = "Please apply a custom scheme to copy.",
	["请店主再上一份柠檬蛋糕。"] = "Shopkeeper, please bring another lemon cake.",
	["请开启今日的福音券，并领取"] = "Please open today's Gospel Ticket and claim it",
	["请开始你的表演吧，艾登先生。"] = "Please begin your performance, Mr. Aiden.",
	["请开始吧"] = "Please begin",
	["请忍耐一下。"] = "Please bear with it for a moment.",
	["请恕我失礼——我以为这座城堡，不会再有人来了。"] = "Please forgive my rudeness—I thought no one would come to this castle again.",
	["请息怒，先生，你觉得刚才的台词怎么样？"] = "Please calm down, sir. What do you think of the lines just now?",
	["请您先试用一下它的能力，等完全掌握了它的用法再出发。"] = "Please try out its ability first, and don't set off until you have fully mastered how to use it.",
	["请您冷静下来，我只是想帮助您。"] = "Please calm down; I only wish to help you.",
	["请您原谅，我其实不太擅长做饭。"] = "Please forgive me, I'm actually not very good at cooking.",
	["请您原谅，能不能让我再看一下黛西小姐的情况？"] = "Please forgive me, can you let me take another look at Miss Daisy's condition?",
	["请您告诉阿兹克先生，今天<P_Yellow>午夜</>，就是<P_Yellow>庆典</>的日子。"] = "Please tell Mr. Azik that today at <P_Yellow> midnight </> is the day of the <P_Yellow> celebration </>.",
	["请您小心点，不要踩到我给盔甲之神布置的祭坛。"] = "Please be careful, don't step on the altar I set up for the God of Armor.",
	["请您帮我把小熊贝利治好吧，他的手受伤了。"] = "Please help me heal little bear Bailey, his hand is hurt.",
	["请您抓紧时间。"] = "Please hurry.",
	["请您放心品尝。"] = "Please enjoy with peace of mind.",
	["请您放心，我一定做出最完美的果子汤。"] = "Please rest assured, I will definitely make the most perfect fruit soup.",
	["请您放心，我们一会儿就去把杰姆接回来，安置好这两个可怜的孩子。"] = "Please rest assured, we'll go pick up Jem in a little while and get these two poor children settled.",
	["请您给予我启示！我该买去哪个地方的蒸汽列车票？"] = "Please give me a revelation! Which place should I buy a steam train ticket to?",
	["请成员组队前往塔罗学派会议室的佐伊处，开启家族创建仪式，至少需要2人才可开启仪式。<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Locate\" u=\"groupRecruit=%s\">点击组队</>"] = "Members, please form a team and head to Zoe at the Tarot Club Conference Room to initiate the family creation ceremony. At least 2 people are required to start the ceremony. <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Locate\" u=\"groupRecruit=%s\"> Click to form a team </>",
	["请把选票给我，我要成为市长，进行一系列的改革，改变廷根的颓势。"] = "Please give me your vote. I want to become mayor and carry out a series of reforms to change Tingen's decline.",
	["请抽出3张塔罗牌"] = "Please draw 3 Tarot cards",
	["请抽取一张牌吧，让我们一同观看命——呜哇！不好意思，牌没拿稳，全撒了。"] = "Please draw a card, let us watch the fate—whoops! Sorry, I didn't hold the cards steady, they all spilled.",
	["请拖动家族成员排序，创建成功后仍可调整"] = "Please drag to sort family members; you can still adjust after successful creation.",
	["请拿好，喝了这瓶“焦糖炸弹”，祝您烦恼全炸飞，生活甜到爆！"] = "Here you go. After drinking this 'Caramel Bomb', may all your worries explode away, and may your life be sweet as can be!",
	["请按住并说出：%s"] = "Please press and hold to speak: %s",
	["请按需借阅，按时归还。"] = "Please borrow as needed and return on time.",
	["请接取任务"] = "Please accept the quest",
	["请接纳我等为……夜的子民……"] = "Please accept us as... children of the night...",
	["请提交正确的物品。"] = "Please submit the correct items.",
	["请握住你的命运。"] = "please grasp your fate.",
	["请擦拭我的墓碑……让我的名字清晰起来。我最后的气息将依附于你……请代我，完成那个拥抱。"] = "Please wipe my tombstone... make my name clear. My final breath will cling to you... please, on my behalf, complete that hug.",
	["请支持我们吧！作为回报，我们愿意为你和伴侣的誓约仪式提供舞蹈表演。"] = "Please support us! In return, we are willing to provide a dance performance for your and your partner's covenant ceremony.",
	["请收下你的奖金吧！这是你自己赢得的！"] = "Please accept your prize money! You earned it yourself!",
	["请收下我的致敬！这是你自己赢得的！"] = "Please accept my tribute! You earned this yourself!",
	["请放心，他不会再有事了，老约翰现在仅仅是一具尸体。"] = "Please rest assured, he won't have any more issues. Old John is now just a corpse.",
	["请文明游戏，如您产生违规行为，将会被禁言甚至封禁。若您发现其他玩家有违规行为，请及时举报并反馈给客服。"] = "Please play civilly. If you engage in violations, you will be muted or even banned. If you discover other players violating the rules, please report and provide feedback to customer service in a timely manner.",
	["请文明游戏，如您发生违规行为，将会被禁言，拉入黑名单甚至封号。如您发现其他玩家有违规行为或者异常情况，请及时举报或联系客服。不信谣不传谣，祝大家游戏愉快！"] = "Please play fairly. If you engage in violations, you will be muted, blacklisted, or even banned. If you discover other players violating rules or acting abnormally, please report them or contact customer service. Do not believe or spread rumors. Have a pleasant game!",
	["请明确你们的路线和价目表，这关系到你们的执照！"] = "Please clarify your routes and price lists; this concerns your license!",
	["请暂别此刻的喧嚣，来到我的身边。"] = "Please leave the noise of the moment and come to my side.",
	["请替我谢谢她，这份心意很珍贵。不过，可以告诉她：我和她一样，也是在黑夜教会的孤儿院长大的。诗人……真正的诗人大概不会因为写诗如此头疼。"] = "Please thank her for me; this sentiment is very precious. However, you can tell her: I grew up in the Nighthawk orphanage just like her. A poet... a real poet probably wouldn't have such a headache from writing poetry.",
	["请根据歌声和声波特效指示的方向前进。"] = "Please proceed in the direction indicated by the singing and sound wave effects.",
	["请止步，{{先生|女士}}！前方区域封锁，警方办案，无关人员请勿靠近。"] = "Please stop, {{Mr.|Ms.}}! The area ahead is cordoned off; the police are handling a case, unauthorized personnel please do not approach.",
	["请正常冲洗照片。"] = "Please develop the photos normally.",
	["请正常地、普通地冲洗照片。"] = "Please develop the photos normally and plainly.",
	["请正常地冲洗照片。"] = "Please develop the photos normally.",
	["请正常地冲洗照片就可以了……"] = "Please just develop the photos normally...",
	["请求仪式"] = "Request Ritual",
	["请求你把我们的身影留在这个和平的世界，这是我们追求的宁静生活。"] = "Ask you to keep our figures in this peaceful world. This is the quiet life we pursued.",
	["请求失败"] = "Request failed.",
	["请求女神垂怜祂的子民，保佑大家平安归来……"] = "Praying for the Goddess to have mercy on Her people and bless everyone with a safe return...",
	["请求带路"] = "Ask for guidance",
	["请求拿到剧本"] = "Request to get the script",
	["请求换位"] = "Request to Swap Positions",
	["请沉醉在曲中吧……"] = "Please be intoxicated by the music...",
	["请注意，我方<PVPHighlight>上路一塔</>已被击毁"] = "Please note, our <PVPHighlight> top lane Tier 1 Tower </> has been destroyed.",
	["请注意，我方<PVPHighlight>上路三塔</>已被击毁"] = "Please note, our <PVPHighlight> top lane Tier 3 Tower </> has been destroyed.",
	["请注意，我方<PVPHighlight>上路二塔</>已被击毁"] = "Please note, our <PVPHighlight> top lane Tier 2 Tower </> has been destroyed.",
	["请注意，我方<PVPHighlight>下路一塔</>已被击毁"] = "Please note, our <PVPHighlight> bottom lane Tier 1 Tower </> has been destroyed.",
	["请注意，我方<PVPHighlight>下路三塔</>已被击毁"] = "Please note, our <PVPHighlight> bottom lane Tier 3 Tower </> has been destroyed.",
	["请注意，我方<PVPHighlight>下路二塔</>已被击毁"] = "Please note, our <PVPHighlight> bottom lane Tier 2 Tower </> has been destroyed.",
	["请注意，我方<PVPHighlight>中路一塔</>已被击毁"] = "Please note, our <PVPHighlight> middle lane Tier 1 Tower </> has been destroyed.",
	["请注意，我方<PVPHighlight>中路三塔</>已被击毁"] = "Please note, our <PVPHighlight> middle lane Tier 3 Tower </> has been destroyed.",
	["请注意，我方<PVPHighlight>中路二塔</>已被击毁"] = "Please note, our <PVPHighlight> middle lane Tier 2 Tower </> has been destroyed.",
	["请注意，每个策略卡往往都有条件，需要满足才能触发效果"] = "Please note that each strategy card often has conditions that must be met to trigger its effect.",
	["请派遣秘偶游历"] = "Please dispatch a Marionette to travel",
	["请添加含有二维码的图片"] = "Please add an image containing a QR code",
	["请添加突破用同名封印物。"] = "Please add a Sealed Artifact of the same name for breakthrough.",
	["请添加雇员"] = "Please add employees.",
	["请灵活使用【入梦】和【通灵】技能，获取线索，可使用【转换身份】改变当前角色视角"] = "Please use your [Enter Dream] and [Spirit Mediumship] skills flexibly to obtain clues. You can use [Switch Identity] to change your current character's perspective.",
	["请点击小地图旁的<Highlight_L>世界灾厄</>按钮，返回队长所在区域"] = "Please click the <Highlight_L> World Calamity </> button next to the mini-map to return to the area where the captain is located.",
	["请点击查看"] = "Please click to view",
	["请点击输入文字"] = "Please click to enter text",
	["请点击骰子"] = "Please click the dice",
	["请留意，当前形态为输出流派。"] = "Please note, the current form is an output style.",
	["请留步一分钟，您有看见那艘红色的赛艇吗？三号桨手是我家的杰尼少爷。"] = "Please stay for a minute. Have you seen that red rowing boat? The number three rower is my family's young master, Jeni.",
	["请直接告诉我"] = "Please tell me directly",
	["请看——"] = "Please take a look—",
	["请看看我"] = "Please Look at Me",
	["请看看这个乐谱。我在艾登住的地方找到的。"] = "Please take a look at this sheet music. I found it where Aiden was staying.",
