	["请问，为什么将我召集到这里？"] = "May I ask, why did you summon me here?",
	["请问，你们听说过回荡在这附近的奇怪琴声吗？"] = "Excuse me, have you heard the strange piano music echoing around here?",
	["请问，你们说的吸血鬼是谁？"] = "Excuse me, who is the vampire you are talking about?",
	["请问，你是来聆听愚者福音的？"] = "Excuse me, are you here to listen to the gospel of the Fool?",
	["请问，刚刚那对母女呢？"] = "May I ask, where did that mother and daughter go?",
	["请问，您如何看待波拿巴餐厅副经理杰·杜兰德模仿血腥屠夫作案这件事？"] = "May I ask, what is your take on the incident where J. Durand, the assistant manager of Bonaparte Restaurant, imitated the Bloody Butcher?",
	["请问，您见过我的儿子吗？"] = "Excuse me, have you seen my son?",
