	["请问，有什么推荐的报刊吗？"] = "Excuse me, do you have any recommended newspapers?",
	["请随便坐。"] = "Please, make yourself at home.",
	["请随便坐。晚上八点之后营业酒水。\n我在研究新的菜谱，您喜欢芜菁还是土豆炖汤？"] = "Please, sit anywhere. Drinks are served after eight in the evening. \n I'm working on a new recipe, do you prefer turnip or potato stew?",
	["请随便看看。"] = "Please feel free to look around.",
	["请随我来，一起欣赏这首美妙的音乐。"] = "Please follow me and enjoy this wonderful music together.",
	["请随我闭上眼，遗忘疯狂"] = "Please close your eyes with me and forget the madness.",
	["诸位"] = "Everyone,",
	["诸位 笑一个吧 感谢你们帮我找到笔记 "] = "Everyone, smile. Thank you for helping me find the notes.",
	["诸位，我今天来晚了……私人马车出了一点故障，我只好临时换一辆……"] = "Everyone, I'm late today... My private carriage had a bit of a breakdown, so I had to switch to another one temporarily...",
	["诸位，跟我一样，笑一个吧，演出该落幕了。"] = "Everyone, smile like me, the performance should come to an end.",
	["诸君！请勿让求学的孩子蒙尘！\n诚邀尊贵的绅士淑女以金镑铺就求学阶梯。\n\n凡捐赠者，皆可登入《黑夜烛光》名录，\n您的善心会获得女神赐福。\n\n捐赠处：<Highlight>当地黑夜教堂</>\n\n附注：本会会计师系贝克兰德大学认证，\n收支账目每月刊登于《廷根日报》第三版"] = "Gentlemen! Please do not let the children seeking education be covered in dust! \n We sincerely invite noble gentlemen and ladies to pave the ladder of learning with gold pounds. \n \n All donors can be entered into the 'Candlelight of the Night' directory, \n your kindness will be blessed by the Goddess. \n \n Donation location: <Highlight> Local Nighthawk Cathedral </> \n \n Note: Our association's accountant is certified by Backlund University, \n income and expenditure accounts are published monthly on the third page of the 'Tingen Daily'",
