	["谁不知道霍纳奇斯山脉上的遗迹！"] = "Who doesn't know about the ruins on the Hornacis Mountain Range!",
	["谁也无法阻止我前往法阵中心，向神献祭自己！"] = "No one can stop me from reaching the center of the ritual circle to sacrifice myself to the God!",
	["谁会想尝这种东西？"] = "Who would want to taste that kind of thing?",
	["谁会讨厌壁炉呢？"] = "Who would hate a fireplace?",
	["谁会谋杀一个工人呢，他既没有财产，又没有保险。说不定偷了我的东西跑了！"] = "Who would murder a worker? He has no property and no insurance. Maybe he stole my things and ran off!",
	["谁允许你坐在这里的！"] = "Who gave you permission to sit here!",
	["谁具有明显嫌疑？"] = "Who is the primary suspect?",
	["谁可能拥有作案动机?"] = "Who might have a motive for the crime?",
	["谁啊！大中午的锯木头……"] = "Who is that! Sawing wood in the middle of the day...",
	["谁在"] = "Who is",
	["谁在何时给予拯救？"] = "Who provides salvation, and when?",
	["谁在外面嚷嚷！"] = "Who is shouting outside!",
	["谁在说话！"] = "Who is speaking!",
	["谁在说话！好多声音……脑袋要裂开了……"] = "Who is speaking! So many voices... my head is about to split...",
	["谁在说话？"] = "Who is speaking?",
	["谁在说话？！"] = "Who is speaking?!",
	["谁在跟踪"] = "Who is following",
	["谁在那儿？"] = "Who's there?",
	["谁在那里说话？"] = "Who is speaking there?",
	["谁干的！到底是谁干的！"] = "Who did this! Who on earth did this!",
	["谁惹你这么生气"] = "Who made you so angry",
	["谁成想突然就打起仗来，她未婚夫去执行任务，失踪到现在。"] = "Who would have thought that a war would suddenly break out? Her fiancé went to carry out a mission and has been missing until now.",
	["谁把图标全改成宁静药水了？"] = "Who changed all the icons to Tranquilizing Potion?",
	["谁指令生成了520万个位面"] = "Who issued the command that generated 520 myriad planes?",
	["谁是世界上最可爱的小猫啊？"] = "Who is the cutest kitten in the world?",
	["谁是世界上最美丽的人？"] = "Who is the most beautiful person in the world?",
	["谁是主导需要比拼一下才知道呢"] = "Who is the dominant one needs a contest to know",
	["谁是大帝"] = "Who is the Emperor",
	["谁是大帝trigger"] = "Who is the Emperor Trigger",
	["谁是大帝采集物"] = "Who is the Emperor collectable",
	["谁是恶龙"] = "Who is the Evil Dragon",
	["谁是本案的"] = "Who is the person in this case",
	["谁杀了谁？"] = "Who killed whom?",
	["谁来救救我……\r\n救救我……"] = "Who can save me...\r\nSave me...",
	["谁来救救我啊，总不能因为这点小事去找会长帮助吧……我又不认识什么人，唉，我就不该这么早尝试召唤信使，啊啊啊……"] = "Who can save me? I can't just go to the president for help over such a trivial matter... I don't know anyone else. Sigh, I shouldn't have tried to summon a messenger so early. Ahhh...",
	["谁知道发生了什么呢？"] = "Who knows what happened?",
	["谁知道呢。"] = "Who knows.",
	["谁知道呢，也许是什么蒸汽革命纪念日吧……对了，你来找弗莱队长？"] = "Who knows, maybe it's some Steam Revolution anniversary... By the way, are you here to see Captain Frye?",
	["谁知道呢，反正总比没有强。北区工人都戴着这种护符，那边事故率确实低一些。"] = "Who knows, but it's better than nothing. The workers in the North District all wear these charms, and the accident rate there is indeed lower.",
	["谁知道呢，反正这乡下平民女现在装一副清高样，保不齐哪天就入主哪个老爷家的天价庄园了！"] = "Who knows? Anyway, this country commoner girl is acting all high and mighty now, who knows if she'll move into some lord's multi-million pound manor one day!",
	["谁知道呢，好奇心太足有时候不是个好习惯。"] = "Who knows, having too much curiosity is sometimes not a good habit.",
	["谁知道呢，就当是做些善事，听一听我这可怜人的牢骚吧。流浪的人那么多，就连济贫院都要排队进，只为从门缝里获得一丝怜悯。"] = "Who knows? Just consider it a good deed and listen to the complaints of a poor person like me. There are so many wanderers, even the poorhouse has a queue just to get a sliver of pity through the door crack.",
	["谁知道呢？听人说，那狒狒眼睛发红，对着训练师就是一口，咬得都撕下了一块肉来…要不是阻止及时，还想冲下来咬观众呢！"] = "Who knows? I heard that the baboon's eyes turned red, and it bit the trainer, tearing off a piece of flesh... If it hadn't been stopped in time, it would have rushed down to bite the audience too!",
	["谁知道它是不是真的古董，我相信我的眼光和判断。你把它拿出来让我看看。 "] = "Who knows if it's a real antique? I trust my eyes and judgment. Take it out and let me see.",
	["谁知道！那么大个男人，嘀嘀咕咕说什么蚂蚁恐怖 ，真可笑。"] = "Who knows! Such a big man, muttering about ants being terrifying, it's ridiculous.",
	["谁知道！那么大个男人，说什么蚂蚁恐怖 ，真可笑。"] = "Who knows! Such a big man, saying ants are terrifying, how ridiculous.",
	["谁知，月亮木偶突然开始祈祷，催生了四周的藤蔓。\n你和伊妮德，都被这些危险的、和“母亲”相关的藤蔓缠住了！"] = "To everyone's surprise, the moon puppet suddenly began to pray, causing vines to grow all around. \n Both you and Enid were entangled by these dangerous vines related to the \"Mother\"!",
	["谁给他上一课？"] = "Who's going to teach him a lesson?",
	["谁能为我跳一个“古典舞”！"] = "Who can dance a \"Classical Dance\" for me!",
	["谁能告诉我怎样才能挑选一个适合自己的护身符？"] = "Can someone tell me how to choose an amulet that suits me?",
	["谁能告诉我怎样挑选一个合适的护身符？"] = "Can someone tell me how to choose a suitable amulet?",
	["谁能帮我写论文！"] = "Who can help me write my thesis!",
	["谁能拒绝<h>武力</>和<h>财富</>呢……"] = "Who could refuse <h>power</> and <h>wealth</>...",
	["谁能给我启示……"] = "Who can give me a revelation...",
	["谁要是真能把莉莉<P_Yellow>灌醉</>了，那接下来可真是便宜那小子了，嘿嘿……"] = "If anyone could actually get Lily <P_Yellow>drunk</>, that guy would really be in for a treat, heh heh...",
	["谁让人家运气好，罗塞尔大帝说过，邻居好比靠近水边的高台，最容易得到月亮的青睐……"] = "Well, some people just have good luck. Emperor Roselle said, 'A neighbor is like a high platform near the water, most easily favored by the moon...'",
	["谁说接不住？我这是让你多看一会儿。"] = "Who says I can't? I'm just letting you watch for a while longer.",
	["谁还刻了一行字？“我偏要下去看看”……？"] = "Who carved a line of text? \"I insist on going down to take a look\"...?",
	["谁都无法忤逆我！"] = "No one can defy me!",
	["谁问你这个了？"] = "Who asked you about that?",
	["谁！……克莱恩？"] = "Who! ...Klein?",
	["谁！谁在外面这么吵！"] = "Who! Who is being so noisy outside!",
	["谁？"] = "Who?",
	["谁？我？"] = "Who? Me?",
	["谁？敢插手猎龙帮的事！"] = "Who? Dares to interfere with the Dragon Hunter Gang's business!",
	["谁？进来吧。"] = "Who? Come in.",
	["谁？！啊……又到狩猎时间了？食物！"] = "Who?! Ah... is it hunting time again? Food!",
	["调制魔药说明"] = "Potion Brewing Instructions",
	["调动周身星界之力勾勒出神秘星图，点亮天空，在目标位置召唤星辰光柱造成范围伤害。\n\n<FaintYellow>星蚀诅咒</>\n命中的敌人降低受到的治疗量。\n<FaintYellow>星界指引</>\n使用星穹裁决后自身获得星界指引，受到的伤害降低，持续15秒。"] = "Mobilize the Astral World power around you to outline a mysterious star map, lighting up the sky and summoning a pillar of starlight at the target location to deal area damage. \n\n<FaintYellow> Star Eclipse Curse </>\n: Enemies hit have their healing received reduced. \n<FaintYellow> Astral Guidance </>\n: After using Starry Dome Judgment, you gain Astral Guidance, reducing damage received for 15 seconds.",
	["调动对知识的感知力，将自身钻研的格斗技巧拆解、融合，通过体验起手招式，深入武学精髓。当再度攻击时，将会留下一道源自知识的格斗残影。\n吸收残影后，可使武力加3，直觉加1。"] = "Mobilize your perception of knowledge to deconstruct and integrate the combat techniques you have studied, delving into the essence of martial arts by experiencing the opening moves. When you attack again, you will leave behind a combat afterimage born from knowledge.\nAfter absorbing the afterimage, you gain +3 Force and +1 Intuition.",
	["调动窥秘人序列的精准感知力，将自身钻研的所有基础格斗技巧拆解、融合、凝于一瞬，瞬间摆出一套细节极致标准的格斗起手式，待姿态自然恢复后，这股势场会随下一次攻击具象化为一道清晰的格斗残影。\n吸收残影后获得武力加3，直觉加1。"] = "Mobilize the precise perception of the Mystery Pryer Sequence to dismantle, fuse, and condense all the basic combat techniques you have studied into a single moment, instantly striking a combat starting pose with extreme detail. After the stance naturally recovers, this force field will materialize as a clear combat phantom following your next attack. \n Absorbing the phantom increases your Might by 3 and Intuition by 1.",
	["调动窥秘人序列的精准灵性把控能力，牵引周身隐秘的信息流，以自身为阵眼在脚下绘刻出覆有窥秘星纹与秘语的阵法，同时施展一套契合古法的巫师仪式动作 —— 指节结秘印、唇间低吟窥秘咒文、抬手引灵覆身，每一个步骤皆精准对应窥秘仪式的古法流程，魔法阵会随动作缓缓流转淡紫微光，咒文伴低沉嗡鸣，充满仪式感。\n期间周围的玩家可以获得临时技能，使用临时技能可以获取一张隐秘知识的纸条。\n自身获得直觉加4，学识加2。使用临时技能的玩家也可以获得直觉加4，学识加2。"] = "Mobilizing the precise spirituality control ability of the Mystery Pryer sequence, drawing upon the hidden information flow around the body, and using oneself as the anchor to engrave a formation covered in Mystery Pryer star patterns and secret words at one's feet. Simultaneously, perform a set of wizard ritual movements that conform to ancient methods—knotted secret seals with knuckles, whispering Mystery Pryer incantations between lips, and raising hands to draw spirits over the body. Each step precisely corresponds to the ancient process of the Mystery Ritual. The magic circle will slowly rotate with a pale purple shimmer as the movements are performed, and the incantations will be accompanied by a low hum, full of ritualistic atmosphere. \n During this period, surrounding players can obtain a temporary skill, and using the temporary skill can acquire a note of secret knowledge. \n The user gains +4 Intuition and +2 Erudition. Players who use the temporary skill can also gain +4 Intuition and +2 Erudition.",
	["调动观众序列的进阶情绪感知力，以序列 9 技能标记的目标当日核心情绪光谱为锚点，锁定目标的表层意识流，读取其当下未加隐藏的具象化想法。\n使目标获得直觉加3，学识加1。"] = "Mobilizes the Spectator Sequence's advanced emotional perception, using the target's core emotional spectrum of the day (marked by Sequence 9 skills) as an anchor to lock onto the target's superficial stream of consciousness and read their current, unhidden, concrete thoughts. \n Grants the target +3 Intuition and +1 Knowledge.",
	["调动观众序列融合疗愈特性的观心灵性，以柔和的灵性触达目标的表层情绪场，不干涉深层心境、不强行扭转情绪根源，仅通过情绪疏导的方式，将目标原本的负面情绪转化为正面情绪，转化后目标周身会浮现新情绪的清晰光谱，且该正面情绪会稳定持续一段时间。\n使目标获得学识加4，魅力加2。"] = "Mobilizes the Spectator Sequence's observation spirituality, which integrates healing properties, to gently touch the target's superficial emotional field. Without interfering with deep states of mind or forcibly twisting the roots of emotions, it merely converts the target's original negative emotions into positive ones through emotional guidance. After conversion, a clear spectrum of the new emotion will emerge around the target, and this positive emotion will remain stable for a period of time. \n Grants the target +4 Knowledge and +2 Charisma.",
	["调动观众序列赋予的观心灵性，以自身为情绪感知锚点，在目标周身凝出一枚淡色光粒色点。色点的颜色严格对应目标当日表层核心心情。\n使目标获得魅力加1。"] = "Mobilizes the Spectator Sequence's observation spirituality, using yourself as an anchor for emotional perception to condense a pale light particle at the target's side. The color of the particle strictly corresponds to the target's superficial core mood of the day. \n Grants the target +1 Charisma.",
	["调味之前，还有几次最关键的步骤，得准备点冰块。"] = "Before seasoning, there are a few crucial steps; we need to prepare some ice cubes.",
	["调教即是训练，训练即是调教，懂得调教的艺术，也懂得了训练的境界。"] = "Discipline is training, training is discipline. Understanding the art of discipline is also understanding the realm of training.",
