	["调整灯光"] = "Adjust Lighting",
	["调整矩形点名面向冲击<Disable>丰饶之藤</>，将其弱化为绿色藤蔓。靠近绿色藤蔓会被其束缚，规避<Disable>丰饶恩赐</>的击退效果。"] = "Adjust the rectangular targeting orientation to impact the <Disable>Vine of Abundance</>, weakening it into green vines. Approaching the green vines will cause you to be bound, avoiding the knockback effect of <Disable>Bounty of Abundance</>.",
