	["调配魔药那天，苏茜开门进了实验室，舔舐了一份观众魔药。幸好我当时准备了两份材料。"] = "On the day of preparing the potion, Susie opened the door and entered the laboratory, licking a portion of Spectator potion. Fortunately, I had prepared two sets of materials at the time.",
