	["贝克兰德！"] = "Backlund!",
	["贝克兰德！万都之都！快看那些马车！"] = "Backlund! The City of Cities! Look at those carriages!",
	["贝克兰德，鲁恩王国的首都，有着“希望之地”“万都之都”的别称。"] = "Backlund, the capital of the Loen Kingdom, is known as the 'Land of Hope' and the 'City of Cities.'",
