	["贪婪的混混"] = "Greedy thug",
	["贪婪被消化在肚子里，变成结晶。"] = "Greed is digested in the stomach, turning into crystals.",
	["贪心的小家伙，那再教你一个有趣的技巧。"] = "Greedy little guy, then I'll teach you another interesting trick.",
	["贪心鬼，今天没有了，不过我还会再来的。"] = "Greedy little thing, there's no more today, but I'll come back again.",
	["贪欲横扫"] = "Greed Sweep",
	["贪欲波及"] = "Greed Spread",
	["贪财好利的骗子、腐蚀学术的蛀虫、玷污道德的渣滓！这些坏学生要是被我抓到，我一定要拿我的戒尺跟他好好握个手！"] = "Greedy swindlers, academic parasites, moral degenerates! If I catch these bad students, I'll definitely give them a good handshake with my ruler!",
