	["购买立即获得<Highlight>300</>金镑以及<Highlight>2个</>活力方糖，并获得持续<Highlight>30</>天的福音券运势解读，以及<Highlight>人脉快速互动次数增加</>、<Highlight>玩法货币获取效率提升</>、<Highlight>自定义传送信标</>、<Highlight>活力上限增加</>等特权。\n每日登录可获得<Highlight>100</>绑定金镑，累积登录还可额外获得更多<Highlight>活力方糖</>。"] = "Purchase immediately to receive <Highlight>300</> Pounds and <Highlight>2</> Vitality Sugar Cubes, along with a <Highlight>30</>-day Gospel Voucher fortune reading, as well as privileges such as increased <Highlight> rapid networking interaction attempts </>, increased <Highlight> gameplay currency acquisition efficiency </>, <Highlight> custom teleport beacons </>, and <Highlight> increased Vitality caps </>. \n Log in daily to receive <Highlight>100</> Bound Pounds, and accumulate logins to receive additional <Highlight> Vitality Sugar Cubes </>.",
