	["赛弗拉"] = "Sephra",
	["赛弗拉，你听！约会……！泽维尔一说这词，我心里砰砰直跳，我什么也不记得了，连他说在哪个餐厅门口见面也不记得！"] = "Sephra, listen! A date...! Every time Xavier says that word, my heart beats wildly. I don't remember anything, not even which restaurant entrance he said to meet at!",
