	["越好的酒越值得等待，请耐心等待美酒的完成。"] = "The better the wine, the more it is worth the wait. Please wait patiently for the fine wine to be ready.",
	["越强大越应该得到足够多的目光？不错的想法。"] = "The more powerful you are, the more attention you should get? Good idea.",
	["越想越觉得委屈，鼻子酸酸的。"] = "The more I think about it, the more wronged I feel, my nose is sour.",
	["越来越多的市民失踪了，必须尽快查出灾祸源头……先去梦中的诡异湖边看看。"] = "More and more citizens are going missing; I must find the source of the disaster as soon as possible... First, go to the eerie lakeside in the dream to take a look.",
