	["踏上滑轨，前往工厂找到崔佛"] = "Step onto the rail and head to the factory to find Trevor.",
	["踏上这条路时，你已身在命运的湍流中。"] = "When you step onto this path, you are already in the torrent of fate.",
	["踏上这片场地，你感觉热血沸腾，刺客和猎人千年来的纠缠在你脑中重现。（尝试与异性在此处切磋。）"] = "Stepping onto this ground, you feel your blood boiling as the millennium-long entanglement between Assassins and Hunters replays in your mind. (Try sparring with someone of the opposite sex here.)",
	["踏入书籍通道-重置偏移"] = "Step into book passage - Reset offset",
	["踏入沙盘的第一批征服者，尚未在罗塞尔的注视下留名。四皇之战的历史回响在耳边轰鸣，而你只是无数棋子中的一枚。"] = "The first batch of conquerors to step into the sandbox have yet to make a name for themselves under Roselle's gaze. The historical echoes of the War of the Four Emperors roar in your ears, and you are but one of countless chess pieces.",
	["踏入神之国度"] = "Step into the Kingdom of God",
	["踏入那片未知的转角阴影，这位可怜的猎物走入了<P_Yellow>哪儿</>？故事在<P_Yellow>何时</>走向终局？\\n又会有<P_Yellow>谁</>的到来？"] = "Stepping into the shadow around that unknown corner, <P_Yellow>where</> did this poor prey go? <P_Yellow>When</> will the story reach its end?\\nAnd <P_Yellow>who</> will arrive?",
