	["身体"] = "Body",
	["身体变大"] = "Body grows larger",
	["身体变小"] = "Body grows smaller",
	["身体控制能力出众，能做出夸张表情和滑稽动作。身体如同白纸，可以变化，掌握纸人替身、火焰跳跃等能力，在危险中优雅脱身。"] = "Possess outstanding body control, capable of making exaggerated expressions and comical movements. The body is like a blank sheet of paper, capable of transformation. Master abilities like Paper Figurine Substitute and Flame Jump to elegantly escape danger.",
	["身体素质大幅增强，力量和敏捷超越常人。能打开目标“心智体”之门修改意识，战斗中强行催眠敌人，让其做出不正常举动。"] = "Physical fitness is greatly enhanced, strength and agility surpass ordinary people. Can open the door to the target's \"mental body\" to modify consciousness, forcibly hypnotizing enemies in battle and making them perform abnormal actions.",
	["身体细小，可以钻入狭窄的缝隙。"] = "Small body, can crawl into narrow gaps.",
	["身体虽是武器，头脑才是真正的扳机。"] = "Though the body is a weapon, the mind is the true trigger.",
	["身体要像老鼠，快、小、灵活。打不过就跑，跑不过就绕。"] = "Your body should be like a rat's: fast, small, and agile. If you can't beat them, run; if you can't outrun them, circle around.",
	["身体逐渐木头人化，移动速度下降50％。"] = "Body gradually turning into a wooden doll, movement speed decreased by 50%.",
