	["迅速<Highlight>集合分摊</>"] = "Quickly <Highlight>gather to share damage</>.",
	["迅速<Highlight>集合分摊</>，分摊后<Highlight>观察连线</>情况，<Highlight>避免冲刺扯断</>连线"] = "Quickly <Highlight>gather to share damage</>. After sharing, <Highlight>observe the connection</> status and <Highlight>avoid dashing and breaking the</> connection.",
	["迅速向前方丢出多张纸牌造成范围伤害，技能共有三段。第一段自身获得穿刺效果，第三段将击退敌人，使其减疗并附加愚弄标记造成额外伤害，同时自身获得一张命运黄牌（用于解锁终结技能）。"] = "Quickly throw multiple playing cards forward to deal area damage; the skill has three stages. In the first stage, the user gains a piercing effect; in the third stage, enemies are knocked back, suffer Healing Reduction, and are applied with a Fooling Mark to deal additional damage, while the user gains a Fate Yellow Card (used to unlock Finisher Skills).",
	["迅速离开这里"] = "Leave here quickly",
	["迅速集中攻击改造后的枯藤！"] = "Concentrate fire to attack the modified Withered Vine immediately!",
	["过了一段时间……"] = "After a while...",
	["过了好久，一个都没来！"] = "It's been so long, and not a single one has come!",
	["过了很久……很久"] = "After a long... long time",
	["过了很久，很久……"] = "A long, long time passed...",
	["过了桥靠左走。"] = "Cross the bridge and keep left.",
	["过于破旧的钱夹，停止在三年之前的日记，还有这样厚重的积雪……"] = "The overly worn wallet, the diary that stopped three years ago, and such thick snow...",
	["过于重复的话语容易被别人把握到自身的习惯和心理活动。那本心理学的书上是这么说。"] = "Overly repetitive words are easily grasped by others to reveal one’s habits and psychological activities. That’s what that psychology book said.",
	["过五分钟，将赛琳娜带到对面的房间，我会纠正她的错误仪式。"] = "In five minutes, bring Selena to the room across the hall, and I will correct her erroneous ritual.",
	["过去"] = "Passado",
	["过去 现在 和未来"] = "The past, the present, and the future",
	["过去<h>问问情况</>"] = "Go over and <h> ask about the situation </>",
	["过去与<h>斯维因</>交涉"] = "Go over and negotiate with <h>Swain</>",
	["过去两周内的死亡事件是正常值的五倍……廷根市警察总局统计数据的时候发现了这个问题，赶紧将事情移交给了我们。"] = "The number of deaths in the past two weeks is five times the normal rate... The Tingen Police Department discovered this while compiling statistics and immediately transferred the matter to us.",
	["过去向<h>莉莉</>说明"] = "Go over and explain to <h> Lily </>",
	["过去向莉莉说明"] = "Go over and explain to Lily",
	["过去和<h>罗珊</>交谈"] = "Go over and talk to <h>Rozanne</>",
	["过去的回想"] = "Recollections of the past",
	["过去皆成历史，历史无疑是伟大的，我们想要从中汲取营养，给予警示，避免悲剧再次重演。"] = "The past has become history, and history is undoubtedly great. We want to draw nourishment from it, provide warnings, and prevent tragedies from repeating themselves.",
