	["过去看看那些<h>文字</>"] = "Go over and look at those <h> words </>",
	["过去看看！"] = "Go over and take a look!",
	["过去获得的恩赐词条，在这里可以查看或者替换掉它。"] = "You can view or replace Gift affixes obtained in the past here.",
	["过去问问情况"] = "Go Over and Ask about the Situation",
	["过去，我只当这是父亲发明的益智游戏，现在看来，更像是微缩的桌上战争。很有魅力的游戏，不是吗？<P_Heart>（微笑）</>"] = "In the past, I only thought of this as a puzzle game invented by my father. Now it seems more like a miniature tabletop war. A very charming game, isn't it? <P_Heart> (Smiles) </>",
