	["运城"] = "Yuncheng",
	["运气不好的人，可不配靠近我哟。"] = "Those with bad luck don't deserve to get close to me.",
	["运气不好，受到了一些奇怪的影响。"] = "Bad luck; you have been affected by something strange.",
	["运气好的时候能捡到只啃了一口的面包！还有很多他们不要的旧衣服啦，盘子啦，可以卖不少便士！"] = "When you're lucky, you can find bread that's only been bitten once! And there are many old clothes and plates they don't want, which can be sold for quite a few pennies!",
	["运气爆棚？"] = "Overflowing luck?",
	["运气而已。"] = "Just luck.",
	["运球"] = "Dribble",
	["运用力量抹去空间，对范围内敌人持续造成伤害，随后终结一击造成大量伤害。对怪物额外造成聚拢、击飞效果。"] = "Use power to erase space, continuously dealing damage to enemies within range, followed by a finishing blow that deals massive damage. Deals additional gathering and knockup effects to monsters.",
