	["近期同类案件"] = "Recent Similar Cases",
	["近期在演出的只有《伯爵归来》一部戏……呵呵。"] = "The only play currently being performed is \"The Count's Return\"... Heh.",
	["近期已申请过目标家族，请勿重复操作"] = "Already applied to the target family recently, please do not repeat the operation.",
	["近期已邀请过对方，请勿重复操作"] = "You have recently invited the other party; please do not repeat the action.",
	["近期廷根离奇案件增多，大量市民失踪，向堕落母神献祭的仪式频繁发生。"] = "Bizarre cases have been increasing in Tingen recently, with a large number of citizens going missing and rituals to sacrifice to the Mother Goddess of Depravity occurring frequently.",
	["近期某些爱情小说，引发了对吸血鬼不必要的狂热。\n现做以下概念澄清，帮助大家进行严谨的小说创作：\n吸血鬼多指因为黑暗力量而产生吸血冲动的堕落个体，在小说中应充当反派角色。\n若有必要创作相关小说，应采用“血族”一词。血族指古老智慧的血液贵族，他们恪守传统，注重礼仪，更应被当做主角书写。\n笔者倡议多创作以血族为主角的荣耀小说，避免过分沉溺虚幻的恋爱情节。"] = "Recent romance novels have sparked an unnecessary frenzy for vampires. \n The following conceptual clarifications are made to help everyone with rigorous novel creation: \n Vampires mostly refer to fallen individuals who develop a blood-sucking impulse due to dark powers, and should act as villains in novels. \n If it is necessary to create related novels, the term \"Blood Clan\" should be used. Blood Clan refers to ancient and wise blood aristocrats who adhere to traditions, value etiquette, and should be written as protagonists. \n The author advocates creating more glorious novels with the Blood Clan as protagonists, avoiding excessive indulgence in illusory romantic plots.",
	["近期焦点"] = "Recent Focus",
	["近期申请已被拒绝，请%s分钟后再试"] = "Recent applications were rejected; please try again in %s minutes.",
	["近期连环凶杀案调查报告"] = "Investigation Report on Recent Serial Murders",
	["近距离撕咬并用前方吐息补充范围伤害。"] = "Close-range biting and uses frontal breath to supplement area damage.",
	["近距离横扫武器，对周围2米以内敌人"] = "Close-range weapon sweep, targeting enemies within 2 meters",
	["近距离横扫武器，对周围2米以内敌人施展3段攻击，最多三人。造成真实伤害<Hint_1>100</>点；第三段攻击有<Hint_1>15%</>的概率附加<Hint_1>“破甲”</>效果，最多3层。<Hint_1>3%</>的概率触发“断筋”效果，持续20秒"] = "Close-range weapon sweep, performing a 3-stage attack on enemies within 2 meters, hitting up to three targets. Deals <Hint_1>100</> points of true damage; the third stage has a <Hint_1>15%</> chance to apply the <Hint_1>\"Armor Break\"</> effect, stacking up to 3 times. There is a <Hint_1>3%</> chance to trigger the \"Hamstring\" effect, lasting for 20 seconds.",
	["近身作战并以血肉阴影伤害周围敌人。"] = "Engage in melee combat and use Flesh Shadow to damage surrounding enemies.",
	["近身侍者都曾在贝克兰德顶级酒店接受三年以上的训练。"] = "The personal attendants have all received over three years of training at top-tier hotels in Backlund.",
	["近身多段攻击并对周围敌人爆发伤害。"] = "Perform multi-stage melee attacks and burst damage to surrounding enemies.",
	["近身抓击并以重锤攻击周围敌人。"] = "Close-range grab and uses Heavy Hammer to attack surrounding enemies.",
	["近身持续撕咬当前目标。"] = "Continuously bites the current target at close range.",
	["近身撕裂并用血焰狂舞攻击周围敌人。"] = "Perform melee tears and use Blood Flame Dance to attack surrounding enemies.",
	["近身攻击并释放周身范围伤害。"] = "Perform melee attacks and release damage in a radius around yourself.",
	["近身普攻"] = "Melee Basic Attack",
	["近身牵制并释放闪电射线。"] = "Engage in melee containment and release a Lightning Ray.",
	["近身连斩"] = "Melee Combo",
	["近身释放通灵仪式伤害周围敌人。"] = "Release a Spirit Mediumship Ritual in melee range to damage surrounding enemies.",
	["近马桶范围"] = "Near Toilet Range",
