	["进去拳击模式"] = "Enter boxing mode",
	["进去的时候他们说，先生这边请，您气质不一般，剪到一半，师傅说——先生您头型这么好，不烫一下浪费了。"] = "When I went in, they said, 'This way, sir, you have an extraordinary temperament.' Halfway through the haircut, the master said, 'Sir, your head shape is so good, it would be a waste not to get a perm.'",
