	["远处能看到村落，村前的湖泊通向水渠，可惜无法过去……更远处，居然还有个城堡……！"] = "You can see a village in the distance, and the lake in front of the village leads to a canal, but unfortunately, you can't get there... Further away, there's actually a castle...!",
	["远大前程早已离我而去，爱人、挚友远在天边，我只能向铁栏倾诉我的思绪。"] = "Great expectations have long since left me; my lover and dearest friends are worlds away. I can only pour out my thoughts to these iron bars.",
	["远战流氓"] = "Ranged Thug",
	["远方的号角依然嘹亮，威瑟尔的荣光仍在此流淌。不屈的灵魂低下头颅，铠甲的光泽却一如往常。"] = "The horn in the distance is still loud, and the glory of Wessel still flows here. The unyielding soul bows its head, yet the luster of the armor remains as always.",
