	["连他去世的时候也一样，我们那时候才二十多岁，他说：“卡尔啊，其实你的那些奇思妙想都不会成功的。但我最喜欢你乱鼓捣的样子！”"] = "Even when he passed away, it was the same. We were only in our twenties then. He said: 'Carl, actually, those wild ideas of yours will never succeed. But I love the way you tinker with things!'",
