	["连同我们的份，赢下这场赌局……"] = "Win this gamble, for us as well...",
	["连庄园的侍者也……只能将他们从失控中解脱了。"] = "Even the manor's servants are... I can only release them from their loss of control.",
	["连廊的尽头是庄园的藏书库，而这里的看守者便是眼前这位失控的管家了……"] = "At the end of the corridor is the manor's library, and the guardian here is none other than the out-of-control butler before you...",
	["连恐惧都来不及流经电流，钻头的轰鸣便在最后一刻彻底停息，成就机械的终结。"] = "Before even fear could flow through the current, the roar of the Drill ceased completely at the final moment, achieving the finish of the machine.",
