	["连续冲击三次，每次造成<HighLight>60%</>攻击伤害；第一击牵引敌人，自身恢复<HighLight>12%</>最大生命。"] = "Continuously impact three times, each dealing <HighLight>60%</> attack damage; the first hit pulls the enemy, and self recovers <HighLight>12%</> of maximum Health.",
	["连续发射三枚星辉弹，每枚对4格内当前目标造成<color=red>75%攻击力伤害</color>。"] = "Fire three starlight bullets in succession, each dealing <color=red> 75% attack damage to the current target within 4 grids</color>.",
	["连续发射五枚能量弹，分别造成<HighLight>60%/55%/50%/45%/40%</>攻击伤害。"] = "Fire five energy bullets in succession, dealing <HighLight>60%/55%/50%/45%/40%</> Attack damage respectively.",
	["连续喷吐九次，每次造成<HighLight>18%</>攻击伤害；命中施加持续<HighLight>4</>秒的灼烧和<HighLight>25%</>生命恢复降低。"] = "Spit nine times in succession, each dealing <HighLight>18%</> Attack damage; hits apply Burn for <HighLight>4</> seconds and reduce Health recovery by <HighLight>25%</>.",
	["连续好几篇罗塞尔大帝的报道了，我都要开始怀疑《廷根市老实人报》被因蒂斯暗中收购了……"] = "That's several reports on Emperor Roselle in a row. I'm starting to suspect that the 'Tingen Honest Man's Newspaper' has been secretly acquired by Intis...",
	["连续好几篇罗塞尔大帝的报道了，我都要开始怀疑《廷根老实人报》被因蒂斯暗中收购了……"] = "That's several articles about Emperor Roselle in a row now. I'm starting to suspect that the Tingen Honest Reporter has been secretly bought out by Intis...",
	["连续打开关闭邮件界面N次，填Count"] = "Open/close mail interface N times; enter Count.",
	["连续扼杀生命回响，你已站在秩序的对立面。命运的经纬因你崩坏，神性的低语在耳边化为疯狂。"] = "By continuously strangling the echoes of life, you have stood on the opposite side of order. The warp and weft of fate have collapsed because of you, and the whispers of divinity have turned into madness in your ears.",
