	["连续终结他人命运，你已成为厄运的化身。印记将伴你左右，直至终结。"] = "Having continuously finished the fates of others, you have become the avatar of misfortune. The mark will accompany you until the end.",
	["连续终结他人命运，你已成为厄运的化身。迷雾中的目光不再移开，所有与你牵连者，都将步入阴影。"] = "By continuously finishing the fates of others, you have become the avatar of misfortune. The gaze from the fog no longer looks away; all those connected to you will step into the shadows.",
