	["选择第一幕场景"] = "Select Act 1 Scene",
	["选择组件——指定自己喜欢的组件（地板、墙等），确认后生成的建筑群<Highlight>只会使用指定的组件</>。\n\n生成规则——如果同一个类型（地板、墙等）下指定了多种组件，那么生成的每个建筑都会随机应用其中一种。\n\n查看生成效果——点击生成按钮后，会先生成建筑群预览效果，如果不满意可以点击按钮刷新。\n\n小贴士：想要生成一个大建筑群，可以分成多次、每次圈选一小块区域生成，这样最终效果会更加可控。"] = "Select Components—Specify your preferred components (floors, walls, etc.). After you Confirm, the generated building complex <Highlight> will only use the specified components </>. \n\nGeneration Rules—If multiple components are specified for the same type (floors, walls, etc.), each generated building will randomly apply one of them. \n\nView Generation Results—After clicking the Generate button, a preview of the building complex will be generated first. If you are not satisfied, you can click the button to refresh it. \n\nTips: If you want to generate a large building complex, you can do it in multiple stages by selecting a small area each time. This will make the final result more controllable.",
