	["透明相关材质参数"] = "Transparency Material Parameters",
	["透过它，灵体清晰，现实模糊。战斗中开启灵视时，能获得灵体的祝福，持续恢复生命并降低受到的伤害，但灵视更短、冷却更长。结束后视力受损，格挡与防御降低。"] = "Through it, the spirit body is clear, and reality is blurred. Opening spirit vision in battle can gain the blessing of the spirit body, continuously recovering Health and reducing damage taken, but spirit vision is shorter and has a longer Cooldown. After it ends, vision is impaired, and block and Defense are reduced.",
