	["逛了有一会儿了，不知道汤姆怎么样了？"] = "I've been walking around for a while now; I wonder how Tom is doing?",
	["逛得差不多了。你呢，东西卖得怎么样？"] = "I've seen enough. How about you, how are the sales?",
