	["邓恩将失控的怪物拖入了梦境……"] = "Dunn dragged the out-of-control monster into a dream...",
	["邓恩将梦魇的力量注入地面，凝聚成梦魇向目标敌方冲击，命中目标敌方后造成bulletdisc(*id)点伤害，并且给目标留下梦魇标记，1.5秒时间结束后造成*d点额外伤害。"] = "Dunn injects the power of nightmares into the ground, condensing it into a nightmare that impacts the target enemy, dealing bulletdisc(*id) damage upon hit and leaving a Nightmare Mark on the target, which deals *d additional damage after 1.5 seconds.",
	["邓恩将梦魇的力量注入地面，凝聚成梦魇对目标敌方造成一定伤害，并且给目标留下梦魇标记，标记结束后造成一定伤害。"] = "Dunn injects the power of a Nightmare into the ground, condensing it into a Nightmare to deal damage to the target enemy and leave a Nightmare Mark, which deals damage after the mark ends.",
