	["邓恩没有变成我的通灵对象，呵呵……等我知道的时候，他的灵早就消散了。哪里都找不到。"] = "Dunn didn't become an object for my Spirit Mediumship, haha... By the time I knew, his spirit had long since dissipated. I couldn't find it anywhere.",
