	["邻居家的太太讲的睡前故事里，主角是一个住在梦幻岛上，用蘑菇当烟囱，和仙子、人鱼生活在一起，永远都不会长大的小男孩……"] = "In the bedtime story told by the neighbor's wife, the protagonist is a little boy who lives on Dream Island, uses a mushroom as a chimney, lives with fairies and mermaids, and will never grow up...",
