	["郊外晨曲"] = "Suburban Morning Song",
	["郊外？那不过是乡巴佬待的泥坑！"] = "The suburbs? That's just a mud pit for bumpkins!",
	["郊野林地"] = "Suburban Woodland",
	["郑州"] = "Zhengzhou",
	["郑斌"] = "Zheng Bin",
	["郝迈思"] = "Haumais",
	["郝迈思-隐秘空间测试用"] = "Hao Maisi - Hidden Space Test",
	["郡警察厅"] = "County Police Department",
	["部件重复穿戴"] = "Duplicate part equipped",
	["部位穿戴"] = "Part Wearing",
	["部位解锁数"] = "Part unlock count",
	["部分人意志被污染！触碰意志碎片解除感染！"] = "Some people's will has been corrupted! Touch the Will Fragments to remove the infection!",
	["部分压力板需要满足一定条件才能解锁。\n在四周寻找线索吧。"] = "Some pressure plates require certain conditions to be met before they can be unlocked. \n Look for clues in the surroundings.",
	["部分可延长受击时长的受击使用"] = "Used for hits that can extend the hit duration.",
	["部分可见"] = "Partially Visible",
	["部分团员目前状态无法加入演出"] = "Some team members are currently unable to join the performance.",
	["部分外观部件含捆绑饰品，请自行调整满足5件限制"] = "Some appearance parts contain bundled accessories; please adjust to meet the 5-piece limit yourself.",
	["部分更高保密等级的资料，则需要进行额外的申请与测试。毕竟，知识就是力量，强大的力量不是每个人都能承受的。"] = "Some materials with higher security clearance require additional applications and testing. After all, Knowledge is Power, and not everyone can bear powerful strength.",
	["部分火炬有颜色区分，只会影响对应颜色的机关。"] = "Some torches are color-coded and will only affect mechanisms of the corresponding color.",
	["部分石柱和机关有颜色区分，需要射击对应颜色石柱启动机关。"] = "Some pillars and mechanisms are color-coded; you need to shoot the corresponding colored pillar to activate the mechanism.",
	["部分神奇物品具有“活着”的特性，会引诱周围的人，试图逃脱，请千万小心。"] = "Some mystical items have the characteristic of being 'alive', which will lure people around them, attempting to escape; please be very careful.",
	["部分组件无法回收：组件与其他组件相连"] = "Some components cannot be recycled: components are connected to other components.",
	["部分设置需要重启客户端后生效。"] = "Some settings require a client restart to take effect.",
	["郭"] = "Guo",
	["郴州"] = "Chenzhou",
	["都不建议"] = "Neither is recommended",
	["都不许动！"] = "Nobody move!",
	["都不许动！警察办案！"] = "Nobody move! Police investigation!",
	["都习惯了。上个月马丁去世，本来以为吵架能结束，谁知道莫里又对着空菜摊吵架。"] = "Got used to it. Martin passed away last month, and I thought the arguing would end, but who knew Mori would start arguing with the empty vegetable stall again.",
	["都住手！"] = "Stop, all of you!",
	["都准备好了。让我看看，这些被污染的秘偶还剩下多少“记忆”。"] = "Everything is ready. Let me see how much \"memory\" these corrupted marionettes have left.",
	["都准备好了，伦纳德先生。"] = "Everything is ready, Mr. Leonard.",
	["都准备好后，我将陪同你一起开启仪式，见证奇迹般神降之时。"] = "After everything is ready, I will accompany you to start the ritual and witness the miraculous moment of divine descent.",
	["都别吵了，偏差的质量是惰性气体。"] = "Stop arguing, everyone. The deviated mass is an inert gas.",
	["都可以"] = "Anything is fine",
	["都哥们"] = "Hey buddy",
	["都在传，是惹上了不该惹的东西。连那些穿黑衣服的“特殊警察”都来了好几趟，但也没什么说法。"] = "Everyone is saying it's because they messed with something they shouldn't have. Even those \"special police\" in black clothes have come several times, but there's no explanation.",
	["都在村口，也就是说，一下马车就能去厕所……真是方便，也许我可以记下来。"] = "They are all at the entrance of the village, which means you can go to the toilet as soon as you get off the carriage... it's really convenient, maybe I can write it down.",
	["都好。"] = "All good.",
	["都很好。"] = "They are all very good.",
	["都很好，我们顺利完成了那次任务，救了很多人……你是唯一的牺牲者。"] = "Everything is fine, we successfully completed that mission and saved many people... you were the only sacrifice.",
	["都怪你们！"] = "It's all your fault!",
	["都怪你，作业没写完还拉着我聊天。"] = "It's all your fault, you kept chatting with me before I finished my homework.",
	["都怪我，都怪我耽误了太久，我真是没用！"] = "It's all my fault, it's all my fault for delaying too long. I'm so useless!",
	["都怪那个沼泽女巫的传说，现在大家都说我的鱼被污染了！"] = "It's all because of the legend of the Swamp Witch; now everyone says my fish are contaminated!",
	["都找齐了，（小声）果然感觉序列越高，配方和材料都会越难搜集……"] = "They are all gathered. (Whispering) As expected, the higher the Sequence, the harder it is to collect the formulas and materials...",
	["都挺好的"] = "Everything is pretty good",
	["都搞清楚了，住在那的是一群流浪儿，我已经用灵视检查过了，他们没有问题。"] = "Everything is clear. Those living there are a group of orphans. I have already checked them with spirit vision, and they have no problems.",
	["都搬去了哪里？"] = "Where did they all move to?",
	["都是一群神秘学疯子，神经兮兮的。"] = "They're all a bunch of occult madmen, acting all neurotic.",
	["都是为了大家嘛。"] = "It's all for the sake of everyone.",
	["都是为了研究霍纳奇斯遗迹的秘密。"] = "It's all for researching the secrets of the Hornacis ruins.",
	["都是之前的人留下的。"] = "They were all left behind by the people before.",
	["都是些过期的报纸，可以用物品交换，也可以随便给几便士。"] = "These are all expired newspapers; you can trade them for items, or just give a few pence.",
	["都是今天早上新鲜出炉的面包，您要来点吗？"] = "It's all bread freshly baked this morning. Would you like some?",
	["都是你的错，都是你的错！我杀了你！"] = "It's all your fault, it's all your fault! I'll kill you!",
	["都是可怜的人啊，被无常的命运反复捉弄。我常跟丈夫说，如果我们当年也投资无烟煤，也不会在这卖香料了。"] = "They are all pitiful people, repeatedly toyed with by fickle fate. I often tell my husband that if we had invested in anthracite back then, we wouldn't be selling spices here now.",
	["都是廷根本地蔬菜，当季的蔬菜。"] = "These are all local Tingen vegetables, seasonal vegetables.",
	["都是很好的风景。"] = "Both are beautiful views.",
	["都是我不好"] = "It's all my fault",
	["都是新鲜的花，大家快来看一看，廷根人不骗廷根人！"] = "They are all fresh flowers, come and take a look, everyone. Tingen people don't lie to Tingen people!",
	["都是新鲜的花，大家看一看，廷根人不骗廷根人！"] = "These are all fresh flowers, take a look, Tingen people don't lie to Tingen people!",
	["都是研究死亡和灵魂的书……难道，丈夫去世之后，芙拉女士就把神秘学当成了救命稻草？"] = "They are all books about death and the soul... Could it be that after her husband passed away, Ms. Fula turned to mysticism as a lifeline?",
	["都是给邓恩队长的生日祝福，他是一位被敬爱着的队长。"] = "They are all birthday wishes for Captain Dunn. He was a captain who was deeply loved.",
	["都是自家种的蔬菜，沿着我身后的路直走，就是我家的菜地！"] = "All these vegetables are homegrown. Just walk straight down the path behind me, and that's my vegetable patch!",
	["都是铁十字街那个女人害的！她把生意全抢走了！"] = "It's all that woman on Iron Cross Street's fault! She stole all the business!",
	["都是面具，看了也认不出来，不如不看。"] = "They're all masks; you wouldn't recognize them even if you looked, so it's better not to.",
	["都有什么"] = "What do you have?",
	["都有什么效果？"] = "Quais são os efeitos?",
	["都有哪的？"] = "Where are they from?",
	["都来瞧一瞧看一看！"] = "Come take a look, everyone!",
	["都来瞧瞧，蔬菜便宜卖，铁十字最新鲜最便宜的蔬菜呐！"] = "Come and take a look, vegetables for sale, cheap! The freshest and cheapest vegetables in Iron Cross Street!",
	["都没了……"] = "It's all gone...",
	["都看过来！"] = "Look over here!",
	["都给你！发完这些蛋糕我就可以下班啦！"] = "Take them all! I can get off work after handing out these cakes!",
	["都能算什么"] = "What can you divine?",
	["都要接受招生考试的毒打！每一个！\n        我要打造一个干净温馨、整洁明亮，处处是诗歌，家家有花草的首都特里尔。\n        但永恒烈阳教会那群家伙是傻子吗？\n        我保护贸易与推行新法的目的之一，就是为了与他们和解啊！和气生财的道理懂不懂？要追究谋权篡位的事到什么时候，他们果然是被太阳烤坏了脑袋——该死，有点想念故乡的烤脑花了。"] = "everyone must receive the beating of entrance exams! Everyone! \n I want to build a clean, warm, tidy, and bright capital, Trier, where there is poetry everywhere and flowers and plants in every home. \n But are those guys in the Church of the Eternal Blazing Sun idiots? \n One of my purposes for protecting trade and promoting new laws was to reconcile with them! Don't they understand the principle that harmony brings wealth? How long are they going to pursue the matter of usurping the throne? They really have had their brains baked by the sun—damn, I kind of miss the grilled brains from my hometown.",
	["都讲讲，老兄，你知道我喜欢听故事。"] = "Tell me both, buddy, you know I like listening to stories.",
	["都说书里少了几章，缺了几张图片，真是奇怪……"] = "They say a few chapters are missing from the book, and a few pictures are gone, how strange...",
	["都说了别过去。"] = "I said don't go over there.",
	["都说了是我一个朋友"] = "I said it's a friend of mine",
	["都说了租房子找我同事弗里斯！他热爱，他积极！"] = "I already said, find my colleague Fries to rent a house! He is passionate, he is proactive!",
	["都说了这是高贵的……好吧，没错，我是在利用序列能力完成一些委托。"] = "I already said this is noble... Alright, fine, yes, I am using Sequence abilities to complete some commissions.",
	["都说了这里没有你要找的人！快走快走！"] = "I've already told you, the person you're looking for isn't here! Go away, go away!",
	["都走开！坏蛋们！这可不是对待淑女的方式！"] = "Go away! You villains! This is no way to treat a lady!",
	["都过来瞧一瞧，蔬菜便宜卖了，铁十字最新鲜最便宜的蔬菜呐！"] = "Come and take a look! Vegetables for sale, cheap! The freshest and cheapest vegetables in Iron Cross!",
