	["酒吧里有狗拿耗子比赛，我想卖点钱。"] = "There's a rat-catching competition at the bar, I want to make some money.",
	["酒喝到自己嘴里，才知道是什么味道。别人的描述，都是多余的。"] = "You only know what the wine tastes like once it's in your own mouth. Anyone else's description is just superfluous.",
