	["酒窖里珍藏着各国名酒六百余瓶，侍酒师会根据您的菜品推荐最合适的佳酿。"] = "The wine cellar houses over six hundred bottles of fine wines from various countries, and the sommelier will recommend the most suitable vintage based on your meal.",
	["酒类"] = "Alcohol",
	["酒类售价："] = "Alcohol Sale Price:",
	["酒红逐猎"] = "Wine-Red Hunt",
	["酒舍专家"] = "Tavern Expert",
	["酒舍大师"] = "Tavern Master",
	["酒舍新手"] = "Tavern Novice",
	["酒舍物产"] = "Tavern Products",
	["酒贩子收它干什么呢？"] = "What do the liquor peddlers want with that?",
	["酒醒了？醒了就快跟我走，看我以后还让不让你喝！"] = "Sobered up? If you're awake, come with me now. Let's see if I let you drink ever again!",
	["酒馆争霸任务"] = "Tavern Hegemony Quest",
	["酒馆公告"] = "Tavern Notice",
	["酒馆小广场也值得一逛，不仅仅是那一圈的食物都十分美味，还有乐队表演呢！顺带一提，如果有机会，你可以去角落里那家店看看。他们家可真是……"] = "The tavern square is also worth a visit, not only is the food around there delicious, but there are also band performances! By the way, if you have the chance, you can check out that shop in the corner. Their place is really...",
	["酒馆激情之夜"] = "Tavern passionate night",
	["酒馆盈利与否和酒馆能否在城市立足，根本不一样！"] = "Whether a tavern is profitable and whether it can establish itself in the city are two completely different things!",
	["酒馆老板"] = "Pub Owner",
	["酒馆靠窗的老客，总把没喝完的麦酒偷偷倒给门口的野猫。"] = "The regular customer by the pub window always secretly pours his unfinished ale for the stray cat at the door.",
	["酒馆？"] = "Pub?",
	["酒鬼"] = "Drunkard",
	["酒鬼1"] = "Drunkard 1",
	["酒鬼2"] = "Drunkard 2",
	["酒鬼3"] = "Drunkard 3",
	["酒鬼，要有酒……要喝酒……想喝了……"] = "Drunkard, need booze... need to drink... want to drink...",
	["酒，酒……哪里还有冰镇的酒？"] = "Beer, beer... where is there more chilled beer?",
	["酗酒的村民"] = "Drunken villager",
	["酣战已久，所有人的攻击力大幅提升！"] = "After a long battle, everyone's attack power has increased significantly!",
	["酬酢之愿"] = "Wish of Exchange",
	["酬酢之愿-子buff"] = "Wish of Exchange - Sub-buff",
	["酬金1"] = "Remuneration 1",
	["酬金2"] = "Remuneration 2",
	["酬金一共200镑，按照队长的规定，一半属于额外经费，一半给你和伦纳德，而你不是正式队员，只能拿到那一半的百分之十。"] = "The total reward is 200 pounds. According to the captain's rules, half goes to extra funds, and half goes to you and Leonard. Since you are not a formal member, you only get ten percent of that half.",
