	["采用位掩码如下，例：需要同时监听添加buff（1）和buff重置时间（64），可以填1+64=65\n    AddBuff = 1, -- 添加BUFF\n    RemoveBuff = 2, -- 移除BUFF\n    AddLayer = 4, -- 叠加BUFF层级\n    RemoveLayer = 8, -- 移除BUFF层级\n    AddLevel = 16, -- BUFF增加等级\n    RemoveLevel = 32, -- BUFF减少等级\n    ResetTime = 64, -- 重置时间\n    ResetMaxLayer = 128, -- 重置最大层数\n    ResetInstigatorID = 256, -- 刷新始作俑者"] = "Use bitmask as follows, e.g.: To listen for both adding buff (1) and buff reset time (64), you can fill 1+64=65 \n AddBuff = 1, -- Add BUFF \n RemoveBuff = 2, -- Remove BUFF \n AddLayer = 4, -- Add BUFF layer \n RemoveLayer = 8, -- Remove BUFF layer \n AddLevel = 16, -- Add BUFF level \n RemoveLevel = 32, -- Remove BUFF level \n ResetTime = 64, -- Reset time \n ResetMaxLayer = 128, -- Reset max layer \n ResetInstigatorID = 256, -- Refresh instigator",
