	["采集指定TemplateID的采集物  玩家根据InstanceID列表创建公有对象（大世界不生效）  玩家发送任务道具  "] = "Collect the specified TemplateID item. Player creates public objects based on the InstanceID list (does not take effect in the open world). Player sends quest item.",
	["采集指定TemplateID的采集物  玩家根据InstanceID列表创建公有对象（大世界不生效）  玩家变身开始  玩家创建公有集团（大世界不生效）  玩家根据InstanceID列表创建公有对象（大世界不生效）  "] = "Gather the specified TemplateID collection item; player creates public object based on InstanceID list (does not take effect in the open world); player transformation begins; player creates public group (does not take effect in the open world); player creates public object based on InstanceID list (does not take effect in the open world).",
	["采集指定TemplateID的采集物  玩家根据InstanceID列表创建公有对象（大世界不生效）  玩家变身开始  玩家变身结束  "] = "Gather the specified TemplateID collection item; player creates public object based on InstanceID list (does not take effect in the open world); player transformation begins; player transformation ends.",
	["采集指定TemplateID的采集物  玩家根据InstanceID列表创建公有对象（大世界不生效）  玩家播放主线任务开始展示界面  "] = "Collect the specified TemplateID item. Player creates public objects based on the InstanceID list (does not take effect in the open world). Player plays the main quest start display interface.",
	["采集指定TemplateID的采集物  玩家根据InstanceID列表创建公有对象（大世界不生效）  玩家根据InstanceID列表创建公有对象（大世界不生效）  "] = "Gather collection item with specified TemplateID  Player creates public objects based on InstanceID list (does not take effect in open world)  Player creates public objects based on InstanceID list (does not take effect in open world)  ",
	["采集指定TemplateID的采集物  玩家根据InstanceID列表创建公有对象（大世界不生效）  玩家根据InstanceID列表创建公有对象（大世界不生效）  NPC销毁自身（无法销毁玩家和大世界的公有NPC）  玩家跨场景传送到指定Trigger  "] = "Collect the specified TemplateID item. Player creates public objects based on the InstanceID list (does not take effect in the open world). Player creates public objects based on the InstanceID list (does not take effect in the open world). NPC destroys itself (cannot destroy players or public NPCs in the open world). Player teleports across scenes to the specified Trigger.",
	["采集指定TemplateID的采集物  玩家根据InstanceID列表创建公有对象（大世界不生效）  玩家根据InstanceID列表创建公有对象（大世界不生效）  玩家根据InstanceID列表创建公有对象（大世界不生效）  "] = "Gather collection item with specified TemplateID  Player creates public objects based on InstanceID list (does not take effect in open world)  Player creates public objects based on InstanceID list (does not take effect in open world)  Player creates public objects based on InstanceID list (does not take effect in open world)  ",
	["采集指定TemplateID的采集物  玩家根据InstanceID列表创建公有对象（大世界不生效）  玩家跨场景传送到指定Trigger  "] = "Collect the specified TemplateID item. Player creates public objects based on the InstanceID list (does not take effect in the open world). Player teleports across scenes to the specified Trigger.",
	["采集指定TemplateID的采集物  玩家根据InstanceID列表创建私有对象  "] = "Collect the specified TemplateID collection item, player creates private objects based on the InstanceID list",
	["采集指定TemplateID的采集物  玩家移除任务道具（全部删除）  "] = "Collect the specified TemplateID collection item. Player removes quest item (delete all).",
	["采集指定TemplateID的采集物  玩家移除任务道具（全部删除）  玩家播放仅自己可见的说话文本  延迟执行  玩家播放仅自己可见的说话文本  "] = "Gather the specified TemplateID collection item; player removes quest item (delete all); player plays speech text visible only to themselves; delayed execution; player plays speech text visible only to themselves.",
