	["里昂"] = "Leon",
	["里昂太太"] = "Mrs. Lyon",
	["里特恩"] = "Retornar",
	["里间的情况"] = "Situation in the Inner Room",
	["里面到底在干什么……听起来不太正常。"] = "What on earth are they doing in there... It doesn't sound normal.",
	["里面有四个人 其中一个气场矮小 应该是艾略特 另外三个是绑匪"] = "There are four people inside. One of them has a small presence; it should be Elliot. The other three are kidnappers.",
	["里面有四个人，其中一个气场矮小应该是艾略特，另外三个是绑匪。"] = "There are four people inside, one of whom has a small aura, which should be Elliot, and the other three are kidnappers.",
	["里面有声响！应该就是这个了。"] = "There's a sound inside! This must be it.",
	["里面水很深，你懂我意思吧？"] = "The water is very deep in there, you know what I mean?",
	["里面没有人，也没有魔法的灵光。"] = "There's no one inside, and no magical aura.",
	["里面还有各种高密级的文献典籍副本，阅读需要一定的权限。另外，在查尼斯门的底层，还保管着一些封印物。"] = "Inside, there are also copies of various high-security documents and classics; reading them requires certain clearance. Additionally, some Sealed Artifacts are kept at the bottom level of the Chanis Gate.",
	["里面还有各种高密级的文献典籍副本，阅读需要一定的权限。另外，在查尼斯门的底层，还保管着一些封印物。 "] = "There are also copies of various high-level documents and classics inside, and reading them requires a certain level of authority. In addition, some Sealed Artifacts are kept at the bottom of Chanis Gate.",
