	["重塑"] = "Remolding",
	["重塑<Highlight>%d</>次后，必定出现<Highlight>3非凡词条恩赐</>"] = "After reshaping <Highlight>%d</> times, a <Highlight>3 Beyonder entry gift is guaranteed </>",
	["重塑可以随机当前装备的词条，获得新的非凡词条、普通词条或污染词条。达到2个或以上的非凡词条时，还会触发恩赐效果。"] = "Reshaping can randomize the current equipment's affixes, obtaining new Beyonder affixes, common affixes, or corruption affixes. When you reach 2 or more Beyonder affixes, a Gift effect will be triggered.",
	["重塑怎么玩"] = "How does reshaping work?",
