	["重置当前选中气息等级可获得此前共鸣时消耗的%d%%的封印裂片，以及%d%%的绑定苏勒。本次重置将返还%d个封印裂片和%d绑定苏勒"] = "Resetting the currently selected aura level will return the %d%% of Sealed Fragments consumed during previous Resonance, as well as the %d%% of bound Sols. This reset will return %d Sealed Fragments and %d bound Sols.",
