	["重试"] = "Retry",
	["重踏前方，造成<HighLight>260%</>攻击伤害并击退；自身获得<HighLight>20%</>伤害减免，持续4秒。"] = "Stomp forward, dealing <HighLight>260%</> attack damage and knocking back; self gains <HighLight>20%</> Damage Reduction, lasting 4 seconds.",
