	["重返幽暗城堡，在信徒与护卫的低语中，为庄园主人带来最终审判。"] = "Return to the gloomy castle and, amidst the whispers of believers and guards, bring the final judgment to the manor owner.",
	["重返异变花园，在猎犬与铠甲的注视下，为管家的执念谱写终章。"] = "Return to the mutated garden and, under the gaze of the hounds and armor, write the final chapter for the butler's obsession.",
	["重返青春，焕然一新！怎么样，不管用不用得上都能买点哦。"] = "Return to their youth and feel brand new! How about it? You can buy some whether you need it or not.",
