	["金色的好看，但银色的更便宜些……我刚领的薪水也只够买银色的。"] = "The gold one looks nice, but the silver one is cheaper... My salary is only enough for the silver one.",
	["金色的好看，但银色的更便宜些……我刚领的薪水好像只够买银色的。"] = "The gold one looks good, but the silver one is cheaper... my recent salary seems to only be enough for the silver one.",
