	["针刺"] = "Needlework",
	["针对污秽与堕落之物锻造的子弹。\n能在适当时机击穿灵性防御，让疯狂的邪物露出真实的脆弱。"] = "Bullets forged specifically for filthy and corrupted things.\n Can pierce spiritual defense at the right moment, exposing the true fragility of insane evil entities.",
	["针对污秽与堕落之物锻造的子弹。在怪物释放蓝圈技能时命中，将击穿灵性防御，打断怪物技能，造成怪物硬直并扣除其大量破防值。"] = "Bullets forged specifically for filthy and corrupted things. If they hit while the monster is releasing a blue-circle skill, they will pierce the spiritual defense, interrupt the monster's skill, cause the monster to stagger, and deplete a large amount of its Armor Break value.",
	["钉刺"] = "Spike",
	["钉子总往软木头里钻……"] = "The nail always drills into the soft wood...",
