	["铁与火凝练的红色宝石镶嵌其间，这是一道尚未展开的庇护，正在等待它唯一的主人。"] = "A red gemstone forged from iron and fire is embedded within; this is an un-unfolded shelter, waiting for its only master.",
	["铁与血之歌"] = "Song of Iron and Blood",
	["铁与血的征伐从未终结，历史沙盘等待着新的主宰——入局吧，征服者。"] = "The crusade of iron and blood never ends; the historical sandbox awaits a new master—enter the game, Conqueror.",
