	["铁十字街平价钟表行"] = "Iron Cross Street Affordable Clock and Watch Shop",
	["铁十字街平价钟表行\n\n“时间属于每个人“\n全廷根<Mark id=\"#159_R\">最低价</>！现金交易，赊账利息另计。\n修理概不退换，开盖即认可报价！"] = "Iron Cross Street Affordable Clock Shop \n\n \"Time belongs to everyone\" \n Lowest price in all of Tingen <Mark id=\"#159_R\">! Cash transactions, credit interest calculated separately. </> No refunds for repairs, opening the cover constitutes acceptance of the quote! \n",
	["铁十字街平价钟表行广告"] = "Iron Cross Street affordable clock shop advertisement",
