	["铁路上冉冉升起的新星，时刻准备带来更加亮眼的成绩。参与铁路大亨玩法，获得周排行榜第11~50名。"] = "A rising star on the railway, always ready to bring more brilliant results. Participate in Railway Tycoon and win 11th-50th place in the weekly ranking.",
	["铁路之旅还将延续"] = "The railway journey will continue",
	["铁路先锋"] = "Railway Pioneer",
	["铁路大亨"] = "Railway Tycoon",
	["铁路大亨-交易技巧"] = "Railroad Tycoon - Trading Tips",
