	["铁路大亨-玩法内货币"] = "Rail Tycoon - In-game currency",
	["铁路大亨-策略卡与路线"] = "Railroad Tycoon - Strategy Cards and Routes",
	["铁路大亨-经销协议"] = "Railroad Tycoon - Distribution Agreement",
	["铁路大亨-进入玩法消耗的门票"] = "Railroad Tycoon - Ticket required to enter the mode.",
	["铁路大亨中出售%d/25000件酒类物品"] = "Sell %d/25,000 alcohol items in Railway Tycoon",
	["铁路大亨中赚取%d/1500000城堡资产"] = "Earn %d/1500000 castle assets in Railway Tycoon",
	["铁路大亨中，一切围绕提升自己的商会票券和货物数量展开。\n物产买卖：不同类型的站点，可购买与出售的物产各不相同。合理规划时机，低买高卖，尽量避免物产滞留，可获得更高收益。\n策略卡：策略卡可提供多种增益。结合当前站点信息，判断下一站类型，使用合适的策略卡，能进一步提升本局收益。"] = "In Railway Tycoon, everything revolves around increasing your Chamber Tickets and cargo quantity. \n Trading Goods: Different types of stations offer different goods for purchase and sale. Plan your timing wisely, buy low and sell high, and try to avoid letting goods sit idle to maximize your profits. \n Strategy Cards: Strategy cards provide various buffs. Combine them with current station information to judge the type of the next station and use the appropriate strategy card to further increase your profits for the current round.",
	["铁路大亨买什么卖什么"] = "What to buy and sell in Railway Tycoon",
	["铁路大亨任务"] = "Railroad Tycoon Quest.",
