	["铁路大亨玩法中，商会认可的一种等价物，以票券的形式发放。"] = "An equivalent recognized by the Chamber of Commerce in the Railway Tycoon gameplay, issued in the form of vouchers.",
	["铁路大亨的目标就是达成业绩，业绩由票券和货物组成"] = "The goal of Railway Tycoon is to achieve performance, which consists of tickets and goods.",
