	["铁路新秀"] = "Railway Rookie",
	["铁路是城市的勋章，我只是这枚勋章的一部分，廷根火车站应该包括每一位廷根市民的名字。"] = "The railway is the city's medal; I am just a part of this medal, and Tingen Train Station should include the name of every Tingen citizen.",
	["铁路管理员"] = "Railway Administrator",
