	["铜镜"] = "Bronze Mirror",
	["铜镜1"] = "Bronze Mirror 1",
	["铜镜2"] = "Bronze Mirror 2",
	["铜镜上有刺客途径的魔法\r\n可以会使携带者隐入阴影\r\n也许还是打开“镜中国度”的钥匙"] = "The copper mirror possesses magic from the Assassin pathway. It may allow the bearer to fade into shadows. Perhaps it is also the key to opening the \"Mirror Realm\".",
	["铜镜上有刺客途径的魔法，会让携带者隐入阴影，还是打开隐藏空间的钥匙。"] = "There is magic from the Assassin pathway on the copper mirror, which allows the carrier to hide in the shadows and is also the key to opening the hidden space.",
	["铜镜上有刺客途径的魔法，可以会使携带者隐入阴影，也许还是打开“镜中国度”的钥匙。"] = "The bronze mirror is imbued with magic from the Assassin Pathway, which can cause the carrier to fade into the shadows. It might also be the key to opening the \"Mirror Realm\".",
	["铜镜吞噬"] = "Bronze mirror devours",
	["铜镜来源"] = "Origin of the bronze mirror",
	["铜镜来源于罗塞尔戏剧节签名活动的赠品\r\n也可能有其他来源途径\r\n市民应该很容易获取"] = "The copper mirror originated from a giveaway at the Roselle Drama Festival. It could also have other sources. It should be quite easy for citizens to obtain.",
	["铜镜模型"] = "Bronze mirror model",
	["铜镜的碎片"] = "Fragment of a copper mirror",
	["铜镜的碎片……难道他们就是失踪的市民？"] = "The shards of the bronze mirror... could they be the missing citizens?",
	["铜镜的碎片，这似乎预示了持有者的混乱与死亡。"] = "Fragments of a bronze mirror, which seems to foretell the chaos and death of the holder.",
	["铜镜碎片"] = "Bronze mirror fragment",
	["铜镜能力"] = "Abilities of the bronze mirror",
	["铜镜（灵性追溯点）"] = "Bronze Mirror (Spiritual Retrospection Point)",
	["铜陵"] = "Tongling",
	["铜雕烛台"] = "Bronze Candlestick",
	["铜齿怀表"] = "Copper Gear Pocket Watch",
	["铠甲"] = "Armadura",
	["铠甲有个名字，伊桑。\n主人死的时候，它动了一下，向在场所有人行了一个骑士礼。 它守着这个家族，守了很久很久。 刀剑劈在它身上留下过无数道痕，它从未后退过一步。\n有人念了咒语唤醒它，它拔出了剑。 但剑没有指向敌人。\n它不知道自己为什么这样做，■■■■的影响已经渗入了它继承的非凡特性， 谁都难以察觉。\n但有一件事到最后也没有改变—— 它从未停止战斗。"] = "The armor has a name: Ethan. \n When its master died, it moved once and performed a knight's salute to everyone present. It guarded this family for a very, very long time. Countless sword strikes left marks on it, but it never took a single step back. \n Someone chanted a spell to awaken it, and it drew its sword. But the sword was not pointed at the enemy. \n It does not know why it did this; the influence of ■■■■ has seeped into the Beyonder characteristic it inherited, which is hard for anyone to notice. \n But one thing never changed until the end—it never stopped fighting.",
	["铠甲残灵"] = "Armor Spirit Fragment",
	["铭之罚"] = "Penalty of Inscription",
	["铭刻之荣"] = "Glory of Inscription",
	["铭刻之途"] = "Path of Inscription",
