	["银白发，眼瞳灰蓝，面容清冷疏离"] = "Silver-white hair, grayish-blue eyes, cold and aloof face",
	["银白指环套住身躯与灵魂，将一切誓言凝固为永恒。"] = "The silver-white ring encircles the body and soul, solidifying all vows into eternity.",
