	["银蔷薇"] = "Silver Rose",
	["银行家麦格文先生，护送着小儿子韦尔奇的尸体返回了康斯顿城，即将举行一场隆重的葬礼……"] = "Mr. McGovern the banker has returned to Coniston with the body of his youngest son, Welch, and a grand funeral is about to be held...",
