	["铸造大师急需稀有金属"] = "Master blacksmith is in urgent need of rare metal",
	["铸造成功"] = "Forjamento bem-sucedido",
	["铸造神话品质胸针（冒险）的关键材料。以64/66/68装等橙色品质胸针（冒险）为基础，消耗15/25/35个灰雾尘埃，可将胸针铸造为神话品质，并附加神话词条。铸造后可进行还原，退还装备和材料。"] = "Key material for forging Mythical quality brooches (Adventure). Based on orange quality brooches (Adventure) with gear level 64/66/68, consuming 15/25/35 Gray Fog Dust can forge the brooch into Mythical quality and add a Mythical affix. After forging, it can be restored, returning the equipment and materials.",
	["铸造神话品质胸针（竞技）的关键材料。以64/66/68装等橙色品质胸针（竞技）为基础，消耗15/25/35个灰雾晶砾，可将胸针铸造为神话品质，并附加神话词条。铸造后可进行还原，退还装备和材料。"] = "Key material for forging Mythical quality brooches (Competition). Based on orange quality brooches (Competition) with gear level 64/66/68, consuming 15/25/35 Gray Fog Crystals can forge the brooch into Mythical quality and add a Mythical affix. After forging, it can be restored, returning the equipment and materials.",
	["铸铁汤锅"] = "Cast Iron Soup Pot",
	["链子"] = "Chain",
	["链式攻击"] = "Chain attack.",
	["链接期间持续施加67%重伤。"] = "Continuously applies 67% Grievous Injury during the link.",
	["链接自身和队友，共享生命值百分比，当双方生命值低于15%时，链接中断，各自回复30%生命值，仅生效1次。"] = "Link yourself and a teammate to share Health percentage. When both parties' Health falls below 15%, the link breaks, and both recover 30% Health. This effect only triggers once.",
	["链接自身和队友，受到伤害或治疗时共享生命值百分比，当双方生命值低于15%时，链接中断，各自回复30%生命值，仅生效1次。"] = "Link yourself and a teammate, sharing Health percentage when receiving damage or healing. When both parties' Health is below 15%, the link is broken, and both recover 30% Health, effective only once.",
