	["长期与灵界相通的古井水，带有未知风险。"] = "Ancient well water that has been connected to the Spirit World for a long time, carrying unknown risks.",
	["长期接触与收集诸多的“异象之物”，无形中拓展了你灵性感知的边界。当你主动探寻隐秘时，你的目光能抵达更遥远的角落。<Talent>【灵视】 探查范围永久性+10米</>。"] = "Long-term contact with and collection of many \"Objects of Phenomenon\" has invisibly expanded the boundaries of your spiritual perception. When you actively explore secrets, your gaze can reach more distant corners. <Talent>【spirit vision】 Exploration range permanently +10 meters</>.",
	["长期暴露在强光环境下形成的矿石，内部蕴含微弱但稳定的光辉灵性。"] = "Ore formed by long-term exposure to strong light environments, containing faint but stable radiant spirituality inside.",
