	["阁下 这里是哪里？"] = "Your Excellency, where is this?",
	["阁下……如果您愿意，可以将它卖给南边的造纸厂，这样不需要给垃圾大王中转费。"] = "My lord... if you are willing, you can sell it to the paper mill in the south, so you don't have to pay the middleman fee to the Trash King.",
