	["防御形态6人有天赋"] = "Defense Form 6 People With Talent",
	["防御形态下，<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061080\" color=\"#f4a067\">怒意猛击</>释放每一段时都增加怪物专防并回复生命值。释放技能时每消耗1/2枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>，怪物专防额外提升15%/30%，回复效果量额外提升20%/50%。"] = "In Defense Form, each stage of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061080\" color=\"#f4a067\">Angry Slam</> increases monster-specific defense and restores health. Consuming 1/2 <HighLight>Dusk Marks</> when releasing the skill increases monster-specific defense by an additional 15%/30% and increases the healing effect by an additional 20%/50%.",
	["防御形态下，<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061080\" color=\"#f4a067\">怒意猛击</>释放每一段时都增加怪物专防并回复生命值。释放技能时每消耗1/2枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>，怪物专防额外提升15%/30%，回复效果量额外提升20%/50%。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061023\" color=\"#f4a067\">王庭号令</>技能对命中的敌方目标造成攻击力降低15%，持续5秒。"] = "In Defense Form, each stage of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061080\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Angry Slam </> increases Monster Special Defense and restores health. Consuming 1/2 <HighLight> Twilight Marks </> when casting the skill increases Monster Special Defense by an additional 15%/30% and restoration by 20%/50%. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061023\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Royal Court Command </> reduces the target's Attack by 15% for 5 seconds.",
	["防御形态下，<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86065010\" color=\"#f4a067\">武器大师</>的被动减伤效果提升至30%。"] = "In Defense Form, the passive damage reduction of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86065010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Weapon Master</> is increased to 30%.",
	["防御形态下，<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86065010\" color=\"#f4a067\">武器大师</>的被动减伤效果提升至30%。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061060\" color=\"#f4a067\">守护坚壁</>获得新的分支<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061063\" color=\"#f4a067\">守护壁垒</>：展开领域，为周围30米范围内生命值最低的两个友方加上高额护盾和15%的减伤，护盾值根据消耗的<HighLight>黄昏印记</>数增加。"] = "In Defense Form, the passive Damage Reduction of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86065010\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Weapon Master </> is increased to 30%. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061060\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Guardian Wall </> gains the new branch <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061063\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Guardian Rampart </>: Deploys a field that grants a high-value shield and 15% Damage Reduction to the two allies with the lowest health within 30 meters. Shield value increases based on the number of <HighLight> Twilight Marks </> consumed.",
