	["阿诺德……<P_Yellow>卡萝</>队长的儿子，我不会忘记的。"] = "Arnold... <P_Yellow> Carol </> Captain's son, I won't forget that.",
	["阿诺德之前没有受到笛子的影响，但这次却被引诱了……"] = "Arnold wasn't affected by the flute before, but this time he was lured...",
