	["阿诺德捧花移动"] = "Arnold Bouquet Movement",
	["阿诺德提到过会有鸟儿找他玩，或许真的是因为夜莺银哨影响到了廷根的鸟儿们，让它们去保护阿诺德。"] = "Arnold mentioned that birds would come to play with him. Perhaps it really is because the Silver Nightingale Whistle is affecting the birds in Tingen, making them go protect Arnold.",
