	["限时时装已过期，当前已脱下该套装"] = "The limited-time outfit has expired, and the set has been unequipped.",
	["限时活动可获得幸运大奖<Highlight>零元购凭证</>，可<Highlight>免费兑换任意商场直售外观</>。参与疯抢之夜事件，有概率获得城市暗面惊喜宝箱。这里没有规则，只有满地灵性和比你更疯的人。"] = "Limited-time event to get the lucky grand prize <Highlight> Zero-Yuan Purchase Voucher </>, which can be used to <Highlight> redeem any direct-sale appearance in the mall for free </>. Participate in the Night of Frenzied Grabbing event for a chance to get a surprise chest from the dark side of the city. There are no rules here, only spirituality everywhere and people crazier than you.",
	["限时玩法中无法进行脱卡操作，请放弃重置玩法或退出场景。"] = "Cannot perform unstuck operations during limited-time gameplay; please abandon the quest, reset the gameplay, or exit the scene.",
