	["陛……陛下？"] = "Your... Your Majesty?",
	["陛下，你已经如此完美了……但您的请求，我都会为您完成，我将为您召唤神秘之镜——"] = "Your Majesty, you are already so perfect... But I will fulfill all your requests. I will summon the Mirror of Mystery for you—",
	["陛下，您来得比我预想的要快。"] = "Your Majesty, you arrived faster than I expected.",
	["陛下，您难得便装出巡，是这次的艺术展览不合心意吗？"] = "Your Majesty, it's rare for you to be out in plain clothes. Is the art exhibition not to your liking this time?",
	["陛下，您需要提提神吗？这里有一瓶醒神花露。"] = "Your Majesty, do you need to refresh yourself? Here is a bottle of Refreshing Flower Dew.",
	["陛下？"] = "Your Majesty?",
	["陛下？你在叫我？"] = "Your Majesty? Are you calling me?",
	["陛下？你在叫我？ "] = "Your Majesty? Are you calling me?",
	["院子伦纳德"] = "Courtyard Leonard",
	["院子邓恩"] = "Courtyard Dunn",
	["院规"] = "House Rules",
	["院长……"] = "Dean...",
	["院长办公室"] = "Dean's Office",
	["院长好！"] = "Hello, Dean!",
	["院长离开"] = "Dean Leaves",
	["院长贝尔纳黛邀请塔罗会的“太阳”先生戴里克·伯格，牺牲的白银城首席的科林.伊利亚特加入塔罗学院，以历史投影的形式担当学院导师，教导学员。"] = "Dean Bernadette invited Mr. Sun, Derrick Berg of the Tarot Club, and the late Chief of the City of Silver, Colin Iliad, to join the Tarot Academy. They serve as academy mentors in the form of historical projections to teach the students.",
	["院长！"] = "Dean!",
	["院长，我们需要对这里进行特别调查，可以请你们离开一下吗？"] = "Dean, we need to conduct a special investigation here. Could you please step away for a moment?",
	["除了…… 没有……的话语"] = "Except for... there is no... speech.",
	["除了一种淡淡的果酸味。"] = "Except for a faint, fruity, acidic scent.",
	["除了你，我没见过其他工厂主愿意为他们提供一份免费的饭。"] = "Except for you, I've never seen another factory owner willing to provide them with a free meal.",
	["除了值班和外出处理事件，弗莱队长会一直在办公室里。"] = "Except for being on duty and going out to handle incidents, Captain Frye will always be in the Office.",
	["除了刚刚克莱恩提到的惨案，这里有份调查报告。"] = "Besides the tragedy Klein just mentioned, here is an investigation report.",
	["除了卡尔和托尼，还有安迪、鲍伯、凯尔、迪伦。"] = "Besides Karl and Tony, there are Andy, Bob, Kyle, and Dylan.",
	["除了喝酒就是打牌，你血的滋味也不怎么样啊。"] = "Other than drinking and playing cards, your blood doesn't taste that great either.",
	["除了基本的周薪之外，我们还有保密和风险补贴。"] = "In addition to the basic weekly salary, we also have confidentiality and risk subsidies.",
	["除了奥利安娜太太以外，你是第二个欣赏这本杂志的人！相当有品位！"] = "Besides Mrs. Orianna, you are the second person to appreciate this magazine! You have quite the taste!",
	["除了奥利安娜太太以外，你是第二个欣赏这本杂志的人！相当有品味！"] = "Except for Mrs. Orianna, you are the second person to appreciate this magazine! Very tasteful!",
	["除了封印物，你们还需要一点奇迹。"] = "Besides the Sealed Artifact, you also need a little bit of hope.",
	["除了左侧的本期大奖以外，以下为当前外观奖池的其他奖励"] = "In addition to the grand prize on the left, the following are other rewards in the current appearance prize pool",
	["除了我们，好像还有其他人在找他。"] = "Besides us, it seems there are others looking for him.",
	["除了报纸，还有罗塞尔大帝的海报、明信片和邮票。"] = "Besides newspapers, there are also posters, postcards, and stamps of Emperor Roselle.",
	["除了挑剔的房东，应该还有其他不便利的因素吧。"] = "Besides the picky landlord, there should be other inconvenient factors, right?",
	["除了有个死人，这里一切正常……"] = "Other than a dead body, everything here is normal...",
	["除了精酿酒舍以外，您还可以尝试建造不同种类的工坊，用以满足不同订单的需求。"] = "Besides the craft brewery, you can also try building different types of workshops to meet the needs of various orders.",
	["除了货物以外，我们需要关注的还有很多。商品陈列，建筑设计……"] = "Besides goods, there is much more we need to pay attention to. Product display, architectural design...",
	["除了这两页，其他的字迹都不是很清楚了。"] = "Except for these two pages, the rest of the handwriting is not very clear.",
	["除了这些家伙，拉姆德小镇还是很值得一逛的，我带您走走吧。"] = "Besides these guys, Lamud Small Town is still worth a visit. Let me show you around.",
	["除了魔药配置外，魔药房还是一个药剂讨论与交流的平台，感兴趣的话你可以和这里的学员交流交流，说不定会有所收获。"] = "In addition to potion preparation, the Potion Room is also a platform for potion discussion and exchange. If you are interested, you can communicate with the students here; you might gain something.",
	["除了黑夜女神，没有别的话语"] = "Apart from the Evernight Goddess, there are no other words",
	["除你们以外，最近还有人去过廷根湖畔吗？"] = "Besides you, has anyone else been to the shores of Tingen Lake recently?",
	["除去匕首，导致黛西死亡的因素就只能是<P_Yellow>法阵</>了……"] = "Excluding the dagger, the only factor that could have caused Daisy's death is the <P_Yellow>ritual array</>...",
	["除去奇怪的法阵，地面还算干净。嗯？床下有很多杂物，布满厚厚的灰尘。"] = "Aside from the strange magic circle, the floor is quite clean. Hmm? There is a lot of clutter under the bed, covered in thick dust.",
	["除此之外，他们也会获得一些身体素质上的提升，能忍耐寒冷、腐烂和死亡气息的侵蚀。"] = "In addition, they will also gain some improvements in physical fitness, able to endure the erosion of cold, rot, and the aura of death.",
	["除此之外，谁还有机会杀害男爵？"] = "Besides them, who else would have the opportunity to kill the Baron?",
	["除非你在我放那个强控的时候的身上有霸体"] = "Unless you have Super Armor when I use that hard crowd-control ability.",
	["陨星水晶"] = "Meteorite crystal",
