	["陶瓷盆托在木制柜架之上，配色结构透露着古典气息，既实用又装饰性十足。"] = "A ceramic basin supported on a wooden cabinet frame, its color scheme and structure revealing a classical atmosphere, being both practical and highly decorative.",
