	["随时乐意为您效劳，这是我的名片。"] = "Always happy to be of service. This is my business card.",
	["随时可以将固定灵质空间内已记录的词条和身上已穿戴装备的固定灵质词条进行<Highlight>置换</>，此操作<Highlight>无任何消耗</>。\n装备上的固定灵质词条<Highlight>类型唯一</>，即不能同时拥有两条及以上的相同属性类型的词条。\n当装备的品级过低时，有可能导致固定灵质的属性数值<Highlight>无法全部生效（不影响空间记录值）</>。"] = "You can <Highlight>swap</> the entries recorded in the fixed spiritual space with the fixed spiritual entries of the equipment you are currently wearing at any time. This operation <Highlight>has no cost</>. \nThe fixed spiritual entries on equipment are <Highlight>unique in type</>, meaning you cannot possess two or more entries of the same attribute type at the same time. \nWhen the equipment grade is too low, it may cause the attribute values of the fixed spirituality <Highlight>to not fully take effect (this does not affect the space record value)</>.",
