	["障碍道具"] = "Obstacle Prop",
	["隶属于“黑夜教会”，廷根市值夜者小队队长、黑荆棘安保公司成员。30岁左右。调查韦尔奇和娜娅自杀案时认识克莱恩并邀请他加入值夜者小队，是克莱恩成为非凡者的引路人。最终以生命为代价启用圣遗物阻止邪神降临，保护了廷根。"] = "Affiliated with the 'Church of Evernight', captain of the Tingen Nighthawks squad and a member of the Blackthorn Security Company. Around 30 years old. He met Klein while investigating the suicide case of Welch and Naya and invited him to join the Nighthawks squad. He is the guide who led Klein to become a Beyonder. Ultimately, he sacrificed his life to activate a sealed artifact to prevent the descent of an evil god, protecting Tingen.",
	["隶属教会"] = "Affiliated Church",
	["难不成哈维私下里其实是个大富翁？"] = "Could it be that Harvey is actually a big millionaire in private?",
	["难不成我真是个天才！"] = "Could it be that I really am a genius!",
	["难不成是邓恩队长提到过的，非凡者的失控？但是，他又为什么会突然失控？"] = "Could it be what Captain Dunn mentioned, the loss of control of a Beyonder? But why would he suddenly lose control?",
	["难不成，克莱恩，你面试通过了？"] = "Could it be, Klein, that you passed the interview?",
	["难不成，就是指这个占卜家？"] = "Could it be that he is referring to this Seer?",
	["难以想象是一个刚入职的新人。"] = "Hard to imagine this is a newcomer who just joined.",
	["难以想象！从铁十字街到列车站，只要十分钟！"] = "It's unimaginable! From Iron Cross Street to the train station, it only takes ten minutes!",
	["难以相信，三次都是拼图，还都是雏菊的图案……"] = "Hard to believe, all three times it was a puzzle, and all were daisy patterns...",
	["难以置信，她们两个居然齐心协力甩了山姆，离开了廷根？"] = "Unbelievable, they actually worked together to dump Sam and left Tingen?",
	["难以置信，这已经不是好运能解释得了的吧？"] = "Unbelievable, this can't be explained by just good luck, right?",
	["难以置信，那可是莉莉！"] = "Unbelievable, that's Lily!",
	["难免的凋谢"] = "Inevitable Withering",
	["难吃到吐了"] = "Disgusting to Vomit",
	["难度"] = "Difficulty",
	["难度增加，需要更迅速地做出反应！"] = "Difficulty increased, need to react more quickly!",
	["难度说明"] = "Difficulty Instructions",
	["难度选择"] = "Difficulty Selection",
	["难得一见的比赛……"] = "A rare match...",
	["难得我们有同样的心情，老汤姆。或许，我们以后还能去更远、更舒适的城市。"] = "It's rare that we share the same sentiment, Old Tom. Perhaps we can go to an even further, more comfortable city in the future.",
	["难得有这么刺激的生意，这次免费！"] = "It's rare to have such an exciting job, this one is free!",
	["难得的假期，为什么不去廷根呢？这里有什么好？"] = "A rare vacation, why not go to Tingen? What's so good about this place?",
	["难怪。"] = "No wonder.",
	["难怪你不肯见雪莉​……士兵在战场上相遇，只有一个选择。那是无可避免的。"] = "No wonder you refuse to see Shirley... When soldiers meet on the battlefield, there is only one choice. It is unavoidable.",
	["难怪你现在这么气派！我就说嘛，你这身新马甲，料子肯定不一般。 "] = "No wonder you're so fancy now! I knew it, the material of your new vest is definitely extraordinary.",
	["难怪你这么漂亮，让所有男人都疯狂地爱上了你。"] = "No wonder you are so beautiful, making all men fall madly in love with you.",
	["难怪在印刷如此昂贵的时代，这叠资料却那么便宜......"] = "No wonder this stack of materials is so cheap in an era where printing is so expensive...",
	["难怪要不同的内脏器官……抱歉，让你回忆起不好的事情了。"] = "No wonder he needed different internal organs... Sorry, I made you recall bad things.",
	["难怪迈尔先生提到，苜蓿号上所有人像被恶魔附身一样。"] = "No wonder Mr. Meyer mentioned that everyone on the Clover seemed to be possessed by a demon.",
	["难怪，黛西小姐会被困在那段最美好、烂漫的记忆中。"] = "No wonder Miss Daisy was trapped in that most beautiful and romantic memory.",
	["难看"] = "Feio",
	["难道<P_Yellow>白莉夫人</>真的是书中的玫瑰夫人，侠盗对她一见钟情？"] = "Could <P_Yellow>Lady Bai Li</> really be the Rose Lady from the book, and the chivalrous thief fell in love with her at first sight?",
	["难道……"] = "Could it be...",
	["难道……被控制了？"] = "Could it be... he's being controlled?",
	["难道……？"] = "Could it be...?",
	["难道你以为我相亲的时候，会这么直接地问对方薪水嘛！"] = "Did you really think I would ask the other party about their salary so directly on a blind date!",
	["难道你在等我？"] = "Were you waiting for me?",
	["难道你就是消失在切斯庄园的……"] = "Could it be that you are the one who disappeared at Chess Manor...",
	["难道你想在同学十六岁生日晚宴时，还穿旧的裙子？"] = "Don't tell me you want to wear an old dress to your classmate's sixteenth birthday party?",
	["难道你想要焦香人设永不<P_Yellow>倒</>？"] = "Do you want your charred persona to never <P_Yellow>fall</>?",
	["难道你改变了自己的看法？关于“活着”和“死亡”的看法？"] = "Could it be that you have changed your view? Your view on \"living\" and \"death\"?",
	["难道你是……"] = "Could you be...",
	["难道你是安提科勋爵和白莉夫人的女儿？"] = "Could you be the daughter of Lord Antigonus and Lady Bai Li?",
	["难道就是这辆……这也算是“最新款”？"] = "Could this be it... This counts as the \"latest model\"?",
	["难道您想……解决带来问题的饮料？不可以！虽然它让我们腹泻，但是——"] = "Don't tell me you want to... solve the problem with the drink? No! Although it gives us diarrhea, but—",
	["难道我真的看不见了？十几年前医生就说我瞎了，可我没瞎呀。"] = "Could it be that I really can't see? The doctor said I was blind over a dozen years ago, but I'm not blind.",
	["难道是……嫁接的非凡力量不太稳定？"] = "Could it be that... the grafted Beyonder power is unstable?",
	["难道是受了太大打击，她精神出问题了？可惜灵视被打断了，看来只能尊重命运的安排。"] = "Could it be that she suffered too much of a blow and her mental state is unstable? It's a pity the spirit vision was interrupted. It seems I can only respect the arrangements of fate.",
	["难道是因为……"] = "Could it be because...",
	["难道是在警告我们，不要寻找睡莲仙女？"] = "Could it be a warning to us not to look for the Water Lily Fairy?",
	["难道是您有什么心事？或者从廷根搬来贝克兰德的这两周还没有适应？"] = "Is there something on your mind? Or have you not adapted to moving from Tingen to Backlund in these two weeks?",
	["难道是我多心了？"] = "Was I overthinking it?",
	["难道是我弹得太糟糕……"] = "Could it be that I played it too poorly...",
	["难道是我最近熬夜太多了？"] = "Could it be that I've been staying up too late recently?",
	["难道是方位？如果把整个小镇看作一个表盘。"] = "Could it be the orientation? If you look at the whole town as a clock face.",
	["难道是管家伪造案发现场，陷害仆人？可是，他曾经愿意舍身救主……"] = "Could it be that the butler faked the crime scene to frame the servant? But he was once willing to sacrifice his life to save his master...",
	["难道是诊金不够吗？"] = "Could it be that the consultation fee is not enough?",
	["难道是走丢后，被当做流浪犬卖到这里了，真可怜。"] = "Could it be that it got lost and was sold here as a stray dog? How pitiful.",
	["难道是钢琴大师贝尔芬的签名杂志到了？这么快！"] = "Could the magazine signed by piano master Belfen have arrived already? So soon!",
	["难道是非凡事件？总之，先去春夜沙龙看看。"] = "Could it be a Beyonder incident? Regardless, I'll go check out the Spring Night Salon first.",
	["难道是非凡者死后，与周围的书结合形成的<P_Yellow>非凡物品</>？看来需要进行封印。"] = "Could it be a <P_Yellow> mystical item </> formed by the combination of a Beyonder after death and the surrounding books? It seems it needs to be sealed.",
	["难道有人被困在封印室里了？"] = "Could someone be trapped in the sealing room?",
	["难道有其他受害者？"] = "Could there be other victims?",
	["难道纺织厂是监狱吗？"] = "Is the textile factory a prison?",
	["难道说……有非凡力量在暗中影响？"] = "Could it be... that Beyonder power is influencing things in the dark?",
	["难道说传说是真的？"] = "Could the legend be true?",
	["难道说？！"] = "Could it be?!",
	["难道这场凶案和非凡物品有关？"] = "Could this murder be related to a Beyonder item?",
	["难道预言要成真了？可是为什么呢？"] = "Could the prophecy be coming true? But why?",
	["难道黛丝在<P_Yellow>从事正常的占卜活动</>后，选择了……自杀？"] = "Could it be that after Daisy <P_Yellow>engaged in normal divination activities</>, she chose to... commit suicide?",
	["难道，今天的经历预示着我要从无尽计划中解脱？也对，我得和海蒂谈谈，还有父亲……但现在有更重要的事……"] = "Could it be that today's experience signifies my liberation from the endless plan? That's right, I need to talk to Heidi, and Father... but there are more important things now...",
	["难道，这是一种拒绝……"] = "Could this be a rejection...",
	["难道，黛西小姐的灵魂被封禁在了某段情景的循环中，所以她的身体才会出现死亡特征？"] = "Could it be that Miss Daisy's soul is sealed in a loop of some scene, which is why her body shows signs of death?",
