	["集中你的精神，想象你的灵性从脚下涌出，向外扩散，形成一个封闭的区域，将我们、仪式台、祭品以及目标宝箱都囊括其中。"] = "Focus your mind, imagine your spirituality pouring out from beneath your feet, spreading outward to form a closed area that encompasses us, the ritual altar, the offerings, and the target treasure chest.",
	["集中力量"] = "Concentrated Force",
	["集中力量打破<Highlight>所有战火残片</>，每位非凡者都需要<Highlight>完成征服能量收集</>，与符文交互开启祈祷。"] = "Concentrate your strength to break <Highlight>all war debris</>. Every Beyonder needs to <Highlight>complete the collection of conquest energy</> and interact with the runes to initiate prayer.",
	["集中团队火力<Highlight>击溃冰牢一角</>就可以打破囚禁，并逃离致死攻击的范围。"] = "Concentrate the team's firepower to <Highlight>break a corner of the Ice Prison</> to shatter the imprisonment and escape the range of the lethal attack.",
	["集中攻击"] = "Focus Attack",
	["集中攻击一处冰牢，打破囚笼"] = "Concentrate attacks on one ice prison to break the cage",
	["集中清理寄生果核！"] = "Focus on clearing the Parasitic Fruit Cores!",
	["集中火力，统一目标，进攻！"] = "Concentrate fire, unify targets, attack!",
	["集中牵引飞弹后远离"] = "Concentrate the guided missiles and then move away",
	["集中精神 先在脑海中冥想一个熟悉的东西"] = "Focus your mind, first meditate on something familiar in your head.",
	["集中精神，构建灵性之墙"] = "Concentrate your mind and build a Wall of Spirituality",
	["集中绿叶宝石的灵性，挡住她的攻击！"] = "Concentrate the spirituality of the green leaf gem to block her attack!",
	["集体"] = "Collective",
	["集体幻觉真可怕……连不存在的知识都进入了大脑……"] = "Collective hallucinations are terrifying... even knowledge that doesn't exist enters the brain...",
	["集卡"] = "Card Collection",
	["集合"] = "Juntar",
	["集合人数 %s/%s"] = "Gathered: %s/%s",
	["集合传送"] = "Group Teleport",
	["集合分摊伤害！"] = "Gather to share the damage!",
	["集合分摊骑士的冲锋伤害！"] = "Gather to share the damage of the knight's charge!",
	["集合圈倒计时"] = "Gathering Circle Countdown",
	["集合抵抗威压，再分散站位，避开余威！"] = "Gather to resist the pressure, then disperse to avoid the aftermath!",
	["集合躲避环状冲击"] = "Gather to dodge ring impact",
	["集市"] = "Mercado",
	["集市上有人在卖生锈的旧枪，只能当装饰品挂在墙上。你觉得有意思，特意过去淘货。"] = "Someone at the market is selling rusty old guns that can only be used as wall decorations. You find it interesting and go over to hunt for treasures.",
	["集市上贩卖的旧枪，似乎有点生锈了。"] = "An old gun sold at the market, it seems a bit rusty.",
	["集市的肉摊前，摊主莫里正中气十足地叫……骂。"] = "At the meat stall in the market, the owner, Mori, is shouting... cursing with great vigor.",
	["集市的，还有她家里，都是花！天台上也有她种的花。"] = "In the market, and at her home, it's all flowers! There are also flowers she planted on the rooftop.",
	["集市里的占卜师"] = "The diviner in the market",
	["集满能量后可以祈祷激活符文"] = "Can pray to activate runes after gathering enough Energy",
	["集火"] = "Focus Fire",
	["集火击破威瑟尔护盾，帮助对决获胜！"] = "Focus fire to break Wetherell's shield and help win the duel!",
	["集火护盾！被寄生的非凡者靠近金色虚影可削弱护盾"] = "Focus fire on the shield! The parasitized Beyonder can approach the golden phantom to weaken the shield",
	["集火雕像标记"] = "Focus Fire Statue Mark",
	["集结"] = "Corrida",
	["集结·俱乐部宣战"] = "Assemble: Club Declaration of War",
	["集齐三张<HighLight>命运黄牌</>以解锁本技能。对范围内敌方造成spellfielddisc(*id)点物理伤害并附加一层<HighLight>愚弄标记</>，敌方怪物被<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">打断</>。随后*f秒内，自身的普通攻击有passivedisc(*id)的概率为目标附加一层<HighLight>愚弄标记</>，自身buffdisc(*id)。施法后获得一点<HighLight>卡牌能量</>。\n释放命运愚弄时会清除灵性爆发的<HighLight>易伤</>效果。\n\n<FaintYellow>愚弄标记</>：叠加3层后引爆并移除愚弄标记，受到施加者造成的mul(*d,3)点物理伤害。\n<FaintYellow>卡牌能量</>：最多持有5点，达到5点时<HighLight>终结技能</>切换并锁定为<HighLight>洗牌</>。"] = "Collect three <HighLight>Fooling of Fate Yellow Cards</> to unlock this skill. Deal spellfielddisc(*id) physical damage to enemies in range and apply one stack of <HighLight>Fooling Mark</>; enemy monsters are <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">interrupted</>. Then, for *f seconds, your Normal Attacks have a passivedisc(*id) chance to apply one stack of <HighLight>Fooling Mark</> to the target, and you gain buffdisc(*id). Gain one point of <HighLight>Card Energy</> after casting. \nCasting Fooling of Fate will clear the <HighLight>Vulnerability</> effect of Spirituality Burst. \n\n<FaintYellow>Fooling Mark</>: After stacking 3 times, it detonates and is removed, dealing mul(*d,3) physical damage to the target from the caster. \n<FaintYellow>Card Energy</>: Can hold up to 5 points. When reaching 5 points, the <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> switches and locks to <HighLight>Shuffle Cards</>.",
	["集齐三张<HighLight>灵性蓝牌</>以解锁本技能。对范围内的敌方造成spellfielddisc(*id)点物理伤害并附加*f秒<HighLight>易伤</>，<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">浮空</>敌方怪物。施法后获得一点<HighLight>卡牌能量</>。\n释放灵性爆发时会清除命运愚弄的自身增益效果。\n\n<FaintYellow>卡牌能量</>：最多持有5点，达到5点时<HighLight>终结技能</>切换并锁定为<HighLight>洗牌</>。\n<FaintYellow>易伤</>：受到来自施加者的伤害提高10%。"] = "Collect three <HighLight>Spirituality Blue Cards</> to unlock this skill. Deal spellfielddisc(*id) physical damage to enemies in range and apply <HighLight>Vulnerability</> for *f seconds, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">launching</> enemy monsters. Gain one point of <HighLight>Card Energy</> after casting. \nCasting Spirituality Burst will clear the self-buff effects of Fooling of Fate. \n\n<FaintYellow>Card Energy</>: Can hold up to 5 points. When reaching 5 points, the <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> switches and locks to <HighLight>Shuffle Cards</>. \n<FaintYellow>Vulnerability</>: Damage taken from the caster is increased by 10%.",
