	["雇员数量"] = "Number of Employees",
	["雇员正在其他位置忙碌，是否仍要上阵？"] = "The employee is busy elsewhere. Do you still want to deploy them?",
	["雇用搬家的马车至少需要10苏勒，略等于我们一周的房租了。"] = "Hiring a moving carriage costs at least 10 soli, which is roughly our rent for a week.",
	["雏菊"] = "Margarida",
	["雏菊开放，但却没有香气，也许只能在同情和理性之间寻找平衡。"] = "Daisies are blooming, but they have no fragrance; perhaps one can only find a balance between sympathy and rationality.",
