	["雪"] = "Snow",
	["雪下了一整晚。早上起来帐篷都被埋了半截，尼尔提议我们提早启程加快行程，如果考虑到意外情况补给可能不太够。\n我们把东西都收拾好，准备启程。\n\n剩余物资：\n面包3份\n肉干和肉肠2份\n糖1罐 尼尔昨晚外出了一趟，回来的时候吃了几颗\n黄油2块 山上太冷，我们昨晚把黄油涂抹在面包上，并且放在火上烤着吃\n酒1瓶 水太重了，只留一瓶等登顶后庆祝\n水3瓶"] = "It snowed all night. When we woke up in the morning, the tents were half-buried. Neil suggested we set off early to speed up the journey, considering that supplies might not be enough if there are accidents. \n We packed everything and prepared to set off. \n \n Remaining supplies: \n 3 portions of bread \n 2 portions of jerky and sausage \n 1 jar of sugar. Neil went out last night and ate a few when he returned. \n 2 blocks of butter. It was too cold on the mountain, so we spread the butter on the bread last night and roasted it over the fire. \n 1 bottle of wine. Water is too heavy, so we only kept one bottle to celebrate after reaching the summit. \n 3 bottles of water.",
	["雪伦"] = "Sharon",
	["雪伦召唤镜子替身，并藏身其中"] = "Sharon summons a mirror double and hides within it.",
	["雪伦夫人"] = "Mrs. Sharon",
	["雪伦夫人作为廷根最有名的交际花，周旋在廷根的议员中，几乎所有被她引诱的男子，都会成为她的情人。"] = "As Tingen's most famous socialite, Mrs. Sharon circles among Tingen's councilors; almost every man she seduces becomes her lover.",
