	["雪莉"] = "Sherry",
	["雪莉……"] = "Shirley...",
	["雪莉不忍收回亡夫给挚友的遗物，她将怀表留给我。我们约定，往后保持通信。"] = "Shirley could not bear to take back the memento her late husband left for his best friend, so she left the pocket watch with me. We agreed to keep in touch from then on.",
	["雪莉也被卷入了战争，她的丈夫也死在了战场上。她都鼓起勇气来到了鲁恩，你连下楼都不敢？"] = "Shirley was also swept up in the war, and her husband died on the battlefield too. She gathered the courage to come to Loen, and you don't even dare to go downstairs?",
	["雪莉娅"] = "Shelia",
	["雪莉娅的面包很不错，不过霍夫曼的咸鱼摊的东西就不太行了。"] = "Shelia's bread is quite good, but the stuff at Hoffman's salted fish stall isn't very good.",
