	["需要3人分摊"] = "Requires 3 people to share the damage",
	["需要4人分摊"] = "Requires 4 people to share",
	["需要6个玩家靠近<Disable>菇勇者</>并将其引离人群，让污染区域远离战斗区域。当所有<Disable>菇勇者</>都被引离成功后，所有人会获得2分钟伤害提升200%的增益效果。"] = "6 players need to approach the <Disable>Mushroom Warrior</> and lure it away from the crowd, keeping the polluted area away from the Combat Area. When all <Disable>Mushroom Warriors</> have been successfully lured away, everyone will gain a 2-minute buff that increases damage by 200%.",
	["需要<Highlight>两名玩家</>在场地两侧分别吸引巴尼先生和安西娅的仇恨，尽量<Highlight>保持远离</>。"] = "It requires <Highlight>two players</> to attract the aggro of Mr. Barney and Anthea on opposite sides of the arena, trying to <Highlight>keep them far apart</>.",
	["需要<Highlight>优先击败</>巴尼先生。"] = "You need to <Highlight>prioritize defeating</> Mr. Barney.",
	["需要<Highlight>集中攻破其中部分果核</>，并保持在安全区域内直到全部果核爆炸消亡。"] = "You need to <Highlight>concentrate fire to break some of the fruit cores</> and stay in a safe area until all fruit cores explode and perish.",
	["需要“星星”先生亲自处理的任务……一定很危险吧。"] = "A mission that requires Mr. 'Star' to handle personally... it must be very dangerous.",
	["需要……八百镑?!<P_Heart>（这价格相当于普通工人十五年的薪水！）</>"] = "It costs... eight hundred pounds?! <P_Heart> (This price is equivalent to fifteen years of an ordinary worker's salary!) </>",
	["需要一把秩序大剑，才可取出混乱大剑。"] = "A Sword of Order is required to retrieve the Sword of Chaos.",
	["需要作用的WeakID列表"] = "List of WeakIDs to apply to",
	["需要保持自身周围10m内没有其他玩家，持续5秒"] = "Need to keep no other players within 10m of yourself for 5 seconds",
	["需要先保存搭配方案后才可开始进行预览，是否前往搭配？"] = "You must save the matching scheme before you can preview it. Go to match?",
	["需要先结算上一次购买。"] = "Must settle the previous purchase first.",
	["需要先编辑签名！"] = "Need to edit the signature first!",
	["需要先进行一些心理治疗，稳定{{他|她}}的精神。大家辛苦了，接下来交给我吧。"] = "We need to perform some psychotherapy first to stabilize {{ his| her}} mind. Thank you all for your hard work; leave the rest to me.",
	["需要先选中目标NPC后使用"] = "Requires selecting target NPC first.",
	["需要免疫伤害类型值累加值（1无类型，2物理，4魔法，8机制伤害）"] = "Cumulative value of damage types to be immune to (1: None, 2: Physical, 4: Magic, 8: Mechanism damage).",
	["需要其他人协助吗？"] = "Do you need assistance from others?",
	["需要净化的污染核心在地窖里的祭坛上。"] = "The corruption core that needs Purification is on the altar in the cellar.",
	["需要判断后续的流星轰炸区域，在轰炸间隙中进行走位躲避。"] = "Need to judge the subsequent meteor bombardment area and move to dodge in the gaps between bombardments.",
	["需要前往【俱乐部】场景，请确保成为俱乐部成员后再进行任务。"] = "You need to go to the [Club] scene; please ensure you are a club member before proceeding with the quest.",
	["需要占领"] = "Needs to be occupied",
	["需要及时<Highlight>转移伤势</>，奶妈玩家<Highlight>注意队友血量</>。"] = "You need to <Highlight>transfer the injury</> in time; healer players <Highlight>pay attention to teammates' health</>.",
	["需要反思一下自己"] = "Need to reflect on myself",
	["需要和已经摆放的地板连接才能摆放"] = "Must be connected to existing flooring to be placed.",
	["需要在2-049<Highlight>闭眼期间</>穿过视线之墙或者不被其扫到。"] = "You must pass through the Wall of Sight or avoid being scanned by it while 2-049 <Highlight>has its eyes closed</>.",
