	["震击"] = "Shock",
	["震击周围敌人，造成<HighLight>120%</>攻击伤害；获得<HighLight>18%</>最大生命护盾和<HighLight>8%</>伤害减免，持续<HighLight>3</>秒。"] = "Shock surrounding enemies, dealing <HighLight>120%</> attack damage; gain <HighLight>18%</> Max Health Shield and <HighLight>8%</> Damage Reduction, lasting for <HighLight>3</> seconds.",
	["震吼"] = "Shocking Roar",
	["震地猛击"] = "Batida do terremoto",
	["震屏"] = "Screen Shake",
	["震屏强度额外系数, 与原文件系数做乘算"] = "Additional coefficient for screen shake intensity, multiplied by the original file coefficient.",
	["震屏效果"] = "Screen shake effect",
	["震屏文件路径"] = "Screen shake file path",
	["震惊集中线"] = "Shock Concentration Lines",
	["震慑"] = "Deterrence",
	["震慑击中带有精神瘟疫的目标时，会使目标昏迷3秒，并减少震慑5秒的冷却时间。"] = "When Deterrence hits a target afflicted with Mental Plague, it stuns the target for 3 seconds and reduces the Cooldown of Deterrence by 5 seconds.",
	["震慑斩魄"] = "Deterrence Soul Slash",
	["震慑新增斩杀效果，当目标血量低于30%时，伤害基础值提高400%，同时有15%几率直接击杀目标。"] = "Deterrence adds a finishing effect: when the target's Health is below 30%, the base damage is increased by 400%, and there is a 15% chance to kill the target instantly.",
	["震慑溃志"] = "Deterrence and demoralization",
	["震荡波"] = "Onda de choque",
	["震荡跳跃"] = "Shock Leap",
	["霍伊大学"] = "Hoi University",
	["霍伊大学 历史系教员"] = "Hoy University History Department Faculty",
	["霍伊大学 资深副教授"] = "Hoy University Senior Associate Professor",
	["霍伊大学一向重视学生的全面发展……看看我们的队员，一个个健康又精神。想要钻研学术，当然要有强健的体魄在先！"] = "Hoy University has always valued the all-around development of students... Look at our team members, each one is healthy and spirited. If you want to study academics, of course, you must have a strong physique first!",
	["霍伊大学副教授"] = "Hoi University associate professor",
	["霍伊大学历史系的教员阿兹克先生提醒克莱恩命运里的不协调，\n这种带点神秘的友善成为了他们友谊的开端。"] = "Mr. Azik, a faculty member of the History Department at Hoy University, reminds Klein of the disharmony in his fate, \nthis touch of mysterious friendliness becomes the beginning of their friendship.",
	["霍伊大学学术诚信办公室"] = "Hoi University Academic Integrity Office.",
	["霍伊大学学生"] = "Hoi University Student",
	["霍伊大学教务处"] = "Hoi University Academic Affairs Office",
	["霍伊大学教员"] = "Hoi University faculty member",
	["霍伊大学教授"] = "Hoy University Professor",
	["霍伊大学是克莱恩·莫雷蒂的母校，也是阿兹克·艾格斯任职的学校。"] = "Khoy University is Klein Moretti's alma mater and the school where Azik Eggers works.",
	["霍伊大学最近因为一桩舞弊案陷入骚动，你接受委托，调查兜售考试答案的神秘卖家。经过一番打听和伪装交易，你终于抓到了幕后卖家，他竟然就是考试的出题人海默教授。原来他为了吸引学生，让历史学传承下去，做出这种荒唐事。最终在你的劝导下，海默教授意识到自己的错误，开创了新的教育方式，寓教于乐，让学生们真正爱上了历史学。"] = "Hoy University has recently been in turmoil due to a cheating scandal; you accept a commission to investigate the mysterious seller peddling exam answers. After some inquiries and a fake transaction, you finally catch the mastermind seller, who turns out to be Professor Haimer, the person who wrote the exam. It turns out that in order to attract students and keep history alive, he did this absurd thing. In the end, under your persuasion, Professor Haimer realizes his mistake and creates a new way of teaching, combining education with entertainment, making students truly fall in love with history.",
	["霍伊大学机械系学生"] = "Hoy University Mechanical Engineering Student",
	["霍伊大学校报"] = "Hoi University school newspaper",
	["霍伊大学正值期末考试，一份包含考试答案的“内部资料”让学生们陷入骚动……"] = "Hoy University is in the middle of final exams, and a set of \"internal materials\" containing the answers has thrown the students into a frenzy...",
	["霍伊大学的赛艇俱乐部又有比赛了!"] = "The Hoy University rowing club has another race!",
	["霍伊大学考务处"] = "Hoi University Examination Office",
	["霍伊大学职员"] = "Hoy University Staff",
	["霍伊大学赛艇俱乐部招新——"] = "Hoy University Rowing Club recruitment—",
	["霍伊大学里都是有礼貌的年轻人。"] = "Hoy University is full of polite young people.",
	["霍伊家的工匠，私人订制。藏蓝表面，链节双股银。"] = "Craftsmen from the Hoy family, custom-made. Dark blue surface, double-strand silver links.",
	["霍伊尔"] = "Hoyle",
	["霍伊河沿岸怪声之谜，今日头条！"] = "The mystery of the strange noises along the Hoey River, today's headline!",
	["霍伊河边种的紫皮洋葱，煎肉、凉拌都绝佳的选择！"] = "Purple onions grown by the Hoey River, an excellent choice for pan-frying or salads!",
	["霍伊河边种的紫皮洋葱，煎肉，凉拌都绝佳的选择！"] = "Purple onions grown by the Hoy River—an excellent choice for pan-frying or salads!",
	["霍伊！作为鲁恩最好的大学之一！"] = "Hoi! As one of the best universities in Loen!",
	["霍克"] = "Hawk",
	["霍克斯"] = "Hawkes",
	["霍克斯先生："] = "Mr. Hawkes:",
	["霍克斯男爵与埃文医生的关系有些奇怪，埃文医生可能拥有作案动机。看来有必要和他聊聊。"] = "The relationship between Baron Hawkes and Dr. Evan is a bit strange; Dr. Evan might have a motive. It seems necessary to talk to him.",
	["霍克斯男爵倒在书桌旁。\n身体向前扑倒，右手还保持着向前伸出的姿势,像是临死前试图抓住什么。\n地上的红茶洒得到处都是。"] = "Baron Hawkes fell beside the desk. \n His body is slumped forward, his right hand still maintaining a reaching posture, as if trying to grab something before he died. \n The black tea on the floor is spilled everywhere.",
	["霍克斯男爵抗拒见到医生，怀疑医生在暗中监视自己。"] = "Baron Howkes resists seeing the doctor, suspecting the doctor is secretly monitoring him.",
	["霍克斯男爵死前，茶杯里的茶水已经快喝完了，可房间的地面却留下了这么多水渍。"] = "Before Baron Hawkes died, the tea in his cup was almost finished, yet there were so many water stains left on the floor of the room.",
	["霍克斯男爵的回应"] = "Baron Howkes's response",
	["霍克斯男爵的异常始于购买的一件古董，那恐怕是件非凡物品，它会是这场凶案的开端吗？"] = "Baron Hawkes's abnormality began with the purchase of an antique. That is likely a Beyonder item. Could it be the start of this murder case?",
	["霍克斯男爵的怀疑"] = "Baron Howkes's suspicion",
	["霍克斯男爵的病情越来越严重，恐怕时候不长了。我不久前如实告知他的情况，却被他怀疑我在监视他，这显然是一种被害妄想。"] = "Baron Hawkes' condition is getting worse and worse; I'm afraid he doesn't have much time left. I told him the truth about his situation not long ago, but he suspected me of spying on him. This is clearly a form of persecutory delusion.",
	["霍克斯男爵近期购入了一件古董，疑似非凡物品。"] = "Baron Howkes recently purchased an antique, suspected to be a Beyonder item.",
	["霍克斯，你疯了……"] = "Hawkes, you're crazy...",
