	["霍普-接爱的方向"] = "Hope - direction of receiving love",
	["霍普1"] = "Hope 1",
	["霍普2"] = "Hope 2",
	["霍普先生是廷根企业家，每年都会来我们拉姆德小镇度假，为我们小镇的经济做出极大贡献。"] = "Mr. Hope was an entrepreneur from Tingen who came to our Lamud Town for vacation every year, making a great contribution to our town's economy.",
	["霍普叔叔去世得太突然了，你那三个兄弟都是硬茬……就算你请我站在你这边也……"] = "Uncle Hope passed away too suddenly, and those three brothers of yours are all tough nuts to crack... even if you ask me to stand on your side, it's...",
	["霍普家族"] = "Hope family",
	["霍普金斯"] = "Hopkins",
	["霍根"] = "Hogan",
	["霍格"] = "Hogg",
	["霍森医生的医术比我家里的私人医生要高多了！但他一心坐诊，还说什么“许多来到这里的病人都是怀着最后的希望……我不能让他们失望”之类的。"] = "Dr. Horsen's medical skills are much higher than my private doctor at home! But he is dedicated to seeing patients, and he says things like, 'Many patients who come here are holding onto their last hope... I cannot let them down.'",
	["霍洛韦"] = "Holloway",
	["霍米尼克"] = "Hominic",
	["霍纳"] = "Horner",
	["霍纳奇斯"] = "Hornacis",
	["霍纳奇斯……弗雷格拉……"] = "Hornacis... Flegrea...",
	["霍纳奇斯……弗雷格拉……霍纳奇斯……弗雷格拉……"] = "Hornacis... Flegrea... Hornacis... Flegrea...",
	["霍纳奇斯……弗雷格拉……霍纳奇斯……弗雷格拉……霍纳奇斯……弗雷格拉……"] = "Hornacis... Flegrea... Hornacis... Flegrea... Hornacis... Flegrea...",
	["霍纳奇斯……算了，还是先解决安娜小姐的问题。"] = "Hornacis... Never mind, let's solve Miss Anna's problem first.",
	["霍纳奇斯……这片土地本就不同寻常，又地处边境，总是很动荡。就像几年前的那场战争……"] = "Hornacis... this land is inherently unusual, and being on the border, it is always turbulent. Just like the war a few years ago...",
	["霍纳奇斯……霍纳奇斯……"] = "Hornacis... Hornacis...",
	["霍纳奇斯冰湖的观景拍照留念：\n冰封的湖面一片死寂，时间早已遗弃这处荒原。\n尖耸的山崖直指天穹，如无声的质问。\n被冰雪掩埋的遗迹，在等一个得不到的答案。"] = "Sightseeing and Photography at Horgess Ice Lake: \nThe frozen lake is dead silent, and time has long abandoned this wasteland. \nThe sharp cliffs point directly to the sky, like a silent questioning. \nThe ruins buried by ice and snow are waiting for an answer that cannot be obtained.",
	["霍纳奇斯山脉"] = "Hornacis Mountain Range",
	["霍纳奇斯山脉-风暴竞逐-冲浪"] = "Hornacis Mountains - Storm Chase - Surfing",
	["霍纳奇斯山脉-风暴竞逐-载具"] = "Hornacis Mountains - Storm Chase - Vehicle",
	["霍纳奇斯山脉曾经藏着某种失控神话生物形态。"] = "The Hornacis Mountain Range once hid some kind of out-of-control mythical creature form.",
	["霍纳奇斯山脉的馈赠，沉重如命运。"] = "The gift of the Hornacis Mountain Range, heavy as fate.",
	["霍纳奇斯山脉秩序世界完成度到达100%"] = "Hornacis Mountain Range Order World completion reached 100%.",
	["霍纳奇斯山脉秩序世界完成度达到100%%"] = "Hornacis Mountain Range Order World completion reaches 100%%",
	["霍纳奇斯山脉秩序世界完成度达到20%%"] = "Hornacis Mountain Range Order World completion reaches 20%%",
	["霍纳奇斯山脉秩序世界完成度达到50%%"] = "Hornacis Mountain Range Order World completion reaches 50%%",
	["霍纳奇斯山脉秩序世界完成度达到80%%"] = "Hornacis Mountain Range Order World completion reaches 80%%",
	["霍纳奇斯的主峰曾经高达六千米以上，某一天塌了。"] = "The main peak of Hornacis was once over 6,000 meters high, but one day it collapsed.",
	["霍纳奇斯花海"] = "Hornacis Sea of Flowers",
	["霍纳奇斯花海-风暴竞逐-冲浪"] = "Hornacis Flower Sea - Storm Chase - Surfing",
	["霍纳奇斯花海-风暴竞逐-载具"] = "Hornacis Flower Sea - Storm Chase - Vehicle",
	["霍纳奇斯花海的午后"] = "Afternoon at the Hornacis Sea of Flowers",
	["霍纳奇斯花海的观景拍照留念：\n霍纳奇斯花海，像是严寒山脉中一处被神眷顾的乐土。\n衣着体面的人们常常来此度假，只为在芬芳中暂歇，让城市的喧嚣与疲惫随风散去。"] = "Hornacis Sea of Flowers Sightseeing Photo: \nThe Hornacis Sea of Flowers is like a paradise blessed by God in the frigid mountain range. \nWell-dressed people often come here for vacation, just to rest for a while in the fragrance and let the city's noise and fatigue drift away with the wind.",
	["霍纳奇斯花海秩序世界完成度到达100%"] = "Hornacis Sea of Flowers Order World completion reached 100%.",
	["霍纳奇斯花海秩序世界完成度达到100%%"] = "Hornacis Sea of Flowers Order World completion reaches 100%%",
	["霍纳奇斯花海秩序世界完成度达到20%%"] = "Hornacis Sea of Flowers Order World completion reaches 20%%",
	["霍纳奇斯花海秩序世界完成度达到50%%"] = "Hornacis Sea of Flowers Order World completion reaches 50%%",
	["霍纳奇斯花海秩序世界完成度达到80%%"] = "Hornacis Sea of Flowers Order World completion reaches 80%%",
	["霍纳奇斯花海，像是严寒山脉中一处被神眷顾的乐土。"] = "The Hornacis Sea of Flowers is like a paradise blessed by God in the frigid mountain range.",
	["霍纳奇斯花海，约会和度假的圣地。在你散步时，从天而降的物品是——"] = "Hornacis Sea of Flowers, a holy place for dating and vacations. While you are walking, the item that falls from the sky is—",
	["霍纳奇斯花船"] = "Hornacis Flower Boat",
	["霍纳奇斯雪山。"] = "Hornacis Snowy Mountain.",
	["霍纳奇斯雪山的观景拍照留念：\n厚重的雪常年笼罩着霍纳奇斯山脉，这里是一片没有四季的禁地。\n或许，唯有这里曾经的主人，与被命运指引至此的迷途者，才能在这片寂静里听见往日的回想。"] = "Hornacis Snowy Mountain Sightseeing Photo: \nThick snow covers the Hornacis Mountain Range all year round; this is a forbidden land without seasons. \nPerhaps only the former master of this place and the lost souls guided here by fate can hear the echoes of the past in this silence.",
	["霍纳奇斯，还是老样子……上次是我输了，不过下次，我会带新的“玩具”，再来一场“欺诈的游戏”。"] = "Hornacis, still the same as always... I lost last time, but next time, I will bring new 'toys' and have another 'game of deception'.",
	["霍纳奇斯？"] = "Hornacis?",
