	["非凡特性"] = "Beyonder characteristic",
	["非凡特性不灭定律：\n非凡特性不会毁灭，不会减少，只是从一个承载物转移到另一个承载物。"] = "Law of Beyonder Characteristic Indestructibility:\nBeyonder characteristics cannot be destroyed or reduced; they only transfer from one carrier to another.",
	["非凡特性守恒定律：\n往往指相近途径非凡特性守恒。高序列多了，低序列就会变少，反之亦然。同一途径内的强者，序列越高，彼此间的冲突可能就越大。"] = "Law of Beyonder Characteristic Conservation:\nThis usually refers to the conservation of Beyonder characteristics within adjacent pathways. When there are more high-sequence individuals, there will be fewer low-sequence ones, and vice versa. Among the powerful within the same pathway, the higher the sequence, the greater the potential for conflict between them.",
	["非凡特性碎片"] = "Beyonder characteristic Fragment",
	["非凡特性聚合定律：\n同一途径的高序列物品会间歇性地无意识地吸引中低序列的非凡者来到它的附近，且有彼此聚合在一起的倾向，高序列可以察觉这种吸引。相近途径同样存在聚合定律。"] = "Law of Beyonder Characteristic Convergence:\nHigh-sequence items of the same pathway will intermittently and unconsciously attract mid-to-low-sequence Beyonders to their vicinity, and they have a tendency to aggregate together. High-sequence individuals can perceive this attraction. The law of convergence also exists for adjacent pathways.",
	["非凡生物"] = "Beyonder creature",
	["非凡生物在哪里"] = "Onde encontrar Beyonder criaturas",
	["非凡生物笔记"] = "Beyonder Notas sobre criaturas",
	["非凡的世界诡异危险 以后要更小心一些……"] = "The Beyonder world is strange and dangerous. Be more careful in the future...",
	["非凡的试炼"] = "Extraordinary Trial",
	["非凡的道路上充满诱惑与危险，一不小心就会堕落失控，成为可怕疯狂的怪物……"] = "The path of the extraordinary is full of temptation and danger. One careless step and you will fall into loss of control, becoming a terrifying and insane monster...",
	["非凡的领域总是扭曲和违背常理的，它的影响与结束都不是我们能够预见和控制的。"] = "The extraordinary realm is always distorted and contrary to common sense; neither its influence nor its end can be foreseen or controlled by us.",
	["非凡知识"] = "Beyonder Knowledge",
	["非凡知识升级"] = "Beyonder knowledge upgrade",
	["非凡知识提升"] = "Beyonder Knowledge Boost",
	["非凡知识等级"] = "Beyonder Knowledge Level",
	["非凡者"] = "Beyonder",
	["非凡者%s成功修改会长雕像，快前往围观"] = "Beyonder %s successfully modified the president's statue. Go and take a look!",
	["非凡者……非凡事件……仪式……失控污染……"] = "Beyonders... Beyonder incidents... rituals... loss of control... corruption...",
	["非凡者们可以学习治安官的相关知识和技巧，成为合格的“治安官”，扮演“治安官”身份，通过“提前扮演”来逐步获得“祝福石板”上的各种非凡能力。 \n1.每位非凡者同时至多可以领取3个悬赏。\n2.悬赏令将在非凡者完成悬赏的时候刷新。\n3.悬赏被完成后，6分钟内不会再次刷新同一个悬赏。\n4.非凡者们可以选择主动点击刷新，刷新所有悬赏。但刷新次数，每日只有3次。\n5.非凡者完成悬赏后将会获得治安经验，和绑定苏勒。治安经验可以提升治安官等级\n6.非凡者可以在治安技能树页面可以对治安技能进行升级和养成，强化自身的六维属性。\n7.悬赏令分为A、B、C三个等级，分别在治安1、2、4级的时候开启。\n8.接取悬赏令后，非凡者的任务列表中会同步接取悬赏任务，点击对应的任务可以自动寻路至悬赏位置。"] = "Beyonders can learn the knowledge and techniques of a Sheriff, become a qualified \"Sheriff,\" and act out the \"Sheriff\" identity to gradually acquire various Beyonder abilities from the \"Blessing Slate\" through \"Pre-Acting.\" \n 1. Each Beyonder can accept up to 3 bounties at a time. \n 2. The bounty list refreshes when a Beyonder completes a bounty. \n 3. Once a bounty is completed, the same bounty will not refresh again for 6 minutes. \n 4. Beyonders can choose to manually click refresh to refresh all bounties, but this is limited to 3 times per day. \n 5. Upon completing a bounty, Beyonders gain Sheriff EXP and bound Gold Pounds. Sheriff EXP can increase your Sheriff level. \n 6. Beyonders can upgrade and cultivate Sheriff skills on the Sheriff Skill Tree page to strengthen their six-dimensional attributes. \n 7. Bounties are divided into A, B, and C grades, unlocked at Sheriff levels 1, 2, and 4 respectively. \n 8. After accepting a bounty, the bounty quest will be synced to your quest list; clicking the corresponding quest will trigger auto-pathfinding to the bounty location.",
	["非凡者加入教团后，应根据教团的规章制度行事，每周需按时完成教团要求，未完成要求者将会收到惩戒。\n非凡者可通过参与教团活动获得教团行动值和社交馈赠宝箱进度值，行动值可用于提升教团等级，等级提升后可领取教团提供的等级奖励。社交馈赠宝箱进度值可用于提升宝箱进度，消耗活力开启宝箱，获取装备、非凡物质、绑定苏勒等奖励。"] = "After joining a cult, a Beyonder must act according to the cult's rules and regulations. Weekly requirements must be completed on time; failure to do so will result in punishment. \nBeyonders can earn Cult Action Points and Social Gift Chest progress by participating in cult activities. Action Points can be used to increase the cult level, and level rewards can be claimed upon leveling up. Social Gift Chest progress can be used to advance the chest; consume Vitality to open the chest and obtain rewards such as Equipment, Beyonder Materials, and Bound Soules.",
	["非凡者可以通过“提前扮演”，即在现实世界中扮演不同的职业和身份，来使自身契合石板上不同能力所对应的非凡特性，从而更安全地获得和使用各种能力。\n除此之外，“身份扮演”有助于非凡者在现实世界中建立更深度的社会关系，为未来晋升更高序列积累“人性锚点”；同时，塔罗学派成员在世界中的锚点越多，塔罗学派在灵界中的存在也会越稳定。"] = "Beyonders can use \"Pre-Acting,\" which is acting out different professions and identities in the real world, to make themselves compatible with the extraordinary characteristics corresponding to different abilities on the tablet, thereby obtaining and using various abilities more safely. \nIn addition, \"Identity Roleplay\" helps Beyonders establish deeper social relationships in the real world, accumulating \"humanity anchors\" for future advancement to higher Sequences. At the same time, the more anchors Tarot Club members have in the world, the more stable the Tarot Club's existence in the Spirit World will be.",
	["非凡者可邀请好友度达到<Highlight>2级·灵性触碰</>的好友到霍纳奇斯花海-萨默尔太太处申请誓约流程。\n结成誓约对双方性别无限制,满足条件的同性/异性好友均可誓约。\n非凡者与好友组队前往萨默尔太大处申请誓约后，完成写下誓言、交换收下、誓约拍照流程后，即正式结成誓约关系。结成誓约后可获得道具<Highlight>誓约之证</>，右键使用可随时查看对方为自己写下的誓言。\n各位非凡者每天最多只可结成<Highlight>1次誓约</>（中途打断不计入次数）。"] = "Beyonders can invite friends who have reached <Highlight>Level 2: Spirituality Touch</> to the Hornacis Sea of Flowers - Mrs. Sammer to apply for the Covenant process. \nThere is no gender restriction for forming a Covenant; friends of the same/opposite sex who meet the conditions can form a Covenant. \nAfter Beyonders and their friends form a team and go to Mrs. Sammer to apply for the Covenant, they will officially form a Covenant relationship after completing the processes of writing down vows, exchanging tokens, and taking Covenant photos. After forming a Covenant, you can obtain the item <Highlight>Covenant Token</>, which you can right-click to view the vows written for you by the other party at any time. \nEach Beyonder can form a <Highlight>Covenant 1 time</> per day (interruptions in the middle do not count towards the limit).",
	["非凡者可邀请好感度达到<Highlight>2级·灵性触碰</>的好友到霍纳奇斯花海-萨默尔太太处申请誓约流程。\n非凡者每次最多只能同时邀请一位好友进行发起誓约流程。"] = "Beyonders can invite friends who have reached <Highlight>Level 2: Spirituality Touch</> to the Hornacis Sea of Flowers - Mrs. Sammer to apply for the Covenant process. \nBeyonders can only invite one friend at a time to initiate the Covenant process.",
	["非凡者和你想象的并不一样，我们一直在与危险同行，所以你一定要谨慎选择。"] = "Beyonders are not what you imagine. We are always walking with danger, so you must choose cautiously.",
	["非凡者和非凡生物死亡后非凡特性会析出，或与其他物品融合成为封印物。析出的非凡特性等同于没有辅助材料的同序列魔药，与辅助材料配合服用，可以使普通人或更低序列的非凡者直接晋升对应序列的非凡者。"] = "After a Beyonder or Beyonder creature dies, their Beyonder characteristic will precipitate or fuse with other items to become a Sealed Artifact. A precipitated Beyonder characteristic is equivalent to a potion of the same sequence without auxiliary materials; when consumed with auxiliary materials, it allows an ordinary person or a lower-sequence Beyonder to directly advance to the corresponding sequence.",
	["非凡者在廷根圣赛琳娜教堂前的广场上开启神降仪式时，其他非凡者可以前往参与协助。\n协助可以加快神降仪式的完成进度。\n参与协助直到神降仪式成功的非凡者，可以获得协助奖励。"] = "When Beyonders initiate a divine descent ritual in the square in front of the Saint Selena Cathedral in Tingen, other Beyonders can join to assist. \nAssisting can accelerate the progress of the divine descent ritual. \nBeyonders who participate in the assistance until the divine descent ritual is successful can receive assistance rewards.",
	["非凡者失控，或是精神死亡，身体崩溃，每一块血肉都变成可怕的怪物。"] = "A Beyonder loses control, or their spirit dies and their body collapses, with every piece of flesh turning into a terrifying monster.",
	["非凡者当前充值总额为:%d"] = "Beyonder's current total top-up is: %d",
	["非凡者当前每秒伤害："] = "Beyonder's current DPS:",
	["非凡者当前每秒治疗量："] = "Beyonder's current HPS:",
	["非凡者是你们对自己的称呼？"] = "Is 'Beyonder' what you call yourselves?",
	["非凡者消散后可选择在该处苏醒。"] = "After a Beyonder dissipates, they can choose to wake up here.",
	["非凡者消耗城堡资产，可以在<Highlight>城堡中庭</>、<Highlight>工匠制所</>放置组件。\n（右上方）快捷功能区——开启奇迹建造、一键拆除、<Highlight>修改视角</>等便捷功能。\n（正下方）组件库——解锁、购买、搜索组件；<Highlight>回收组件</>时，组件会<Highlight>回到组件库</>。\n（正上方）信息说明区——显示当前组件名称，以及可以对组件进行的操作。\n（右上顶栏）城堡评分——显示当前摆放评分、总评分、城堡资产数量等信息。"] = "Beyonders can consume castle assets to place components in the <Highlight>Castle Atrium</> or <Highlight>Artisan Workshop</>. \n(Top right) Shortcut function area—enable miracle building, one-click demolition, <Highlight>modify perspective</>, and other convenient functions. \n(Bottom center) Component library—unlock, purchase, and search for components; when <Highlight>recycling components</>, the components will <Highlight>return to the component library</>. \n(Top center) Information description area—displays the current component name and operations that can be performed on the component. \n(Top right bar) Castle Rating—displays information such as current placement rating, total rating, and quantity of castle assets.",
	["非凡者炼制魔药后剩下的废料，通常直接倒掉。不知道是谁开始收集装瓶，以极低的价格在黑市上流通。闻起来有股难以描述的腥臭，堪比狼鱼罐头的气味——你有仇人吗？可以推荐对方尝尝看。"] = "Waste left over after a Beyonder concocts a potion, usually poured away. I don't know who started collecting and bottling it, circulating it on the black market at a very low price. It smells like an indescribable fishy stench, comparable to the smell of canned wolf fish—do you have any enemies? You can recommend they try it.",
	["非凡者的力量，并不仅仅用于战斗。扮演不同身份，进入他们的视角，在层层谜团中寻找隐藏的答案。"] = "The power of a Beyonder is not just for combat. Act out different identities, enter their perspectives, and search for hidden answers within layers of mysteries.",
	["非凡者的力量，并不仅仅用于战斗。有时，一段残缺的脚印、一句混乱的低语，甚至一扇无法开启的门，都需要特定“序列”的能力才能解开。扮演不同身份，进入他们的视角，在层层谜团中寻找隐藏的答案。"] = "The power of a Beyonder is not just used for combat. Sometimes, a trail of incomplete footprints, a chaotic whisper, or even a door that cannot be opened requires the abilities of a specific \"Sequence\" to unlock. Act as different identities, enter their perspectives, and search for hidden answers amidst layers of mysteries.",
	["非凡者的敌人不仅仅是邪教徒、黑巫师，还有自己！几乎每年都有人失控和牺牲！你不害怕吗？不考虑家人的感受吗？"] = "The enemies of Beyonders are not just cultists and dark sorcerers, but also themselves! Almost every year people lose control and sacrifice themselves! Aren't you afraid? Don't you consider the feelings of your family?",
	["非凡者的道路，始于对自我的掌控。每一次扮演都是一场修行——唯有入戏够深，魔药方能真正消化。"] = "The path of a Beyonder begins with the control of oneself. Every act of acting is a form of cultivation—only by being deeply immersed in the role can the potion be truly digested.",
	["非凡者能够影响天气吗？"] = "Can Beyonders influence the weather?",
	["非凡者该如何安排假期？"] = "How should Beyonders arrange their vacations?",
	["非凡者都是恶魔吧……那种邪恶的力量。我曾经亲眼见到外祖父失控，长出了触手，然后陷入疯狂。而现在，我也继承了这种力量，身体里好像有其他存在，太可怕了。"] = "Beyonders must be demons, right... that kind of evil power. I once saw my grandfather lose control with my own eyes; he grew tentacles and then fell into madness. And now, I have inherited this power. It feels like there is another entity inside my body. It's too terrifying.",
	["非凡者都要被登记监管，野生非凡者会被带走。"] = "Beyonders must be registered and supervised; wild Beyonders will be taken away.",
	["非凡者需要<Highlight>找到这4个舞者并击败</>，随后在原4个舞者的位置上进行<Highlight>跳舞</>，将舞蹈接力下去。"] = "Beyonders need to <Highlight>find these 4 Dancers and defeat them</>, then perform <Highlight>a dance</> at the original positions of the 4 Dancers to relay the dance.",
	["非凡者需要<Highlight>找到这4个舞者并击败</>，随后在原4个舞者的位置上进行<Highlight>跳舞</>，将舞蹈接力下去。拥有<Highlight>相同舞蹈</>技能的非凡者，需要到<Highlight>舞阵里跳舞</>"] = "Beyonders need to <Highlight> find these 4 dancers and defeat </> them, then stand in the original positions of the 4 dancers to <Highlight> dance </>, continuing the dance relay. Beyonders who possess the <Highlight> same dance </> skill need to go to the <Highlight> dance formation and dance </>.",
	["非凡者需要<Highlight>进入符文区域</>激活"] = "Beyonders need to <Highlight>enter the rune area</> to activate it.",
	["非凡者需要<Highlight>进入符文区域</>激活，注意观察<Highlight>符文顺序</>，按照正确顺序激活。"] = "Beyonders need to <Highlight>enter the rune area</> to activate it. Pay attention to observing the <Highlight>rune sequence</> and activate them in the correct order.",
	["非凡者需要和6个<Highlight>舞者交互</>，获得<Highlight>临时舞蹈技能</>从而躲避伤害。"] = "Beyonders need to interact with 6 <Highlight>Dancers</> to obtain <Highlight>temporary dance skills</> to dodge damage.",
	["非凡者，你的步伐告诉我，你还没准备好面对真正的黑暗。木桩不会还手，但敌人会。要进去练练吗？"] = "Beyonder, your footsteps tell me you aren't ready to face true darkness. The wooden stake won't fight back, but the enemy will. Want to go in and practice?",
	["非凡者？那是什么……我不是非凡者……"] = "Beyonder? What's that... I'm not a Beyonder...",
	["非凡能力"] = "Beyonder Ability",
	["非凡能手"] = "Extraordinary Expert",
	["非凡药剂"] = "Beyonder Potion",
	["非凡药剂百科"] = "Enciclopédia de Beyonder Poções",
	["非凡药剂，使用后，能够暂时隔绝臭味。"] = "Beyonder potion that, when used, can temporarily isolate odors.",
	["非凡药剂，能够帮助陷入昏迷的人恢复神智。"] = "A Beyonder potion that can help someone in a coma regain their sanity.",
	["非凡评分"] = "Beyonder Avaliação",
	["非凡评分-封印物评分"] = "Beyonder Rating - Sealed Artifact Rating",
	["非凡评分-装备评分"] = "Beyonder Rating - Equipment Rating",
	["非凡评分-途径评分"] = "Beyonder Rating - Pathway Rating",
	["非凡评分-非凡人物评分"] = "Beyonder Rating - Beyonder Character Rating",
	["非凡评分加成"] = "Beyonder Rating Bonus",
	["非凡评分加成 <Tips_TWhite>%s</>"] = "Beyonder Rating Bonus <Tips_TWhite>%s</>",
	["非凡评分是什么"] = "What is Beyonder rating?",
	["非凡评分构成"] = "Beyonder Rating Composition",
	["非凡评分测试"] = "Beyonder Rating Test",
	["非凡评分达到14000"] = "Reach a Beyonder Rating of 14000",
	["非凡评分达到19000"] = "Reach a Beyonder Rating of 19000",
	["非凡评分达到24000"] = "Reach a Beyonder Rating of 24000",
	["非凡评分达到30000"] = "Reach a Beyonder Rating of 30000",
	["非凡评分达到35000"] = "Reach a Beyonder Rating of 35000",
	["非凡评分达到40000"] = "Reach a Beyonder Rating of 40000",
	["非凡评分达到7000"] = "Reach a Beyonder Rating of 7000",
	["非凡评分限制超过最大值%s"] = "Beyonder rating limit exceeds the maximum value of %s.",
	["非凡评分（战力）"] = "Beyonder Rating (Combat Power)",
	["非凡评分： "] = "Beyonder Rating: ",
	["非凡词条"] = "Beyonder Affix",
	["非凡途径"] = "Beyonder pathway",
	["非凡途径又称神之途径，序列4之上步入半神阶段，就能一定程度上展现神话形态。 "] = "Beyonder pathways are also known as divine pathways; once you step into the Demigod stage above Sequence 4, you can display a mythical form to a certain extent.",
	["非凡领域对普通人严格保密，警官徽章还在吗？"] = "The Beyonder realm is strictly confidential to ordinary people. Is your police badge still with you?",
	["非凡风波平息"] = "The Beyonder disturbance subsides",
	["非凡馈赠"] = "Beyonder Gift",
	["非凡！异变！"] = "Extraordinary! Mutation!",
	["非势力战指挥玩家，暂无使用权限"] = "Not a commander player in the faction war; no permission to use.",
	["非可宣战俱乐部"] = "Non-war-declarable Club",
	["非家族首席的成员仅可更改自身角色"] = "Members who are not the Family Chief can only change their own character.",
	["非常、非常感谢您的理解！您真是一个善良的人，和店主先生一样！愿女神庇佑您！"] = "Thank you so, so much for your understanding! You are truly a kind person, just like the shopkeeper! May the Evernight Goddess protect you!",
	["非常不错。"] = "Muito bom.",
	["非常乐意……"] = "Very happy to...",
	["非常内向，遇到同类都不敢上前搭话。"] = "Very introverted; doesn't even dare to talk to its own kind when it meets them.",
	["非常厚重的空气墙合集1"] = "Very Thick Air Wall Collection 1",
	["非常好。约翰从小看着霍克斯长大，照顾霍克斯三十年了。"] = "Very good. John has watched Hawkes grow up since he was a child and has taken care of Hawkes for thirty years.",
	["非常好，我们开始吧，塔罗会第一次集会。"] = "Very good, let's begin, the first gathering of the Tarot Club.",
	["非常差。"] = "Very poorly.",
	["非常感激。他给了我活下去的机会，还让我认识了其他成员……倒吊人、正义、太阳。"] = "I am very grateful. He gave me a chance to survive and let me meet other members... The Hanged Man, Justice, The Sun.",
	["非常感谢"] = "Thank you very much",
	["非常感谢。"] = "Thank you very much.",
	["非常感谢。对了，请问会计太太在哪里？"] = "Thank you very much. By the way, may I ask where the accountant is?",
	["非常感谢！"] = "Thank you very much!",
	["非常感谢，{{先生|女士}}。这是我们几位的生日，我们都非常想知道自己最近的运势。"] = "Thank you very much, {{ Mr. | Ms. }}. These are our birthdays, and we are all very eager to know our recent fortunes.",
	["非常感谢，你们的效率令人赞叹。"] = "Thank you very much, your efficiency is admirable.",
	["非常感谢，我之后会去尝试一下的！"] = "Thank you very much, I will try it later!",
	["非常感谢，斯林太太，您今天真像个年轻又活泼的女士。"] = "Thank you very much, Mrs. Stin, you look like a young and lively lady today.",
	["非常成功。我身后跟着一支浩浩荡荡的“小尾巴”，太幸福了！ "] = "Very successful. I have a long \"little tail\" following me, it's so wonderful!",
	["非常成功。我身后跟着一支浩浩荡荡的小尾巴，太幸福了！ "] = "Very successful. I have a long, bustling tail following behind me—it's pure bliss!",
	["非常抱歉，{{PlayerName}}，我没有单独借阅《谜题破解法》的权限。"] = "I'm very sorry, {{PlayerName}}, I don't have the authority to borrow \"Puzzle-Solving Methods\" alone.",
	["非常抱歉，功能暂时关闭，相关人员正在处理中"] = "We are very sorry, the function is temporarily closed, and relevant personnel are handling it.",
	["非常抱歉，摆摊系统暂时关闭，相关人员正在紧张处理中。"] = "We are very sorry, the stall system is temporarily closed, and our staff is working hard to resolve the issue.",
	["非常抱歉，该手机号暂未获得测试资格，您可以前往关注官方公众号获取后续一手情报，感谢您的支持和理解。"] = "We are very sorry, but this phone number has not yet been granted test eligibility. You may follow our official account to receive the latest updates. Thank you for your support and understanding.",
	["非常抱歉，该账号已经绑定另一个设备，请使用注册用的设备进行登录，感谢您的支持和理解。"] = "We are very sorry, but this account is already bound to another device. Please use the device used for registration to log in. Thank you for your support and understanding.",
	["非常抱歉，该道具在摆摊中上架的功能暂时被关闭，相关人员正在紧张处理中。"] = "We are very sorry, the function to list this item at the stall is temporarily disabled, and our staff is working hard to resolve the issue.",
