	["顶奢华服，非凡之证。凡人以金钱求购，非凡者以仪式降下神迹。\n埃姆林·怀特曾向你展示过他所拥有的那些精美衣饰，每一件都堪称艺术品，每一件都来历不凡。而当你问起这些衣饰从何而来时，他露出了一个神秘的笑容。\n去找埃姆林·怀特，或许，你也可以拥有。"] = "Luxury clothing, proof of the extraordinary. Mortals seek to buy with money, Beyonders bring down miracles with rituals. \n Emlyn White once showed you the exquisite clothing and accessories he possessed; each one was a work of art, and each had an extraordinary origin. And when you asked where these clothes came from, he gave a mysterious smile. \n Go find Emlyn White; perhaps you can have them too.",
