	["领取条件：\n四方联赛中，参赛出战（需要达到参与时间）；\n歌剧魅影观战或被选入参赛阵容，二者满足其一即可领取奖励。\n发放规则：\n第一周：根据比赛胜负结果发放奖励；\n第二周：根据两轮比赛的综合排名发放奖励，排名越高奖励越丰厚。\n<Highlight>互斥规则：歌剧魅影观战奖励与联赛参赛奖励仅可二选一，不可同时领取</>。"] = "Claim conditions: \nParticipate in the Four-Way League (requires reaching the participation time);\n Watch the Phantom of the Opera or be selected into the competition lineup; meeting either of these two conditions allows you to claim rewards. \nDistribution rules: \nFirst week: Rewards are distributed based on the match results; \nSecond week: Rewards are distributed based on the comprehensive ranking of the two rounds of matches; the higher the ranking, the more generous the rewards. \n<Highlight>Mutual exclusion rule: Phantom of the Opera viewing rewards and league participation rewards can only be chosen one of the two; they cannot be claimed at the same time</>.",
