	["风尚不是炫耀华服，而是身份、礼仪与审美的平衡。既然你站到了这里，不妨接受一场真正的品鉴挑战。"] = "Fashion is not about showing off fancy clothes, but a balance of identity, etiquette, and aesthetics. Since you've stood here, why not accept a real fashion appreciation challenge?",
	["风尚会随着花期流转，也会随着心境改变；既然来到这片花海，不妨用你的搭配留下属于自己的颜色，让我们来进行一场时尚品鉴吧！"] = "Fashion flows with the flowering season and changes with one's mood; since you've come to this sea of flowers, why not leave your own color with your outfit? Let's have a fashion appreciation challenge!",
