	["风尚品鉴通常会从基础挑战开始安排。等获得廷根<P_Yellow>五位</>初级时尚会员的认可，成为中级时尚会员后，再来和我交流搭配心得吧。"] = "Fashion appreciation usually starts with basic challenges. Once you gain recognition from <P_Yellow> five </> junior fashion members in Tingen and become an intermediate fashion member, come back and share your styling insights with me.",
