	["首先得找到食材和厨具。"] = "First, I have to find the ingredients and cookware.",
	["首先是对我的<P_Yellow>称呼</>……"] = "First, regarding my <P_Yellow> honorific </>...",
	["首先要避开月圆之夜、灵潮高峰日和正神教会的大型庆典期。"] = "First, you must avoid full moon nights, peak days of spiritual tides, and major celebration periods of the Orthodox Churches.",
	["首先，从我们的国家因蒂斯开始……"] = "First, let's start with our country, Intis...",
	["首先，前任屋主的名字和身份，我想从这两件东西，应该说得足够明白了……"] = "First, the name and identity of the previous owner, I think these two things explain it clearly enough...",
	["首先，占用一下你的时间，听我讲一讲我们的道标和救主……"] = "First, take a moment of your time to listen to me talk about our beacon and savior...",
	["首先，我们需要建立仪式的基础——仪式台与祭品。"] = "First, we need to establish the foundation of the ritual—the altar and the offerings.",
