	["首先，指派一位<Highlight>雇员</>到该工坊。"] = "First, assign an <Highlight>Employee</> to this workshop.",
	["首先，身体保持挺直，然后在空中伴随一个转体，使用背部着陆至草垛中。"] = "First, keep your body straight, then accompany it with a twist in the air, and land on your back in the haystack.",
	["首先，躲开赌场的那帮猎狗，悄悄地伪装进去。"] = "First, avoid the hounds from the casino and sneak in disguised.",
	["首尾相接的扭曲圆环，无尽循环的肇始。"] = "A twisted ring connected end-to-end, the beginning of an endless cycle.",
	["首席"] = "Chief",
	["首席·邦尼"] = "Chief Bonnie",
	["首席……是以前在神弃之地时的称呼。即使现在我在拜亚姆的新白银城接任了首席的职务，仍然改不掉过去的习惯。"] = "Chief... that was the title back in the Forsaken Land of the Gods. Even though I have taken over the position of Chief in New Silver City in Bayam now, I still can't break the old habit.",
