	["香气如光，能照进灵魂的褶皱。"] = "Fragrance is like light, able to shine into the folds of the soul.",
	["香气浓郁到令人窒息，现实开始扭曲。"] = "The fragrance is suffocating, and reality begins to distort.",
	["香气陷阱"] = "Fragrance Trap",
	["香气陷阱减速"] = "Fragrance Trap slow",
	["香氛如不可见的指尖，拂过每一寸试图坚守的意志。那道回眸只停留了一息——可当裙摆旋过烛光时，舞步便乱了拍子，从此再也找不回自己的节奏。拜伏吧，成为美的俘虏吧，这是赐予倾倒者的又一个姓名。"] = "The fragrance is like an invisible fingertip, brushing against every inch of will that tries to hold its ground. That glance lingered for only a breath—but when the hem of the skirt swirled past the candlelight, the dance steps lost their rhythm, and from then on, they could never find their own pace again. Bow down, become a captive of beauty; this is another name bestowed upon the fallen.",
