	["马洛的对话"] = "Marlow's dialogue",
	["马洛选了生命。他怕死。"] = "Marlow chose life. He is afraid of death.",
	["马洛，我想，你的老师是幸福的。"] = "Marlow, I think your teacher is happy.",
