	["马车单程4便士，往返8便士。"] = "A one-way carriage ride is 4 pence, and 8 pence for a round trip.",
	["马车单程4便士，往返8便士。如果你和班森也乘坐马车，每天就要花费24便士，整整2苏勒！不算周日的话，一周就是12苏勒！"] = "A one-way carriage ride is 4 pence, and a round trip is 8 pence. If you and Benson both take the carriage, it would cost 24 pence a day—that's 2 soli! Excluding Sundays, that's 12 soli a week!",
