	["马车来了"] = "The carriage is here",
	["马车特快！为您效劳！"] = "Carriage Express! At your service!",
	["马车的初始血量降低，战斗中场上会不断掉落修理道具，对马车使用修理道具可以回复马车血量。"] = "The Carriage's initial Health is reduced. During combat, Repair items will constantly drop on the field. Using Repair items on the Carriage can restore its Health.",
	["马车的初始血量降低，战斗中场上会不断掉落修理道具，对马车使用修理道具可以回复马车血量。被秘法球命中时会减少1个修理道具"] = "The Carriage's initial Health is reduced. During combat, Repair items will constantly drop on the field. Using Repair items on the Carriage can restore its Health. Being hit by an Arcane Ball will reduce the number of Repair items by 1.",
	["马车的味道……东区的味道……我自己的味道。"] = "The smell of the Carriage... the smell of the East District... my own smell.",
