	["高级非凡物质礼包"] = "High-level Beyonder Material Pack",
	["高级风尚品鉴只会向通过中级时尚会员考核的人开放。先去参加廷根前面<P_Yellow>两场</>普通难度的中级时尚品鉴挑战吧！等你成为时尚协会高级会员，再来和我讨论搭配心得吧！"] = "Advanced fashion appreciation is only open to those who have passed the intermediate fashion member assessment. Go participate in the <P_Yellow> two </> normal-difficulty intermediate fashion appreciation challenges in Tingen first! Once you become a senior member of the Fashion Association, come back and discuss styling insights with me!",
	["高耸的穹顶，巨大的石柱，恢弘，大气！遗迹里随处可见黑夜符号，但又与黑夜女神的圣徽有所不同……您猜是为什么？"] = "Towering domes, huge stone pillars, magnificent and grand! Symbols of the night can be seen everywhere in the ruins, but they are different from the holy emblem of the Evernight Goddess... Can you guess why?",
