	["魔药材料·西尔维娅"] = "Potion Material: Sylvia",
	["魔药材料不足"] = "Insufficient potion materials.",
	["魔药材料中蕴含着超凡物种的能力，非凡者或多或少会受到残留的精神影响。贸然服食更高序列的对应魔药，会累积疯狂，累积失控。"] = "Potion ingredients contain the abilities of extraordinary species, and Beyonders will be affected by residual mental influence to varying degrees. Rashly consuming a corresponding potion of a higher sequence will accumulate madness and lead to loss of control.",
	["魔药材料奖励"] = "Potion Material Reward",
