	["魔药消化进度达到60%"] = "Potion digestion progress reached 60%",
	["魔药消化进度达到80%"] = "Potion digestion progress reached 80%",
	["魔药炼制成功"] = "Potion brewing successful",
	["魔药的关键不是掌握 是扮演"] = "The key to a potion is not mastery, but Acting",
	["魔药的关键不是掌握，是消化！不是挖掘，是扮演！ "] = "The key to a potion is not mastery, but digestion! Not digging, but acting!",
	["魔药的名称也不仅仅是核心象征 还是具体意象和消化的钥匙"] = "The name of the potion is not just a core symbol, but also a specific image and the key to digestion.",
	["魔药的名称来自“亵渎石板”。"] = "The names of potions come from the \"Blasphemy Slate\".",
	["魔药的名称来自“亵渎石板”，上面一共记载了二十二条神之途径。"] = "The names of the potions come from the Blasphemy Slate, which records a total of twenty-two divine Pathways.",
	["魔药的名称来自“亵渎石板”，经过巨人语、精灵语、古赫密斯语、古弗萨克语、当代赫密斯语地不断转译，早就有了符合时代特征的变化，名称不是重点，重点是它能否代表这份魔药的“核心象征”。"] = "The names of potions come from the 'Blasphemy Slate'. Through continuous translation across Giant, Elvish, Ancient Hermes, Ancient Futhark, and Modern Hermes, they have long since evolved to fit the characteristics of the era. The name is not the point; the point is whether it represents the 'core symbol' of the potion.",
	["魔药的滋味"] = "The taste of a potion",
	["魔药茶"] = "Potion Tea",
	["魔药茶会"] = "Potion Tea Party",
	["魔药茶会触发"] = "Potion Tea Party Trigger",
	["魔药茶水"] = "Potion Tea",
	["魔药象征的意义在它的名称中，作为“占卜家”，你可以多想想这个名字的象征含义。"] = "The symbolic meaning of the potion is in its name. As a 'Seer', you can think more about the symbolic meaning of this name.",
	["魔药辅助材料"] = "Potion Auxiliary Materials",
	["魔药配方"] = "Potion Formula",
	["魔药配方中标注了晋升下一序列所需的魔药材料，以及<Highlight>所有可获取的途径</>。"] = "The potion formula indicates the potion materials required for advancing to the next sequence, as well as <Highlight>all obtainable pathways</>.",
