	["鲁本把自己锁在里面，已经一刻钟了！他有怕黑的毛病，再这样下去会喘不上气的！"] = "Reuben locked himself inside a quarter of an hour ago! He has a fear of the dark; if this continues, he won't be able to breathe!",
