	["鲁莽、冲动、永远先用拳头思考……你能想象吗？她竟然想单枪匹马去调查一个海盗将军！"] = "Reckless, impulsive, always thinking with her fists first... can you imagine? She actually wanted to go investigate a pirate general all by herself!",
