	["麻烦上一些新的蛋糕！"] = "Please bring some new cakes!",
	["麻烦了？什么意思？我为什么要跳崖？"] = "Troublesome? What do you mean? Why would I jump off a cliff?",
	["麻烦你们去调查一个叫做尤朵拉的人，或许会与案件有关联。"] = "Please investigate a person named Yodora; it might be related to the case.",
	["麻烦再快一点，甩开他们。"] = "Please go faster and shake them off.",
	["麻烦动作轻一点，弄断她的关节，我还要找人重新接上，那可就麻烦了"] = "Please be gentle. If you break her joints, I'll have to find someone to reattach them, and that would be troublesome.",
