	["黄水晶黛西小姐，这里最年轻的一位。不弹琴，不跳舞，也不聊天下大事。"] = "Miss Yellow Crystal Daisy, the youngest one here. She doesn't play the piano, doesn't dance, and doesn't talk about world affairs.",
	["黄沙掩埋往昔，祂的凝视穿透时光，烈日的梦从未消散。"] = "Yellow sand buries the past; His Gaze pierces through time, and the dream of the scorching sun has never dissipated.",
