	["黄金之罪通关"] = "Clear Sin of Gold",
	["黄金俗气，白银易变，唯有宝石，能见证一段段历史。"] = "Gold is tacky, silver is fickle; only gemstones can witness history.",
	["黄金在烈焰中哭泣，光芒刺穿永夜的心脏。"] = "Gold weeps in the flames, and the light pierces the heart of the eternal night.",
	["黄金威能"] = "Golden Might",
	["黄金威能累计5层，可以对目标单体造成bulletdisc(*id)伤害。"] = "Accumulate 5 stacks of Golden Might to deal bulletdisc(*id) damage to a single target.",
	["黄金威能累计5层，可以对目标单体造成bulletdisc(*id)伤害，并产生爆炸，对目标周围10米范围内的敌人造成spellfielddisc(*id)点伤害。"] = "Accumulate 5 stacks of Golden Might to deal bulletdisc(*id) damage to a single target and create an Explosion, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) damage to enemies within 10 meters of the target.",
