	["黑荆棘入口-阿兹克支线"] = "Blackthorn Entrance-Azik Side Quest",
	["黑荆棘六人本怎么打"] = "How do I clear the Blackthorn 6-player dungeon?",
	["黑荆棘前台"] = "Blackthorn reception",
	["黑荆棘加载"] = "Blackthorn loading",
	["黑荆棘周边氛围"] = "Blackthorn surrounding atmosphere",
	["黑荆棘外\n伦纳德倚墙整理好手套，\n朝咖啡馆的位置微微侧头，感受到心理治疗已经成功，微笑离开"] = "Outside Blackthorn \n Leonard leans against the wall to adjust his gloves, \n tilts his head slightly toward the cafe, feels that the psychotherapy has been successful, and leaves with a smile.",
	["黑荆棘外\n黑荆棘外面，伦纳德倚着墙或者路灯，做出刚好戴完手套的姿势。\n他朝咖啡馆位置微微侧头，还是不放心你自己过来，于是离开。"] = "Outside Blackthorn \nOutside Blackthorn, Leonard leans against a wall or street lamp, posing as if he has just finished putting on his gloves. \nHe tilts his head slightly toward the cafe, still worried about you coming alone, so he leaves.",
	["黑荆棘安保公司"] = "Blackthorn Security Company",
	["黑荆棘安保公司\r\n<LeonSubTitle size=\"22\">Blackthorn Security Company</>"] = "Blackthorn Security Company\r\n<LeonSubTitle size=\"22\">Blackthorn Security Company</>",
	["黑荆棘安保公司-伦纳德拦路-新版"] = "Blackthorn Security Company - Leonard Blocks the Way - New Version",
	["黑荆棘安保公司众人"] = "The people of Blackthorn Security Company",
	["黑荆棘安保公司众人：干杯！"] = "Blackthorn Security Company members: Cheers!",
	["黑荆棘安保公司接了一桩复杂的寻人委托，弗莱希望你加入一起调查。"] = "Blackthorn Security Company has taken on a complex missing person case. Frye wants you to join the investigation.",
	["黑荆棘安保公司接了一桩寻人委托，弗莱希望你加入一起调查。"] = "Blackthorn Security Company has received a missing person request. Frye hopes you will join in the investigation.",
	["黑荆棘安保公司文职人员。\n曾是值夜者正式队员，后来年纪大了，身体衰弱，未能晋升，不再适应处理案件。不愿转为内部“看守者”或在家休养，只希望与文献典籍为伴。于是担任武器库和文献库管理员，擅长配制魔药，教授神秘学知识。"] = "A civilian staff member at Blackthorn Security Company. \n He was once an official Nighthawk, but as he aged and his physical condition declined, he could no longer advance or adapt to handling cases. Unwilling to transfer to an internal \"Gatekeeper\" role or retire at home, he only wished to be accompanied by documents and classics. Thus, he serves as the keeper of the armory and the archives, skilled in potion preparation and teaching occult knowledge.",
	["黑荆棘安保公司？妈妈工作过的地方……"] = "Blackthorn Security Company? The place where Mom used to work...",
	["黑荆棘就是一支正式的雇佣兵小队，你们经常去出一些非官方的任务。嗯，能赚点外快，又能帮助人们解决困难，双赢。"] = "Blackthorn is a formal mercenary squad. You often go out to take some unofficial quests. Hmm, you can earn some extra money and help people solve difficulties; it's a win-win.",
	["黑荆棘工作手册"] = "Blackthorn Work Manual",
	["黑荆棘工作手册获取"] = "Blackthorn Security Company handbook acquisition",
	["黑荆棘废墟"] = "Blackthorn Ruins",
	["黑荆棘怎么打"] = "How do I clear Blackthorn?",
	["黑荆棘报销商店"] = "Blackthorn Reimbursement Shop",
	["黑荆棘接到委托，廷根中央广场出现了来历不明的金雨。背后有着一双资本家的手在暗自操控着一切——他压榨工人，设立“斩杀线”淘汰完不成定额的人。黄金无罪。有罪的，是把黄金当成神明的人，而你是解开这场悲剧的关键。"] = "Blackthorn received a commission: mysterious golden rain has appeared in Tingen's Central Plaza. Behind it, a capitalist's hand is secretly manipulating everything—he exploits workers and sets a \"slaughter line\" to eliminate those who cannot complete their quotas. Gold is innocent. What is guilty are those who treat gold as a god, and you are the key to unraveling this tragedy.",
	["黑荆棘接工厂工人失踪案，弗莱委托你前往拉姆德古堡调查第三名失踪者亚瑟。你抵达后触发灵视，目睹阿兹克从棺材中苏醒。他正调查“永暗蜡烛”引发的自杀潮，已救下六人。你发现亚瑟被蜡烛污染企图自杀，阿兹克救治后资助他回家。线索指向蜡烛工坊学徒芬恩，他告诉你幕后黑手将在墓地广场举行死亡庆典。庆典上，你与阿兹克揭穿主持者托马斯神父——他扭曲黑夜女神教义，妄图用永暗蜡烛逃避死亡。托马斯失控逃入冥界，你随阿兹克追击。阿兹克点亮蜡烛驱散黑暗，击败托马斯。芬恩用老师维斯塔的蜡烛替换了邪异蜡烛，救了众人。阿兹克看着烛光，回忆起人性中明亮温暖的片段，点出了死亡与生命的意义。"] = "Blackthorn takes on a case of missing factory workers, and Frye entrusts you to go to Lamud Castle to investigate the third missing person, Arthur. Upon arrival, you trigger spirit vision and witness Azik waking up from a coffin. He is investigating the suicide wave caused by the \"Evernight Candle\" and has already saved six people. You discover that Arthur was contaminated by the candle and attempted suicide; after Azik treats him, he provides funds for him to return home. The clues point to the apprentice Finn of the candle workshop, who tells you that the mastermind will hold a death celebration at the cemetery square. At the celebration, you and Azik expose Father Thomas, the host—he distorted the teachings of the Evernight Goddess, attempting to use the Evernight Candle to escape death. Thomas loses control and flees into the Underworld, and you pursue him with Azik. Azik lights the candle to dispel the darkness and defeats Thomas. Finn replaces the evil candle with his teacher Vista's candle, saving everyone. Looking at the candlelight, Azik recalls the bright and warm fragments of humanity, pointing out the meaning of death and life.",
	["黑荆棘推理1"] = "Blackthorn Deduction 1",
	["黑荆棘推理2"] = "Blackthorn Deduction 2",
	["黑荆棘搬救兵"] = "Blackthorn Calling for Reinforcements",
	["黑荆棘文职"] = "Blackthorn clerical staff",
	["黑荆棘是距离最近的值夜小队，所以由我们派人援助。"] = "Blackthorn is the nearest Nighthawk team, so we are sending people to assist.",
	["黑荆棘来了两位恩马特港的值夜者同事，似乎有事求助。 "] = "Two Nighthawk colleagues from Enmat Harbor have arrived at Blackthorn, and they seem to be seeking help.",
	["黑荆棘标志"] = "Blackthorn symbol",
	["黑荆棘每日副本怎么进"] = "How to enter the Blackthorn daily dungeon",
	["黑荆棘氛围"] = "Blackthorn Atmosphere",
	["黑荆棘的值夜者们常常来此散步，花香会给予他们安宁的拥抱。"] = "The Nighthawks of Blackthorn often come here for a walk; the fragrance of flowers gives them a peaceful hug.",
	["黑荆棘的真正职责，是处理廷根市的非凡事件。"] = "The true duty of Blackthorn is to handle Extraordinary events in Tingen.",
	["黑荆棘的队长室，是弗莱队长日常办公的地方。"] = "The Captain's Office in Blackthorn is where Captain Frye works daily.",
	["黑荆棘相机·门口马车"] = "Blackthorn Camera · Carriage at the door",
	["黑荆棘移动案例"] = "Blackthorn Moving Case",
	["黑荆棘移动测试案例"] = "Blackthorn Movement Test Case",
	["黑荆棘空气墙"] = "Blackthorn air wall",
	["黑荆棘至火车站"] = "Blackthorn to Train Station",
	["黑荆棘贡献"] = "Blackthorn Contribution",
	["黑荆棘贡献商店"] = "Blackthorn Contribution Shop",
	["黑荆棘车夫"] = "Blackthorn carriage driver",
	["黑荆棘里似乎散落着很多旧物，比如烟斗……报销单……斗邪恶的纸牌……"] = "There seem to be many old items scattered in Blackthorn, such as pipes... reimbursement forms... cards for fighting evil...",
	["黑荆棘门口"] = "Blackthorn Entrance",
	["黑荆棘门口-想接下来的安排"] = "Blackthorn entrance - thinking about next steps",
	["黑荆棘门口脚踏车棕"] = "Blackthorn Entrance Bicycle (Brown)",
	["黑荆棘门口马车夫"] = "Blackthorn Entrance Coachman",
	["黑荆棘门外的街道消失了，变成了廷根中央广场。\n玩家抬头，廷根的夜空被涌动的知识洪流所替代。\n知识的流光注入一位少女的大脑中，原本正常的人砰地一声——变成了一股洪流消散。"] = "The street outside the Blackthorn Gate disappeared and became the Tingen Central Plaza. \nThe player looked up, and the night sky of Tingen was replaced by a surging Torrent of Knowledge.\n The flowing light of knowledge poured into a young girl's brain, and the originally normal person went 'bang'—and dissipated into a torrent.",
	["黑荆棘马车夫"] = "Blackthorn carriage driver",
	["黑荆棘，伪装成安保公司的廷根值夜者小队。"] = "Blackthorn, the Tingen Nighthawks squad disguised as a security company.",
	["黑荆棘，值夜者们不停地翻阅报告，在密密麻麻的资料中寻找着什么。\n追溯无数线索而上……"] = "In Blackthorn, the Nighthawks keep flipping through reports, searching for something in the dense information. \n Tracing countless clues back...",
