	["黑铁色戒指，顶端有一个尖刺般的凸起，上面沾染着陈旧的血迹，既古老又邪异。"] = "A black iron ring with a spike-like protrusion on top, stained with old blood, both ancient and evil.",
	["黑铁锻造成的家用汤锅，厚重的材质适合慢熬冬日浓汤。"] = "A household soup pot forged from black iron; the heavy material is suitable for slow-simmering winter soups.",
