	["默念尊名"] = "Recite Honorific Name",
	["默念方向，等待灵摆转动"] = "Recite the direction silently and wait for the pendulum to rotate",
	["默思"] = "Mosi",
	["默恩索"] = "Muenso",
	["默瑟"] = "Mercer",
	["默知"] = "Mozhi",
	["默认"] = "Default",
	["默认-1，代表在“放置位置”描述的所有位置点各创建1个对象。填正整数则取min生效。"] = "Default is -1, which creates 1 object at each position described in \"Placement Positions\". If a positive integer is entered, the minimum value takes effect.",
	["默认0\n当技能基础CD为C，CDMulti=x，CDTime=y时，触发的CD时长是xC+y"] = "Default 0 \n When the skill base CD is C, CDMulti=x, and CDTime=y, the triggered CD duration is xC+y.",
	["默认0，数字越小越优先"] = "Defaults to 0; the smaller the number, the higher the priority",
	["默认0，越大优先级越高，可填负数。同槽位映射多个技能时，高优先级的显示，低优先级的不显示。同优先级则按后来者优先的栈式规则管理显示。"] = "Default 0; the larger the value, the higher the priority; negative numbers can be filled. When multiple skills are mapped to the same slot, the high-priority one is displayed, and the low-priority one is not. If priorities are the same, display is managed by a stack rule where the newcomer takes precedence.",
	["默认1.0代表没有缩放"] = "Default 1.0 means no scaling.",
	["默认60"] = "Defaults to 60.",
	["默认FALSE。填TRUE代表：当被Keep的Buff区分来源时，KeepBuff结束时，只移除自身添加的Buff（这个规则应该是默认，但直接这么写死可能导致问题，来不及回归，所以新增参数来支持）"] = "Default FALSE. Filling TRUE means: When the Kept Buff distinguishes sources, when KeepBuff ends, only the Buff added by itself is removed (this rule should be the default, but hardcoding it like this might cause problems, and there is no time to revert, so a new parameter is added to support it).",
	["默认False，也即强制执行，填True代表要进行一系列条件检查（前置条件、状态冲突、后摇等），同时支持Combo技能"] = "Defaults to False, meaning forced execution. Setting to True means a series of condition checks (prerequisites, state conflicts, post-swing, etc.) will be performed, and it also supports Combo skills.",
	["默认False，代表单个技能实例内多次命中目标时，每次命中（无论此次命中多少个目标）触发一次Event；填True则代表单个技能实例内，只触发一次该Event。"] = "Default is False, meaning that when a single Skill instance hits a target multiple times, each hit (regardless of how many targets are hit) triggers an Event once; filling in True means that within a single Skill instance, this Event is only triggered once.",
	["默认False，代表朝向跟着持有者旋转；\n填True，代表朝向在世界坐标系里保持不变。"] = "Default False, meaning orientation rotates with the holder; \n Fill True, meaning orientation remains unchanged in world coordinates.",
	["默认False，即需要配置指定IDs"] = "Default False, meaning specific IDs need to be configured.",
	["默认both"] = "Defaults to both",
	["默认false"] = "Defaults to false",
	["默认false，用始作俑者，技能内的阵营判定都会用始作俑者，填true则表示不用始作俑者，技能内阵营判定完全以技能释放者本身来做判定"] = "Defaults to false, using the originator; all faction judgments within the skill will use the originator. If set to true, the originator is not used, and faction judgments within the skill are determined entirely by the skill caster themselves.",
	["默认不交换"] = "Defaults to no swap.",
	["默认不勾选则计算两圆心距离，勾选则计算自身圆心到目标点碰撞半径"] = "Default unchecked calculates distance between two centers; if checked, calculates distance from own center to target point collision radius.",
	["默认不填写时，为1，即100%概率。允许填写公式。"] = "Defaults to 1 if not filled, i.e., 100% probability. Allows filling in formulas.",
	["默认不填写时，为1，即100%概率。当存在多个对象时，每个对象单独判断概率。"] = "Default is 1 if left blank, meaning 100% probability. When multiple objects exist, probability is checked individually for each object.",
	["默认不检查，填True代表：如果Buff是区分来源的，且始作俑者不是自己，则不予考虑"] = "Defaults to no check; filling in True means: if the Buff distinguishes sources and the originator is not self, it will not be considered.",
	["默认不贴地"] = "Defaults to no ground snapping.",
	["默认为0，代表同一时间全部创建；填正数时，首次创建也要等待Interval的时间"] = "Defaults to 0, meaning all are created at the same time; if a positive number is entered, the first creation must also wait for the Interval duration.",
	["默认为1"] = "Default is 1.",
	["默认为1.会清除等级小于等于该值的控制和受击"] = "Default is 1. Clears control and hit effects with a level less than or equal to this value",
	["默认为False，此时检查Target的FlowChart里的值；填True代表取关卡/场景的FlowChart里的值"] = "Defaults to False, checking the value in the Target's FlowChart; filling True means taking the value from the Level/Scene's FlowChart.",
	["默认为falase.如果你希望打断技能，请配置true"] = "Defaults to false. If you wish to interrupt the skill, please set to true.",
	["默认为false。为true时，仅当leafid满足时，才可通过"] = "Defaults to false. When true, it only passes if the leafid is satisfied",
	["默认为false，true时将会把伤害记录和击杀溯源认为是buff的始作俑者。若为false，则会以伤害来源为伤害记录和击杀溯源"] = "Defaults to false. When true, damage records and kill attribution will be considered as the buff originator. If false, the damage source will be used for damage records and kill attribution.",
	["默认为false，为true时，代表属于同一个RangeHit内部的多次伤害/治疗，不进CD"] = "Default is false. When true, it means multiple damage/healing within the same RangeHit, not entering CD",
	["默认为false，为true时，如果因为资源溢出导致实际上并未增加任何资源值，也触发该监听。资源为0时尝试扣除导致的向下溢出不触发"] = "Defaults to false; when true, it also triggers the listener if no resource value is actually added due to resource overflow. Downward overflow caused by attempting to deduct when the resource is 0 does not trigger it",
	["默认为true"] = "Defaults to true.",
	["默认为true，即可以被霸体抵挡。填false则引力场可以影响霸体的单位"] = "Defaults to true, meaning it can be blocked by Super Armor. If set to false, the gravity field can affect units with Super Armor.",
	["默认主题"] = "Default Theme",
	["默认传入点"] = "Default entry point",
	["默认值为0.在buff中使用不要填写"] = "Default value is 0. Do not fill this in when using in a buff",
	["默认关闭，每次执行切换“强制开/不强制开”"] = "Default off, each execution toggles \"Force On/Not Force On\"",
