	["龙"] = "Dragon",
	["龙之牙的记忆，沉淀在草叶中。"] = "The memory of the dragon's tooth is deposited in the grass leaves.",
	["龙之谷"] = "Dragon Nest",
	["龙之遗泽"] = "Dragon's Legacy",
	["龙之遗泽攻速20"] = "Dragon's Legacy Attack Speed 20",
	["龙之遗泽攻速30"] = "Dragon's Legacy Attack Speed 30",
	["龙之遗泽攻速40"] = "Dragon's Legacy Attack Speed 40",
	["龙之遗泽攻速50"] = "Dragon's Legacy Attack Speed 50",
	["龙之遗泽：战斗开始<HighLight>8</>秒后，龙息横扫整个棋盘，对敌人造成真实伤害，并提升所有友军攻速，持续到战斗结束。"] = "Dragon's Legacy: <HighLight>8</> seconds after battle starts, Dragon Breath sweeps across the entire board, dealing true damage to enemies and increasing the Attack Speed of all allies until the battle ends.",
	["龙卷风"] = "Tornado",
	["龙卷风过境般的床铺，床单上隐约可以看到人形的汗渍……"] = "A bed that looks like a tornado passed through it; you can vaguely see human-shaped sweat stains on the sheets...",
	["龙啸将至。\n我将不<Hide id=\"#157\">畏高、不惧火、不后退。我将不恋温床，不贪安逸，</>不向恐惧低头。\n我这平庸的人生，注定<Hide id=\"#157\">光辉万丈</>。\n我要将旗帜，<Hide id=\"#157\">插在最高</>的地方。\n我是刺向龙<Hide id=\"#157\">心的长矛，龙焰中的坚盾，风暴里的号角，黑暗之中的光芒。</>\n为猎龙献上生命与心脏！\n\n猎龙人：凯文·斯托克   <Hide id=\"#157\">瑞尔·比</>伯"] = "The dragon's roar is coming. \n I shall not <Hide id=\"#157\"> fear heights, fear fire, or retreat. I shall not cling to warm beds, nor covet comfort, </> nor bow to horror. \n This mediocre life of mine is destined <Hide id=\"#157\"> to be glorious </>. \n I will plant the flag <Hide id=\"#157\"> in the highest </> place. \n I am the spear piercing the dragon's <Hide id=\"#157\"> heart, the sturdy shield in dragon fire, the horn in the storm, the light in the darkness. </> \n Offer my life and heart to dragon hunting! \n \n Dragon Hunter: Kevin Stock <Hide id=\"#157\"> Riel </> Bieber",
	["龙啸将至。\n我将不畏高、不惧火、不后退。 我将不恋温床，不贪安逸，不向恐惧低头。\n我这平庸的人生，注定光辉万丈。\n我要将旗帜，插在最高的地方。\n我是刺向龙心的长矛，龙焰中的坚盾，风暴里的号角，黑暗之中的光芒。\n为猎龙献上生命与心脏！\n\n猎龙人：凯文·斯托克   瑞尔·比伯"] = "The dragon's roar is coming.\nI will not fear heights, not fear fire, and not retreat. I will not cling to a warm bed, not covet comfort, and not bow to horror.\nThis mediocre life of mine is destined to be glorious.\nI will plant the flag in the highest place.\nI am the spear piercing the dragon's heart, the sturdy shield in dragon fire, the horn in the storm, the light in the darkness.\nOffer life and heart to dragon hunting!\n\nDragon Hunter: Kevin Stock   Ray Bieber",
	["龙啸将至。\n我将不畏高、不惧火、不后退。我将不恋温床，不贪安逸，不向恐惧低头。\n我这平庸的人生，注定光辉万丈。\n我要将旗帜，插在最高的地方。\n我是刺向龙心的长矛，龙焰中的坚盾，风暴里的号角，黑暗之中的光芒。\n为猎龙献上生命与心脏！\n\n猎龙人：凯文·斯托克   瑞尔·比伯"] = "The dragon's roar is coming. \n I will not fear heights, I will not fear fire, I will not retreat. I will not cling to a warm bed, I will not covet comfort, I will not bow to fear. \n This mediocre life of mine is destined to be glorious. \n I will plant the flag at the highest point. \n I am the spear piercing the dragon's heart, the sturdy shield in dragon fire, the horn in the storm, the light in the darkness. \n Offer my life and heart to dragon hunting! \n\n Dragon Hunter: Kevin Stock   Ray Bieber",
	["龙威"] = "Dragon Might",
