	["龙威天赋的观众推荐携带洞察、梦境编织、精神瘟疫、震慑进行战斗。"] = "For a Spectator with the Dragon Might talent, it is recommended to carry Insight, Dream Weaving, Mental Plague, and Deterrence for combat.",
