	["（<Tips_THighlight>我</>）"] = "(<Tips_THighlight> Me </>)",
	["（A级动画占位）克莱恩，我们之间不需要假装。"] = "(Grade A Animation Placeholder) Klein, there's no need for us to pretend with each other.",
	["（B级动画占位）做得不错，廷根变得更动荡了……恐惧和死亡总是最好的养料。"] = "(B-grade animation placeholder) Well done. Tingen has become even more chaotic... Fear and death are always the best nourishment.",
	["（CS制作中，临时文本）\n“徘徊不去的英灵，真实造物主的眷属，凝视命运的眼睛。​”\n模糊的巨大的真实造物主出现。"] = "(CS in production, placeholder text) \n \"The lingering heroic spirit, the kin of the True Creator, the eye that gazes upon fate.\" \n The blurry, massive True Creator appears.",
	["（CS制作中，临时文本）\n房间里雾气弥漫，赛琳娜目光变得阴冷，皮肤一点点苍白，十指飞快长出了白森森的尖锐指甲。"] = "(CS in production, temporary text) \n The room is filled with mist, Selena's gaze becomes cold, her skin turns pale bit by bit, and sharp, white, bone-like nails grow rapidly on her ten fingers.",
	["（CS制作中，临时文本）\n无尽灰雾涌来，将你吞没。\n千万个历史孔隙的侧影于眼前闪过，直到其中一个停驻在面前……"] = "(CS in production, placeholder text) \n Endless gray fog surged, swallowing you. \n The silhouettes of thousands of historical gaps flashed before your eyes until one of them stopped in front of you...",
	["（CS制作中，临时文本）\n莫雷蒂一家乘坐马车，前往赛琳娜家赴宴。\n和其他宾客们一起进入屋内。"] = "(CS in production, placeholder text) \n The Moretti family took a carriage to attend a banquet at Selena's House. \n They entered the house along with other guests.",
	["（CS制作中，临时文本）\n走入占卜俱乐部，一位男子正在讲解占卜方法……"] = "(CS in production, placeholder text) \n Walking into the Divination Club, a man is explaining divination methods...",
	["（C级占位）胸好闷……"] = "(C-level placeholder) My chest is so stuffy...",
	["（………先请几天假，再去找皮特问清楚一些事。）"] = "(......... I'll ask for a few days off first, then go find Pete to clarify some things.)",
	["（……可我从小和皮特一起长大，多少对他有一些责任。）"] = "(...But I grew up with Pete, I have some responsibility for him.)",
	["（……这时候，身为廷根时期历史投影的他，还不知道故乡早已被埋葬的真相，还是不要揭穿吧。）"] = "(...At this moment, as a historical projection from his Tingen period, he doesn't yet know the truth that his home has long been buried. Better not to expose it.)",
	["（一局斗邪恶教学局对战后），我这……算是赢了吗？手上的牌都出光了。"] = "(After a round of Fighting Evil tutorial), did I... win? I've played all the cards in my hand.",
	["（一怒之下，怒了一下啊……）很期待见到“月亮”先生！"] = "(He got angry in a fit of rage... I'm really looking forward to meeting Mr. Moon!)",
	["（一晃都这么多年了，好怀念啊……）"] = "(In the blink of an eye, so many years have passed. I miss it so much...)",
	["（一段待包装的对话）"] = "(A dialogue to be packaged)",
	["（一段待包装的对话）不要拉倒，包团灭的"] = "(A dialogue to be packaged) If you don't want to, forget it, the whole team will be wiped out.",
	["（一段待包装的对话）你可以在这里进行传送和查询团队成员首领进度。"] = "(A dialogue to be packaged) You can teleport and check the progress of team leader members here.",
	["（一段待包装的对话）你想要体验哪一个故事呢"] = "(A dialogue to be packaged) Which story do you want to experience?",
	["（一段待包装的对话）你要查询哪个故事的进度？"] = "(A dialogue to be packaged) Which story's progress do you want to check?",
	["（一段待包装的对话）你要查询哪位首领的进度？"] = "(A dialogue to be packaged) Which leader's progress do you want to check?",
	["（一段待包装的对话）保重啊，非凡者"] = "(A dialogue to be packaged) Take care, Beyonder.",
	["（一段待包装的对话）勇敢的冒险者，要来个额外技能吗？"] = "(A dialogue to be packaged) Brave adventurer, do you want an extra skill?",
	["（一）\n　　我们是5月23日上午上山的，上山的时候碰到了一个穿着整齐西装的男人，四十来岁的样子，他向我们询问下山的路，给我感觉像城堡里的伯爵先生一样，佐治将下山的路告诉给他。没走两步，我回头，他消失不见了。\n　　佐治说要学习搭帐篷，我给他示范了三次，最后反倒是我被帐篷难倒了，这新买的帐篷不太顶用。"] = "(I)\n　　We went up the mountain on the morning of May 23rd. On the way up, we met a man in a neat suit, looking to be in his forties. He asked us for the way down the mountain. He gave me the feeling of a Count in a castle. George told him the way down. We hadn't walked two steps when I turned back, and he had disappeared.\n　　George said he wanted to learn how to set up a tent. I demonstrated it to him three times, but in the end, I was the one stumped by the tent. This newly bought tent isn't very reliable.",
	["（一）\n我们是5月23日上午上山的，上山的时候碰到了一个穿着整齐西装的男人，四十来岁的样子，他向我们询问下山的路，给我感觉像城堡里的伯爵先生一样，佐治将下山的路告诉给他。没走两步，我回头，他消失不见了。\n佐治说要学习搭帐篷，我给他示范了三次，最后反倒是我被帐篷难倒了，这新买的帐篷不太顶用。\n\n物资：\n面包——8余6\n肉类制品——6余5\n糖——1罐约1磅\n黄油——4余4\n酒——4余3\n水——5余5 明天留意水源\n\n（二）\n今天是晴天，雪很刺眼。\n佐治每隔一段时间就要看他的那本登山日志，像个老道的登山者一样，物资的记录就交给他了。\n其实他这是第二次跟我登山，上一次我跟他走的是古堡附近的野山。\n\n（三）\n今天是赶路的一天，我们必须赶在明天前抵达山顶，否则物资会不够。\n晚上，我发现扎营的地方附近有水源，很幸运，我们暂时不缺水了。\n但我隐约感觉有“野兽”在注视我们的帐篷，今晚只好我来守夜了。\n\n（四）\n在山上找到了一颗琥珀，把佐治羡慕坏了。这是我在霍纳奇斯登山以来最特殊的一个登顶纪念品。\n奇怪的是，这颗琥珀是从什么时候到我手里的？我为什么会不记得？\n琥珀里还有一只小虫子，听说琥珀里面的虫子可是跨越了千万年时间的“时间旅客”？千万年前的虫子长这样？\n\n（五）\n珀琥是不本根那"] = "(I) \n We went up the mountain on the morning of May 23rd. On the way up, we met a man in a neat suit, about forty years old. He asked us for the way down. He gave me the feeling of a Count in a castle. George told him the way down. We hadn't walked two steps when I looked back, and he had disappeared. \n George said he wanted to learn how to set up a tent. I demonstrated it to him three times, but in the end, I was the one stumped by the tent. This newly bought tent isn't very useful. \n\n Supplies: \n Bread—8 left 6 \n Meat products—6 left 5 \n Sugar—1 jar about 1 lb \n Butter—4 left 4 \n Alcohol—4 left 3 \n Water—5 left 5 Keep an eye on water sources tomorrow \n\n (II) \n Today is a sunny day, the snow is blinding. \n George checks his mountaineering log every so often, like an experienced mountaineer. The recording of supplies is left to him. \n Actually, this is his second time mountaineering with me. Last time, I walked the wild mountains near the ancient castle with him. \n\n (III) \n Today was a day of rushing. We must reach the summit before tomorrow, otherwise, the supplies won't be enough. \n In the evening, I found a water source near the campsite. Fortunately, we are not short of water for now. \n But I vaguely feel that a \"beast\" is watching our tent. I have to stand guard tonight. \n\n (IV) \n Found an amber on the mountain, which made George very envious. This is the most special souvenir I've had since mountaineering in Hornacis. \n The strange thing is, when did this amber get into my hands? Why don't I remember? \n There is a small bug in the amber. I heard that the bugs in amber are \"time travelers\" that have spanned millions of years? Do bugs from millions of years ago look like this? \n\n (V) \n Amber is not...",
	["（一） 相逢\n\n（二） 倾心\n\n（三） 英雄\n\n（四） 告白\n\n（五） 赴海\n\n（六） 风暴"] = "(I) Encounter \n\n(II) Falling in Love \n\n(III) Hero \n\n(IV) Confession \n\n(V) Heading to the Sea \n\n(VI) Storm",
	["（一）相逢"] = "(I) Meeting",
	["（一）银雾森林"] = "(I) Silver Mist Forest",
	["（三）\n　　今天是赶路的一天，我们必须赶在明天前抵达山顶，否则物资会不够。\n　　晚上，我发现扎营的地方附近有水源，很幸运，我们暂时不缺水了。\n　　但我隐约感觉有“野兽”在注视我们的帐篷，今晚只好由我来守夜了。"] = "(III) \n　　Today was a day of rushing. We must reach the summit by tomorrow, otherwise, the supplies won't be enough. \n　　In the evening, I discovered a water source near where we camped. Very lucky, we are temporarily not short of water. \n　　But I vaguely feel that a \"beast\" is watching our tent. I'll have to stand guard tonight.",
	["（三）羽毛"] = "(III) Feather",
	["（三）英雄"] = "(III) Hero",
	["（上周继承%d）"] = "(Inherited %d from last week)",
	["（上课期间的教室除外！！）"] = "(Except during class time!!)",
