	["（不对劲，他真的是凶手吗？)"] = "(Something is wrong, is he really the murderer?)",
	["（不对劲，她真的是凶手吗？）"] = "(Something is wrong, is she really the murderer?)",
	["（不对，有人在注视我？打量我？监视我？）"] = "(Wait, is someone watching me? Sizing me up? Monitoring me?)",
	["（临时-备注）动画未完成"] = "(Temporary-Note) Animation not finished",
	["（临时-画外音）很好 我们可以进一步治疗了"] = "(Temporary-Voiceover) Very good, we can proceed with further treatment",
	["（临时-画外音）战胜祂 掌握你体内的污染"] = "(Temporary-Voiceover) Defeat Him, master the corruption within you",
	["（临时-画外音）这是“伟大母亲”借由污染 降生的部分意志"] = "(Temporary-Voiceover) This is a part of the will of the \"Great Mother\" born through corruption",
	["（临时占位，此处有回忆视频）\n克莱恩之前在罗塞尔日记上看到：不是掌握，是扮演……"] = "(Placeholder, there is a flashback video here) \n Klein had previously seen in Roselle's diary: It is not mastery, it is Acting...",
