	["（临时）这里是选项部分 功能还在做 现在先等它播完"] = "(Temporary) This is the options section, the functionality is still being built, wait for it to finish playing for now",
	["（临时）邮差阿蒙"] = "(Temporary) Postman Amon",
	["（主动拉住你的小指）我们拉钩，你陪我玩，我告诉她在哪里。（迅速摇了摇手）不许反悔哦，不然就会变成一块大石头！"] = "(Actively hooks your little finger) Let's pinky swear. You play with me, and I'll tell you where she is. (Quickly shakes your hand) No backing out, or you'll turn into a big rock!",
	["（二十年前我还在码头区当学徒的时候，最馋这鱼了。）"] = "(Twenty years ago, when I was an Apprentice in the dock area, I craved this fish the most.)",
	["（二）\n　　今天是晴天，雪很刺眼。\n　　佐治每隔一段时间就要看他的那本登山日志，像个老道的登山者一样，物资的记录就交给他了。\n　　其实他这是第二次跟我登山，上一次我跟他走的是古堡附近的野山。"] = "(II)\n　　Today is a sunny day, and the snow is blinding.\n　　George looks at his mountaineering log every once in a while, like an experienced mountaineer. The recording of supplies is left to him.\n　　Actually, this is his second time mountaineering with me. The last time I went with him was to the wild mountains near the old castle.",
	["（二）守护者"] = "(II) Guardian",
	["（五）\n虫！珀琥是不本根那"] = "(V) \n Bug! Amber is not the root of this",
	["（五）森林的记忆"] = "(V) Memory of the Forest",
	["（今天的鱼真新鲜，鳞片闪闪发光。）"] = "(The fish today is really fresh, the scales are shining.)",
	["（今日已领取）"] = "(Claimed today)",
	["（从门外传来）警官，老师的情况怎么样了？"] = "(Coming from outside the door) Officer, how is the teacher?",
	["（仔细阅读）这些是什么字？（恐慌）我怎么一个都不认识？（暴怒）我怎么这么笨！上了夜校，也一个字都不认识！"] = "(Reads carefully) What are these characters? (Panic) Why don't I recognize a single one? (Rage) Why am I so stupid! I went to night school, and I still don't recognize a single word!",
	["（仔细）我没有在镇上见过你……你也是外面来的吧？"] = "(Carefully) I haven't seen you in town before... You're from outside, aren't you?",
	["（他们对待死亡的态度好诡异。）"] = "(Their attitude toward death is so bizarre.)",
	["（以手按胸）赞美女神。"] = "(Presses hand to chest) Praise the Lady.",
	["（以防万一，跟过去看看吧。）"] = "(Just in case, let's follow and see.)",
	["（伊妮德一个人乱跑太危险了，至少要把她找回来。）"] = "(It's too dangerous for Enid to run around alone; I must at least find her.)",
	["（优雅）很高兴你能记住夫人为此做出的贡献。"] = "(Gracefully) I am glad you remember the contribution the Madam made to this.",
	["（但中断仪式需要一个独立的房间 还要摆上神秘学物品 我需要一个帮手 最好是一位神秘学爱好者……）"] = "(But an interrupted ritual requires a separate room and occult items. I need a helper, preferably an occult enthusiast...)",
	["（但既然奥利弗已经去了教会，官方非凡者迟早会注意到这件事并加以处置，或许我可以…… ）"] = "(But since Oliver has already gone to the Church, the official Beyonders will notice this matter sooner or later and deal with it. Perhaps I can...)",
	["（低声嘀咕）丝瓜滞销，{{这位善良的先生|这位善良的女士}}，能不能帮帮我，拜托了。"] = "(Muttering) The loofahs aren't selling, {{this kind sir|this kind madam}}, can you help me? Please.",
	["（你从怀中掏出昨天购买的玫瑰，轻轻放在枯萎的玫瑰树下。）"] = "(You take out the rose you bought yesterday from your pocket and gently place it under the withered rose tree.)",
	["（你感到他的神色瞬间严肃了起来，用审视的目光打量你。）"] = "(You feel his expression become serious instantly, and he looks at you with a scrutinizing gaze.)",
	["（你感到口腔里一阵辛辣，冰凉的液体一路烧到了你胃里。）"] = "(You feel a spicy sensation in your mouth, and the cold liquid burns all the way down to your stomach.)",
	["（先占着用用）好像有股能量指引我前往命运咖啡厅，过去看看吧。"] = "(Might as well use it for now) It seems there is some energy guiding me toward the Destiny Cafe. Let's go take a look.",
	["（先租车到城外码头，再坐船顺塔索克河而下，到贝克兰德避避。）"] = "(First rent a carriage to the dock outside the city, then take a boat down the Tussock River to hide in Backlund.)",
	["（克莱恩对战赛琳娜）"] = "(Klein vs. Selena)",
	["（克莱恩！）这些标灰的是不在了吧。"] = "(Klein!) These grayed-out ones are no longer here, right?",
	["（全蒙狂欢机制开始）"] = "(Amon Carnival mechanism begins)",
	["（六）风暴"] = "(VI) Storm",
	["（再这样下去这些孩子就要吵起来了，得转移她们的注意力……）"] = "(If this continues, these children are going to start arguing, I have to distract them...)",
	["（凑近）看您的样子，应该是刚来廷根，正发愁去哪里找一个落脚处吧？"] = "(Leaning in) Looking at you, you must have just arrived in Tingen and are worried about where to find a place to stay, right?",
	["（到旁边占卜一下试试。）"] = "(Go to the side and try a divination.)",
	["（前面的人能不能快点？）"] = "(Can the people in front hurry up?)",
	["（剧本陷入死一般的寂静，随后机械地开口）"] = "(The script falls into a deathly silence, then speaks mechanically)",
